window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2301,"title":"Chapter 2301: Chapter 2300 Arrival! I","paragraphs":["2300 Arrival! I","An indescribable sensation coursed through him.","In his body, his Quintessential Aeonic Soul had gone to bathe everything to the level of his very cells down to the last atom, with countless wisps of his Soul permeating through and connecting everything.","This was a stage and transformation all beings underwent while they went ever closer towards Extremity. Their souls would gradually connect with every single aspect of their existence as they became more and more in control and proficient in its manipulation!","They could more easily alter the reality around them and manipulate their souls to establish their own versions of Reality through the concepts they expanded towards Extremity.","When one went from the 8th and into the 9th Boundary Layer, their closeness towards Extremity granted them a transformation of the soul in relation to the rest of their Aspects of Existence as everything...became one.","The transformation Noah was experiencing from the effects of the 7th Boundary Layer of Manadynamics as his soul was turned into an Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul was actually equivalent to other existences normally reaching the 9th Boundary Layer as the countless wisps of his Soul all across his Aspects of Existence...entirely and completely integrated into his Body and Origin.","HOOONG!","Seas of glorious Aeonic Mana of Extremity surged all around him as they kept the incandescent blue, but it was tinged with a brightness and ancientness that could burn the eyes of weaker beings!","It all surged around his body as his soul completely integrated and became connected to every part of him, where if he just willed any part of him to move- he would mobilize all the strength of his Soul to erupt instantly.","He could move in nanoseconds and gaze at things at an unimaginably slow pace, but he felt like he could see things even slower at this moment as weaker beings below his level may not even be able to see how he moved!","This change to his soul was truly fundamental and Quintessential as his Will expanded outwards powerfully, covering the vastness of the Dimensions, Realities, and Cosmos within the Infinite Plane even without utilizing his connection to this construct.","It spread out across its boundaries to even wade across the Planar Palisades of Extremity that the Infinite Plane was floating in!","He could cover a ridiculously vast distance with his Soul as he felt like the moment he wanted to, he could appear and make a move in any of this vastness that he covered.","-","Near the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity.","The changes Noah went through also erupted around the True Sanguine Clone that was Dual Cultivating with Ophelia, the eruption of essence being too much for this Elder Ancestor as she was pushed away with an explosive force towards the other end of the Observatory!","Noah's soul reacted fast as wisps of his Will instantly stopped her from smashing into the crystalline glass, the radiant glow around Ophelia being even more brilliant than ever as she waved her hands while pouting in protest.","<Time out...time out! Let me consolidate everything first...>","A white gold robe came to drape over her as she had experienced shocking changes with the burst of power just now, her soul very clearly feeling the radiant multicolored waves of Quintessence coursing through her along with the wonder of a second Crimson Innate Boundary of Manadynamics!","Two Crimson Innate Boundaries!","She felt them clearly transform her soul as the first Boundary of Quintessence caused all her other Boundaries to churn, any Boundary that she had below the 6th Boundary Layer being forcefully advanced 1 extra layer.","As for her single Boundary that she had focused on to reach the 8th Boundary Layer...she also felt its stagnant progress erupt upward and surge towards Extremity once more!","She knew that she was barely a hundredth of the way across the 8th Layer, and yet its progress exploded at this moment to climb over halfway to the 9th Boundary Layer.","This alone was unbelievable as she heard Noah's voice ring out while Aeonic Mana of Extremity transformed into a cerulean gold Emperor's Robes around him.","<The First Layer of Quintessence will automatically elevate any boundaries below the 6th Boundary Layer one additional layer, but for anything exceeding the 7th Layer and upwards, only half of this effect is achieved as when Quintessence itself reaches these Layers...the full effect will be applied.>","Noah's voice carried a golden trace of Wisdom as from this Cultivation session, he had also obtained the First Boundary Layer of the Obsidian Innate Boundary of Wisdom!","He confirmed the effects of Quintessence on the later layers past 6 as even for Manadynamics, Noah only felt it progress halfway past the 7th Boundary Layer!","Half of the effect would be achieved unless Quintessence itself arrived at the sought after Layer.","If it reached the 9th Boundary Layer, it could expand the additional Layers of Boundaries up to this level!","But even with half of the effect, if Noah deemed Manadynamics as Quintessential to gain the boon of a second additional layer, he could at this moment take Manadynamics from the 7th to the 8th Boundary Layer.","The same applied to Ophelia as her stellar brown eyes showed immense amazement, information flowing into her mind about the First Boundary Layer of Quintessence alone as just with this...she could obtain the other half of the Boost as long as she deemed Wisdom as Quintessential!","<Good, let's keep going!>","Her soul was about to make a move to achieve something she thought was millions or billions of years away when all of a sudden, her gaze changed as she gazed out from the Observatory.","Noah's soul that had expanded outwards to cover vast regions nearby had already seen everything occurring out there as he voiced out with a smile.","<Have your main body consolidate everything and deem Wisdom as Quintessential. You should achieve the 9th Layer by then as for now...we seem to have encountered guests.>","WAA!","Yes.","As they appeared near the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity, their surroundings became filled with tendrils of cloudy skies of Nullity and glacial mountains below them.","The temperature dropped to shocking levels as even existences who had merely achieved the First or Second Boundary Layers would be frozen in Body, Origin, and Soul within moments in this region!","Since the eruption of the multicolored light of the Aeonic Treasures of Extremity and their discovery by multiple Lineages, Noah's force wasn't the only one heading here.","There were many from the Ancestral Lernaeans that may have already arrived to reinforce Ancestor Rodwig and the others, and of course...the forces of the Noblesse and Quasarians that have also discovered this would also be here with even more of them coming!","As they came closer, they would naturally run into other forces as at this moment, a massive teardrop-shaped obsidian interstellar vessel that was a streak of dark light heading towards the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity stopped its advancement.","It stopped and turned its ominous gaze towards the Chaoticus Behemoth Transporter they were on as within an instant, it began floating over towards their direction!","Undoubtedly, these existences wanted to eliminate the enemy forces before they were even able to reach the location filled with clusters of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity."]},{"number":2302,"title":"Chapter 2302: Chapter 2301 Arrival! II","paragraphs":["2301 Arrival! II","<Let's go ahead and give them a warm welcome.>","Noah had a faint smile on his face as right after yet another ridiculous power up, Loot came to throw itself before his feet as how could he not be happy?","He saw Ophelia lick her lips with distaste at the interruption as she nodded and appeared beside him, both of their bodies becoming wrapped by a spatial light to appear on the periphery of the Chaoticus Behemoth Transporter that Ophelia had commanded to come to a stop.","The slightly less than a dozen Boundary Expansion Realm Lernaeans that had reached the 6th Boundary Layer and were taken from the Abecedarian Sacrarium gazed cautiously at the incoming vessel, and those below this stage who were simply tasked with maintaining operations of communications on this massive beast vessel gazing out fearfully when they saw the Obsidian vessel as they knew it meant nothing other than their most hated enemies.","The Noblesse!","But they were told to stand down and do nothing.","Instead, the figure of the Sacrarium Empress adorned in a white gold robe appeared as she very closely stuck to an existence adorned in blue gold Emperor's Robes that those on the Chaoticus Behemoth Transporter only knew as the recently appearing Last True Emperor of the Barren Lands!","Dangerous tendrils of NULLITY filled with coldness and death permeated across the gray skies, glacial Islands floating in this atmosphere as tendrils of gray lightning constantly struck out in different areas.","Only the most powerful of beings would ever come to this region as those who could float in its skies calmly were not to be underestimated!","Before the Chaoticus Behemoth Transporter, an obsidian Vessel approached and opened up at this moment.","Noah gazed at the teardrop-shaped interstellar vessel that opened to show regal looking figures of Noblesse, blazing Halos of light around their bodies that showed multiple 2 to 3 Echelon Crimson Existences.","Their eyes were entirely black with no pupils as obsidian purple robes and metal Armaments wrapped around them, their bodies dripping with regality and nobility as they seemed higher than even the skies they floated on!","Yet when Noah saw them...","<You poor things...>","...!","Before they could even announce themselves and bring whatever conflict they wanted forward, Noah couldn't help but pity these beings as his eyes truly showed sympathy and a shred of sorrow when looking at them as he sighed!","Ophelia saw this scene as her eyes twinkled of Wisdom to his right, a laugh of incredulity escaping her vibrant lips as she asked while shaking her head.","<You couldn't possibly be feeling pity for them because...>","<Yes.> Noah gave a light nod before she finished, his voice emanating out loud enough to the extent that the domineeringly floating Noblesse who were coming over could hear it as well.","<I can only pity their poor souls as can you imagine what terrible fates and destinies they have? They cultivated for who knows how many billions of years in these lands and achieved such a stage, and they're even here in a place of an overabundance of opportunity that's drawing all nearby Lineages in. Yet their vessel just so happened to cross near our Chaoticus Behemoth Transporter and they actually decided to veer off course and target us... their fates are so abysmal as they actually came to target me!>","WAA!","A unique compassion for the living was expressed on the face of the True Emperor of Quintessence as it veiled his overabundance of Tyranny, Ophelia looking at the show while trying to keep her laughter in as the domineering Noblesse heard Noah's words as their bodies erupted with immense power!","<This ant...!>","<To actually be so bold and not know when death is near?!>","They were a party of 13 beings here as each had achieved the 6th Boundary Layer in multiple Boundaries, with another 6 auras similar to them remaining on the Vessel as they were truly a force to fear!","19 beings that had each achieved one or more Boundaries at the 6th Layer.","Yet a target they chose to wipe out before they entered the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity to actually be showing pity towards them?","This was preposterous!","<You...I'm going to enjoy especially ripping you apart while I make that woman beside you watch!> A cruel smile appeared on the leading Noblesse as the others released waves of power, the VOID releasing from them freely as they floated over with an immense and oppressive demeanor.","Towards this, the eyes of the True Emperor of Quintessence gradually lost all the pity he showed towards these beings as he continued with a rising air of tyranny while he shook his head.","<If only you guys had slightly better destinies, you would have long since ran away from here. Alas...your journey on the path of Extremity will have to end because of this single mistake you made today!>","BZZP!","His hand rose as he pointed upwards.","A heart shaking aura bloomed as a dense blue light of the Aeonic Mana of Extremity erupted en masse, the dreary skies above holding glacial wisps of light instantly lighting up as a cluster of coiling cerulean Realities made of pure Mana formed!","A whole cluster of Realities made of pure Aeonic Mana of Extremity as under the effects of the [Aeonic Mana of Extremity Manipulationy], he could release pure Mana into any constructs he imagined- with slight limitations!","And the construct of cerulean clusters of Realities swirling like tendrils into a haven of circular light represented his strongest damage output currently, which was something truly ridiculous to conceptualize.","When he dealt with Desiderius and Theseus, he was already capable of releasing tens of thousands of Aeonic Damage Values. Over the course of the past day, he had constantly surpassed his past self as he reached a bit over 200,000 Aeonic Soul Damage Values, and then the final augmentations of Manadynamics and its strengthening to its current stage came in.","It made his current output easily exceed and slightly ti over 1 million Aeonic Soul Damage Values!","Something that these Noblesse at the level o Desiderius...could not even dream of holding back wit mere 6th Boundary Layers.","And they felt this closely the moment Noah called fort the cluster of cerulean Realities as their faces paled an turned ashen, their Souls beginning to scream at the as they recalled the words of pity this being showe earlier!","Their oppressive momentum stopped as they came to look at the cluster of pulsing Realities holding unbelievable Aeonic Soul Damage Values and a sense of Extremity they couldn't fathom.","They swallowed their disbelief and regret as they looked forward again.","The teardrop vessel behind them holding the remainder of their forces...began edging backwards ever so slightly.","Fear and incredulity spread in the surroundings as all eyes came to rest on the cerulean robed Emperor with his hand in the air.","With the cluster of volatile Realities holding hundreds of thousands of Aeonic Soul Damage Values he had conjured so freely, he looked like an unblemished being of utmost power that couldn't be opposed!"]},{"number":2303,"title":"Chapter 2303: Chapter 2302 Let’s get crazy! I","paragraphs":["His grandeur was unmatchable as with a hand in the air, he conjured a stellar cluster of cerulean Realities that emanated hundreds of thousands of Aeonic Soul Damage Values!","One of the foremost Noblesse reacted extremely fast as he tried to keep his composure while feeling the deathly sensation above, ignoring that he had just told this being he would rip him apart and make the woman beside him watch as they began to pull back while he voiced out with immense humbleness and humility- while at the same time, his body and the bodies of all others erupted with the densest concentrations of the VOID as if their very lives depended on it!","<We seem to have made a mistake, Sir. Why don't we let bygones be byg->","<Now now, it is much too late for regrets.> Noah waved his hands before this being finished talking as his eyes pulsed with waves of Tyranny.","<Let's just enjoy the last few moments you have to experience Extremity.>","...!","His hand remained in the air as his index finger flickered again.","It meant...","BZZT!","Another dazzling cluster of cerulean Realities formed from Aeonic Mana of Extremity bloomed as the faces of the enemies it was directed at turned even paler.","And his ginger flickered again soon after as another cluster of Realities formed!","And another!","And another!","...!","All color drained from the Noblesse as the weaker ones that remained in the interstellar vessel also felt an astonishing sense of dread and disbelief while staring at the dreary glacial skies above them.","Multiple clusters of Reality bloomed as each one could decimate with over 1 Million Aeonic Soul Damage Values, and Noah called forth multiple!","It was utterly overkill as he didn't truly need to do it.","But he did it nonetheless since he now had {Aeonic Mana of Extremity Manipulation} and could use his Mana to endlessly release abilities or form any constructs he could imagine!","His hand that was hung in the air felt like a blade on the necks of his enemies as...it finally came down as the multiple clusters of cerulean Realities surged down at a ridiculously fast speed, meeting their enemies who had erupted with the VOID in a maddening fashion!","The Obsidian Innate Boundary of the VOID erupted with fervor to spread out a blinding darkness!","But the darkness only shone for a moment before it was entirely eclipsed by a terrifying blue sea, the True Emperor of Quintessence truly having chucked multiples Realities as bombs towards his enemies as the explosive light of blue covered nearby light-years and caused an eruption of the glacial landmarks of this area!","Ophelia watched it all happen with amazement as she nodded her head with appreciation.","This...was just the welcome before the True Emperor of Quintessence delved into the Abyss!","<14x Golden Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","<5x Obsidian Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","His blue gold Emperor's Robe rose and fell majestically over his visage as he watched the destruction with his head held high.","The Noblesse outside of the teardrop shaped interstellar vessel and those within it had disappeared entirely when the scene cleared, glacial tendrils of NULLITY being the only thing arcing across space as pieces of glacial Islands fractured chaotically!","Those within the Chaoticus Behemoth Transporter were gobsmacked at the scene before them as the outer periphery of the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity they were near seemed to have a chunk of it destroyed.","Ophelia gazed at this scene with sharp eyes as she turned to her left and right, her voice coming out soon after.","<This is just a party of the Noblesse we came across. Many others are already at the entry point of the Abyss as if we don't want to miss out...we have to hurry!>","Her eyes were free of worry as she listened to the words of Wisdom, her main body making a move in the Abecedarian Sacrarium to deem Wisdom Quintessential and gain the wings to fly towards the 9th Boundary Layer!","It was a move that would make her one of the more powerful existences in this whole region.","Noah nodded at her words as his figure turned into a streak of blue light that surged towards the glacial Caverns of the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity.","The Chaoticus Behemoth Transporter behind them received orders from Ophelia as it flew low, bringing the rest of the Ancestral Lernaeans towards the innermost regions quietly as Ophelia turned into a golden light that surged beside Noah.","The powerful party of Noblesse was eradicated and not even mentioned again as if what Noah had done was just a casual flick of his hands!","—","After the endless fall that dropped existences on a black earth.","Deep within the region that was termed the Abyss by those who first discovered it.","The situation had drastically changed from what it was when just a few groups of the Lineages of Ancestral Lernaeans, Quasarians, and Noblesse were here!","Three domains were drawn across the vibrant stellar black desert as they all crossed the black gold lake that used to hold clusters of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity.","Currently, the whole black gold oasis was cleared out as it was unknown as to which groups obtained the most Treasures.","A dreadful sense of tension permeated the surroundings as all groups were on guard, with the battles having died down by now as the attention of all three Lineages was focused on the transparent veil of light far from them that showed multiple titanic eyes of dreadfully massive creatures staring towards them!","Their eyes dripped of coldness and intellect as their bodies gave off a heavy feeling of oppression as from one massive creature, it had now increased to over a dozen.","On the side of Quasarians.","A stellar Obsidian platform releasing waves of gravitational light was laid down towards the center of their encampment, terrifying auras clustered here as Prince Zagugan was not the most powerful Quasarian who was now here!","Over a dozen other Princes with his stature appeared as they formed a neat line currently behind a single being.","A being whose very existence caused crackles of potent essence of Boundaries of Extremity to surge around him, multiple tendrils of light weaving around him that showed he grasped at the very least 3 or 4 Boundaries at the 9th Boundary Layer!"]},{"number":2304,"title":"Chapter 2304: Chapter 2303 Let’s get crazy! II","paragraphs":["Potent waves of the essence of Boundaries swirled around this being as he had reached such proficiency and control of his Aeonic Soul that it was now completely integrated with his Aspects of Existence- a hallmark of those who had achieved the 9th Boundary Layer as this was known as Aeonic Soul Sublimation!","Existences that had reached Aeonic Soul Sublimation were to be feared as the level of power they could freely release from their souls was unimaginable, with their damage simply catastrophic compared to others of the lower level.","Reaching this stage meant one had their Aspects of Existence ready for the profound transformation of becoming an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","Powerhouses like this were treasured in any Lineage as having one of the more powerful ones here from the Quasarian Lineage paired with a dozen more Quasarian Princes that had achieved a single Boundary at the 9th Boundary Layer, it showed just what level of importance they placed on this location.","The existence that Prince Zagugan and others lined up behind had closed eyes that sparkled with clusters of trillions of quasars, his voice magnetic and full of power as he spoke with his eyes remaining closed.","<The words of Augur Kaito are true...when the dark lands filled with treasured light are unveiled and those imprisoned within roar out with rage, the Extremity Sanctification will begin.>","This being repeated the words that Prince Zagugan had uttered- words that were picked up on by Ancestor Rodwig and a nearby Noblesse that was surging towards the black gold oasis at the time as this intelligence had already spread across the three Lineages!","ROAAR!","As if to cement his words, Plane shattering roars boomed out from behind the transparent veil in sequence as the monstrous behemoths behind it seemed as if they were making battle cries.","Prince Zagugan had a pondering expression as he voiced out.","<This bears immense opportunity as well as great danger, Reverend Emperor Septimius. I feel like the veil...>","<It will fall soon.>","WAA!","The one termed Reverend Emperor Septimius nodded with his eyes opening ever so slightly, releasing a dazzling radiance that nearly covered everything here!","<During this venture, a great danger will unfold as none of your lives are guaranteed- even mine.>","...!","Words that caused the eyes of the Princes behind him to open in shock emanated out as none of them denied him, their trust running too deep!","<But there will also be an overabundance of opportunity as that is what Extremity Sanctification is. If any of us manage to overcome the coming challenges, reaching the stage of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform is not an impossibility. Thereafter...Extremity will only be a few steps away.>","BOOM!","Shocking words were released from him as behind the Princes, clusters of Quasarians ranging from those that had achieved the 8th to the 6th Boundary Layers stretched out behind them in terrific Legions- similar stances being seen on the side of the Noblesse and Ancestral Lernaeans as each had their own domains and vessels enacted, waiting patiently for what was coming.","It felt like a bomb that was getting ready to explode as on the side of the Ancestral Lernaeans, half of the Aeonic Soul Clone of Ancestor Rodwig could be seen gradually healing with a grim expression, three women in verdant robes beside him releasing abundant life force from their hands as they continued to heal him.","He did not come out unscathed from the clash with Prince Zagugan even after devouring any Aeonic Treasures of Extremity he came across, but he had devoured enough to the extent that he felt the 9th Boundary Layer of the Sword...was infinitely close.","His somber gaze was shared by other Ancestral Lernaeans at the same level as him, and there were even pristine Elder Ancestors who had achieved the 9th Boundary Layer who were currently clustered around a single being!","<Our Seers are confirming the words about Extremity Sanctification. How are we proceeding...>","Their words were filled with caution as among the three Lineages here, theirs was undoubtedly the weakest!","Even the one who had arrived to lead them was a renowned combatant of the Ancestral Lernaeans who had managed to bring two Boundaries to the 9th Boundary Layer- a terrifying genius among the generation of Ancestors who had first arrived to explore the Havens of Extremity!","His gaze was utterly radiant as he was known as Reverend Emperor Achilles.","<Our race has always lagged behind. It is time to whether through life and death and see if we can produce more Apex Aeonic Lifeforms. Only then can we truly establish a lineage that survives across the spacetime continuum...>","His words caused a stifling feeling in the chest of Ancestral Lernaeans to rise as their eyes turned cold and sharp, gazing towards the dazzling transparent veil as their thoughts were hard to understand!","On the side of Noblesse, a myriad of teardrop shaped interstellar vessels fractured and beaten up could be seen pulsing with light after surviving the fall into the Abyss.","Their Commanders and beings of power were just as abundant as the Princes and single Reverend Emperor of the Quasarians, but their uniqueness was the Legions behind them that brought two massive eyes chained by stellar light!","It was a pair of eyes shining with abundant Clarity as beside them, the figures of multiple Noblesse who had achieved the 6th and 7th Boundary Layers could be seen, and uniquely...a being that didn't have the Lineage of Noblesse was among them.","The prideful and arrogant Noblesse actually gazed towards him like a peer as with golden waves of light surging around him, the eyes of Oppenheimer opened to show an endless sea of Destiny!","Arcs of Nullity surged above this group and all others here as from the transparent veil far from them, streaks of RUIN could also be seen beginning to permeate outwards as this event promised boundless mystery and death.","And at this moment, far above this location- in the extending cylindrical abyss that formed deep in the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity.","The figure of a certain True Emperor appeared as a woman clad in the golden light of Wisdom could be seen near him!","His figure rumbled with arcs of blue light as his eyes released endless cerulean grandeur, gazing at the endless darkness below him as without a word...he jumped."]},{"number":2305,"title":"Chapter 2305: Chapter 2304 Let’s Get Crazy! III","paragraphs":["2304 Let's get crazy! III","In a serene environment away from wars and conflict.","A contained sea of boundary essence brimming with Vitality and a vibrant essence that would even be capable of nourishing one's Aeonic Soul could be seen as atop this sea that was the size of a Cosmos, the figure of a young woman whose skin shone with a stellar glow could be seen.","Countless quasars formed her stellar visage as she had a sad expression on her face, tendrils of the life-force on the sea she floated on constantly sinking into her and nourishing her as every now and then, one could see her body flash with a translucent light that showed a deadly and terrifying scene within!","Devilish tendrils of a type of RUIN could be seen snaking across all vessels of her body as they constantly ate up the life-force being infused into her.","She gritted her teeth through the pain as she gazed out towards an expanse of stellar nothingness, this being a domain only she was enclosed in as it was uniquely molded for her!","At this time...","HOONG!","An obsidian portal opened near the cosmic sea of life force she was on as a figure with utterly dreadful waves of Extremity stepped out.","He looked towards the young woman atop the cosmic sea as a smile came on his lips while he drew close.","<Little Xiaomi, how are you feeling today?>","Even with the potent waves of Extremity surging around him, this being seemed ever so gentle to the young girl who smiled painfully towards him while trying to clench her fist and raise it up.","<Father, have you ever seen a girl as strong as me? I woke up today and felt like I could live another billion years!>","...!","She said the words out to assure him, but when he heard them, his powerful eyes trembled as he was reminded of the cruel reality.","He was reminded that she would not even live for another hundred years, much less a billion!","A feeling of immense weakness coursed through him even amidst his overabundance of strength, his soul feeling unbearable pain as he couldn't manage to look at his daughter again as he nodded while waving his hands to cause the appearance of over a dozen Aeonic Treasures of Extremity that flew towards the cosmic sea his daughter floated in. <Just wait a little longer, Little Xiaomi. Something has risen that may just hold the key.>","His eyes seemed to have made a decision he couldn't make before as he looked towards the young girl with immense guilt and love, floating back towards the Obsidian portal as Xiaomi nodded with the strongest smile she could muster.","In no time, the extremely powerful being disappeared from this domain as only a young girl was left staring out at a stellar expansion of nothingness- pain and sadness being the only thing in her gaze!","Outside of this domain.","The existence emanating waves of potent Boundaries had a cold look on his face as he appeared above the barrier of a massive Plane of Existence, clusters of other Planes of Existence stretching out around him as he was in one of the Sacred Quasarian Planes where the core power of Quasarians was held!","His cold eyes gazed at the vastness around him as he spoke.","<I will be making a trip to the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity. I should be able to find something that can cure her of this there...especially with the Extremity Sanctification that shall bloom from it.>","He should've been speaking to nobody, but a sigh was heard from the veils of Extremity around him as an ancient voice stemming out of an entirely different form of life echoed out.","<Caesar...even the power of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform wasn't able to remove the RUIN interlinked with her Aspects of Existence. Only an existence that has reached the Extremity of RUIN may be able to cure her...but such a being isn't one even I dare stand in front of. But you are right, there may be a possibility in that place. After all, it will be a baptism through RUIN.>","The voice was deep and ancient as it stood on an entirely different stage of life- stemming from none other than an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","Reverend Emperor Caesar said nothing at these words as his body simply emanated glorious waves of power.","From what could be discerned, ten shocking strands of Boundaries expanded towards the 9th Boundary Layer could be seen around this being, his power being at the very peak as he was actually known by all Civilizations wading across the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!","The voice of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform rang out again amidst the silence.","<This may be the last trip you are able to make freely, Caesar. You will not be able to repress your Realm any longer as the process of transformation of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform will start budding within you soon. As soon as this happens....you cannot compete for the opportunities of lesser Lifeforms anymore. Finish this well and come join us. There are grander possibilities even within this Aeonic Haven of Dissolution waiting for you as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, not to mention the other Havens you can traverse to. The answers you seek may also be there.>","WAA!","A smidgen of secrecy was revealed as one may wonder why in an area like the Abyss within the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity that was found to have clusters of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity... didn't have the strongest forces of the Lineages that discovered it sent over.","Why didn't the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of the Ancestral Lernaeans, Quasarians, and Noblesse come to end things cleanly?!","This involved grand workings within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution and the Havens of Extremity in totality as only the truly powerful beings knew!","Caesar nodded at the words of the Apex Aeonic Lifeform that never showed itself as he gazed towards a certain direction...and he disappeared a moment later as he set off.","He was known by many names and had grand accolades.","He had appeared multiple times across the billions of years to end wars in the victory of the Quasarians as among the many titles he was known by, the most pronounced one was a grand accolade.","The Mad Reverend Emperor.","The being that broke into Sacrariums and Domains of Noblesse to seek Treasures and cures for his daughter as he came out unscathed!","The Terror of Dissolution!","The Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar set off for the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity as his inclusion... would spell utter catastrophe for all others!","ps: There are still some that are being edited."]},{"number":2306,"title":"Chapter 2306: Chapter 2305 Let’s Get Crazy! IV","paragraphs":["2305 Let's get crazy! IV","Tendrils of NULLITY coursed around him as he fell.","Endless darkness was all that accompanied him as Noah thought about his lack of focus on the path of NULLITY, and how he had sought to fuse this state of verisimilitude with Mana!","He had the inkling that when he went across the stages of Nullity and expanded it towards a Boundary, only then would he have the possibility of pairing it up with the Aeonic Mana of Extremity as the two would be ever closer towards each other- each one seeking Extremity.","It may even be possible with the other state of verisimilitude that he could barely feel wisps of right now- RUIN.","These were his passing thoughts as he fell down endlessly with only darkness around him.","The Boundary of Manadynamics pulsed as it senses the Essences around Noah, his feet beginning to burst with a dazzling cerulean glow of light that went on to cover his body entirely, his descent seeming like an incandescent meteor descending onto the abyss!","The essence of Manadynamics continued to pulse around him as even though he couldn't see, he could feel the countless waves of energies intermixed as very quickly, he felt like the bottom was nearing!","When others fell into the abyss, they smashed into the black earth as they found it unbearable to even move, with those who had only expanded the 6th Boundary Layer barely being capable of slowly moving across the stellar black earth as every step took great effort from the reinforcement of their souls.","Only those who had further expanded the 7th and 8th Boundary Layers like Elder Ancestor Rodwig could move with some freedom, and only existences who had reached Aeonic Soul Sublimation could freely manage to even float in this dreadful region that held a heavy weight of Extremity!","Noah's descent was glorious as akin to a shining blue meteor, he cascaded down and felt the black earth below before he neared it, his Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul releasing waves of pristine grandiosity as its complete integration to the rest of him allowed utmost control, his descent slowing down as a gorgeous scene unfolded.","He neared the black earth as if a graceful celestial stellar existence from ancient times was descending, his visage being caught in the eyes of the closest Boundary Expansion Realm experts of all three Lineages tasked with seeing which other forces came down.","There was a clear line of distinction between the Quasarians, Noblesse, and the Ancestral Lernaeans as normally after a being came down- they would very quickly go towards where their Lineage was clustered!","But what about Noah?","HOONG!","A droning sound boomed out as radiant blue Aeonic Mana of Extremity formed into a Miniature sea below his feet, his figure slowing his descent as he became ever slower when he neared the black earth until...he floated a few feet above it.","His blue gold Emperor's robe fluttered with glory as his hands were clasped behind his back, his eyes rising as he came to gaze upon the myriad of powerful existences here.","The Noblesse that began their encampment to his left and the Quasarians that began their encampment straight ahead looked at him with sharp gazes of killing intent as they ascertained he wasn't of their Lineage, and they deemed him a powerful Commander as he was currently floating with ease in this space- something that only those who had arrived at the stage of Aeonic Soul Sublimation were able to do so far!","At the same time, the Ancestral Lernaeans encampment that began to his right gazed towards him with caution as he wasn't a being they knew of in their Lineage- as all existences that had reached the 9th Boundary Layer in ant Boundary were renowned and known!","This was until...","WAA! 1","Another figure descended into the abyss as a golden light of grandeur fluttered, a rough and pristine aura actually erupting out with the descent of this being as a bubbling sea of halcyon light supported their feet- this being controlling her descent and not smashing down as her feet came to land gracefully on the black sand.","<Phew...>","An expression of amazement and joy could be seen on the face of the entrant as to others, she seemed like a powerful Commander at the peak of the 8th Boundary Layer to do what she did.","They didn't know that this being's main body had just deemed a Boundary to be Quintessential as it took it past the 8th Boundary Layer and fantastically expanded it to the 9th, the power she expressed now simply being rough due to her recent advancement as she didn't let it be known that she had arrived at this Boundary yet!","But her visage was known as the eyes of the Ancestral Lernaeans lit up with surprise, some Commanders even speaking out as they recognized her.","To them, she was Sacrarium Empress Ophelia.","And their eyes lit up with even more surprise when they saw her walk towards and stay close to the unknown Aeonic Soul Sublimation expert that had a dazzling blue sea below him.","Was he truly one of theirs?","The commanding forces of the Ancestral Lernaeans reached out towards Ophelia as her Automaton Boundary Modulator lit up, but at this time, Noah was still gazing at the darkness around him and the myriad of beings of different races before his eyes.","On the side of the Noblesse, he saw glorious vessels and two massive Eyes chained by stellar black light-eyes that caused his own to pulse as if they were alike!","He also felt a rousing pulse of Destiny as he smiled lightly when gazing towards this direction!","His Will continued to wander around as he didn't choose any side to go towards.","He looked at the massive transparent veil in the distance and the terrifying auras behind it.","His heart actually pulsed with an unknown dozen pairs of eyes that were each more massive than even Cosmos!","From them, he felt ruin and destruction.","Quintessence and Loot communicated with him about many things as did Wisdom.","They all said how a terrifying catastrophe and chaos was about to break out as the means he could employ to gain the most opportune results were limited in the unfolding chaos!","<Well in that case...>","Did he have to wait for the chaos to begin?","Did he have to choose a side here?","If there weren't an overabundance of paths and opportunities for him to obtain the best possible results in the coming chaos, why didn't he just create them himself?","Even though he felt terrifying auras of power at the depths of the encampment of the Ancestral Lernaeans, Quasarians, and Noblesse, he wasn't fearful.","And he didn't consider any of the three sides allies as to him...they were all competitors on his path of conquest!","So instead of waiting for the chaos to begin like all these powerful beings here, he may just as well begin the chaos.","...!","His eyes flashed with tyranny as he felt a rising feeling of conquest erupt from the depths of his Soul.","The sea of Aoenic Mana of Extremity below his feet churned.","<Let's get crazy...even if just for a little bit.>","WAA!","He has just arrived as he didn't wait for the eruption of chaos and disorder.","He would be the one to cause it as at this moment, the abyssal dark skies above began to light up with a cerulean light.","Noah's eyes reflected this blue color as he looked at the powerful Legions and forces of the Quasarians, Noblesse, and the Ancestral Lernaeans.","He looked at all of them...as countless clusters of cerulean Realities began to appear in the abyssal skies!"]},{"number":2307,"title":"Chapter 2307: Chapter 2306 Extremity Sanctification! I","paragraphs":["2306 Extremity Sanctification! I","The glow of Destiny wrapped around him tightly, seeking solace in his soul as if it was its home.","He was surrounded by beings not of his race, yet their gazes towards him were clear as if he was their brethren!","He was towards the center of the Legions of Noblesse as regal figures of Noblesse Commanders surrounded him, the two vibrant Eyes of Clarity dug out from the living body of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform still chained by a terrifying authority and placed in the hands of specific Noblesse being seen nearby.","They released beams of radiant light in the surroundings as their gaze eventually came to land on the veil of light far from them that held back massive creatures.","Behind this veil was what everyone was here for.","The incandescent light of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity could be seen in abundance behind this veil as even though this was what Ancestral Lernaeans, Quasarians, and Noblesse would wage a bloody fight for... this was not what Oppenheimer fought for! He knew that his destiny lay in something else entirely.","<Commander Oppenheimer, what do the Lernaeans think of you when they see you amongst us? I can see the gazes of some of the Aeonic Soul Sublimation beings among them pass over here and focus on you every now and then.>","Words filled with curiosity rang out from a Noblesse Commander to his left who released waves of authority of multiple Boundaries at the 7th Boundary Layer!","Oppenheimer's expression remained placid at such words as he gazed towards the Ancestral Lernaeans briefly while the Noblesse Commander continued.","<Do you think they still have the benefit of the doubt that you joined us to somehow betray us in the end? That you would return to the Lernaeans at the end of all this? Haha!>","The Noblesse Commander laughed boisterously at his words as those nearby also smiled, these beings seemingly knowing something others didn't!","Oppenheimer shook his head as he replied calmly.","<They do not know anything. After all->","He was about to continue.","But he had to stop.","The glow of Destiny covered his eyes as he saw something shocking, his gaze turning upwards to the abyssal darkness above them.","The dark space of this domain that only contained traces of NULLITY and tendrils of RUIN!","At this moment, Oppenheimer saw the flickering of cerulean flashes of light.","It seemed like the blooming of blue singularities, of profound stellar constructs that pulsed with a heart throbbing sense of danger.","HOONG!","Waves of stellar majesty flashed as momentarily, the dark skies were tinged blue as it seemed like a vast stellar sea!","A sea of dangerous vacillating clusters of Realities that carried the essence of Extremity that made all existences at the 7th Boundary Layer and below tremble while causing all those at the 8th Boundary Layer to gaze forward with solemnity.","A flash of blue that caused the eyes of Aeonic Soul Sublimation existences to light up as what was most deafening and ridiculous...was how vast of an area the clusters of blue Realities covered!","If any beings here were told this was a normal phenomenon, they would deny it as an impossibility as this could only be something produced by the Havens of Extremity.","A catastrophic event that was meant to weed out the weakest!","Some beings even gazed up and questioned whether this was the beginning of the Extremity Sanctification!","But the eyes of Oppenheimer were covered in gold as he was among the beings whose gaze instantly turned towards a certain direction.","The other beings were Aeonic Soul Sublimation Reverends who were able to instantly pinpoint a Source!","And others....were those near the entry of the Abyss that had seen a similar light wrap around a certain being during his descent.","Their eyes and Wills briefly turned towards the direction of the True Emperor of Quintessence who had closed his eyes at this moment, a symphony surging around him as his hands were outstretched upwards towards the vast sea of clusters of Realities he conjured- his hands flinging down at this moment in an utterly glorious fashion as if he was the conductor of a grand symphony!","HOONG!","And the vast blue sea in the abyssal skies began its descent.","A descent that within a nanosecond had covered half the distance as in another...it had already arrived above the heads of those standing on the black earth below.","<...>","And the blue sea crashed down as cataclysm bloomed!","Truth be told. a small. single cluster of Realities was each a little over 1 Million Aeonic Soul Damage Values as it was something that existences who had achieved the 8th Boundary Layer could dish out and defend against.","What was unbelievable and impossible... was the scale at which such clusters of Realities were thrown out!","A few thousand existences who had achieved the 8th Boundary Layer had to cast such an ability simultaneously to cause such a vast change in the skies!","Yet a single being had done so as the speed at which the attacks of existences who had fully integrated their souls to the rest of their Aspects of Existence reached...such speed was enough that only beings near this stage could even follow.","So the vast sea that seemed like a sea of blue stars from afar descended and smashed down before the vast majority of beings could defend themselves!","But there were still extremely powerful existences here.","Before the blue sea fully fell and even a nanosecond before it arrived, the central areas of the three Lineages here bloomed with fantastical and impenetrable defensive lights that emanated from the truly powerful beings here.","Some even surged up to meet the blue sea of Realities before it arrived!","But the glorious defensive lights of the strongest beings here weren't able to cover every field of space.","The time was too short!","The Boundary Expansion Realm experts in the periphery who weren't surrounded by 8th Boundary Layer Existences or Aeonic Soul Sublimation experts were left to defend themselves as they faced a terrifying Apocalypse!"]},{"number":2308,"title":"Chapter 2308: Chapter 2307 Extremity Sanctification! II","paragraphs":["2307 Extremity Sanctification! II","The stellar black earth of the Abyss became covered by a layer of blue as massive explosions releasing millions of Aeonic Soul Damage Values rose out in waves.","The architect of all this was surrounded by a high-paced symphony of grandeur as his arms waver around gloriously as if he was a conductor, his eyes opening to see his destruction as he was met with an utterly beautiful sight of cascading golden prompts.","<38x Golden Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","<55x Golden Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","<27x Golden Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","<69x Golden Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","<44x Golden Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","<77x Golden Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","<17x Obsidian Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","<28x Obsidian Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","...!","A rain of Loot prompts.","The grandeur that signified boons from the forces of three powerful Civilizations!","Ophelia stood beside him staunchly even though she knew his actions meant he would be targeted by terrifying existences.","Her eyes shone with profound wisdom as after adding a false layer to propel herself to the 9th Boundary Layer of Wisdom, she saw the reality around her very differently.","She saw that even though the actions he took were drastic yet grand, he...was only fishing amidst unfolding chaos.","But he didn't wait for this chaos to begin as he simply initiated it for his own best possible results!","As for the rage and anger from the most powerful beings here being directed towards him?","For the answer to this, Ophelia's stellar brown eyes were pulled towards the far distance where one could see the transparent veil...begin to flash with radiance as it slowly melted and disappeared amidst the chaos.","The most powerful beings of the three Lineages here would not even be able to direct their wrath towards him as when the destruction of the stellar rivers of Realities ended and the auras of multiple Aeonic Soul Sublimation experts surged towards their direction, the roars of terrifying creatures rang out!","Amidst the shattered black earth that now had crystallized sand and molten cerulean lava flowing, many Wills rose out to see the fading veil as the terrors within were made clear, some of them using their titanic limbs and claws to tear off the residual Layers of the veil as they sought to exit with purpose.","Word had been passed to the Ancestral Lernaeans as the term Extremity Sanctification also reached the ears of Ophelia and Noah. They had their own thoughts as to what could be happening as at this moment, Noah's hand landed on Ophelia's shoulder to take her out of a trance.","<Are you ready?>","The True Emperor of Quintessence continued to see fantastical boons in the form of prompts as the reason he undertook such a drastic action that would make all beings here his declared enemies was simple.","From the overabundance of Treasure Caches he would receive, there would be dozens and dozens of Complete Golden and Obsidian Aeonic Pearls of Extremity stemming out as he could utilize all of them to raise the Boundary Layers of concepts, sacrifice them for Quintessential Experience Points of Extremity, and then direct them towards his strongest Boundaries!","From the hundreds of Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches he had already obtained, hundreds of Complete Golden and Obsidian Aeonic Pearls of Extremity would bloom as this...was a path he could take to very quickly obtain the necessary tools to match the terrifying monsters he was coming across.","The necessary tools to bring Quintessence, Blood, and Manadynamics towards the 7th and 8th Boundary Layers...and even further beyond! 1","These tools were falling in his hands, and so did their consequences as even though the unfolding chaos was beautifully timed as the veil in the distance fell and forced the attention of the truly powerful beings on it, the Beasts behind it, and the overabundance of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity they could see even further behind these Beasts...even though many eyes were forced to turn towards this direction, there was still a few dreadful lights of power that shot out from each of the three Lineages.","Each one held shocking speed and power as it was an existence at the stage of Aeonic Soul Sublimation.","This was the consequence of his grand actions as three existences that had reached the 9th Boundary Layers from the Ancestral Lernaeans, Quasarians, and Noblesse surged towards him like quantum bombs!","This wasn't to even mentioned the unknown creatures breaking out and about to surge towards all beings here!","HOONG!","Waves of Extremity surged as Ophelia felt Noah's hand and breathed out, golden words of wisdom only she could see surging around her as she nodded.","<You're putting me to work too early...but I am ready, Sacrarium Master.>","A smile formed on her lips for the unknown future to come as beside her, Noah's body surged with Aeonic Mana of Extremity.","His entire figure became ablaze with cerulean flames as...a construct he termed Aeonic Mana of Extremity Barrier formed around him, along with stacks and stacks of other barriers and auras each holding over a million in Aeonic Soul Defense Values!","His eyes were fearless and filled with a blazing light of conquest as he actually didn't pull back at the sight of three 9th Boundary Layer Aeonic Soul Sublimation experts surging towards him, his figure shooting out like a coiled singularity as tendrils of profound blue light surged from his eyes.","He felt a bubbling sensation of power and valor as for him, this was his path towards Extremity!","It couldn't be normal.","It had to be one of a kind!","BZZZT!","Incandescent cerulean radiance surged as he looked like an Emperor from times unrecorded even on the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","He followed the path of Quintessence as while he was faithful to his Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul, it triggered a profound Resonance of all the Boundaries within him as his Will formed into a terrific Haki- a Haki that exploded out into a wave of glorious majesty as he released a bellow that nearly matched the roars of the Beasts surging out in the distance!","<OOOOOH!!!>","...!"]},{"number":2309,"title":"Chapter 2309: Chapter 2308 Extremity Sanctification! III","paragraphs":["The actions had been taken as Noah's main body would be the one to reap the rewards.","His task was the opening of the many recently gained Treasure Caches, upgrade, and burn Boundary Layers to fuel Quintessence, Blood, Loot, and Manadynamics until he grew powerful enough to face existences that had reached the 9th Boundary Layer.","Because at this moment...the reality truly was that his Aeonic Soul Damage Values could not exceed theirs!","The only reason for his boldness was one thing.","It was his Infinite Mana.","It was his capability to spam!","So even though the three Aeonic Soul Sublimation Reverends that surged over carried billowing pressure and Aeonic Soul Damage Values in the tens of millions, his figure released a wave of Haki that boomed out with over a single Million Damage Value, he had Layers of auras and barriers each carrying over a Million Damage Value, and to top it all off...a domain of an Apocalyptic Blitzkrieg descended.","Massive cerulean Infinity symbols formed behind him and smashed forward as each one pulsed with terrifying gravitational waves.","And then flames rose behind him as it seemed like he brought a whole sea into this fight as even though he may not currently be able to take down his enemies...","'I can spam you all to exhaustion!'","BOOM!","The initial clash between the Wills and forces of the two sides occurred as to top off everything around Noah, the golden glow of Wisdom was ever so prevalent as Ophelia was right beside him.","Her radiant visage gave off waves of majesty as a golden light reinforced everything around Noah, the billowing waves of power that the three Reverends brought over actually being nullified after they smashed through the Infinite symbols, auras, and seas of volatile Realities reinforced by the golden light of Wisdom as the enemies before them became utterly clear.","A Reverend Noblesse holding a massive stature as uniquely designed rings covered various parts of his body. A Reverend Quasarian who emanated terrifying gravitational force and temperature that made him put ancient suns to shame!","And an Ancestral Lernaean Reverend that Noah recognized by the name of Elder Ancestor Riddick who bellowed out towards Ophelia.","<Sacrarium Empress Ophelia...what is this?!>","BOOM!","His voice carried explosive force as tangible change and transformation began to bloom in the nearby reality around this being.","Changes in reality were also occurring around the other 2 Reverends as for the first time in history, three Aeonic Soul Sublimation existences of different Lineages in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution actually moved in conjunction to quickly put to rest a single being as terrifying Planar Domains of these beings erupted out!","But even in the face of all this, Noah only took in the results of the fact that he actually rebuffed their heavy Damage Values with stacks of abilities, even though 90% were broken through before he reapplied the auras and barriers again.","He still held confidence in the face of all this because just as these beings in front of him released their Planar Domains...so did he.","And herein lay another significant part of his strength.","Planar Domains cost a great deal of one's Aeonic Soul Values as most beings could cast it a few times if not two to three times as it was under a time limit.","But ever since Noah gained the Boundary of Manadynamics and further reduced his rate of regeneration of all Resources within 10 Minutes, paired with the profound reality altering Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul came with a stellar description...he could do even more ridiculous things.","Part of the description within the 7th Boundary Layer of Manadynamics was of utmost importance.","It read....","<...You have an infinite amount of Mana, so let it be put to use. 90% of all the required Aeonic Soul Values required to cast anything will be paid for by the Aeonic Mana of Extremity...>","90%","The cost to cast the Halcyon Plane of Loot was a tenth of his Soul as he could activate it for 1 minute, the Planar Domain of Sanguinity also cost a tenth of his Soul as he could activate it for 1 minute, and the Quintessential Hegemony of the Emperor took 95% of his Aeonic Soul Values to be active for 2 minutes.","Noah recovered 10% of his Maximum Aeonic Soul Values every minute.","It meant that due to his now Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul covering for 90% of all used Aeonic Soul Values, his three Planar Domains for Loot, Blood, and Quintessence combined would all cost him a little less than 10% of his Aeonic Soul Values all together.","His cost to keep three Planar Domains active...was fully covered and exceeded by his rate of regeneration!","This brought forward the broken reality wherein Noah...could call forth his three Planar Domains and keep them active indefinitely if he wished!","And so, he erupted with this tool right away as a wondrous glow of gold, Crimson, and a myriad of colors erupted as the 6th Boundary Layers of Loot, Blood, and Quintessence were called upon.","HOONG!","His soul cried with profound fervor and wonder.","His Bound Natural Laws and Decreta flowed their authorities passively into even the initiation of these Boundaries as they shone with incandescent waves of power.","Massive Treasure Caches began to bloom for all to see as for the Planar Domain of Sanguinity, a dazzling Crimson sea of blood formed while a massive Crimson crown dripping with blood came to float above Noah- a Crimson robe also extending behind him and connecting with this sea of blood as he seemed to be the source!","And for the Quintessential Hegemony of the Emperor- for the Planar Boundary of Quintessence that always changed if Noah allowed it to be cast naturally...it wasn't massive Planar chains of extremity this time around.","The multicolored light of Quintessence shone in multiple areas as it bloomed to bring to fruition constructs with humanoid figures!","They seemed to be made of pure multicolored light as an aurora of light formed wings behind them, their figures becoming adorned in a multicolored armament screaming of Extremity as their hands held massive hammers releasing a terrifying radiance.","Multiple of such constructs formed as when Noah looked at them, the term <Quintessential Empyrean Planar Guards> rose in his mind!"]},{"number":2310,"title":"Chapter 2310: Chapter 2309 Extremity Sanctification! IV","paragraphs":["This was the amalgamated authority of the Planar Domain of Quintessence as dozens of such <Quintessential Empyrean Planar Guards> formed, their bodies very quickly becoming tinged with a crimson and golden light as yet another feature of Noah's Planar Domain of Quintessence bloomed.","It...could Resonate and empower currently cast domains and alter them in unquantifiable ways!","The Quintessential Empyrean Planar Guards became filled with a raging aura of blood and Loot as along with treasured Caches forming something circular domain and opening to release radiant halcyon pillars of light that began to turn the very surrounding reality and everything within it into Loot, they moved with their massive celestial hammers to besiege the Aeonic Soul Sublimation Reverends in a grand show of power.","BZZZT!","This whole area buzzed and trembled at the sheer grandiosity and power released as even with all of this...Noah had yet to utilize the ability with a heavy cost to attain the Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity form!","With his explosion of domains, the Reverends he faced bellowed out as the reality around them transformed into grand constructs as well.","And the visage of the dazzling figure of Ophelia beside him released a magnificent light of power as the Planar Domain of Wisdom also unfolded!","A great deal of things were happening as all this...was only localized to this small region Noah was in.","Across the stellar black earth that had areas flowing with cerulean molten sand due to Noah's attacks, there were the Legions of Noblesse, Lernaeans, and Quasarians that moved like a tide towards the area where a veil had been removed.","The area where an overabundance of light of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity could be seen!","But along with this...were the titanic Beasts who were freely unleashed the moment this veil came down.","What were they, and what exactly was Extremity Sanctification that Augurs and Seers foresaw?","The answer lay in the surging titanic Beasts themselves.","Multiple surged out, but at the forefront, one could see a stellar Obsidian scaled beast that seemed like a giant scorpion.","Its stinger had a cluster of rotating singularities that swallowed the surrounding reality, its eyes filled with a brutal Crimson light of RUIN as even tendrils of NULLITY surged around this creature!","Its nature and Origins were unknown as from among those coming to meet it, the regal bellow of a Reverend Emperor of the Noblesse could be heard.","<Release the Light of Clarity!>","HOOONG!","A brilliant light flickered from the two massive eyes at the center of the formations of the Noblesse.","The eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform that the Noblesse had captured and chained released a bright light that instantly crossed across space to flash over the innumerable beings here, dazzling gold blue letters instantly beginning to form above the heads of existences thereafter!","And above the foremost stellar obsidian scorpion releasing a terrifying light of power that even turned the eyes of Reverend Emperors somber, something glorious appeared.","<Aeonic Prion Scorpiones>","Such a glorious name flashed before everyone's eyes.","But in the eyes of the Noblesse who were granted a specific right through the authority of the Apex Aeonic Eyes of Clarity, even more information unfolded that caused them to be gobsmacked.","Others had their own means as the truly powerful beings forged forward, with the one at the forefront among the three Lineages being Reverend Emperor Septimius who propelled himself forward with a shocking gravitational force, the speed of this being that had multiple Boundaries at the 9th Boundary Layer being utterly insane as he arrived before the <Aeonic Prion Scorpiones> in an instant!","<HO!>","And his body then exploded like the most extreme black sun as it carried shocking momentum and power, seemingly about to smack into the crystalline obsidian scales of the Aeonic Prion Scorpiones when all of a sudden...","CAA!","A cry emanated from this creature as its body...dissolved as if it were foams of a vast sea.","It parted left and right and turned malleable as if it were countless minuscule obsidian stellar foam, surging to the sides of the burning black quasarian sun and reforming behind it to turn back into the shocking form of the Aeonic Prion Scorpiones.","It appeared right behind Reverend Emperor Septimius and the Legions of Quasarians that followed him as its stinger that swirled with multiple spinning singularities then struck out towards a started Reverend Emperor Septimius, and the terrifying claws of this creature struck out as they released tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY that surged like waves to smash onto the Legions before it!","<Ah!>","<Defend!>","Cries of shock and valor rang out as Planar Domains erupted, only to be eaten up by the surging tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY that at this moment...released waves of Extremity.","Extremity!","It meant this creature had the Expanded concepts of RUIN and NULLITY surging around it in the forms of Boundaries, with its stage no doubt being utterly high as they devoured everything in their path!","The Aeonic Prion Scorpiones smashed into the Legions of Quasarians as other Beasts of vastly different shapes and sizes came in contact with the Ancestral Lernaeans and Noblesse.","Their names flashed here and there as they were grand to witness.","<Aeonic Varicella Singularity>","<Aeonic Shigella Ox>","<Aeonic Dragonian Parvoviridae>","Deadly and extremely menacing creatures that seemed to stem from ancient times rushed towards them as behind them, the eyes of all Quasarians, Noblesse, and Ancestral Lernaeans couldn't help but shine with a light of greed as they saw behind the torn veil...were multicolored mountains shining with tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY that held Aeonic Treasures of Extremity!","There were Crimson and Silver floating stellar bodies with waterfalls of essence cascading down as pulsing herbs and treasures with the light of Extremity grew from them, all of this seeming like the opening of a domain from ancient times!","Yet even far within these multicolored mountains filled with the light of Extremity, auras of these powerful Beasts could be felt as to get their hands on them would be an utterly arduous affair.","But this wasn't all.","Something that all beings here shockingly came to notice was that while some Beasts surged towards their Legions, others took to the skies as if the heavy pressure that forced all beings at the 8th Boundary Layer and below didn't exist for them.","They took to the skies as they...traversed up the Abyss that all others descended into.","Like massive flickering lights of RUIN and NULLITY, their destination was the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity...and beyond.","Extremity Sanctification.","Augurs and Seers knew of it.","One of the most powerful Augurs who could gaze at the Aeonic Annals of Extremity was able to find out about it.","But...they truly did not know just what Extremity Sanctification would signify.","They did not know!"]},{"number":2311,"title":"Chapter 2311: Chapter 2310 Extremity Sanctification! V","paragraphs":["The unknown creatures from the Abyss took to the dark skies as they surged out with power!","The prominent beings here could only look on in shock before their Wills returned to the ones they were fighting against, and the biggest task before them was to get past these creatures and get their hands on the Aeonic Treasures of Extremity in the distance.","But this was when the battlefield changed yet again.","HOONG!","In the area where the Aeonic Prion Scorpiones erupted amidst the Quasarians, Reverend Emperor Septimius was able to rebuff its power with his own immense might, but the surprise eruption of waves of RUIN and NULLITY into the formations of Quasarians was deadly.","A few hundred of the powerful Quasarians at the 7th and 6th Boundary Layers were tainted as those at the 8th Boundary Layers were able to resist somewhat!","The main point...were those affected.","Their Origins did not face decay and death under the attacks of the Aeonic Prion Scorpiones.","No. There was something else contained in the Essence of RUIN and NULLITY as the secret lay in the name of this creature.","Prion.","Abnormal pathogenic agents considered terrors across countless histories.","And such creatures were at a stupendously close stage towards Extremity as the Quasarians they attacked...","BZZZT!","Crackled with crimson silver light as they rose back up from the stellar black earth they fell into.","Their eyes were red and filled with RUIN.","Silver wings of NULLITY erupted from their backs.","They rose from the depths of the Abyss as they turned to their very Lineage, those that they stood beside just moments ago...and they roared out while jumping towards unaffected Quasarians with profound fervor of destruction!","...!","A shocking phenomenon unfolded as at the same time, dozens of Quasarians tainted by the essence of the Aeonic Prion Scorpiones were pulled towards it by a terrifying gravitational force, circling around it protectively as the terrific visages of the Quasarians who had 6th Boundary Layers trembled, dazzling light of power emanating from the unknown creature as these existences who should only have power at the 6th Boundary Layer...pulsed before they very quickly began to emanate an aura of those at the 7th Layer.","And the affected Quasarians at the 7th Boundary Layer released blinding radiance of RUIN and NULLITY as they very soon gave off the blinding auras of those at the 8th Boundary Layer!","It was a drastic development that caused the gazes of all the Reverends of the three Lineages here to change, multiple orders being given out at this moment!","<Always move behind an 8th Boundary Commander!>","<Spread out!>","<Destroy those affected and do not be tainted!>","<Do not engage, go further inland and attain the Aeonic Treasures of Extremity!>","Booming commands rang out as across the battlefield, a terrifying quality of those affected by the power of the erupted creatures of the Abyss...turned into those who were then under their control as a wanton massacre unfolded.","—","Across the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","Undercurrents slowly began to surge, but nothing extensive had erupted yet!","In the Abecedarian Sacrarium of the Ancestral Lernaeans.","In the stellar region at the very peak of this Sacrarium, there were spinning multicolored rivers of reality stretching down endlessly below and a vibrant barrier of light above.","It was the Abecedarian Sacrarium where Noah had marked the coordinates of with the Infinite Pylon of Ascension.","And now after some time...","BZZZT!","A multicolored stellar bridge began to form at the very center of the Abecedarian Observatory as Ophelia, Luna, and Katelyn were opposite to it gazing forward with wonder, seeing the allure of the Planar Palisades of Extremity far behind the multicolored bridge, and then the auras of multiple figures being pulled on this bridge to appear before them now!","With hair as golden as the honey of celestial bees, Eowyn was one of the first to arrive as beside her, the visage of the Dream Dimensional Chassis appearing as Noah released it from its constant state of Cultivation to arrive in the Havens of Extremity.","Beside them, Little Henry could be seen next as the figures of the Oldest Dream, the Seeker of Knowledge, and all the other Dimensional Rulers under Noah appeared with their True Sanguine Clones one after another.","The vibrant figures of Adelaide, Barbatos, Kazuhiko, Kraken, Blue Slime, Tiamat, and many others also made their entry into the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","In the distance, the figures of Lilith, Eckert and Europa, and a few others could be seen as a large number of the critical beings from Noah's Infinite Plane appeared, all of them ready to establish themselves in this grand new location!","Ophelia smiled towards them with a warm welcome as she spoke.","<You all are coming into the Havens of Extremity at a really bad time...>","The eyes of her main body reflected the scenes occurring in the Abyss as she continued.","<...but nonetheless, I welcome you to the Abecedarian Sacrarium of the Ancestral Lernaeans. Friends and people of the Sacrarium Master are naturally my people as well, so don't be afraid to ask for help during your acclimation here.>","...!","Her words caught nearly all the new entrants off guard as Eowyn's fair face glimmered while she pushed her gold hair aside, turning towards Noah's clone and asking in exasperation.","<Sacrarium Master? You couldn't have possibly already conquered one of the domains of the Ancestors in just a day, right?>","The title granted to Noah was too astounding as he shook his head calmly, floating towards Ophelia while replying with a straight face.","<No, the conquest finished just a few minutes after I stepped foot in there.>","<...>","Noah casually spoke the truth while leaving everyone speechless, waving his hand to show the Scenes occurring in the Abyss in order to expand the point of view of the new arrivals.","He also gazed at the unfolding scenes and the terrifying creatures as he voiced towards Ophelia.","<What does Wisdom say about Extremity Sanctification?>","The words they kept hearing.","Did even they have no idea what it entailed?"]},{"number":2312,"title":"Chapter 2312: Chapter 2311 Extremity Sanctification! VI","paragraphs":["<Extremity Sanctification...>","Ophelia spoke out calmly as her eyes perused over the many new beings before her who were connected to the Sacrarium Master.","Her eyes even came to lock onto the young man who truly didn't deserve to be called Little Henry anymore, his figure looking valiant as if he was the young prince of an ancient haven visiting common lands!","Ophelia sensed the Boundary of Quintessence from this being along with the potent Bloodline of the Sacrarium Master, Wisdom shining in her eyes as they were led over to Adelaide and the few other dazzlingly beautiful women here as she smiled even brighter.","<Wisdom says it is an opportunity that only those who live through it will enjoy. Those who manage to survive it in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution will be elevated ever closer to Extremity as the lands that the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans stem from are filled with Aeonic Treasures of Extremity.>","...!","<This is connected to the nature of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution itself and the Havens of Extremity as a whole, something that all of our Lineages have been trying to understand...>","As she spoke, she floated towards Queen Adelaide and clasped her hands, kissing her cheeks in a greeting before she bent down to do the same towards the much shorter Barbatos.","<...It deals with one of the core basis of Extremity itself, where Wisdom is interpreting it as a natural phenomenon to put pressure on the countless Lifeforms here, spurring those who can bear such a pressure to evolve into more complex Lifeforms...thus, the process of Extremity Sanctification!>","WAA!","Her utterly shocking beauty as she casually talked about unimaginably important things left many of the inhabitants of the Infinite Plane shaken!","Since she was a being at the 9th Boundary Layer and closer to Extremity than most others here, the beauty she displayed was something very few others matched here as only Adelaide with the Bloodline of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor had a similar glow.","Her beauty didn't have its pronounced effect on Noah as he thought about her words and thought about himself.","He closed his eyes and felt his surging Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul.","He felt his main body in the Infinite Plane as it began to open the Golden and Obsidian Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches.","He felt the process of his main body elevating previously eaten up Boundaries to the 3rd Boundary Layers with Complete Golden Aeonic Pearls of Extremity, only for him to burn and sacrifice these Boundaries repeatedly over and over again as he took everything from them and commanded it to flow into Loot, Quintessence, Blood, and Manadynamics!","He also saw the usage of a Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearl of Extremity that would take a Boundary to the 6th Boundary Layer...be utilized for the Boundary of Dimensions as he wanted to spur the growth of his Origin even faster!","He felt all of these things as his Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul burned with the light of Refinement and Strengthening, his Will surging as Aeonic Soul Values were spent...the Aeonic Annals of Extremity opening before him once more.","He sought knowledge and information.","He sought to understand just what there would be in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution for him...and how he could best benefit from it! His soul was fixated on the creatures being released from the Abyss!","His will buzzed as out of the innumerable books he could view in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, he focused on his current timeline as information began to flow into his mind, his Aeonic Soul Values rapidly declining and his Aeonic Mana of Extremity surged to fill in the gaps.","He finally understood why even the Seers or Augurs who could view the Aeonic Annals of Extremity had little information on this as pulling it up took a great deal of power and effort- with Ophelia actually becoming one of the beings capable of peering into this Record after she reached the 9th Boundary Layer of Wisdom- even though she didn't have a Consummate Boundary!","<Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans>:: Unique lifeforms born in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands under the concentrated essence of Extremity rising from the Extremity Vein of Dissolution. Their bodies were constantly refined and reformed, only to be reborn with utter closeness to Extremity as their Origins were tainted with the Vessels of Extremity prevalent in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution- the states of verisimilitude RUIN and NULLITY. They carry extremely old blood within them as their nature leans heavily onto the lineages of Prions, Parvoviridae, and many other nanoscopic lifeforms. Their bodies are as destructive as they are filled with an overabundance of treasure for any beings capable of destroying their souls. Their purpose is singular in nature as they serve to spur the process of Extremity in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution...","WAA!","Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans!","Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands!","Extremity Vein of Dissolution!","Wondrous terms jumped into Noah's mind as his eyes became extremely sharp.","His Aeonic Soul Values and Aeonic Mana of Extremity continued to be drained as while boundless information surged towards him, his point of view refocused in the outer periphery of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands that was simply referred to as the Abyss before.","His True Sanguine Clone that was here was surrounded by its three stellar Planar Domains, his eyes coming to lock onto the multiple Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans that were raging their might across the stellar black earth, and those that were rising from these Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands and taking to the dark skies as their purpose...was to actually spread into the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","Onto the lands where multiple Lineages were trying to establish their Hegemony!","He looked at all this...as everything around him slowed down.","He saw that the power which a single Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathan gave off could rival Reverend Emperors who had reached the 9th Boundary Layer.","To even get past them, he had to get past the three Reverends that surrounded him and Ophelia.","Reverends that rebuffed his stanchions of Loot light from his Halcyon Plane of Loot and resisted his pull of Blood even with his overbearing sanguinity, and they pushed back the <Quintessential Empyrean Planar Guards> formed from the Planar Domain of Quintessence!","And seeing the gradually increasing disorder of the situation around them, the three Reverends bellowed out to quickly finish him off as they initiated something only those who had achieved the 9th Boundary Layer could do so.","HOONG!","Their Aspects of Existence scattered into their unfolding Planar Domains as these existences undertook a process known as....Aeonic Boundary Manifestation.","When one examplified their Boundary as they turned into it entirely!","It was a terrifying power for Noah to withstand as his Main Body worked with haste to sacrifice Boundary Layers as fuel for even greater strength!"]},{"number":2313,"title":"Chapter 2313: Chapter 2312 Slay A Reverend! I","paragraphs":["Aeonic Boundary Manifestation.","Even with all the chaos occurring in the outer periphery of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands, such a release of power was potent as it was one of the more powerful releases of power of the Reverend Emperors.","To Noah's left, the Reverend Emperor of the Noblesse Lineage bellowed out as his surrounding reality had entirely turned into an inky black VOID, his entire body turning into blackness as he became one with the VOID and manifested this Boundary entirely- a sea of liquid darkness barreling towards Noah as it devoured everything on its path!","Above Noah, the Quasarian Reverend had a cold expression as his body exploded into a massive Singularity.","A singularity that blazed with shocking temperature and gravity as at its depths, a crimson purple stellar eye opened as it released a volatile ray of extreme heat that even singed 8th Boundary Layer experts a distance away- with its target being Noah's billowing figure surrounded by auras, barriers, and a sea of cerulean flames of Infinity symbols!","And to add onto this, the Ancestral Lernaean Reverend Emperor released a furious grant at not getting any answers from Ophelia as the immense white gold light of the Sword erupted.","His visage disappeared and turned into a titanic white gold sword that surged with a sea of minuscule swords around it, with the sword tip of this Manifestation cutting everything on its path as it sought Noah's Aspects of Existence!","SHAA!","The most powerful attacks of all 3 Reverends flew out as the myriad of Defensive Layers began to be shredded.","Noah's body felt the coming power closely as around him, countless Realities bloomed as his Aeonic Mana of Extremity endlessly conjured skills!","But there was still a gap.","Those that had built a pathway towards the 9th Boundary Layers were still too powerful as he was only in the process of elevating his own Layers forward!","BZZT!","Time slowed as an endless inky darkness, a blazing ray of gravity and heat, and an endlessly sharp sword actually worked in conjunction to release hundreds of millions of Aeonic Soul Damage Values, a vast majority of it being slowed down and eaten up by the countless abilities spammed as at the end of it all...","It wasn't enough!","SAA!","The white gold sword arrived the fastest as it tore the Mana Barrier and sank into the glorious chest of the True Emperor of Quintessence.","The endless VOID arrived thereafter as it entirely covered the limbs of the True Emperor of Quintessence and seemed ready to melt them!","And the volatile ray released from a singularity that could very well eradicate average newly advanced Reverends...arrived right before his head.","...!","A terrifying development.","Time seemed to be moving utterly slow as Noah's stellar eyes were opened wide in the face of all this.","The sharp sword sunk into his chest.","The VOID covering all his limbs.","And the volatile ray of singularity right before his face.","Just from this distance, his reforged and transformed skin should have begun to melt!","And yet...it didn't.","In this slowed time, his face actually formed a dazzling smile as his Will emanated out simple words that caused the Souls of the Aeonic Soul Sublimation Reverends to shudder.","<Got you.>","...!","Their Wills showed alarm as the being their attacks had arrived and smashed into actually hadn't perished, with drastic changes occurring in the next moment as the fair light stellar skin of this being...peeled off to reveal a blue stellar layer.","A Layer of skin that seemed to be made of pure Mana from ancient times- his body erupting with this color all around as the VOID that covered his limbs...was tightly held onto.","It was the activation of the Planar Domain of Manadynamics.","It was the attainment of the Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity that passively transformed any sources of essence that it came in contact with into its own essence.","At the cost of 10% of his Aeonic Soul Values every nanosecond, he could release a shocking domain and take on this form as with it active, he had the Complete Extremity Nullification I that ignored Damage from the 9th Boundary Layer of Extremity and below!","HOONG!","Alarm and shock were felt in the hearts of the three Reverends as amidst blooming dreadful cerulean lights, they pulled back.","The three beings felt unprecedented danger as the white gold sword and Quasarian light of singularity were able to pull a certain distance, but the endlessly dark taint of the VOID...felt clasped as something else had finally made a move at this moment.","With her entire body covered by a halcyon light of utter majesty as her radiant light brown skin couldn't even be seen, Ophelia made a move at this moment as her mind seemed one with the being Wisdom told her to rely on!","She was akin to a pure golden light of Wisdom as she transformed into a single Word of Wisdom!","A word that directed all of its power towards the inky black VOID as it stated a simple command.","[BIND]","HUUUM!","The terrifying power of the 9th Boundary Layer of Wisdom was released for the first time as the Reverend Emperor from the Noblesse Lineage wasn't able to pull back for even a moment, this immense darkness finding itself becoming surrounded by an unbelievable cerulean reality as the being it was devouring the body of focused on it with a devilish smile.","The body of the True Emperor of Quintessence had entirely changed as it expanded massively, the form of an Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity being taken gradually as at this moment, a shocking sense of power and grandeur that should in no way be possible was being released from him!","A power that was in no way his as this...lay in the core secret of the attainment of the Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity and Manadynamics.","In this form, Noah had the Complete Extremity Nullification I as the most critical piece...was the fact that he could transform any sources of essence that he came in contact with into its own essence.","The core of Manadynamics!","Energy was neither created nor destroyed- only changed into different forms!","And he...took the attacks of three Reverend Emperors in this form!"]},{"number":2314,"title":"Chapter 2314: Chapter 2313 Slay A Reverend! II","paragraphs":["He took the attacks of three Reverend Emperors in the Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity form!","The essence of the strongest attacks of three 9th Boundary Layer experts!","The hundreds of millions of billowing Aeonic Soul Damage Values were received and transformed.","They weren't lost.","Noah felt the billowing waves of essence surging in his new form with utter ease as he felt like the embodiment of Manadynamics, altering these raging hundreds of millions of Aeonic Soul Damage Values as he redirected them towards a single being!","The weakest Reverend out of the ones who had attacked him, and the one unlucky enough to not be able to pull back in time as he had the help of Ophelia to keep him in place.","It was someone powerful that at his current stage of Power, Noah undoubtedly could not take down.","He didn't have the damage values to do so, nor was his soul overpoweringly more powerful than it!","But he could scheme to much greater degrees as with the tools he had from his reality-breaking abilities...some shocking things were possible.","So he took the strongest attacks of three 9th Boundary Layer Reverends at this moment as without losing even an iota of their energies, he transformed it all into Aeonic Soul Damage Values that coursed with Manadynamics and Quintessence as it was all redirected onto the soul of a single being.","...!","And herein came another fantastical wonder today.","When an Aeonic Soul Sublimation Reverends manifested with their domains and became one with their Boundary, their soul was spread out evenly around it.","And with all of the VOID clustered around Noah while the rest of it was bound by Ophelia momentarily, this Noblesse could only feel the sensation of an unprecedented danger increase to unimaginable levels as horrific levels of the power of three Reverend Emperors was centralized and released to ravage his soul!","<HOOOOO!!!>","A billowing cry of disbelief, unwillingness, shock, and pain boomed out and split the skies!","A flash of the VOID erupted to momentarily turn everything in the surroundings black!","And then...a burning blue light shone as if it was the rising of an unstoppable cerulean sun, baptizing everything in its grandiosity as it utterly tore apart the Manifestation of an Aeonic Soul Sublimation Reverend, a shocking level of Damage Values being released as even those nearby paled and turned over this direction in shock!","What they found...was a shining blue sun rising as around it, fractures of the VOID bathed with crimson gold blood stretched out.","It was the blood and soul of an existence with an extremely strong soul.","An existence with a sublimated soul!","...!","The scene had shocking meaning to any who saw the progression of events and even those looking over now, their eyes unable to see the shining blue sun that was revealed to be a humanoid figure at this moment.","Above his head, a cluster of stellar blue crowns rotated with mad majesty.","Behind it, five pairs of auroras of cerulean wings that extended like endless seas could be seen.","Four limbs could be seen stretched out from its built humanoid form as if it was some ancient cerulean celestial creature of aged times, its whole body emanating a terrifying pressure as the face...carried exceeding beauty and handsomeness as only 2 eyes were present on this face- these two eyes seeming like a cluster of blue singularities!","It was the grandness of the Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity.","A being that those seeing for the first time inscribed in their souls as the truth of reality from what they could see...was the torn VOID and soul of a Reverend that unbelievably showed one had actually fallen here!","WAA!","It was too shocking to be believed as even when the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans were released as they raged with their power, no 9th Boundary Reverend had fallen.","Yet...one just fell so simply to this new entrant they hadn't seen before?","Even in common times, a Reverend Emperor perishing was nearly an impossibility in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution unless under extremely terrifying circumstances.","For one to fall now...it caused an immense amount of attention to be clustered towards the being responsible for it as the two Reverend Emperors of the Ancestral Lernaeans and Quasarians who were attacking Noah just now...they actually did not advance anymore.","<...>","Their manifested forms shone with grandeur as they actually didn't continue their attacks when they looked at the Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity before them!","This was because they had felt the same unprecedented level of danger that caused the death of the Noblesse Reverend, but what they didn't know was that this feeling stemmed from the transformed energy of the attacks of the three Reverends put together.","They didn't know that this being before this simply used their own power and transformed it into another form of essence that he then released!","So they labeled him as a terrifying Entity that could withstand attacks from three Reverends and even release a single attack to kill a Reverend.","It was the beginning of a new Legend that was etched just as the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands opened and the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans were released!","One of the first beings to fall was actually a powerhouse of the Noblesse as the one responsible for it all.. gazed out with utter wonder and euphoria as prompts cascaded before him in waves.","<An Unprecedented Achievement!>","<You have extinguished the Aeonic Soul of an existence levels above you in power!>","<The Boundaries of Loot and Quintessence have strongly reacted as a truly Quintessential Cache is being born!>","...!","Utmost multicolored brilliance shone around him as everything about the Noblesse Reverend Emperor was devoured.","And its result...","<1x Crimson Aeonic Quintessential Extremity Treasure Cache of Nilado has been obtained!>","A treasure cache that unlike all the previous Aeonic Quintessential Treasure Caches, it had the term Extremity within it.","It shone with utmost grandiosity in Noah's Expansive Space as it took up 50% of all the space, seeming to be as vast as a plane of existence as it opened right away!","As if it couldn't contain the wonders within it!","And even more unprecedented prompts fell before Noah.","<1x Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearl of Extremity has been obtained.>","<1x Complete Crimson I Aeonic Pearl of Extremity has been obtained.>","<8x Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearl of Extremity has been obtained.>","<10x Complete Golden Aeonic Pearl of Extremity has been obtained.>","<1,000x Refined Aeonic Sanguine Singularities have been obtained.>","...!"]},{"number":2315,"title":"Chapter 2315: Chapter 2314 Destiny Makes a Move!","paragraphs":["An unbelievable reality!","Amongst the ranks of Noblesse, fury and disbelief rose as their Reverend Emperors gazed at the situation behind them and roared out with power.","But their Wills were still too focused on the terrifying Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans that continued to erupt out, as well as their advancement into the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands where dazzling rays of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity could be seen.","And even if they wanted to divide their attention to the far back where the Noblesse Reverend Emperor Nilado had fallen...","BOOOM!","The Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans truly did not allow it as among the ranks of Noblesse, one Leviathan with the name <Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus> ruptured across the skies to smash into the very center of their Legions.","It was a massive beast that looked like a massive titanic shark, wings of RUIN and NULLITY surging on its back as its fins swirled with volatile singularities!","Its red eyes roared out with maddening anger at this moment as it rushed to this location with purpose, entering the depths of the Legions of Noblesse for nothing else other than the massive Eyes that flashed their light towards it and its brethren!","The dugout eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform- the Eyes of Clarity!","ROAAR!","The gazes of the Noblesse in charge of guarding and utilizing the Eyes changed as one Reverend that was making her way into the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands changed direction to return- not thinking the Eyes of Clarity would be singularly targeted.","And just like that...the unbelievable actions that a certain True Emperor had taken could not be focused on or addressed as this region...was simply too chaotic.","There was an overabundance of disorder as even though the death of a Reverend Emperor that was sublimely had just occurred, most other beings had to continue making decisions and moves right after just to keep their lives!","They could not do much else amidst such chaos!","'But if you can freely steer destiny amidst the most chaotic situations...'","In the ranks of Noblesse where the <Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus> had begun going wild with multiple 8th Boundary Layer Existences releasing the VOID to stop its advancement, the visage of none other than Oppenheimer could be seen as his eyes swirled with a golden light of Destiny.","He hadn't made any move forward or backward since chaos erupted, with his gaze currently locked onto the far away cerulean form of a being that had just eradicated a Reverend Emperor.","When looking at this being, Oppenheimer felt an inexplicable sensation as his eyes carried a pondering expression, where even though a deadly Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathan was already nearby and was unleashing destruction to decimate everything...he wasn't worried!","The reality around him was even shocking for those who were truly listening as every now and then, amidst the chaos and Noblesse Commanders around him releasing waves of the VOID to attack, one could see Oppenheimer's figure make a few steps to the left and right ever so often.","And the area he was just at a few nanoseconds ago...would be ravaged with tendrils of NULLITY or RUIN as it seemed he was just a step ahead before it struck.","He veered across the battlefield simply as if he had no goal or direction as he shockingly avoided the waves of fight and chaos around him, but the reality was much different!","It was not that he didn't have a goal or that he didn't wish to seek opportunities like everyone else here to delve into the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","It was just that he knew his Destiny lay elsewhere.","And...a critical time was actually coming as he became exceedingly calm.","His gaze remained on the cerulean Emperor in the distance a bit longer as he nodded, affirming the faint connection with his soul as soon after, the golden light of Destiny around him flickered.","His reason for being here was about to unfold.","BOOOM!","Behind him, lightning bolts made of RUIN surged around like Apocalyptic thunder as it rained down on the Noblesse nearby, the 8th Boundary Layer experts not being able to hold on as their barriers were shattered, and chains holding the Eyes of Clarity tightly started to become undone!","<No!>","The Noblesse Commanders bellowed out with rising rage as they released their power even more, but the <Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus> was too dreadful.","Its essence had already affected and tainted nearby Noblesse as their eyes changed, beginning to turn on their own brethren around them as even more chaos unfolded!","And at such a time, the aurora of wings above the <Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus> fluttered while its jaws opened wide towards the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform.","Towards that something that would be akin to a tonic for it!","BZZZT!","A terrifying layer of protection that was ever present on these Eyes flashed at this moment as the <Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus> was about to devour it, this barrier being something that could withstand attacks and interferences from even a 9th Boundary Layer existence as in a matter of a few nanoseconds...the Crimson jagged teeth of the Leviathan broke through it.","<No you don't!>","WAA!","into chains of the VOID that wrapped around the <Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus> to stop its advancement!","And at such a time, the Noblesse Reverend Emperor that had turned around to come to this location arrived, her hands forming into chains of the VOID that wrapped around the <Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus> to stop its advancement!","Yet this creature boasted too much power as its body instantly turned into a fluid form, seeming like endless Crimson silver foam that bypassed everything to devour what they sought.","<OOOH!>","And an inky darkness was released from the Noblesse Reverend Emperor as she actuated her Planar Domain and even went as far as to manifest the VOID to stop this terrifying beast, feeling it slip past her as he bellowed out.","<Do not let the Eyes be devoured!>","Her words spurred the shocked Noblesse nearby as they tried to near the tendrils of raging RUIN and NULLITY while also fighting against their tainted brethren.","And in such chaos...","WAA!","A golden light flashed as the True Emperor of Destiny made his move!"]},{"number":2316,"title":"Chapter 2316: Chapter 2315 Destiny Makes a Move! II","paragraphs":["Sifting between the tendrils of NULLITY and RUIN smoothly as destiny steered him, Oppenheimer successfully walked to appear in the middle of the two Eyes of Clarity that released a radiant light of power...a power than even passively kept the storm of NULLITY AND RUIN back as these were the parts from an Apex Aeonic Lifeform after all!","His heart resonated with his soul as a golden light began to cascade from him in shocking waves.","While others came to these lands for opportunity, his was always right here.","He waited for it.","He could not bypass its protective layers and chains of control that the Noblesse had inserted before.","But now...all of it was shredded apart as only a passive light of protection of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform remained!","And at such a juncture, he made his move.","SHIING!","Seas of golden waves of Destiny erupted and coursed up the broken chains that used to control the Eyes of Clarity, hundreds of such golden chains forming and anchoring themselves onto the back of the eyes as soon after...they began to pull.","...!","A vibrant golden sea erupted around him as a unique Planar Domain formed, the golden chains anchored to the Eyes of Clarity releasing a halcyon wave that covered them as the pulling sensation became even more immense...and the golden light covering the eyes caused them to begin miniaturized as they were pulled back!","And the myriad of golden chains...snaked out like daggers on the other end as they became anchored and stabbed into the golden eyes of the True Emperor of Destiny.","Crimson gold blood erupted as immense pain coursed through him, but his expression didn't change as the light of Destiny only became more potent around him, the Eyes of Clarity covered by it being pulled with even greater speed as they became even smaller- their destination already determined as chains of golden light pulled them towards the bleeding eyes of Oppenheimer!","All of these actions...occurred in an extremely short period of time as to others, the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform began to shrink amidst raging tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY, a golden light erupting to cover them briefly.","And when the <Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus> saw this, it roared out with mad anger as its body exploded with utmost power.","And a sea of RUIN and NULLITY appeared in the skies as it crashed down cataclysmically to drown everything!","<NO!>","The Noblesse Reverend Emperor cried out as her body released profound dark brilliance, barely being able to see as the Eyes of Clarity shrunk and disappeared amidst the storm of RUIN and NULLITY.","And...","BOOOM!","Light flashed.","Destiny bloomed.","And pure wonder ensued as within the stellar back earth that was withstanding crashing waves of NULLITY and RUIN, a figure breathing heavily could be seen as his eyes still maintained utmost calmness.","His Aeonic Soul was fully drained as it seemed like nothing remained, but this being opened his eyes in the next moment as...","A celestial and magisterial brilliance erupted from them.","The eyes pulsed with wonder.","The eyes pulsed with power of an utterly complex life form as the being that had transplanted them onto himself...felt his Aeonic Soul cry out at this moment as it began to surge!","—","Across the battlefield.","Far from the center of the Noblesse Legion where a <Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus> was running rampant, Noah's visage slowly lost its Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity state as the highly draining 6th Boundary Layer of Manadynamics was deactivated, and his vibrant eyes were forced to gaze towards the far away distance where he barely saw the scene of two massive eyes shrinking as a flash of golden light bloomed!","A light he was all too familiar with as even amidst the chaos...his eyes provided clarity and they shone with a sharp light.","'Oppenheimer...'","He uttered the name of the anomalous being that had fractured the very fabric of Reality as in his mind, countless thoughts were computed within an instant!","A section of his Will was dedicated towards this issue as at this moment where he faced no deadly attacks from enemies for at least a few nanoseconds, another major section of his Will was focused on giving him yet another rebirth and transformation.","It would of course be a rebirth due to the boons that came from eliminating a 9th Boundary Layer Reverend Emperor!","He had to move fast in this short period of time as like before, he sought to expand an instant into a much longer period of time with his main body in the Infinite Plane as deep in the Source of Reality, the effects of the feature of Time Dilation could easily be expressed.","So he gazed at the most pristine Loot to come from the death of a being many levels higher than him!","<Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearl of Extremity>:: A type of Loot of Extremity that has a chance of coming out from defeated enemies that have at least reached the 9th Boundary Layer...This Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearl of Extremity contains within it references to expand any concept to the 9th Boundary Layer, with the expanded concept having a ranking of a Crimson Innate Boundary at the very least. Consuming more Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity on the same Boundary will have a unique influence of enhancing the quality of the selected Boundary, edging it ever close to the Consummate Boundary Tier before it even reaches the 10th Boundary Layer....","A Loot with utterly shocking capabilities that should not exist.","A Loot that propelled a concept all the way to the 9th Boundary Layer- something that even the vast majority of the first generation of Ancestral Lernaeans who had arrived into the Havens of Extremity billions of years ago had yet to achieve!","Yet Noah unimaginably made it possible through his ridiculous concepts.","And at this moment, he made a choice on what the usage of such a ridiculous Loot would be without any hesitation.","HOONG!","The Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearl of Extremity shone with a blinding light of a singularity as Noah devoured it all instantly.","And deep within his soul...","<Rise...Quintessence.>","...!","The concept that defined him was roused.","The concept that just with its advancement...it would propel the advancement of all others forward!"]},{"number":2317,"title":"Chapter 2317: Chapter 2316 Reverend! I","paragraphs":["A great number of things were happening all at once as Noah had to prioritize multiple different things with his strong soul and bodies.","He tuned out any background noise to focus on the glorious task at hand as just the beginning of the entrance into the Havens of Extremity, a day was barely considered to have passed.","A day.","And yet towards the end of this day, he was on the precipice of reaching a stage of power that took others billions of years!","The paths that different beings took were countless in nature as others may have slowly progressed across the Boundary Layers of Extremity and experienced them slowly over time.","But Noah was making incremental jumps within a matter of hours as the only way he could be like the masses...was to sit in his Infinite Plane and not be involved in anything. But even then, he would still grow at an exponentially faster pace than others!","But when he did wade across the river of Providence, even more miraculous things happened as at this moment...","<The Seventh Boundary Layer of Quintessence has been achieved.>","His main body floated in the Source of Reality while surrounded by waves of blazing multicolored radiance.","Quintessence surged around him as it continued to refine and strengthen his Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul, its elevation not being isolated to it as the effects of this concept were simply too immense.","His eyes were closed as he felt the wondrous unfolding changes across his Aspects of Existence, with prompts continuing to fall amidst the surge of brilliance!","<The Eighth Boundary Layer of Quintessence has been achieved.>","...!","Step by step, as if it were ever so damn easy for him...he crossed thresholds that held others back for billions of years!","Something unique was that when his highest Boundary Layer was just the 7th Boundary Layer of Manadynamics, he had gained the fundamental change of his Soul that was fully integrated with all parts of him.","A hallmark of a being that had reached the 9th Boundary Layer- a Reverend!","He reached this stage in the level of his Soul way before he even neared the 9th Boundary Layer on any concept as what would happen now when he was actually on his way there?!","HOONG!","In the depths of the Infinite Plane, Noah's figure released entirely too much multicolored light as the Source of Reality began to tremble.","Outside of this spacetime continuum, the Aeonic Haven Boundary Space also began to seethe as with Noah's elevation- the essence of Quintessence flowing across the Infinite Plane also began to surge.","The truly fantastical thing was that from the depths of the Infinite Plane in the Source of Reality, the potent aura of Extremity was rising as its inhabitant and master reached a critical step!","<The Ninth Boundary Layer of Quintessence has been achieved.>","WAA!","Plasmic waves of the essence of a 9th Boundary Layer concept of Extremity surged madly as his bodies were swept in it.","His Origin cried out in euphoria as at the same time, the Sources of Extremity anchored within it released blinding radiance as they also surged!","Noah had just achieved the Ninth Boundary Layer of Quintessence as even before he could adjust to and understand the changes...ραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","<New effects of the elevated Boundary of Quintessence are being applied.>","...!","<The Seventh Boundary Layer of Loot has been achieved.>","<The Seventh Boundary Layer of Blood has been achieved.>","An overabundance of change and information flowed in as Noah once more reeled himself in, his Will organizing all caches of information as he focused to understand just what wonders Quintessence brought forth from its new Layers!","<The Seventh Boundary Layer of Quintessence>:: A myriad of concepts make who you are, with the most important ones bound to your very soul. In conjunction with the nature of Manadynamics and Blood, all concepts that have their Sources bound to your Soul are spurred towards Extremity, with a passive Automatic Quintessential Extremity reality-altering effect being applied to all your bound Sources as their initial start points will always be at the Third Boundary Layer of Extremity. Thereafter, their rate of progression towards Extremity will rapidly increase to reach your highest achieved Boundary Layer. The effect of this Layer will be altered and vary when other beings reach it...","\"...\"","'What even...'","A description of a Boundary Layer that made Noah's soul momentarily question reality rose as at this moment, it was truly actions that spoke louder than words!","The Seventh Boundary Layer of Quintessence spoke of applying an Automatic Quintessential Extremity reality altering effect to all of his bound Sources as their initial start points would always be at the Third Boundary Layer of Extremity!","It meant...","<All Bound Natural Laws, Decreta, and Fundamental Natural Laws, are being expanded towards the 3rd Boundary Layer.>","...!","BOOM!","<The Decretum of Dreams has begun its expansion towards Extremity.>","<The Decretum of Avalon has begun its expansion towards Extremity.>","<The Decretum of Prana has begun its expansion towards Extremity.>","Gold, purple, and verdant waves of light erupted first as after them, even more varying colors followed as a change that even Noah himself didn't fully encapsulate the significance of began!","He had only just finished the process of binding all Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws in the past days as even greater changes were unfolding within him, their quantification being in process as he did not expect even grander changes to arrive before this.","This was even more so for the bound Decreta where they weren't even spurned towards Extremity by Manadynamics like it did for other Natural Laws, with Quintessence going above and beyond this as to put this change lightly...it was a passive and thorough explosion of power that meant within Noah's body, twice a dozen concepts were instantly being expanded towards Extremity as they would not stop until they reached the 3rd Boundary Layer!","The utterly profound changes to his Soul from such an action?","...were simply unimaginable as Noah couldn't help but bellow out as he sensed a false feeling of invincibility!","<OOOH!>","...!"]},{"number":2318,"title":"Chapter 2318: Chapter 2317 Reverend! II","paragraphs":["In the periphery of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands, things only became increasingly more chaotic as Lernaeans, Quasarians, and Noblesse made some headway to surge into the deeper Lands beyond the veil at the risk of their very lives.","Some risked their Aeonic Soul Clones while others risked their main bodies, with a pull they could not ignore of the Aeonic Treasures of Extremity drawing them forward!","The Noblesse, on the other hand, suffered successive losses at this moment as after one of their Reverends inexplicably fell to an unknown combatant, and now the status of a treasure of great importance was unknown!","Towards the center of the Noblesse Legions, the Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus reformed multiple times over as it roared angrily, the Reverend Noblesse above it doing the same as when the scene cleared somewhat while the sea of RUIN and NULLITY faded, she and all other Noblesse couldn't see the Eyes of the Apex Aeonic Lifeform anymore!","<Find them! The Eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform cannot be destroyed so easily!>","The Noblesse Reverend roared out with power as she dove like an endless VOID towards the Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus, her expression utterly ugly as things were not flowing in a smooth direction so far.","But...below the fading sea of RUIN and NULLITY where others saw nothing, the visage of a handsome man lay on the caved in stellar black earth as his eyes released waves of multicolored light that covered his body.","Waves of light that couldn't be seen through even with the eyes of a 9th Boundary Layer existence as even though Oppenheimer was right there, neither the Dragoshark Prion Oxyrinchus nor the Noblesse Reverend Emperor could see him!","The Eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform could see through everything, and they could also mask everything!","The tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY were also kept at bay as Oppenheimer slowly rose and sat on the black earth while feeling shocking changes coursing through him.","Had others even imagined doing what he did?","Even if they tried to do it, they may not be successful!","After all, even the Noblesse could only chain the Eyes of Clarity and use them in a restricted fashion that barely utilized 10% of their power.","Yet Oppenheimer had managed to pull them while they were at their lowest as he had now gained an unprecedented boon.","As he sat on the black earth with tendrils of red and silver all around him, chaos unfolded as if it had nothing to do with him. Others couldn't even see him as he knew he would have time to absorb his gains...or it should have been so!","But, he felt a piercing gaze focus on his location as if it was over and above even Reverends.","His dark hair fluttered gloriously as when he turned his head, his new eyes locked onto this gaze right away as far from his position, the being who had adorned a cerulean visage briefly and destroyed the Aeonic Soul of a Reverend Noblesse could be seen.","His gaze locked onto his newly transplanted eyes as Oppenheimer became increasingly more cautious!","He felt endless power and possibilities in the other set of eyes as even the eyes of the Apex Aeonic Lifeform that was the True Emperor of Genesis felt a sharp sensation tug on them at this moment!","Destiny now swirled within them as feeling this unique and unknown situation unfold, Oppenheimer instantly made a move to consolidate his gains- his eyes releasing a blinding light as his figure buzzed with power, burrowing into the black earth below him as he silently went towards the direction of the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands silently.","He would first discern destiny and understand his enemy. Then he would make a move!","—ραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","The inheritance of the Eyes of Clarity in Noah's own eyes died down as he saw Oppenheimer's figure disappear.","He sensed the connection and link between his current eyes and the Eyes Oppenheimer had just taken, many thoughts and possibilities emerging within his mind as he thought of this being!","There was chaos unfolding all around them, but nobody dared to near their position as even the Quasarian and Lernaean Reverend still floated in the distance carefully.","They were debating whether it was worth it amidst this chaos and the opportunity that lay behind them as after nanoseconds of deliberation...they swallowed their pride and this humiliation as they turned around to also go towards the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands all others were seeking!","Noah floated in the dark skies as his figure released pulses of power, Ophelia materializing with golden grandeur beside him as she marveled while her soft hands came to check his body all over, affirming what Wisdom told her as she could only shake her head.","<You've really reached the 9th Boundary Layer this easily? Ah...>","His talent was enough to make others question and despair as Ophelia sighed, collected her emotions, and maintained her image as she put all other thoughts aside and gazed around them with a smile.","<No matter, Sacrarium Master. What shall we do now amidst all this?>","In this state of increasing disorder, just how exactly would they move?!","Around Noah's True Sanguine Clone, tendrils of Dream, Avalon, Prana, Fantasia, Apollyon...all the essence of the Sources of Decreta began to bubble and form a shocking platform below his feet as they now carried traces of Extremity.","But this wasn't all.","There were also tendrils of Natural Laws surging below him to make the multicolored platform he floated on as one particular essence was wilder and more potent than all the others.","It was due to its nature and what currently unfolded around it as the essence Noah felt surging gleefully...was none other than Entropy!","In this reality of ever increasing chaos and disorder, Entropy should theoretically reign supreme as it was showing its wildness right now.","It caused Noah to give it more attention as along with the Boundary of Dimensions he had utilized the Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearl of Extremity on, this became his next target as his Will sent the commands right away.","There was bound to be immense wonders in the unfolding chaos as he would make use of it.","In regards to Ophelia's question, he knew that he needed time to consolidate his power and see just where he was at with the overabundance of information currently flowing through him due to Quintessence and the many changes it brought.","But at the same time, his eyes waded across the periphery of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands as he did not focus on the Aeonic Treasures of Extremity all others surged towards in the distance.","He looked...at the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans that all others were holding at bay and seeking to get past.","While others may consider them hindrances, to him...they're fantastical tonics and even more important than the Aeonic Treasures of Extremity!","Seeing their bodies surging with RUIN and NULLITY already in the form of Boundaries, Noah wondered what he could gain from them as he currently tried to obtain a precious few seconds to consolidate his gains and optimize his power!"]},{"number":2319,"title":"Chapter 2319: Chapter 2318 Reverend! III","paragraphs":["Waves of RUIN and NULLITY cascaded all around him as his eyes were filled with an overabundance of clarity.","His True Sanguine Clone had an even brighter luster of blue at this moment as Manadynamics surged powerfully around him, Quintessence propping it up and many more sources within Noah with utmost radiance!","Amidst all this chaos and battle, Noah calmly read everything before him as he spoke to Ophelia.","<It's messy and chaotic here while the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands hold unknown secrets. There will be even more Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans within as we can also make our way in...>","Most of the Reverends of the three different Lineages had forged forward as they're just part of the forces of some of the Civilizations booming within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution, with the much greater level of importance now being placed in this location as events unfolded. This meant that even more Reverends and powerhouses of Lineages would be sent here as those who forged ahead and gained more would have a much easier time going forward!","Ophelia nodded at Noah's words as she continued to gaze at the ever flowing words of Wisdom, finding new traces of information that were never there before.","<The deeper we delve into these lands, the more dangerous it becomes. At some point, Wisdom says that locations that only Apex Aeonic Lifeforms can survive in may appear...>","Terrific words emanated from her as when Noah heard them, his smile only became brighter.","<Good.>","WAA!","Conquest and tyranny were roused within his heart as since he was becoming an utterly sharp blade at rapid speeds, he needed even more unimaginable opponents to keep this same speed!","Below his feet, the authorities of many newly expanded Boundaries surged as he carried a dense concentration of power while he began to float forward.","Ophelia floated behind her serenely as they looked like a pair of celestial organisms on a stroll, not a single being standing in their way at this moment as they began to edge deeper into the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands!","—","Across the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","In a location where roiling tendrils of RUIN the size of Realities swirled like endless snakes, a unique Minor Plane floated undaunted.","While tendrils of RUIN that would decimate Reverends as if they're mere meat on a chopping block churned, this Minor Plane of Existence ignored it all as it floated serenely, a unique power coursing over its boundary as it shone of stellar radiance and wonder!","And near the edge of this Plane, a sea of NULLITY that broke into a waterfall could be seen near its planar boundary, with two particularly dreadful auras actually being atop this sea as one sat on the edge of the sea of Nullity that transformed into a waterfall, while the other was at the very center of this silver sea as thick chains rose from it and wrapped tightly around his whole body.ραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","Dark strands of hair shimmering with wonder cascaded past his shoulders as his eyes...they held mere sockets that shone like endless singularities as be stared out into the distance.","His skin shone with a fair radiance of wonder and power as it seemed indestructible even with the attacks of hundreds of Boundaries at the 9th Boundary Layer, everything about him emanating grace and power even though he was chained!","The being sitting at the edge of the waterfall of nullity had a curious expression on his face as he occasionally reached outside the barrier around this minor plane, his hands smoothly wrapping around the thick coiling tendrils of RUIN the size of Realities as he pulled them in as if he were fishing and....threw them towards his mouth as he devoured them whole.","This seemed to be his routine as if he had done this countless times, the massive Crimson rings around his limbs and head transparent and barely visible as his obsidian skin seemed to devour all forms of light as it put black holes to shame!","Everything seemed to be flowing as it normally should when all of a sudden, the chained existence with empty sockets emanated out a will that showed an aged voice full of tiredness.","<We were wrong.>","WAA!","His released will caused the sea of Nullity around him to seethe as the chains surging with Nullity and traces of crimson Ruin around him danced with a cacophony of noise!","<Hmm?>","The Noblesse Lifeform before the chained existence turned his head back with a smile, licking his lips as he finished yet another thick tendril of RUIN.","<O Genesis, what were we wrong about?>","His words seemed to carry genuine curiosity as if he were talking to a friend, and the one he referred to as Genesis stared out towards the expanse of tendrils of RUIN that released heavy waves of EXTREMITY as he continued with a sense of melancholy!","<Why do we continue to conflict and seek for more? When we arrived in the Havens of Extremity, we saw a vast world before us as we sought its power. We then gained more than enough power as we became Lifeforms that could traverse the Cracks of Extremity and even step foot into the other Aeonic Havens...only to find even grander lands and even more powerful beings. It's just...>","His head shook as he spoke, the tiredness and melancholy ever present in his words as he continued!","<Those in the Firmaments of Ascendancy perish. Those expanding Boundaries towards Extremity perish. Even beings like you and me who have attained a stage to be called Apex Aeonic Lifeforms perish. Just...look at me. Chained here for the past billion years as what about me screams Apex? What about me screams a higher life form?>","A great deal of despondency emanated out as his words actually caused the smile on the Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeform to fade, a somber expression coming down as even this being turned around to stare into the expanse of crimson tendrils before them!","He did not deny what Genesis said- nay, he could not deny it as this being's feelings were actually not too far off!"]},{"number":2320,"title":"Chapter 2320: Chapter 2319 Reverend! IV","paragraphs":["<We were wrong about all of it at the very beginning, O Agathocles. The opening of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands in the Haven of Dissolution should have told you the same thing. We...should've never sought Extremity. The more we seek it, the more it draws near...and yet still infinitely far away. You will never reach it. I'll never reach it. And even if a stroke of Destiny came and we did reach it...what then? Will you finally be happy? Will you finally stop? Or will you simply realize that within Extremity, there exists something even far greater?>","...!","Crimson RUIN crackled and destroyed the fabric of Nature outside the floating Minor Plane as if denying the words of the True Emperor of Genesis!","Yet this being whose eyes were dug out seemed to see a whole lot more as he sighed while he continued.","<When we became Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, we thought we would have more freedom as instead, we only became more shackled. We were told to fight tooth and nail to reach Extremity...invited to join Forces we never knew existed as we left our Lineage designations. Those of us who denied were cast out and left to fend for ourselves as I came to realize...the selfish nature of organisms never changes no matter what stage of power they achieve.>","WAA!","<We always seek our own benefits. We always desire things for ourselves as cycles of hatred and chaos are sown no matter what stage we are at. War and chaos are ever present no matter where you go as if it's all the same...what meaning is there, Agathocles? When all I can see at the end of this path is merely our own ruin? When even in the baptism of Extremity, there is still death? Under the weight of Extremity, all of us are bound to perish...whether we reach it or not.>","BOOM!","The sea of NULLITY beneath him seethed with even more entropy as the thick tendrils of RUIN outside the Minor Plane formed into mountains that crashed down with immense ferocity!","Silence descended onto these lands as desolation was the only thing felt, the Noblesse Apex Lifeform known as Agathocles sighing even more as he continued to stare out into the Crimson blackness.","He had no words.","After all, they had exchanged too many words over the years.","Agathocles was silent as he spoke lightly after a few seconds passed.","<Have you reached it after all these years?>","A simple question that only Genesis understood as without a second delay, he nodded slowly as his Will emanated out once more.","<I've made some progress.>","<...>","Agathocles said nothing at this affirmation as he simply reached his hand out to grab even more tendrils of RUIN, gazing at them within his hands as they roared out chaotically while behind him, the massive chains of NULLITY and RUIN that had endlessly sunk into the Aspects of Existence of the True Emperor of Genesis began to crack and splinter into countless silver snowflakes.","<We were born from nothing, we remain nothing, and we'll return to nothing. We shall all perish under the weight of Extremity, but on my end...there are wrongs I must right before I perish. There are too many regrets.>","...!","A light of profundity and wonder thundered out madly from the words of the True Emperor of Genesis as everything around him seethed chaotically!","The chains that dug deep into his soul cracked and disappeared as if they're nothing, his massive figure that took a significant portion of the Minor Plane they were one rising as if he had never been chained.","Agathocles did not even turn around as the countless chains broke and the visage of Genesis rose, his feet dangling and feeling the surging waterfall of Nullity cascading down as his eyes carried mixed emotions.","The two beings stared out into the expanse of crimson ruin as the visage of Genesis soon began to flicker, space folding in on itself as within moments, he disappeared.ραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","The only thing he left behind were a set of words.","<You were great company for all these years, Agathocles.>","...!","SHAA!","With that, the True Emperor of Genesis was gone.","Unshackled and unbound as he had reached an even greater stage of profundity!","Agathocles continued to stare out past the boundary of the Minor Plane as his eyes trembled at this moment, a calm voice emanating from him as he sighed.","<The lands always seem too grand and never ending. We thought the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution was it as later on, we find there are Seven Aeonic Havens with established Civilizations that have been there for trillions of years. I...was getting too tired of it all anyways. So thank you, Genesis.>","...!","His eyes trembled even more as his radiant transparent Crimson Halos began to fracture and shatter.","His skin then fissured and had countless cracks bloom as this being that exuded the immense life force of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform...instantly began to seem like a desiccated corpse as all signs of life were slowly fading away from him!","His very origin was destroyed long ago when Genesis had begun speaking, with Agathocles only realizing halfway through that he was already dead!","The profundity of RUIN and NULLITY within him that he believed in so much could do nothing to stop it.","So he became calm and listened to the words of the being he had personally dug the eyes out of and watched as focused RUIN and NULLITY surged into his vessels for many years while his Aspects of Existence should have been entirely shackled and unable to resist.","But at the end of it all, this being actually reached an even greater stage of profundity as with a single move, he extinguished the origin of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","The massive body of the Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeform began to flicker and turn into stellar dust that was flushed away by the raging waterfall of nullity, the eyes of this being closing peacefully as his Will emanated out for the last time.","<I hope you find your peace...Genesis.>","HOONG!","Essence seethed as his whole being turned into dust.","From the position he was in, a blinding singularity was left behind as some of the dust clustered around it, releasing a blinding radiance that very soon accumulated to pulse with a dreadfully potent aura of an Aeonic Treasure of Extremity!","Thereafter, everything returned to serenity in this Minor Plane.","The only thing that had changed...was one particular Apex Aeonic Lifeform becoming unchained after a significant number of years!"]},{"number":2321,"title":"Chapter 2321: Chapter 2320 Reverend! V","paragraphs":["Indomitable power coursed through him as he engrossed constant waves of information while over 20 new concepts were expanded towards Extremity, each one holding its own uniqueness that could fill up countless pages.","But the most important one currently remained the core value that he brought up to the 9th Boundary Layer- Quintessence!","He perused its details as he accepted the fact that somehow, he had truly reached the stage that those in the Havens of Extremity designated the experts of as Reverend!","He was now a Reverend as he shared a profound sense of power, but...he did not want to be alone in this feeling.","He had others he cared for. He wanted the same happiness he felt to also be experienced by them.","So his Will surged.","His focus was placed on the Dream Dimensional Chassis that had arrived in the Abecedarian Sacrarium and were seeing its vastness with Ophelia in the lead.","They had moved from the Observatory as they currently floated in a junction of this Plane of Existence that had a nexus of stellar Rivers of Reality joining together, with all of them currently floating within a region of stellar purple gold dust that bloomed from a dying singularity.","Noah gazed at the people he had been through many journeys with as he exceeded them greatly in power in a short period of time- going from Adelaide who helped him in the Beast World, to the Kraken Atlantis, to Barbatos in the Demon World, to the Cthulhu and other Terrors of his Universe, to Lancelot of the Avalon Dimension...all the way to Eowyn and what at the time were ridiculous capabilities with Absolute Dream Authority, Guinevere, Arthus, Oldest Dream- and many others!","He thought of all of this as he then looked towards Ophelia.","An existence currently at the same stage of power as him as who knew how much time would pass before Noah exceeded everything she knew?","He had boundless levels of power and glory, but it did not have to be contained within him as he could always share it with those he cared about!","<I've always grappled with how to best provide you all with the same level of glory and power I experience daily. How to let you all have your own identities and goals if you wished to pursue them.>","His voice emanated out suddenly as all his people that were moving around and staring at the wonders around them while adapting to the heavy aura of Extremity stopped to look towards him.","Ophelia stopped talking as well as she listened with a meaningful smile as Noah continued, his gaze coming to land on Barbatos.","<The Necromancer of Chaos, the Demon Lord that conjured Legions of Undead.>","WAA!","His words caused Barbatos's small figure to rise with power and intensity as his eyes turned towards another direction and continued!","<Tiamat, the Dragon Progenitor that reigned over Lineages of Dragons.>","<Dimensional Rulers of Minor Planes of Existence themselves.>","<The Great Usurper that tears through the veils of Dimensions...>","Noah gazed at multiple organisms and called out their names and titles as after gazing at a certain amount...he addressed them all grandly.","<Do you all desire your names to ring out from the souls of countless organisms once more? To be echoed out in the vastness of Extremity?>","...!ραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","Utmost radiance shone around him as he waved his hands to reveal hundreds of dazzling singularities that were Complete Golden Aeonic Pearls of Extremity, with a few Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearls of Extremity mixed in.","Just a fraction of the Loot he had gained from his single attack on the Legions of Noblesse, Lernaeans, and Quasarians!","Loot that granted 3 Boundary Layers to any concept as he had no need for hundreds of them when all Sources bound to him were already being passively elevated by his Boundary of Quintessence at this very moment.","So he laid out these halcyon singularities as he continued!","<It's all possible with the vastness of Extremity- with the vastness of the Havens of Extremity that would take time for even I to cover everything. If you so choose, take these Pearls of Extremity. And once you do...you shall stretch out across this Aeonic Haven of Dissolution and spread word of Quintessence. Spread your names and titles, spread your grandeur and glory, but most of all...spread the tyranny of conquest of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor.>","HUUM!","Boundless waves of light and power emanated from him as in the silence, the cry of an Emperor Penguin bellowed out!","CAA!","He was the first to surge forward and swallow a cluster of Pearls of Extremity, with the visage of the Blue Slime following next as Eowyn, Kazuhiko, Barbatos, and all others followed!","During all of this, Henry floated near his father as he watched the magnificence before his eyes as soon after, Noah turned to stare at him as 9 Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearls of Extremity appeared before him, along with tens of Complete Golden Aeonic Pearls of Extremity as Noah locked his grand gaze with his progeny.","<My son.>","WAA!","Arcs of Destiny and glory flashed as Henry gazed at his father with endless trust and wonder.","<When you were born, Destiny seethed torrentially as you were proclaimed the Child of Destiny. Prove this title and exceed it. I'll give you the means...and I want you to deliver to me the Domains of Noblesse in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.>","...!","<Our Lineage is not one that simply follows, and you must make a name as an Emperor yourself that others will cry out across the Havens of Extremity.>","There were multiple Sacrariums of the Ancestral Lernaeans to see.","An unknown number of domains under the Noblesse and Quasarians.","Noah would spread his forces across its domains while he himself ventured into the depths of Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands!","His words were heard loud and clear as Henry gazed back at him and nodded with power.","<Yes, Father!>","The features of a child were long gone from Henry as he lost the designation of <Little>, this existence ready to try and forge his own path when the shadow that his father cast...was immeasurably hard to overcome!"]},{"number":2322,"title":"Chapter 2322: Chapter 2321 Reverend! VI","paragraphs":["Waves of Destiny spread out madly as among the many organisms here, Noah also turned his head to see a friend.","He gazed at the visage of Eckert surrounded by Europa and a group of women he was not entirely familiar with as he asked the Great Usurper that he also offered a few dozen Complete Golden Aeonic Pearls of Extremity and a few Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearls of Extremity.","<What shall you do?>","The Great Usurper and his own anomalous path. Just which direction would he now follow?","Eckert smiled at Noah's question as he gazed out into the blackness of stellar light and replied lightly.","<There should be more than this Aeonic Haven of Dissolution, right? I shall also head out and forge my own name and path. Maybe I'll find what I seek in Extremity.>","...!","What did the Great Usurper seek? With his path of domination and idleness, just what would the Havens of Extremity provide for him? Nobody knew what the future held, but the aura of Boundaries whipped around him and those nearby as decisions were made.","Paths were chosen.","Choices were made.","No matter what occurred in the future though, Quintessence was bound to spread!","Quintessence.","Noah repeated this concept over and over again as he now gazed at the neatly formulated details of its upper layers.","It was said in the past that the closer one went towards Extremity, the more that paths converged as a single concept could very well act offensively, defensively, and have its own auxiliary features.","Concepts of Seers or Augurs who expanded Destiny, Fate, or Wisdom did not mean they would have low fight power, where apart from their foresight- their future Boundary Layers had their own variation of deadly offensive capabilities!","The closer one went towards Extremity, the more that all paths and concepts converged.","<The Eighth Boundary Layer of Quintessence>:: Your Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul has already integrated to all parts of you and achieved Aeonic Soul Sublimation. Quintessence wants to take things a step further and begin your transformation into an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, the effects of passive Soul Refinement and Strengthening being boosted to a Quintessential level as in addition to the augmentation of +1,000% provided by the 5th Boundary Layer of Quintessence, the augmentation of +10,000% to All Aeonic Parameter Values is granted with this Boundary Layer...","<The Ninth Boundary Layer of Quintessence>:: An important threshold has been crossed as Quintessence Quintessence begins to proliferate to the reality around you. Up to 9 Boundaries can now be deemed Quintessential as all the Boundaries deemed Quintessential can now be passively elevated an additional Layer for a total of Three Quintessential Apocryphal Layers. The only limitation is the application of the Quintessential Apocryphal Layers being applicable only to the highest level that Quintessence itself has reached. As Quintessence becomes more pervasive, your authority over multiple areas also increases as your authority to peer into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity is further expanded with its cost reduced. Your distinction as a Quintessential Aeonic Curator becomes even more pristine as you can manipulate your presently unfolding history that is being written in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity with even more ease. Quintessence nudges you forward to inform you that with its efforts in elevating your Soul and this expanded authority as a Quintessential Aeonic Curator, the time has come for you to expand it and all others to the Consummate Boundary Tier...","Pure glory was in the details of the 8th and 9th Boundary Layers of Quintessence as they opened the path forward.","An expansion to what the designation of Quintessential would do!ραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","An expansion to the authority as a Quintessential Aeonic Curator!","When he looked at the abundant information, Noah knew that all he had to do was utilize a single Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearl of Extremity to expand a Boundary to have 6 True Boundary Layers, and the moment he deemed them Quintessential to apply the Three Quintessential Apocryphal Layers...they would reach the 9th Boundary Layer!","It meant that in the next few moments, Loot could reach the 9th Boundary Layer.","Blood could reach the 9th Boundary Layer.","Dimensions and Entropy could reach the 9th Boundary Layer!","9 chosen Boundaries could ridiculously be expanded to such a high stage where only the most powerful of Reverends had reached across the Civilizations of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution- the only exceptions being Anomalous Entities and existence truly attune with Extremity.","This...was why Quintessence paved the way forward.","It was the first to reach the 9th Boundary Layer, and yet its first influence could bring 9 other Boundaries to its level.","Another was to grant Noah the power and authority to reforge his Boundaries to the Consummate Level!","Billowing waves of multicolored grandeur overflowed from the visage of his Dream Dimensional Chassis s he oversaw his people beginning to emit waves of Extremity, his son to his right erupting with the light of the Boundary of Loot, Quintessence, and Blood beside him as his handsome figure showed abundant regality.","Adelaide calmly watched to his left as she didn't rush forward to consume the Pearls of Extremity.","She knew herself well and what she wanted as she was a Queen.","Her King would grant her even more than this as she did not need to put herself on the front lines, so she only smiled as she watched the unfolding grandeur before her.","Such a scene was et ceterahed in Noah's mind as he began to send out multiple commands with his very soul.","The first command...was the deactivation of the effects of Quintessence on the Boundaries of Loot, Blood, Dimensions, and Entropy among others as they all showed only their true layers.","He then devoured multiple Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearls of Extremity as all these Boundaries would be propelled to the 6th Boundary Layer, and after this was achieved...he would designate them Quintessential and instantly bring them to the 9th Boundary Layer!","And at the same time...a terrific light of the authority of the Quintessential Aeonic Curator began to shine as he wanted to see.","He wanted to see just what a Boundary at the Consummate level entailed!"]},{"number":2323,"title":"Chapter 2323: Chapter 2322 Across The Lands! I","paragraphs":["An eerie calm settled.","Under the manipulated flow of time in the Source of Reality, Noah's body aptly controlled the surging flows of essence as after the eruption of radiance from Quintessence reaching the 9th Boundary Layer and multiple other concepts being expanded towards Extremity, he pulled everything towards his main body as his skin was the only thing releasing a blazing contained luster.","Any radiance that erupted out shone on his fair stellar skin as he currently had a wild visage, his figure continuing its transformation constantly as his sense of beauty and handsomeness became more and more otherworldly!","The closer one was towards Extremity, the more pristine and glorious they became.","The number of high quality concepts they had going towards Extremity counted as well- with Noah having an obscene number that propelled his soul forward as his Aeonic Soul Values broke past 800,000 seconds ago and continued ascending without stopping!","Such a high number was the reason his authority as the Aeonic Quintessential Curator was expanded, where it was a long way away from the few thousand he initially had when he altered his Recorded History to make all his Boundaries at the Crimson Innate Boundary level.","So when he initiated Aeonic Quintessential Curator right now, he expected grand changes as his Main Body closed its eyes, containing the radiance within as his soul was taken to another location!","A location that was extremely far away and also unimaginably very close.","The distance of such a place did not matter as it could be accessed normally so long as one had a Consummate Boundary at the Seventh Boundary Layer or more- it was the fringes of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","Radiance overflowed as he delved deeper into the fringes easily now, his soul that much stronger as he saw the Runic Ecritures forming into pillars of multicolored light, and around these pillars...the same stellar golden, Obsidian, and Crimson colored scrolls floated in space calmly as they contained everything about him.","The golden scrolls had the designation of [Genesis], the obsidian scrolls had the destination of [Chrysalis], and the stellar crimson scrolls that remained utterly empty were labeled [Extremity].","His gaze floated towards the dazzling obsidian scrolls of [Chrysalis] once more, seeing the breakdown of his own life as he focused on the set of scrolls that were designated as [Boundary Expansion]!","A massive ancient-looking obsidian scroll unfurled as dazzling details showed themselves.","Uniquely, he now saw a scene different from before where he saw an illusory image of himself at the very center of the scroll, and multiple lines emanated from this figure to form bubbles of light labeled [Loot], [Blood], [Quintessence], [Manadynamics], [Entropy], [Dimensions], [Dreams], [Gravitation], [Isochronism], [Prana]...it was all the Boundaries under him as it was shown as multiple lines of connected that surrounded him peacefully.","Currently, the illusory bubbles around these Boundaries were light Crimson in color as they emitted a dull light of Extremity- and if Noah focused on them, the breakdown of the Boundary and its Layers rose up as his soul joyously loved such a layout where it seemed he was looking at his character Stat Panel that currently showed a branching Boundaries of Extremity!","His goal here...was to change their dull Crimson glow of Extremity into radiance at the Consummate level.","Quintessence had promised him so as at this moment, his will locked onto it as he focused on its details.","<The Boundary of Quintessence>:: A Crimson Innate Boundary forged by the True Emperor of Quintessence. Currently, Nine Boundary Layers have been achieved as its prowess sits at the very top among the expanded concepts towards Extremity of the same tier. Its First Boundary Layer grants...","An array of details cascaded down as Noah stopped at the very first sentence of this Boundary.ραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","And then...the authority of the Aeonic Quintessential Curator was activated as his Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul began to surge out torrentially towards the concept of Quintessence!","Last time, he burned a few hundred Soul Values to reach the tier of Obsidian Innate and a few thousand to reach Crimson Innate.","At this moment...over 100,000 Aeonic Soul Values surged forward like a massive tide as they weren't alone.","His Aeonic Mana of Extremity also burned with cerulean grandeur as since he was using his Aeonic Soul Value...it would also do its best to make up any differences it was allowed to!","It meant that tidal waves of cerulean majesty also descended onto the Boundary of Quintessence as Noah attacked its designation, beginning to erase the words Crimson Innate and beginning to forge the words Golden Consummate as he directly altered his Recorded History!","As he directly changed the reality of the Tier of his Boundary from what it was into something else entirely.","HOONG!","A booming sound erupted as it felt like a portion of his Soul exploded- but this was simply the abrupt and shocking change at a grand scale occurring right away just like before...Quintessence led the way forward.","It was just that...the changes this time would be too grand!","—","In the periphery of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","Noah's True Sanguine Clone was floating towards its depths past the torn veil with Ophelia following closely beside him, their auras being noticed by many as the closer they appeared to the periphery of the stellar mountains and fantastical landscapes- even the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans floating in this region begun to gaze towards their direction!","And yet at this moment before they delved in too deep...","BZZZT!","The potent aura of Extremity in the surroundings and across this initial area of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands pulsed in a shocking manner as this dense aura...began to surge towards none other than Noah's figure.","...!","His visage began to give off a shocking feel and aura of Extremity as such a phenomenon was very quickly recognized- especially so by a few specific Quasarians who had managed to grasp something similar!","It was...the air of an existence achieving a Consummate Boundary!"]},{"number":2324,"title":"Chapter 2324: Chapter 2323 Across The Lands! II","paragraphs":["The pervasive pressure of Extremity across the Havens of Extremity was transparent and formless as it pressed down on everything.","In the case of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands, it was even more focused and dreadful to the extent that existences who had only come as far as achieving the Sixth Boundary Layer in a concept had a hard time just walking across these lands!","Only those at the Eighth Boundary Layer and above could move freely or even manage to float across this space- with these restrictions only increasing the deeper one went.","This was one of the secrets of this domain and why these lands were places where Aeonic Treasures of Extremity could bloom!","One of them was this immense pressure of Extremity, and the other...was the Extremity Vein of Dissolution coursing somewhere within these Lands.","And at this moment, the palpable pressure descending on everyone could be seen actually being absorbed by a single being- with the very nearby mountains of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands pulsing with radiance as it seemed like a whirling transparent storm formed with a single figure at the very center absorbing everything.","His figure gave off an abrupt increase in grace and power as he began to emanate a potent aura of Extremity- something that only beings like Prince Zagugan and Reverend Emperor Septimius gave off on this field of battle currently!","One of the most powerful beings here- Reverend Emperor Septimius, turned around from the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands he had reached as his gaze became solemn at this moment.","The Quasarians were the only Lineage apart from the fourth Lineage full of secrets and mystery in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution that had a Consummate Boundary.","The Noblesse did not have one. The Ancestral Lernaeans didn't have one.","Only they and the unique Civilization that seemed to have walked these lands for many years before they came held something as pristine as a Consummate Boundary as it distinguished them in power!","Even though it was not a Boundary all Quasarians could learn as it had the prerequisite of an existence needing to achieve at least the 7th Boundary Layer before they could expand the First Layer of the Consummate Boundary- it was still something that even made their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms utterly dreadful.","To see an existence who seemed linked to the Ancestral Lernaeans show off an aura of such a Boundary?","It did not evoke any good feelings in the soul of Quasarians!","At the same time, the Ancestral Lernaeans gazed at this scene and the visage of Ophelia near this being as their complex expressions were filled with doubt and happiness!","If they cleared up whatever misunderstanding this situation around them caused, it meant that their Lineage of Ancestral Lernaeans had produced a Consummate Boundary and could move forward even further!","HOONG!","A brilliant multicolored pillar of light shot out with the figure of the True Emperor of Quintessence at the center, the potent aura of Extremity barreling into him as one could see pieces of his skin bursting and disappearing as even more radiant skin bloomed.","An air of immense power and Tyranny surged out as before his eyes...","<The Golden Consummate Boundary of Quintessence has been born.>","A fantastical prompt appeared.","And the moment it did, the birth of a Consummate Boundary was cemented as those he had allowed to learn it...","BZZT!","...Also shared in his glory as beside him, Ophelia also gave off a terrifying wave of power as even she gazed towards Noah in shock!ραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","Even Wisdom did not foretell this as her light brown radiant skin was replaced by an even grander layer of brilliance!","Amidst all of this, the man beside her sensed the profound aura of Extremity he carried as he...took a single step in the skies.","And his figure instantly disappeared as apart from just being able to fly in this restricted space, he could now even twist the spacetime continuum to appear from one location to another as he instantly got past the torn veil that others had just crossed while putting their lives on the line.","His actions roused the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans as a few that floated grandly atop stellar mountains holding Aeonic Treasures of Extremity roared out in low tones.","But...he was not done.","Even before the potent aura of Extremity from a single Boundary reaching the Consummate Tier was done, his figure blared out again as this time, a golden pillar of light joined the multicolored one to shine around him!","...!","It caused the jaws of the Myriad of Boundary Expansion Realm experts here who were still following what this meant to almost drop on the stellar black floor as it showed...a second concept also reaching the tier of Consummate at this very moment within this being!","It was unimaginable as once more before the eyes of this being, another prompt rose as behind the scenes, hundreds of thousands of Aeonic Soul Values whipped from his soul to change his Recorded History as an even more obscene amount of Aeonic Mana of Extremity accompanied this process.","<The Golden Consummate Boundary of Loot has been born.>","WAA!","A halcyon light accompanied the multicolored pillar of light around him as the air of Extremity he gave off became even more concentrated, his visage feeling stifling to others as he released an air of wildness akin to the Leviathans who lived in these lands since ancient times!","ROAAR!","His rising aura of Extremity caused many eyes to lock onto him as the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans felt like their prestige and dominion were threatened- deep roars booming out.","And an instant later, an Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathan moved with pristine glory- a creature with the name of <Varicella Emperor Kong> booming out as it looked like a Celestial ape with black and Crimson fur, it's massive limbs crashing down like two mountains towards Noah's figure as they pulsed with seas of RUIN and NULLITY!","...!","The Varicella Emperor Kong arrived in an instant to appear before him, and yet what he did next caused the hearts of many organisms here to lurch.","Against the oncoming limbs that seemed like mountains that could shatter an average 9th Boundary Layer expert, he rose a single hand upwards as the moment it arrived....","PAAH!","Space buzzed, fissured, and cracked all once as the unstoppable force that the Varicella Emperor Kong had displayed was actually received and dispelled in an instant with what seemed to be the force of his body alone.","<...>","His visage looked utterly dominating and majestic at this moment as immense silence reigned.","...!"]},{"number":2325,"title":"Chapter 2325: Chapter 2324 Across The Lands! III","paragraphs":["Oppressive.","Mighty!","This was the sense of awe and wonder that the True Emperor of Quintessence currently showed as his figure continued absorbing the potent aura of Extremity, the pressure he released only building up more and more as his power rose to the extent that with his hand alone...he could rebuff the strike of a creature that oppressed average Reverends!","Others may look at this with sheer disbelief, but to some of the most powerful organisms here, they understood the power that an Aeonic Soul Sublimation expert could achieve.","They knew that at that point, the Soul was fully integrated into all aspects of Existence as any part of one's body could display their strongest capabilities!","So Noah stopping the mountainous limbs of the Varicella Emperor Kong smashing down with his bare hand was also something that could have been replication if he cast a Barrier or Defensive Shield- or anything that could display his power.","But of course, it remained an astonishing scene as it showed just what the immensity of the boons were currently unfolding as Noah made way for Consummate Boundaries!","—","A heavy aura that made others feel stifled!","α?dαsηθνε| Oppenheimer stared at such a being closely now while he stood near a radiant mountain to the left of where boundless chaos currently unfolded.","The eyes of the Apex Aeonic Lifeform in his sockets were supposed to analyze and break down his secrets like all others, but...","Oppenheimer squinted and became somber.","When he now gazed at the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans or the most powerful organisms under the Quasarians, Ancestral Lernaeans, and Noblesse- he could very clearly see their identities and destiny as the Eyes of Clarity unveiled it all easily!","But with this being...no information that wasn't already known could be obtained!","Even with the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, he couldn't see this being's details or destiny!","The only thing...was what was already known by him as he affirmed his suspicions.","<The True Emperor of Quintessence>.","...!","The one who had risen from the very same Barren Lands he came from as he foiled what he had planned with these Planes of Existence.","He should've been many billions of years younger, and yet he was somehow releasing the air of Consummate Boundaries at this moment as he seemed to equal or exceed average Reverends!","It only showed how much of an anomaly this being was.","Throughout his life, Oppenheimer had seen and overcome special existences with unimaginable destinies. Chosen Emperors and Destined Emperors- organisms meant for greatness...and he exceeded them when he was not anywhere close to their destined fortune!","But...he hadn't met a being like this.","And this was moreso affirmed as while this existence rebuffed the strike of a Varicella Emperor Kong, his austere body giving off waves of potent aura of Extremity didn't pour attention into the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathan tight before him as his eyes gazed over the radiant mountains outstretched before him, only for his gaze to land on and focus on the mountain that Oppenheimer currently stood beside!","...!ραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","The dazzling eyes of this being releasing a providential aura felt like they locked with his eyes again even though he should be invisible and unseen to others as Oppenheimer sighed.","Destiny told him that his only opportunity here were the Eyes of Clarity as attaining anything else was off the table, but he still wanted to try after obtaining the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform as he delved deeper into the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","He now affirmed why no opportunity here was his as staying here...was too dangerous when this anomaly was showing himself!","He...had to do what he did before.","Learn about his enemy.","Understand him better than he understood himself.","Only then...would he be victorious.","HOONG!","He turned and gazed at the aura of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity around him as without a second of a delay, the spatial continuum around him twisted as he took a step.","He instantly traversed a vast distance to instantly appear past the area of the torn veil as he left the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","He saw the deadly eyes of the anomalous being shockingly turn to follow him as he seemed ready to give a chase when the roar of another Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathan boomed out- a second one of these Beasts arriving to besiege him as Oppenheimer only observed this scene and did not look back as he took the dark skies of the Abyss!","The same skies that many other Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans were flying up to leave the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity and spread outwards for the purpose of Extremity Sanctification.","Oppenheimer's figure quickly followed this path to ascend out of the Abyss- something that all those at the 7th Boundary Layer and below would find impossible for them to do in the very near future as only truly powerful 8th Boundary Layer Existences and above could leave the Abyss after they had entered.","A glow of clarity covered him as he trusted in the senses that got him where he was today.","He left the lands others considered a great opportunity instantly as the enemy that had locked onto him currently...he was someone that needed a great deal of planning to face!","There were other abundant opportunities with the Eyes of Clarity stemming from an Apex Aeonic Lifeform he now held.","With them...he even felt like he could cross the walls of the Aeonic Havens that only Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could traverse!","So...he would seek destiny carefully as he moved.","His eyes turned around to the Abyss one last time as he continued to see the radiance of this being, his eyes solemn as he disappeared while leaving behind simple words.","<Wait for me, O True Emperor of Quintessence.>","...!","With a glimmer of unseen light, Oppenheimer disappeared as he left this region!","And past the torn veil, the visage of the True Emperor of Quintessence only released grander radiance as a third light of crimson Consummate brilliance shone at this moment that caused all others to be gobsmacked!"]},{"number":2326,"title":"Chapter 2326: Chapter 2325 Across The Lands! IV","paragraphs":["A multicolored and golden radiance had surrounded him as they represented two Consummate Boundaries from their pristine pressure, with this alone causing Reverends to turn solemn and pay even greater attention to this being...but he was not done!","While the Varicella Emperor Kong was stopped by his right hand as he seemed like he was holding off an obsidian crimson mounting, another Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathan attacked.","It was a massive verdant spider with white stripes that had the dazzling destination of <Arachnoid Prion Queen> as it released a web of crimson silver light that could encompass all of reality.","And at such a moment, a crimson pillar of light was added to Noah as yet another prompt appeared.","<The Golden Consummate Boundary of Blood has been born.>","Golden!","This was the only stage of Consummate Noah could currently achieve as it was a heavy jump from the tier of Innate to Consummate, where he knew to take his concepts from Golden Consummate to Obsidian and later Crimson Consummate would be something he would struggle to do for the days and weeks to come.","But he felt his power scaling upwards once more as his used-up Aeonic Soul Values were forcefully being regenerated just as rapidly as he was using them, his left hand rising towards the encompassing web of RUIN and NULLITY as scathing cerulean flames composed of Infinity symbols bloomed to hold back the Arachnoid Prion Queen and its attack.","Two creatures exceeding average levels of power of Reverends attacked him as he rebuffed both of them at the same time, his Main Body beginning to peruse the shocking changes brought by his Boundaries being taken to the Consummate Tier as his True Sanguine Clone here...he could allow it to go wild to feel this power in real time!","<WOOO!>","Towards the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans releasing an air of wildness and brutality, he bellowed out with a royal air of tyranny and even greater wildness as his right hand clamped onto the crimson black fur of the Varicella Emperor Kong, his Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul expressing its power through his body as he fantastically applied force and moved the towering mountain that attacked him as if it was an object that could be lifted.","BZZT!","Reality cracked and fissured as while bellowing out, he was actually capable of moving the body of the Varicella Emperor Kong as he hoisted such a mountainous creature and chucked it towards the Arachnoid Prion Queen!","...!","His figure then barreled towards the both of them with shocking vigor and celestial stellar might as he seemed like a creature even more ancient and wild than them- a creature forged in the pressure of Extremity for an unknown number of years!","α?dαsηθνε| —","The endless stretches of the Aeonic Haven of Extremity seemed insurmountable for some, but eventually, even they had an end to those truly powerful.","Eventually, one could see their defined borders, where they began- and where they ended.","In the deepest reaches of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution that even the Ancestral Lerneans had not yet reached.","A massive concentration of potent essence of Extremity formed into a hazy billowing fog that seemed like a sentient entity that could swallow any beings below the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms with ease.","This billowing fog stretched out linearly in all directions as right at the point where it connected to the skies and the vibrant earth, incandescent Aeonic Treasures of Extremity grew in abundance as they sparkled with pristine radiance.ραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","They were forged over an unknown period of time as the potent aura of Extremity transformed even common herbs into profound wonders.","At this moment, the billowing cloud that was simply part of a massive spacetime continuum barrier began to roil and flicker as in one particular area, it began to open up as a verdant light shone through!","A light...of pristine wonder and closeness towards Extremity as it seemed to be almost there- a light of an Apex Aeonic Life Form that held such volume and breadth that it could encompass all other Lifeforms with ease!","HOOONG!","Such a light blared out as the unmovable fog that nobody below the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could traverse parted, an existence stepping out as his hair shone with a verdant gold radiance, a dazzling verdant gold robe draping over him as it put all EPOCH Relics to shame.","This being remained in the periphery of the billowing dog as he did not step out of it- his hands only waving forward to release a verdant point of light that began to enlarge into a massive green platform that revealed the auras of existences that even the weakest of...seemed to be that of Reverends who had at least 9 Boundaries at the 9th Boundary Layer!","As for the most powerful...their bodies carried a sense of grace and grandeur of Consummate Boundaries as the very potent pressure of Extremity swirled around them peacefully.","Their number reached twice a dozen as the Apex Aeonic Lifeform who had transferred them across the cracks of Havens looked towards them calmly as his resonant voice rang out.","<The Extremity Vein in the Youngest Haven has begun its Initiation as the process of Sanctification is underway in this Haven. If you can reach the depths of the Initiating Extremity Vein of Dissolution and obtain the Extremity Panaceas, you will achieve an Extremity Foundation akin to the legends you admire and hear of now before you become Apex Aeonic Life Forms. Such a foundation is critical in reaching Extremity in the future...so use any means necessary to obtain it.>","WAA!","An austere air of power and wonder surged out at his words as among the twice a dozen auras on the verdant platform he had released, a devilishly handsome man with regality and nobility dripping from every part of his body spoke out.","<Our actions towards the Aboriginals in the Haven?>","...!","His words were cold and callous as if he didn't consider those in this Haven anywhere near as pristine as himself and the others here!","The Apex Aeonic Lifeform still in the billowing fog of Extremity waved his hands dismissively as he replied while the fog began to envelop him.","<Go easy on them. They also have the right to fight for the opportunities of their Haven, but they will not be able to hinder you all in obtaining what you want.>","WAA!","Dazzling waves of Extremity surged in the surroundings as unique existences arrived in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution after crossing the crevices between different Havens.","They were unique and powerful...but they weren't the only ones as from other Havens, those similar to them were arriving around the same time as the initiation of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution was something significant!"]},{"number":2327,"title":"Chapter 2327: Chapter 2326 Across The Lands! V","paragraphs":["Existences from other Havens on the cusp of becoming Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were moved across the walls of Havens to appear into the past Haven that began its Extremity Sanctification!","But even among these existences, there were some of truly special standing and dispositions who also arrived.","In a region filled with raging storms of NULLITY and RUIN, the billowing fog connecting endless the skies and earth rolled and opened calmly as two figures stepped out of it.","One was an aged old man with radiant red and gold hair neatly trimmed, a pair of small Crimson horns rising from the top of his head as his face was full of vigor and life as a clean goatee shone with radiance!","His eyes sparkled with immense knowledge and mystery as he gazed at the roiling lightning and thundering of NULLITY and RUIN as he smiled, speaking towards the young woman beside him that he pushed forward.","\"Just obtain the Extremity Panacea to set up your Foundation, Ayame. Leave the rest of the opportunities for the Aboriginals of this Haven, it was meant for them to forge their path anyways.\"","Not an ounce of authority could be felt from his words.","From all accounts, he actually seemed like an Entity full of mysteries- no ounce of danger or aura raging around him as it was extremely unique to see!","The young woman he talked to was slim and slender, with similar fiery red gold hair snaking past her shoulders as she held a single stellar Crimson horn sprouting out of her forehead.","Her aura was strong and filled with regality as over a dozen Boundaries at the very peak of the 9th Boundary Layer silently coiled around her, a smile of power and humility radiating from her face as she waved towards the old man behind her.","<Don't worry, Grandpa Daichi. Even though other Treasures exist to build an Extremity Foundation in our Vaults, nothing beats the Extremity Panacea from a waking Extremity Vein. The Panaceas coming from this Haven of Dissolution will be the last in all the Seven Havens as the last generation of Existences to reach Extremity will be born from them. Providence tells me my path will start here.>","Her words caused the surrounding essence to surge cheerfully as they carried shocking power, the one she referred to as Grandpa Daichi nodding lovingly at her words as the stellar fog calmly began to wrap around him.","Before he left, his hand flickered lightly as he released an aura for the first time- this light coming to land on Ayame to her own surprise as she shook her head wryly soon after.","But this flash of light caused the nearby NULLITY and RUIN to tremble and calm down, their tendrils even bowing towards it in shock as it was a light that exceeded all Boundaries!","It was...a light of a concept that had truly reached Extremity.","WAA!","Extremity!","Such a light landed on Ayame as who in this Haven could even dream to do anything against her?","Her crimson horn flickered and absorbed the light of an unknown concept of Extremity as she bowed towards the fog before turning around and taking a step forward.","Every time she did so, space twisted as she appeared light years away, her face full of exceeding calm and beauty as in terms of speed, she outmatched any guests that were entering the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution currently!","—","OOOHραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","His bellows caused the stellar darkness above to flicker while the Obsidian earth below churned!","He threw the figure of the Varicella Emperor Kong onto the Arachnoid Prion Queen as he surged forward like an unhinged bullet, a cerulean aurora of wings erupting behind him while raging blue flames from Infinity symbols flickering like singularities crashed out.","He seemed wilder than even the Beasts here as the Reverends watching became grimmer and grimmer!","This was because they could feel his rising aura.","It didn't stop at releasing a grand Consummate Light three times as from there on...it continued.","For a fourth time.","For a fifth time!","His aura seemed to rouse the potent aura of Extremity in the surroundings as it surged towards him and was absorbed into his Soul, with his touring aura beginning to spread across the lands!","It pressed onto the stellar black earth and the abyssal skies above.","It reached out to press on the souls of all beings here as of course the Reverends would pour attention into him and the wildness he displayed while his aura of Consummate Boundaries stretched out all around!","And none were more focused than Ancestral Lerneans as their Reverends focused on his figure and then turned towards Ophelia, their eyes full of understanding and expectation.","They had to clear the situation and affirm this being's standing in their Lineage!","But it didn't seem like they could approach his raging figure at this moment as while the Varicella Emperor Kong roared out towards him and the Arachnoid Prion Queen spat out countless webs, his figure continued to move wildly as a sea of blue flames, singularities, Infinity symbols, and much more thundered down to blanket everything in a wild show of wonder.","And how could he not be wild?!","His Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul was roaring out with maddening grandeur as its strongest concepts were altered to an even greater level, and the sheer changes brought about through them had to be experienced for him to fully understand!","He could see that from Quintessence, Blood, and Loot- their Boundary Layers were ever so subtly changed as the Layers that had the All Aeonic Parameter Values were scaled upwards greatly.","And it was crucial to understand that currently - two changes were taking place simultaneously.","One was Noah bringing 9 concepts to the 6th Boundary Layer and then Designating them as Quintessential to instantly have them arrive at the 9th Boundary Layer, and the second change was him using his authority as an Aeonic Quintessential Curator to alter these concepts to the Consummate level.","So, many new Layers were added from these 9 Boundaries as some of them granted additional augmentations to All Aeonic Parameter Values among other boons!","It was an overload of information.","Information that if written out, they could fill entire pages with 81 excerpts of just each of the Boundary Layers for the 9 Boundaries!"]},{"number":2328,"title":"Chapter 2328: Chapter 2327 Across The Lands! VI","paragraphs":["So...Noah wanted to simplify these changes as he focused on the most important ones.","While his True Sanguine Clone moved wildly in the periphery of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands, his Main Body went through the abundant information and gave out commands.","<Bring up the most pertinent Layers in relation to my current strength from each of the 9 Boundaries.>","...!","<Put together all the All Aeonic Parameter Value Augmentations from each Boundary and display it under a stat panel.>","WAA!","A dazzling blue stat panel unfurled in his mind as the long version was countless pages with everything he had. The short and condensed version currently showed his Name, Titles, Natural Laws, Decreta, Killing Techniques, Foundation, Boundaries, and what his current maximum Damage Output, Defense, and Vitality Values were.","He gazed at the section of Natural Laws and Decreta as he waved his hands to have this disappear as well- and this was because all of these concepts were expanded towards Extremity as they're also listed under Boundaries!","His Stat Panel became even more condensed as he nodded while gazing at the Boundaries section that listed the 9 Boundaries that had over half already at the Consummate level while his Soul continued to spend more of itself as an Aeonic Quintessential Curator to turn the rest towards the same level.","With every passing second, another would join the ranks of the Consummate Tier.","HOONG!","And his soul would cry out with fervor.","And the lands around him would tremble as his bodies in the Vaults of Extremity sucked in the surrounding aura of Extremity to fuel his rise!","His eyes released a terrific light of power as he focused on the Boundaries that had already reached the 9th Boundary Layer and the Consummate level.","He felt that as he went down the list, all of them would arrive at this place in the seconds to follow as everything would be neatly quantified!","His eyes first went to the Boundary responsible for all these changes, focusing on the overall All Aeonic Parameter Value Augmentation shown beside this Boundary.","<Boundary of Quintessence>::...Current All Aeonic Parameter Value Augmentation: 25,000%. [Featured Boundary Layers], [All Boundary Layers]...","An astonishing change in just the All Aeonic Parameter Values Augmentation came from Quintessence after it entered the Golden Consummate Tier- and this wasn't to mention any alterations on the other Layers of this Boundary!","This was one of the causes for his explosion of power as after this, his eyes continued down the list.","<Boundary of Loot>::...Current All Aeonic Parameter Value Augmentation: 12,999%. [Featured Boundary Layers], [All Boundary Layers]...","<Boundary of Blood>::...Current All Aeonic Parameter Value Augmentation: 12,500%. [Featured Boundary Layers], [All Boundary Layers]...","<Boundary of Dimensions>::...Current All Aeonic Parameter Value Augmentation: 12,500%. [Featured Boundary Layers], [All Boundary Layers]...","<Boundary of Entropy>::...Current All Aeonic Parameter Value Augmentation: 35,999%. [Featured Boundary Layers], [All Boundary Layers]...","...!","Noah's gaze came to a pause when he reached Entropy.","At this moment in time, countless changes were blooming with his Aspects of Existence as it was hard to say what they were due to when he had so many things happening all at once.","But at this moment, he saw the mere boons of Entropy alone that almost neared what 3 Golden Consummate Boundaries of his granted!ραпdαs `n?ν?| сom","The augmentation of Entropy alone even exceeded his strongest Boundary that was undoubtedly Quintessence as this...","<<This is partly due to the 9th Boundary Layer of Entropy, and the overall nature of Reality in the Havens of Extremity.>>","WAA!","The words of the Source of Reality rang in Noah's mind as it knew more than anyone else about the expanded Natural Laws.","Their transformations were occurring in real time as with all the changes that Noah was going through, the Infinite Plane that was bound by the Fundamental Natural Laws undergoing the expansion to Extremity was undergoing even greater changes than Noah!","The Infinite Plane knew this closely as during the expansion of Fundamental Natural Laws, it focused on what Entropy would bring!","And everything was now unveiled as the Will of the Infinite Plane drew Noah to gaze under the section of [Featured Boundaries] of Entropy, the first of which was the 9th Boundary Layer.","<The Ninth Boundary Layer of Entropy>:: Disorder is the immutable flow of reality, order is but a mere illusion of weaker existences. The flow of nature is always increasing in Entropy, with things in an ever constant state of expansion and transformation. As a being who has bound the workings of Entropy and aided in its transformation towards Extremity, you have gained the distinction of the Entropic Entity of Extremity- an existence that thrives and grows more powerful amidst increased chaos and disorder. To other existences, Entropy unsettles and overwhelms them- but to an Entropic Entity of Extremity, Entropy is something you can control. At this moment, your soul will begin a transformation to an Entropic Entity of Extremity as part of the unfolding abilities is that every action you now take will mobilize the Sources of chaos and disorder in your surroundings to temporarily move with your will. Previous augmentation of past Layers will also rise and change as other abilities will unfold once the transformation is completed...","...!","Noah's soul buzzed.","Among the many changes occurring with his Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul, it seemed a particularly dreadful one was taking place as...exactly what did one of the crucial sentences in the detail of the 9th Boundary Layer of Entropy mean?","<...every action you now take will mobilize the Sources of chaos and disorder in your surroundings to temporarily move with your will...>","The Sources of chaos and disorder around him.","Before Noah could theorize just what this entailed...his True Sanguine Clone in the periphery of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands felt it closely as incredulous changes bloomed!","—","At this moment, Noah's True Sanguine Clone had a sea of blue flames behind him and singularities flying towards the Varicella Emperor Kong and Arachnoid Prion Queen when a phenomenon that even caused Ophelia's jaws to drop bloomed.","α?dαsηθνε| When the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans erupted out, each of them surged with torrential tendrils of NULLITY and RUIN at an extremely high level.","And towards the deeper depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands, one could see even greater concentrations of surging RUIN and NULLITY.","Yet at this moment, around Noah's figure bathed in cerulean flames...it felt like time slowed down as from the surroundings.","From the bodies of the Varicella Emperor Kong and the Arachnoid Prion Queen.","From the bodies of other Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans nearby...","The tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY flowed out like tamed souls as they turned into wisps that joined his blue flames.","...!","He didn't know of them.","He did not have them expanded towards Extremity!","Yet...he commandeered them from the surroundings as his glorious visage became surrounded by blue flames that in their exterior...shimmering crimson and silver light began to join in astonishing brilliance as the Leviathans he targeted felt a sense of danger for the first time since the veil was torn down!!!"]},{"number":2329,"title":"Chapter 2329: Chapter 2328 Chaos I","paragraphs":["Shimmering crimson and silver tendrils of light began to join his blue flames as ushered by Entropy, the Sources of Chaos in the surroundings followed Noah's will!","The Varicella Emperor Kong and Arachnoid Prion Queen he targeted felt a sense of danger for the first time since the veil was torn down as their bodies fantastically flickered to turn into countless foamy particles similar to what many other Leviathans had shown the capability to do so in recent battles.","And the flames bounded by entropy and disorder crashed down.","BOOOOM!","The impact was immensely heavy as a shocking indentation appeared on the stellar black earth as if an inverted mountain was carved out, the vibrations and waves of power spreading out to give rise to the stellar black earth to fissure and crack across this region!","The residual impact of the blow even blasted out into a pressure wave that passed through the bodies of the Ancestral Lernaeans, Quasarians, and Noblesse as the weaker beings at the 6th Boundary Layer were forced to spit blood and sustain injuries from the mere Shockwaves alone.","...!","The Leviathans that had turned into foam restructured their bodies from the vast crater as when they returned to their glorious figures of the Varicella Emperor Kong and Arachnoid Prion Queen...one could see the crimson black fur of the Kong stained with blood as one of his arms was lost, while the Arachnoid Prion Queen had a huge gash spreading over her carapace!","ROAAR!","They released maddening roars as for the first time, the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans actually suffered a loss.","And the being to do so...","He currently floated above the massive stellar craters he created as its earth melted and began to crystallize, his figure shrouded by blue flames that became tinged with Crimson and Silver grandeur at this moment.","And as NULLITY and RUIN mixed in due to his distinction of the Entropic Entity of Extremity stemming from the Boundary of Entropy...","<Your understanding of NULLITY is Quintessentially increasing.>","<You have begun to understand RUIN.>","WAA!","Noah's eyes flashed brilliantly as he caught onto one of the concepts that more intricately followed the course of nature more than anything else.","Because inherently...nature was predisposed and always going towards more chaos and disorder!","If he could reign in a concept presiding over this and take it to Extremity...","Many possibilities bloomed in his mind as even greater changes occurred around him.","The auras of more and more Consummate Boundary Layer erupted from him that continued to make others tremble, some even becoming distrustful as within the Lernean Reverends- one known as Reverend Imamu spoke towards Elder Ancestor Rodwig and other Elder Ancestors who normally took hold of the day to day ongoing of the various Sacrariums.","<No such being is in our ranks, right? But that Ophelia...>","Their eyes hungrily looked towards Ophelia as from her dazzling figure, they could see the outburst of a Consummate Boundary similar to the first multicolored light that shone over the anomalous Entity before them!","Since she moved with him, it showed their connection and the fact that this was a genuine Consummate Boundary that they could learn.","Ancestor Rodwig's pupils shone with a glorious sword light as he spoke out slowly.","<We have to get a hold of her and communicate well. I've already sent the message to gather some of our Elder Ancestors towards the Abecedarian Sacrarium where her main body should be.>","...!","Ancestor Rodwig moved quickly as Reverend Imamu nodded, his body brimming with power as he observed the unfolding chaos which drawing deeper into the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands, leaving behind one last message.","<Good. He seems to have a conflict with us as he didn't differentiate between friend or foe when he first arrived. Clear this up first and give up whoever offended him. Build a strong relationship through Ophelia and let's get our hands on this Consummate Boundary...or multiple of them if the auras around him are to be believed!>","Destiny rose and fell in wondrous waves as many beings continued their own movements and followed intricate paths amidst the unfolding chaos.","—","Back in the Source of Reality, Noah's main body licked his lips as he felt the sensation coursing through his True Sanguine Clone due to the distinction of Entropic Entity of Extremity- his Soul feeling as if the more chaos there was out there, the more powerful he would become!","Of course, this could also be another sensation he felt as multiple other Boundaries he chose were designated as Quintessential- their Boundary Layers exploding to reach the 9th Boundary Layer as Noah used his authority as the Quintessential Aeonic Curator to elevate them towards the Golden Consummate Tier thereafter.","He continued to read over their augmentations first before he jumped to see the featured Boundary Layers of Entropy and the other newly expanded concepts.","<Boundary of Manadynamics>::...Current All Aeonic Parameter Value Augmentation: 20,000%. [Featured Boundary Layers], [All Boundary Layers]...","<Boundary of Providence>::...Current All Aeonic Parameter Value Augmentation: 12,500%. [Featured Boundary Layers], [All Boundary Layers]...","<Boundary of Conquest>::...Current All Aeonic Parameter Value Augmentation: 12,500%. [Featured Boundary Layers], [All Boundary Layers]...","WAA!","Yes!","Conquest was also something that greatly defined Noah as he chose to expand this towards Extremity!","Quintessence, Loot, Blood, Dimensions, Entropy, Manadynamics, Providence, and Conquest.","Noah's soul stopped here briefly as he had other plans for a Ninth and Tenth Boundary to raise to the 9th Boundary Layer and make them at the Consummate Tier, but he had to put a hold as not too long ago, the prompts that spoke of NULLITY and RUIN appeared.","He had to study these a bit more as the expanded concept of Providence had begun to feed him information that he doubted Ophelia would ever receive from the concept of Wisdom, with one thing already being made clear.","The time he began to massacre the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans would be the time he would quickly ascend the Primitivus, Proficere, and Terminus stages of NULLITY and RUIN as he could then expand them into Extremity and attain a fantastical tool in his hands!"]},{"number":2330,"title":"Chapter 2330: Chapter 2329 Chaos II","paragraphs":["Outside of the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity.","A figure shot out of its inky black depths silently as more figures and vessels could actually be seen jumping into the Abyss at the same time.","It was none other than Oppenheimer who was wrapped with a light stemming from the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform that very few others could ever hope of seeing through!","He silently moved out of the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity as his destinations were many, with a great number of things he had to do before he fully began to move.","The Noblesse Commanders around him earlier in the outer periphery of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands had scoffed at the possibility that Ancestral Lernaeans thought he may have been more than just a defector- the reason for this was because they knew the price that Oppenheimer paid to gain their trust!","Even with the methods Desiderius had provided for him, Oppenheimer had to give up a significant portion of his Soul to be held in the Spirit Hall of Noblesse that was always under the guard of Reverends.","A location that was one of the major points of communication, and it was stretched out to multiple domains of the Noblesse.","Oppenheimer knew exactly which domain the portion of his Soul was hidden in as with the Eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, he should be able to enter and leave it unscathed and unseen as he retrieved his Soul and closed off any avenues of danger in the future- before any of the Noblesse Commanders amidst the chaos realized he was no longer there!","With his body glimmering with radiance, he left the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity and turned towards the direction that held the Domains of the Noblesse Lineage.","---","Lightyears away from the Abecedarian Sacrarium.","A stretch of stellar gold vegetation could be seen endlessly painting the earth below as the skies carried a hazy glow of gold, with the constantly changing auras of multiple figures seen crossing this region atop another Chaoticus Behemoth Transporter from the Abecedarian Sacrarium!","At the forefront of it was the figure of Henry, accompanied by the Blue Slime bouncing on his head, Kazuhiko tightly grasping a sword not too far away, and the figures of the Kraken, Emperor Penguin, Dimensional Rulers like Eowyn and Guinevere, and many others that joined him on his mission.","Henry's eyes were sharp as he gazed out at the vastness around him.","He knew his father well.","What others achieved in centuries, he achieved within seconds.","It took billions of years for others to reach the 9th Boundary Layer of a concept...his father had already reached this within a matter of days- his Lineage told him so!","So the moment that his Father told him to move and deliver the Noblesse domains to him, Henry knew he had to act fast.","Otherwise, while he began conquering one Noblesse Domain, his father may have already finished dominating the Ancestral Lernaeans and all their Sacrariums.","So he moved out as quickly as he could, Complete Aeonic Pearls of Extremity still swirling around him as his destiny showed him many paths.","And even more paths opened up in the last minute as he felt Quintessence- the Boundary he chose to focus on and use a Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearl of Extremity to bring to the 6th Boundary Layer...he felt its profound elevation to the Consummate Boundary Tier as the 6 Boundary Layers he just learned were altered stupendously!","Quintessence was automatically deemed Quintessential as it was in its name- and it could now exceed 2 Quintessential Apocryphal Layers on itself and any other Boundaries that Henry had...with the maximum limitation being not exceeding the 9th Boundary Layer.","So his total Boundary Layers of Quintessence instantly became 8 as his Aeonic Soul released eye-catching brilliance.","The next Boundary he had utilized a Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearl of Extremity on was Providence as at this moment, he also applied the effect of Quintessence on it as it added two Apocryphal Layers!","That made it two Boundaries at the 8th Boundary Layer!","And as he optimized his power over the next few minutes...he would add Destiny, Loot, Blood, Manadynamics, and Entropy into this as he would be an existence who rose rapidly in power similar to his father...achieving what others took billions of years to do in a span of a day.","Even at this very second, his extremely young soul was transforming into something at the level of power that began to exceed average Elder Ancestors of the Ancestral Lernaeans like Elder Ancestor Rodwig!","And it would only grow stronger as he included more and more Boundaries to the 8th Boundary Layer...such an unimaginable thing actually being made possible at this moment.","And...it was all due to his father.","The Loot that made it possible, and whatever ridiculous method he used to turn Quintessence into a Consummate Boundary as even at this moment, Henry felt other Boundaries originating from his father rousing and going towards the same level.","\"Hooo...\"","He breathed out to contain himself and his bubbling power as he gazed out into the expanse before him.","Yes, everything he had achieved now was due to his father.","He wanted to see if he could obtain something by himself as this mission to deliver the Noblesse Domains to him...he would see if he could get a hold of stupendous Loot and grandeur with his own hands as well!","And his newly enacted Boundary of Providence that reached the 8th Boundary Layer with the help of Quintessence shone.","He was looking at the many paths he could take in the Lands of the Noblesse when at the same time, his golden heart released a profound brilliance as his gaze changed!","\"Oh?\"","Tendrils of golden destiny released from his eyes as he foresaw countless things.","Destiny and Providence told him many things as he saw that his incursion into the Noblesse...he would have a chance of a profound opportunity that didn't actually have to do with this Lineage!","This caused Henry to be confused as what could he get from the Domains of the Noblesse that wasn't connected to the Noblesse Lineage itself?","<Give me a clue. A place, a name...anything!>","He spoke out authoritatively in his mind as his Aeonic Soul Values were drained out rapidly.","The Child of Destiny released a profound golden radiance as in his mind, a single word unfolded after nearly all of his Aeonic Soul Values were spent!","[Oppenheimer]","...!","Oppenheimer.","Henry's eyes expanded as very soon, a devilish smile inherited from his father bloomed as his eyes released blinding radiance!"]},{"number":2331,"title":"Chapter 2331: Chapter 2330 Chaos III","paragraphs":["Above a massive stellar crater that was melting and crystallizing at rapid speeds.","Noah's figure was shrouded by blue flames that were tinged with crimson and silver grandeur at this moment.","Frankly, too many things were currently happening with him as he needed to take even at least a moment to absorb and compartmentalize everything neatly.","There were many new Layers of Boundaries to look over and understand, even if they're just the featured ones that augmented his strength the most right now.","But...he had many bodies and had his Will divided over them just for this purpose.","His main body and other clones would understand the changes occurring as the True Sanguine Clone here...it would continue to act!","And right now, the expanded concept of Providence was telling him to focus on the two Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans before him.","This stemmed from no other reason other than a Featured Boundary of Providence he was also being urged to call out!","It was the 6th Boundary Layer that granted...the Planar Annals of Providence!","His luminous eyes pulled briefly focused on his status panel as under <Boundaries>, he focused on the [Featured Boundaries] of Providence at this moment.","<The Sixth Boundary Layer of Providence>:: A layer meant to illuminate the countless paths before you into a single best one depending on your nature, allowing you to call out the Planar Annals of Providence to guide the way. Your current attributes and quality of Aeonic Quintessential Mana Soul have been placed into account when it comes to the cost of calling forth the Planar Annals of Providence and their duration, allowing for this Boundary Layer to be utilized without a true cost when taking into account your Aeonic Soul Values and Aeonic Mana of Extremity. Once cast, it has an unlimited duration due to your rate of regeneration greatly exceeding the cost to cast. The uses and illumination of the Planar Annals of Providence are hard to describe as to experience them, the best way is to call it out and watch it show the path forward...","It was a featured Boundary of Providence that did not truly say what it did, but Noah called it out nonetheless.","<Planar Annals of Providence>.","In the dark skies as the injured Varicella Emperor Kong and Arachnoid Prion Queen bared their fangs towards him, his bodies surrounded by flames released a golden radiance as he spoke out.","And soon after, this radiance expanded to form a dazzling halcyon grimoire of light that shot its rays outwards and erased the darkness!","A golden grimoire that a second later turned into a streak of light that fused into Noah's forehead- causing a faint tattoo to appear at the very center as a stellar golden halo emanated from him.","A halo of Providence.","It covered everything about him as most of all, it covered his eyes.","He blinked a few times to adjust as when he looked at the reality around him once more...it seemed like everything had changed.","He could see countless dim lines that represented paths he could follow, and a few golden lines that represented paths he should follow that were based on his very own aspects of Existence!","Not just this, he was also being fed boundless waves of information as when he gazed at the Varicella Emperor Kong and Arachnoid Prion Queen before his eyes...","All of their details rose out.","Their name, Titles, the concepts they controlled, and even how their Values compared to his!","But more than this, he could see multiple points highlighted on their bodies that showed their weakest points he could attack...and exactly what he had to do if he wished to grant the two Leviathans before him True Death!","Thereafter, he would achieve the possibilities shown by the Planar Annals of Providence as what occurred would then be written down on it.","And even further from this, Noah also received information on what he could obtain if these two Leviathans were to be taken down by him as his eyes lit up brightly when he saw the names of new possible Loot he hadn't even grasped before!","With all paths neatly laid out and everything set just for him to choose...","<OOOH!>","He bellowed out gloriously as the surging blue flames tainted by red and silver tendrils of NULLITY and RUIN...began to be sucked towards his body.","More specifically towards his eyes as they're akin to backhoes that swallowed everything rapidly!","What he was doing now...was devouring and concentrating sparse forms of power source into two luminous balls of light.","He gathered his cerulean flames made from singularities and countless Infinity symbols as they're tainted by tendrils of NULLITY and RUIN, these essence mixing in an utterly chaotic and disordered fashion as the result of it...Noah gave it a name for the first time he formulated an ability after the Quintessential Killing Techniques.","<Entropic Ray>.","His voice was light.","But the pressure he emanated...was utterly disastrous as his eyes that devoured everything and shone like ancient Suns...exploded!","—","'What is he?'","This was a thought that not someone foreign, but a being that had just pledged herself to Noah not too long ago had!","Ophelia gazed at the scene before her with utter awe as she saw a stunning scene.","This Entity she had bound herself to seemed to control the uncontrolled chaotic tendrils of NULLITY and RUIN around them as he absorbed his own flames and these chaotic forces into his eyes, and an instant later...his eyes shone with a blinding light as a ray that caused Ophelia's body to tremble erupted out.","It caused her to tremble because...she could not see it!","She only saw a flash of volatile light as she knew if it hit her, all aspects of her existence would perish.","Wisdom would not be able to save her even if it managed to alert her!","This power...was approaching the stage of the truly powerful Reverends feared across the battlefields of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!","And such a being had only just stepped out from the Barren Lands- a cluster of Minor Planes and one Major Plane outside of the Vaults of Extremity for merely over a day!"]},{"number":2332,"title":"Chapter 2332: Chapter 2331 Chaos IV","paragraphs":["Unprecedented danger rang in the souls of the Varicella Emperor Kong and Arachnoid Prion Queen.","And how could they not?","Noah...could feel their shock and terror with his eyes the moment he released the volatile rays of light from them!","The utter speed that his eyes released the rays of blue, crimson, and silver was too fast even for him to follow as before the two Leviathans could even move away...","SHIIING!","The two lasers of chaotic glory from his eyes already passed through them as the earth of the crater they were at the bottom of...","CRACK!","Split apart and extended like a fissure towards the inner stellar mountains past the torn veil, a clean cut extending through as everything was crystallized instantly!","...!","And to the shock and awe of all, the massive titanic body of the fearsome Varicella Emperor Kong...split from the forehead and towards its lower torso as crimson red blood gushed out endlessly.","·?θm Beside it, the carapace of the Arachnoid Prion Queen also split and was cleanly split apart as countless green vessels could be seen trying to stay together!","They both took great damage as they tried to put their bodies together, but the visage of the Arachnoid Prion Queen trembled in the next instant as its will caught onto a heart shaking phenomenon beside it.","It was on the Varicella Emperor Kong.","The Arachnoid Prion Queen saw the titanic body of its compatriot twist, turn, and implode into itself as the Crimson gold blood leaking from it, its limbs, any parts of soul...anything and everything about it was being drawn towards a golden Singularity that suddenly erupted at the center of its being!","As if it was an inescapable black gold that devoured every part of the remaining life-force and soul of the Varicella Emperor Kong!","The Arachnoid Prion Queen felt great terror at this as it didn't know what such a phenomenon was, but Noah knew it very clearly as this...was the effect of the Ninth Boundary Layer of Loot.","<The Ninth Boundary Layer of Loot>:: Whenever you erase the Aeonic Vitality Values of a target to the extent that they fall below 30% of their Maximum Aeonic Vitality Values, the effect of The Devouring Loot Singularity will be applied as the remaining Aspects of Existence of the target will instantly be devoured and turned into Loot that gets assimilated to you right away- unless you direct it not to. The Devouring Loot Singularity is the current ultimate design of the Boundary of Loot that exceeds Treasure Caches, with their Quantity and Quality Multipliers reaching unrecorded Quintessential levels...","To others, it was a foreign phenomenon.","To Noah, it was the first eruption of the Devouring Loot Singularity as every remaining part of the Varicella Emperor Kong was devoured into a single golden point of light...before it exploded outwards and surged towards his body uncontrollably!","And before Noah's eyes...","<The Source of 2x Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearl of Extremity have been absorbed into your body.>","<The Source of Complete Aeonic Nullity Pearl has been absorbed into your body.>","<The Source of Complete Aeonic Ruin Pearl has been absorbed into your body.>","WAA!","<The Source of 100x Obsidian Planar Origin Panaceas have been engrossed into your body.>","Everything that used to be the Varicella Emperor Kong turned into streams of golden light from an exploded Singularity as all beings here watched this light be devoured into his Body entirely as he emanated even greater radiance!","<A deep Understanding of Nullity exceeding the Primitivus and Proficere Stage is being infused into your Soul.>","<A deep Understanding of Ruin exceeding the Primitivus and Proficere Stage is being infused into your Soul.>","A red and silver radiance tinged his soul as his Understanding of Two sources of chaos scaled upwards at a ridiculous speed.","They were rapidly shooting past the Primitivus Stage as they would more than likely also speed past Proficere to enter Terminus soon enough, where at that point in time- the Boundaries of Nullity and Ruin would be for Noah to expand as he would see just what the states of Verisimilitude held.","But more than this there were the new Loot termed Obsidian Planar Origin Panaceas directly engrossed by him as at this moment, his First Plane of Extremity pulsed.","Extremely pure essence surged from the very top of his Origin and washed down over his Dimensional Realities as it was akin to a Celestial rain on a dry earth, his Dimensional Realities hungrily devouring everything and rapidly expanding as they took in the Source of an Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathan!","A creature who lost more than 70% of his Aeonic Vitality Values as the influence of the Devouring Loot Singularity instantly took out its remaining 30% and turned everything about it into fuel for Noah that was engrossed right away.","It was dreadful, but the Varicella Emperor Kong was lucky to die this way.","It died peacefully and instantly.","It would not be here for the shocking chaos to unfold like all the others as at this moment, Noah called out once more as he lifted his hand towards the Arachnoid Prion Queen that seemed ready to retreat...and then closed his fist.","<Spontaneous Entropic Planar Combustion>.","...!","A planar domain.","A domain that was the 6th Boundary Layer of Entropy as its description....was one of the more fantastical ones that Noah had seen so far!","<The Sixth Boundary Layer of Entropy>:: Termed the Spontaneous Entropic Planar Combustion, this Planar Domain allows you to draw in and compress all Sources of Chaos in nature nearby before releasing it on a specified area in an even more disordered state, such a domain requiring 50% of your Current Aeonic Soul Values to cast. A single cast of this domain will give rise to for all nearby surroundings to enter a state of even greater disorder. Initiate chaos, control chaos, and thrive under the glory of chaos...","Short.","Simple.","But what exactly did it mean?","Noah wanted to find out fully as the moment he closed his fist, it was like all light was extinguished as it surged into his hand.","And when he unfurled his fist...","...!","BOOOM!"]},{"number":2333,"title":"Chapter 2333: Chapter 2332 Chaos V","paragraphs":["The scene was an ecstatic one to observe.","The visage of Noah closed his fist as an instant later, it seemed like all light was devoured into it.","<Spontaneous Entropic Planar Combustion> was called upon as every trace of sources of chaos nearby disappeared, with others feeling a sense of awe while one creature in particular felt immense dread!","It was the Arachnoid Prion Queen as her many eyes were barely able to gaze over when she saw the fist unfurl.","The fist that devoured all light and was pulsing as if it held all of reality in it!","'Nearby'.","This was the word utilized in the description of the 6th Boundary Layer of Entropy in how vast the area was covered when all Sources of Chaos were drawn in, but everywhere from the outer periphery and the rising ravines of stellar mountains in the distance seemed to turn dark as every single tendril of RUIN and NULLITY were devoured along with multiple other sources of essence.","And then all of this was released the moment Noah's fist unfurled as the designated location...was the body of the Arachnoid Prion Queen!","...!","Ruin coursed over its many eyes as its soul was barely ready to scream out when...everything exploded.","BOOOOM!","As if its body was the center of an Apocalyptic singularity, a force exploded that utterly shredded its Aspects of Existence and caused the activation of the Ninth Boundary Layer of Loot right away!","But this was not all.","With this explosion at the center, effects propagated outwards as horrific shockwaves emanated out, the stellar black earth being scathed and fractured as in the skies...even thicker tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY began to rain down and surge.","Chaos.","The moment that the <Spontaneous Entropic Planar Combustion> was utilized, all nearby chaos would be drawn in and released as thereafter, the affected region would delve into an even greater chaos.","And the more chaos there was...the stronger Noah was!","BZZZT!","Crimson silver thunder and lightning began to roil and wash down from the skies as it even reached the outermost periphery where the vast majority of the armies of the Quasarians, Noblesse, and Ancestral Lernaeans were- chaos unfolding in a stellar fashion as beings moved to protect themselves.","Noah watched all this as his figure floated in the skies above catered mountains and fissured stellar black earth, seeing the radiant golden waves of light from the defeated Arachnoid Prion Queen being devoured by his body as even more prompts came down.","<The Source of 2x Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity have been absorbed into your body.>","<The Source of a Complete Aeonic Nullity Pearl has been absorbed into your body.>","<The Source of a Complete Aeonic Ruin Pearl has been engrossed into your body.>","<The Source of 125x Obsidian Planar Origin Panaceas have been absorbed into your body.>","His body took everything and transferred to his main body as the ones bringing him the greatest changes right now were the Nullity and Ruin Pearls, as well as the Obsidian Planar Origin Panaceas!","So much so that after devouring an untold billions of years of understanding of these two states of verisimilitude...","<You have crossed the threshold of the Primitivus Stage of Nullity.>","<You have crossed the threshold of the Primitivus Stage of Ruin.>","...!","He instantly crossed towards the Proficere Stage as he knew within the next few minutes, he could also exceed the Terminus Stage of these two concepts and expand them to become Boundaries!","Then, there were the Obsidian Planar Origin Panaceas.","Their use was singular in nature.","<Obsidian Planar Origin Panacea>:: A type of Aeonic Treasure of Extremity that is the accumulation of countless years of Origin Essence that can be used to elevate your Realm. A single one holds the potential essence to bud to a Minor Plane if left in the outside Reality for a billion years...","A fantastical loot, and it was one that held the potential essence of a budding Minor Plane of Existence.","225 of such Loot were devoured by his body as his Origin...","<Your First Plane of Extremity is experiencing a Quintessential advancement.>","His Origin released radiant waves of light as his Dimensional Realities added land and skies in an utterly glorious manner- stretching out endlessly as he felt all other parts of him undergo changes due to it.","His path continued to flow with a fast pace as he knew he would have even more accomplishments soon, the Realm and Foundation he built being expanded even further as Providence affirmed that the First Plane of Extremity...was on its way towards completion.","Providence affirmed this, and many more other things though.","Like the fact that...","HOOONG!","Noah turned his head around to gaze up towards the massive abyss in the skies that others jumped down in to arrive here as he saw a blazing point of light break through the darkness and stop briefly to gaze around...its form being caught by the most powerful beings here as it ignored the forming tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY!","...!","Noah's actions were taking the spotlight as many eyes were on him before, but the eyes of pertinent Boundary Expansion Realm experts were all drawn towards the newly arriving figure and his dreadfully powerful aura at this moment as they knew him too well!","<It can not be...>","An Elder Ancestor swallowed hard as he had merely taken the aftereffects of an attack from this being before.","Too many chaotic things were happening as for him to be here as well...","Amidst the ever increasing chaotic landscape now becoming filled with tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY, one name was uttered out for the arrival of a single being.","<The Mad Reverend Emperor!>","A Nobless Commander explained as his eyes turned somber!","And even from the Lineage he came from, Reverend Emperor Septimius who was the furthest into the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands turned around to stare at him as a gaze of respect shone in his eyes while he called out this being's name.","<Caesar!>","WAA!"]},{"number":2334,"title":"Chapter 2334: Chapter 2333 Chaos VI","paragraphs":["Flashes of red and silver light stretched out across the dark skies!","The Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans scrambled as a steady stream continued to rush out from the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands, those nearby on tall mountain peaks striking out against beings that tried to go further inland.","But at this moment, the eyes and Wills of all powerful beings were momentarily drawn to the mere appearance of an existence.","Of Caesar!","The Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar had appeared as his figure was only seen by others briefly- and it represented an oncoming change in this region that others weren't prepared for!","It was the change of truly powerful existences making their way over- this being a statement that Providence told Noah among many more things.","Amidst the roiling tendrils of chaos, his eyes that were covered by the golden light of Providence continued to obtain information, where one of the biggest things that showed when he gazed at the dazzling figure of the one known as Caesar...","Providence didn't show any weaknesses.","As if this man's entire body was an impenetrable fortress!","It was enough to caution others and give rise to them to step back, but Noah continued to stare towards this new being coldly as Providence also told him that the level of power this being released...it was something he could attain very soon if he continued to devour bountiful Loot.","So he was unphased as he saw this newly arriving being only give a cursory glance to everyone here before coming to land his eyes on his figure floating amidst the tendrils of chaos, but they did not even stay on him for too long as he ignored all others here and shot towards the inner areas that all organisms here were surging towards in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","There seemed to be something deep within the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands that drew him in, with Noah's eyes also lighting up as he saw a few golden pathways laid out before him along with a stellar multicolored one.","As his body underwent drastic changes from the elevation of Consummate Boundaries, achievement of 9th Boundary Layers in multiple Boundaries, and his Aspects of Existence began their transformation due to Obsidian Planar Origin Panaceas...Noah's figure also turned into a glorious amalgamation of flames as he went deeper inland!","Multicolored waves of light and chaos followed him as Ophelia also broke out of her stupor and followed.","<...>","It left behind shocked existences that had experienced new waves of power from him, along with a changed landscape.","It was common for the Planar Domains of truly powerful beings to leave their effects in the outside reality, but when others stared at the extreme alteration of the landscape and the tendrils of NULLITY and RUIN...they placed a label on a new mysterious Entity as their focus very quickly returned to the Aeonic Treasures of Extremity and bypassing the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans here!","—","Above the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity.","Silver gray clouds occupied everything above currently as a silver rain of Nullity cascaded down with glacial coldness, where even amidst all this chaos, even more organisms continued to arrive at this location.","This particular party did not seem hurried as if they knew some secrets about inner workings others didn't, their figures actually being many as they formed into a neat legion that floated towards the billowing light of the Abyss and the Leviathans coming out of it!","Their image was pristine as at the very forefront of this Legion, one could see Lifeforms that seemed entirely identical to humans with some variations on their faces that gave out celestial wonder- minute differences like their eyes being multicolored singularities of light, and their strands of hair and skin releasing a stellar Planar light as if it contained the grandeur of countless planes of existence within them!","This Legion alone that was here....only had auras of existences who had achieved the 8th Boundary Layer and above- their people all beings of utmost quality as those who couldn't make waves and survive in the Abyss weren't even taken.","They stemmed from the Fourth and most powerful Lineage in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","The ones that seemed to stay out of conflict between the Noblesse, Quasarians, and the Ancestral Lernaeans over the years as Consummate Boundaries were a very real reality within their Lineage!","It was...the Lineage of the Planeswalkers.","WAA!","Mysterious and terrifying in nature, their most powerful commands among the Legion going towards the Abyss were actually not at the center of attention as beside them, at least 10 exemplary existences releasing a potent aura of Extremity could be seen as this Legion...even seemed to be escorting them.","...!","An escort!","A Legion of Planeswalkers where the weakest were 8th Boundary Layer Commanders and the strongest were Reverends releasing an air of power rivaling Prince Zagugan or exceeding it, with a few auras being as potent if not more than Reverend Emperor Septimius...and they're actually escorting 10 organisms as the Planeswalkers Commanders had their bearing full of pride, yes, but also respect when they gazed at these beings.","One of the 10 exemplary existences being escorted looked at the entrance of the Abyss below as she smiled, this small movement of hers brightening up this whole region as the rain of Nullity stopped momentarily while the glacial freezing cold around them began to melt.","<I've only investigate d the Extremity Vein from our Haven that is almost impossible to make any achievements in after the passage of so many years since its Initiation...so I'm actually looking forward to what the Initiating Extremity Vein of Dissolution holds!>","...!","Regality and nobility flowed from her as those around her smiled, a dashing man full of power floating beside her as he waved his hands.","<Let's go in. I can already sense others like us approaching as things are bound to get hectic soon.>","Their voices were resonant and full of worries as they seemed to be of organisms that considered themselves to be at the very peak of Existence.","Not because of hubris or arrogance or a wrong sense of displaced pride.","But...they held such a view deeply ingrained in their bones by it being a reality. By it being slowed mere fact!"]},{"number":2335,"title":"Chapter 2335: Chapter 2334 The Concepts You Abandoned! I","paragraphs":["Like moths to a raging stellar flame, a great number of organisms came towards the Abyss as the Initiation of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution began.","Initiation.","A stage that only pulled in those below the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as it was the ringing of the bells for the start of Extremity Sanctification!","As those seeking the extreme tiers of power and a chance to become Apex Aeonic Lifeforms flocked into the region that hid the entrance of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution, the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans delved out of the Abyss and began to spread outwards from the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity.","They were one of the tools of Extremity Sanctification.","And under their actions, they would ensure that only the strongest survived- with the stronger existences getting ever closer towards Extremity!","It was the survival of the fittest.","But as this chaos and wildness bloomed in these regions, others had their sights set elsewhere entirely.","Towards the domains of the Noblesse.","Within a Chaoticus Behemoth Transporter.","<Oppenheimer, you say?>","Eowyn gritted her teeth as she spat these words out, her golden hair swaying beautifully over her shoulders.","After all, this being had nearly granted her True Death when he was ascending to the seat of the True Emperor of Destiny!","Dimensional Ruler Guinevere and others silently mulled over this word and name as all of them floated in a small isolated domain shining with gold that was born from the essence of Providence.","After all, what they talked about here had to be a secret- otherwise, the being they spoke of may just pick up on something from his own concepts!","Henry, who had enacted the golden domain, gazed at all the Vassals of his father who followed him here as he nodded thoughtfully.","<He will be tricky to catch. I've communicated with my Father, he says that Oppenheimer has obtained the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform as only through taking him by surprise do we stand a chance. But...I have a plan.>","WAA!","A devilish smile was et ceterahed on his lips as his eyes saw something else entirely compared to others.","Similar to his father, he had the <Planar Annals of Providence> from the 6th Boundary Layer of Providence as boundless possibilities could be seen by him.","And among all of them...","<The only method that works is actually going to be the full deployment of most of us here. With his means and his control of Destiny, he is extremely slippery. But...I know where he is going, so we can prepare. Let's see, think of him as...a rat.>","...!","Shocking words left his devilishly handsome face as from afar, Kazuhiko and others stared at Henry as if they were looking at another version of Noah!","<Think of him as a rat, and we just have to prepare an inescapable trap that even with the means of the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform and Destiny, he will not be able to escape. Our Boundaries are greater, our Layers are greater, and our Destiny...>","HOONG!","He left the last words unsaid.","Their Destiny.","His destiny against the being who took the True Throne of Destiny before his father!","He was curious about the result!","—","In the Abecedarian Sacrarium.","Bountiful auras of powerful Elder Ancestors or their Aeonic Soul Clones had begun to appear in the last few minutes as this area became of great focus due to the identity of Ophelia and the being she was seen following in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands!","A being who emanated waves of Consummate Boundaries as Ophelia also showed the same phenomenon soon after.","This was of great interest to the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage as among those here, Elder Ancestor Rodwig came with his main body after rethinking things as he left a proxy to guard the Sacrarium of the Sword.","At this moment, he and a few other important Elder Ancestors in charge of prominent Sacrariums cautiously bypassed the barriers of the Abecedarian Sacrarium to head towards the Crimson Sacrarium Antechamber where organisms were normally received, but they changed their route as soon as their Wills moved across the Sacrarium to notice two particularly resonant auras located at the Abecedarian Observatory.","At the lead beside Elder Ancestor Rodwig were the Aeonic Soul Clones of two Reverend Emperors- one known as Reverend Emperor Osaka and Reverend Emperor Light!","Osaka was an exceedingly handsome woman with a golden blindfold over her eyes as she was one of the more prominent Seers in their Lineage, and Light was a Reverend with four 9th Boundary Layer concepts as he was respected and known within the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage, as well as being one of the few organisms who could contact their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","His coming here showed the importance they placed on this matter when events like the Extremity Sanctification had begun with boundless possibilities presenting themselves at the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","<When we begin discussions, there shall be no outbursts or disruptions. And do not speedily offer your opinions unless called upon.>","Resend Emperor Osaka had the golden light of the Boundary of Judgment surging around her blindfolded eyes as she spoke out coldly towards those around her.","It showed the delicacy of this situation as Elder Ancestor Rodwig locked eyes with the other Ancestors while they proceeded forward.","Their steps were light, but they were powerful existences that could cross a whole Plane in a few moments as they very quickly arrived in the Abecedarian Observatory!","The barrier of the Sacrarium could be seen above them as the scene of stellar Rivers and Havens sparkled beneath them, their gazes all going towards a center point of the Abecedarian Observatory that showed a golden platform made of dreamy gold sand which caused many of them to gaze at with alarm!","If they weren't mistaken...this should be the authority of the Decretum of Dreams that belonged to one of the Nine Minor Planes of Existence in their old home!","Why...was it so easily displayed here at this moment, and why did it emanate the aura of a Boundary?!"]},{"number":2336,"title":"Chapter 2336: Chapter 2335 The Concepts You Abandoned! II","paragraphs":["Why was the abundant authority of Dreams so easily displayed here at this moment, and why did it emanate the aura of a Boundary?!","This question should've taken their focus and thoughts, but even this had to be pushed aside momentarily as atop the sandy gold platform of Dreams, they saw a single golden throne rising that one Entity sat atop of, the figure of Ophelia seen to the left of this throne along with the auras of a few other existences they did not know of.","This scene may seem like nothing to others, but to them...they're truly affirming the reality that the one who should have been the Sacrarium Master of the Abecedarian Sacrarium...she was currently standing obediently to the side of another man situated on a throne- a man who dripped of power and regality as he had the same exact devilishly handsome face as the Entity they had just seen rip apart two Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans in the Abyss!","Yet the body he currently held emanated intense waves of Dream Authority that to their immense disbelief- it truly seemed like a potent Boundary.","The over a dozen Elder Ancestors here remembered the words of Reverend Emperor Osaka as they didn't make any outbursts.","They followed the lead of Osaka and Light and floated ever closer, coming to stop a distance away from the beginnings of the dream platform as The True Emperor of Light was the one to speak first.","His figure radiated light and brilliance all around as his beauty as a man lost only to the one they could see on the golden throne, his voice calm and full of grace as he first nodded towards Ophelia before locking his white eyes towards the being on the throne.","<What might be the identity of the one we stand before? I normally like to know who I'm talking to as it makes for a much easier discussion and fewer misunderstandings between us.>","Calmness.","Light.","Power.","These were how his words felt as they had some records of the events after the death of Sacrarium Emperor Vulcan, but this information didn't seem all that trustworthy as they wished to discern the True identity of this being!","But the scene of the authority of Dreams surging as a Boundary before them caused rising skepticism as the being atop the throne didn't keep them in suspense.","<My identity is the same one that I told the last Elder Ancestor that was here. I am the Last True Emperor of the Barren Lands, the True Emperor of Quintessence!>","HUUM!","The moment the word Quintessence was uttered, the surrounding space vibrated as the eyes of Rodwig and others shone with brilliance because they felt the aura of the same Consummate Boundary they had felt in the Abyss!","It proved this being was one and the same, but his words also caused immense silence to descend as it meant too many things!","The Last True Emperor.","The Cataclysm of the Barren Lands.","This information was enough to cause many complications to arise as the True Emperor of Light spoke once more while Reverend Emperor Osaka quietly listened while Judgment swirled around her beautifully.","<You expanded the concept of your Age to a Consummate Boundary...even the First True Emperor was not able to achieve this.>","Light spoke in a matter of fact tone as his eyes released a light of marvel!","He wanted to continue, but he felt the fair hands of Osaka on his right shoulder as he stopped and turned towards her.","Towards one of the more prominent Seers that even he listened to at times- even with his greater power!","Yet her next words caused all the Elder Ancestors here to shift with solemnity.","<You...are angry.>","...!","Her golden blindfold was striking as hairs striped white and black cascaded past her shoulders.","Her words caused Noah to tap on his Throne as he asked with a gaze of coldness.","<Am I now? A man tends to get angry when organisms he has never seen before decree his home to be destroyed along with the lives of everyone he loves, and countless others. All because these beings were too damn feeble to figure out the simple usage of Natural Laws.>","WAA!","The Wills of the Elder Ancestors buzzed.","Solemnity and coldness descended as Clarity was gained!","The situation and the mechanics behind it all were slowly unveiled from these words alone as they felt his stance and attitude from his words!","Yet at the same time, he besmirched their own Lineage as some Elder Ancestors nearly erupted with anger.","Some particular Ancestors like Rodwig...clenched their hands as many pieces of the puzzle began to fall into place!","But they knew the current situation.","They remembered the words of Reverend Emperor Osaka!","So immense silence descended as they relied on the Seer of Judgment to navigate this, even the eyes of the True Emperor of Light only squinting hugely as he did not make any moves!","<...>","Osaka's blindfold shone with stellar radiance as she moved forward.","She broke away from the delegation of Ancestors behind her as her hand rose to stop them from advancing, her feet coming to land on the dreamy gold platform as her blank gaze momentarily went towards Ophelia.","BZZZT!","Her Judgment and Ophelia's Wisdom interacted and buzzed as from Ophelia...Osaka gained nothing but a calm face that held a smile.","She shook her head with a myriad of emotions as she spoke out.","<It seems we were wrong in the path we took before. Even if we are considered Ancestors, we are also beings just like you. Of the same Lineage and Creed. Of the same home. The same home that a great many deal of beings voted to not face the decree of destruction, but the wrong path was taken in the end. What I wish to do now...is ask for you to hold your anger and see if there is a path of reconciliation between us.>","...!","Reconciliation!","A being capable of delicately handling matters was sent forth as her golden blindfold seemed to obscure her vision and also grant her an immense sight at the same time!"]},{"number":2337,"title":"Chapter 2337: Chapter 2336 The Concepts You Abandoned! III","paragraphs":["It took every ounce of their power.","Every single ounce to control themselves and make sure that they did not have any outbursts as Reverend Emperor Osaka commanded.","But some had it much harder than others as Elder Ancestor Rodwig clenched his fists.","He thought of his Son sent as one of the Leaders in charge of overseeing the smoothness of the Cataclysm of the Barren Lands as he connected the dots with his death!","Yet he held it in.","Because the being before them was of the same source as them as he had enacted a Consummate Boundary! His feelings...were superseded by his duty to his bloodline as he didn't utter a word.","He only raised his head to lock his eyes onto the existence that a unique Seer of their Lineage had asked for the calming of his anger as she thought of a pathway of reconciliation.","Obtaining a Consummate Boundary was that important!","And his reply to such a question...","<Reconciliation, huh?> He tapped on the golden throne he sat on as his gaze went from Osaka to the True Emperor of Light, his voice continuing.","<There is but a simple path of reconciliation between me and those who decreed my death not too long ago...the leaders of the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage are weak and ineffective as they make such choices as to destroy their own homes, so I simply need to sit above them to make sure such organisms do not have a say in the future.>","...!","His words seemingly brought all of the spacetime continuum to a halt.","An eerie silence descended as the Elder Ancestors confirmed whether they heard correctly!","And after a nanosecond...HOONG!","Waves of Wills erupted and buzzed with incredulity!","andasnovel.com This being before them...actually dared to say such things?","For him to depose those leading the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage due to the verdict of destruction of the Barren Lands?!","Many Elder Ancestors wanted to erupt with their own words as before they could do this, even more shocking words came down that caused them to question their current reality.","It was five words that actually stemmed from Reverend Emperor Osaka as her blindfold released eye-catching waves of radiance.","<It's not an impossibility.>","...!","BOOOM!","Utterly shocking words reverberated out.","<...>","Words that were very quickly followed with a buzzing rebuttal of Wills from the Elder Ancestors behind, but the True Emperor of Light blazed with a shocking radiance that blinded everyone behind him as he bellowed out!","<Quiet!>","WAA!","Silence descended.","Time slowed as every second seemed infinitely precious.","Light's body shone with power as he stared at Osaka gravely.","He was someone of great standing and power as he oversaw the workings of a Cluster of nearby Sacrariums near the border between their Lineage and the Qusarians.","He was one of the very few that were even granted the authority to contact the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of the Ancestral Lerneans Lineage!","He...wanted to hear exactly where Reverend Emperor Osaka was going with a statement that actually agreed with words of rebellion!","And her words continued to be just as explosive.","<Power is ultimately what decided the path we took in the past. No matter the votes cast, word came from our Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to simply be rid of the Natural Laws if they're going to bind themselves to us again. So long as you can exceed our power and the power of the Ancestral Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, there will be no opposition to electing you the Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor.>","...!","<This...!>","BOOOM!","The mouths of most of the Elder Ancestors were agape.","<Preposterous!>","Many could not control themselves any longer as their voices erupted out.","<Rebellion!>","<Emperor Osaka!>","<Such words have immeasurable consequences!>","Booms and rebuttals bellowed out from all around as once more, the True Emperor of Light released a raging blinding radiance while turning around to lock his gaze onto all the Elder Ancestors here.","<The next person to voice their opinions will be stripped of their positions and lose their seat!>","...!","A terrifying air of power reverberated out as silence descended again.","The cold eyes of the True Emperor of Light filled with radiance locked onto all Elder Ancestors behind him before he turned around and stepped forward.","A single step took him onto the golden platform as he turned to face Reverend Emperor Osaka calmly.","He looked at her eye-catching blindfolded face as he recalled countless instances in the past billions of years where she and other Seers had led them towards victory and treasures.","He had never rejected her words before.","But what she uttered now...","She spoke of things that would not normally ever be talked about!","She spoke of the authority of the Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor!","A personage so far away and so important that even Light dared to not have any designs on such a being.","Only endless respect!","And now...he measured all of this with the nature and weight of a Seer that was more often than not right on most things!","He paused in what move he should make, but in this silence, boisterous laughter erupted out as the True Emperor of Quintessence upon the golden throne seemed to enjoy the unfolding show, his visage rising from the vibrant throne.","Haki began to surge and coagulate around him like a multicolored shawl, the potent aura of the Consummate Boundary of Quintessence erupting out fully and pressing upon everything as he spoke with a diabolical smile.","<Power, power, and more power. I've heard a lot and experienced a lot more with this concept recently. After all, there is only one reason you lot are standing before me right now. Not because you suddenly came to your senses that the Cataclysm of the Barren Lands and killing me and all others within it was wrong, but because I have a Consummate Boundary that you now desire to leech off of. To get that, you would bow your head and seek reconciliation. You're right though...with enough power, I can depose the Kings and Emperors overseeing the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage. But I can do that myself just fine. I truly do not see what there is to gain from a so called reconciliation with the weakest Lineage in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!>","WAA!"]},{"number":2338,"title":"Chapter 2338: Chapter 2337 The Concepts You Abandoned! IV","paragraphs":["<...I truly do not see what there is to gain from a so called reconciliation with the weakest Lineage in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!>","His voice emanated grand Haki and pressure that spread the grandeur of The Consummate Boundary emanating from his very skin!","Against beings that the Dimensional Rulers revered as Ancestors, he spoke with grandness and regality.","Against those who had lived for billions of years, he spoke against them with no terror as the scene was exceedingly quiet!","The task of communicating was left to the Seer.","Reverend Emperor Osaka had her blindfolded gaze on the daunting figure of the standing Noah as even amidst all this, she kept her calm while replying.","<The Vaults of Extremity are unimaginably vast, and our Lineage is very weak. You are part of that Lineage. Part of those stemming from the same Planes of Existence as you even bore the weight of a True Emperor like many others before you. As someone seeking to effect change in our path and leadership, I would only seek for you to share your Quintessence with the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage so that we gain an even greater fighting chance even in our Haven of Dissolution.>","...!","A fighting chance.","Against the mysterious Planeswalkers, the brutal Noblesse, and the steadfast Quasarians...where were they going to be when the unfolding process of Extremity Sanctification truly kicked into high gear?","They needed something like a Consummate Boundary.","They needed this being standing before them!","The scale of time didn't even matter in this as among the many tools their Lineage had, there were the means of the Boundary of Sacrifice born from an Apex Aeonic Lifeform Lernaean that allowed one to sacrifice all the Layers of two identical Boundaries to grasp the Layers of a single one.","It was inefficient, but some organisms utilized it greatly as they advanced two Planar Boundaries to a high Boundary Layer for the sole purpose of sacrificing them for the progression of a single Innate Boundary.","So long as they could gain the authority to the Consummate Boundary of Quintessence this being held...the power of their Reverends would be revolutionized so long as they sacrificed something for it!","So Osaka spoke of their Lineage and their home plane they all stemmed from as even though she uttered these words, Judgment already told her their results.","But she still uttered them because the words to come out of the True Emperor of Quintessence next...","<The only Lineage I am a part of that matters is the Quintessential Kainos Emperor Lineage. And any organisms wishing to even touch my Consummate Boundaries...there is only one pathway in doing so. It can only be those I consider my Vassals!>","BOOM!","...!","A deafening silence cascaded down as the eyes of many Elder Ancestors gazed forward with hidden anger and burning pride.","andasnovel.com Who were they?","Rulers of Sacrariums!","Beings that this True Emperor before them were Ancestors of!","The being himself in question was also someone that should have been their descendent.","Yet he was actually voicing out such incredulous words as they only had to listen?!","Their regal eyes full of power turned towards the True Emperor of Light.","They wanted to be represented. They wanted to let their unwillingness be known!","Light bore all these gazes and Wills as his hand moved to land on the shoulders of Osaka.","And Osaka said no more as if she had done what she needed to do, the potent figure of Light coming into the picture as he stared at Noah and spoke out with calmness.","<If I may ask, how did you arrive at the position of power you currently have in this short period of time? How exactly did you bring the concept of your Age to a Consummate level?>","There were geniuses in the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage that rose to prominence over the years.","Many beings here were also considered geniuses as anyone achieving the 9th Boundary Layer in any concept had great attunement towards Extremity!","But what Noah was doing...was utterly ridiculous as the True Emperor of Light posed such a question.","And the ever increasing pressure of Haki around the True Emperor of Quintessence rumbled as his hand rose up while gazing forward, a burst of cerulean grandeur emanating from him along with his resonant voice.","<It's due to the home you all wanted to destroy, and the same concepts you all abandoned and thought to be restrictions. Had you really seen them for what they were...you would not have been struggling with the Noblesse, Quasarians, and Planeswalkers after billions of years in this Haven!>","WAA!","Glorious essence of Manadynamics erupted out as it screamed of purity and Extremity, the aura of a Consummate Boundary releasing from it wildly as it caused the Elder Ancestors before him to stare in a stupor!","But this was not all!","BZZT!","A fantastical ray of gold erupted as Providence also appeared around his body, the aura of a Consummate Boundary swirling around it with glory.","<The concepts you abandoned...>","Another flash of light bloomed as a mixture of crimson darkness erupted out- Entropy coming into play as Noah seemed like an incarnation of the rulings of reality!","<...were the answers to all your problems. You all were simply too weak to realize it.>","...!","They termed the Natural Laws of Reality the worst types of concepts to be expanded to Boundaries.","They felt restricted by them and anchored the Major Plane of Existence they stemmed from to escape their influence!","Yet now, a being stood before them and told them how wrong they were!","Utter silence descended as the buzzing glow of multiple Consummate Boundaries was the only thing rising and falling in the Abecedarian Observatory.","If they had these for the last Billions of years...would not they be at the same level of Hegemony as the Planeswalkers who were filled with power and secrecy? Would they have exceeded even the Quasarians long ago? Would their great Enemies of Noblesse be a force they wiped out long ago?!","<You can run back to your Sacrariums and let it be known.>","WAA!","The dominating voice of the True Emperor of Quintessence rang out as he chose a different method of Conquest.","The tyrannical light of this Boundary burned from his eyes he continued.","<Let it be known that multiple Consummate Boundaries are at my fingertips, and any who wish to attain even a semblance of understanding of such concepts can come before me and kneel for them.>","...!","BOOM!"]},{"number":2339,"title":"Chapter 2339: Chapter 2338 An Unimaginable Form Of Conquest! I","paragraphs":["There were many different methods of Conquest.","Noah could have chosen to send one or multiple of his clones onto the domains of the Ancestral Lernaeans.","But instead, he flaunted his Consummate Boundaries as he let them know that if any of them wished to even get close to such Concepts...they needed to come before him and kneel!","He wouldn't have to chase them, they would all have to run towards him.","And such shocking words smashed onto the Wills and souls of the powerful Elder Ancestors that were masters of Sacrariums.","Osaka was silent.","The True Emperor of Light had no words.","Who were they? Just what level of prestige in reality did they enjoy in their day-to-day life? For them to bow towards their Descendant- someone who came from their very own lineage years after they were born.. their souls and hearts forged in the light of Extremity over billions of years could not overcome this feeling so easily!","TAP! TAP!","Yet it was at this moment though, that the light steps on the sandy golden platform could be heard as the figure of Ophelia that was situated behind Noah stepped forward and came to kneel before his stature.","The Golden Lights of Wisdom were graciously wrapping around her, and she raised her head while kneeling and taking the right hand of the True Emperor of Quintessence who stared down towards her with utter magnanimity!","And seconds later...","BOOM!","The body of Ophelia erupted first with the grand light of Providence, and soon after the light of Entropy and Manadynamics also made their appearance as the aura of multiple Consummate Boundaries also trickled around her freely!","...!","Actions spoke louder than words.","In her wisdom, Ophelia showed just what the words of the True Emperor of Quintessence meant.","And they bore witness to the shocking scene themselves!","A fight between pride and humility was an interesting one, but in the grand scheme of things... it never lasted long.","Didn't they choose to destroy their very home all for the sake of power? If they could truly get their hands on Consummate Boundaries just by paying homage to this being before them..","WAA","Waves of Providence surged as after Ophelia showed the way, and the silent and blindfolded Osaka was the next one to follow.","Things seemed to be relatively easier for the Seers as the boundaries that they had more often than not steered them towards a better fate- and the Judgment around Osaka was clear as day.","With her being the first one to fall, an Elder Ancestor gritted his teeth as he also fell to his knees, the allure of power before them being too strong!","Consummate!","Something they could never reach!","So even though the being before was their Descendant...they as the Ancestors began to kneel towards him one after another.","Noah watched this scene coldly as Haki continued to regally pulse around him, gazing as over half of the Elder Ancestors her kneeled- the essence of Conquest erupting out with wild tyranny as dazzling singularities of lights began to float out from the bodies of these Elder Ancestors.","These were...a part of their Aeonic Soul.","A core part of them that made their power!","This was the price to be paid as kneeling was merely a formal gesture!","They had to pay fealty and give up a part of their Soul!","And so the portions of souls of beings that had lived for billions of years...all surged towards Noah as he devoured it all completely.","And only after he received the pledge of Fealty did the bodies of those kneeling begin to tremble as from the portion of the soul they gave up, they felt an unbreakable bond form between them and the True Emperor of Quintessence as through this bond...they felt the connection of multiple Consummate Boundaries that they could now access!","With this...","<Haha...Consummate!>","An Elder Ancestor among those kneeling laughed boisterously at this moment as he wanted to initiate the Boundary of Sacrifice right away to attain something he thought to be impossible.","But...he was among those that kneeled.","There were a few other Elder Ancestors that still stood as Elder Ancestor Rodwig was among them...and in the lead of all these organisms was the True Emperor of Light!","His hair shone with radiance as he spoke out cool amidst all this.","<I represent too many things as I cannot make such a choice myself. I will pass the word and let you know.>","...!","He was one of the leading Elder Ancestors as he didn't fall into the allure of power so easily.","Among those by his side, Rodwig clenched his fists as a sword glow blazed from his body!","<I have to ask.>","The Sword glow was contained and sharp as he spoke out amidst all this, Noah's gaze turning towards him as he felt a tinge of Karma.","<Theseus- one of the Commanders sent to assure the Cataclysm of the Barren Lands...you were the one who killed him?>","WAA!","A grand question! Rodwig would not be himself if he didn't at least ask such a question!","And yet the True Emperor of Quintessence replied simply and with coldness.","<Your son came to kill me and destroy my home...the result of all this was his death. If you feel discontent about this, you can also come at me.>","<...>","The buzz of the Sword was low as it hummed.","The face of Elder Ancestor Rodwig darkened and held a mix of emotions as he seemed ready to act, Light who was in front of him getting ready to move to make sure a fight did not break out!","But...","THUNK!","In the mixture of emotions and to the disbelief of many, Rodwig joined the majority that were kneeling as after ascertaining the fate of his son...he actually bowed to his killer!","andasnovel.com Others may not be able to understand it. His own eyes showed a trace of unwillingness, but he did it nonetheless as only he knew why he did this!","Noah gazed at such a scene coldly as his Soul took everything in.","The oh so great Ancestors that others revered kneeled before him all for the sake of power.","It roused his tyrannical will of conquest and simultaneously caused a sense of distaste, Noah gazing at them as his voice echoed out.","<Go back and defend your Sacrariums. Let others know what they need to do in order to touch even a semblance of this power.>","He did not even need to move out himself.","He would have all of them come to him as he carried out an unimaginable method of conquest, telling these organisms to defend their Sacrariums!","After all, similar to the Abecedarian Sacrarium...many of the occupied domains were either a Major Plane, a Cluster of Major Planes of Existence, or Natural Domains of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution like the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity.","And since the Ancestral Lernaeans had multiple domains in the form of planes...it was time for Noah to be planting the seeds of having Planes for his Infinite Plane to devour and assimilate soon!"]},{"number":2340,"title":"Chapter 2340: Chapter 2339 An Unimaginable Form Of Conquest! II","paragraphs":["One of Noah's biggest tools was his Infinite Plane, and it was already undergoing great changes when the Natural Laws that made it were expanded towards Extremity.","Noah benefited from Providence, Entropy, or Manadynamics becoming Consummate and reaching the 9th Boundary Layer, but the Infinite Plane...its benefits were on a whole other level entirely as at this moment, the pervasive aura of Extremity that lorded over everything in the Vaults of Extremity also began to permeate across the Infinite Plane and build in concentration.","It was a slow and gradual process to make sure the inhabitants were crushed under its weight as they slowly adapted, but it was occurring!","As all this happened, Noah would be ready for its expansion as he planted the seeds.","His deadly method of Conquest for the Ancestral Lernaeans.","His son that he had pointed towards the Noblesse!","All that was left...were the domains of Quasarians and Planeswalkers.","<Mmm...>","In the Source of Reality, Noah spoke out thoughtfully while feeling his expanding Origin, Body, and Soul.","He thought of the Planeswalkers that in the abundant memories he had gained, there was still little known about them as the high ranks of Noblesse and Lernaeans had sufficient evidence that these beings...may have not necessarily originated from this Haven.","That they stemmed from another Haven and had support across the crevices that organisms apart from Apex Aeonic Lifeforms couldn't cross!","And when Providence surged around Noah now, it fed him a great deal of information as he knew he would soon mix with these beings...and even those from other Planes as they all seemed to be coming for the secrets within the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","And even though his power may not be enough to overwhelm them right now...things may be drastically different in just a matter of minutes or hours!","<Very well. Let's open up NULLITY and RUIN first, and then the rest will follow...>","His Will rang out gloriously as around his main body, tendrils of crimson and silver lights wrapped around him.","He had exceeded the Primitivus and Proficere Stages with ridiculous speed due to his devouring of the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans.","He was now scaling up the Terminus Stage as the first set of Boundaries for these sources of chaos....were not too far away!","—","Deep within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","In a region that held auroras of stellar obsidian rivers of light, a vibrant Plane of Existence floated within the very center of such natural constructs as it gave off a grand feeling of ancientness.","A countless number of these stellar obsidian rivers of light wrapped around the barrier of this Plane of Existence like surging rings of light that also carried a heavy gravitational force, radiant interstellar vessels stationed all around this area as the potent aura of Boundary Expansion Realm existences could be felt in abundance.","A few light years away from this location, within the foldings of spacetime...the visage of Henry carefully gazed towards the Domain known as the Styx Regality Plane that was filled with Noblesse.","Boundless intricate things were contained within it as Chaoticus Beasts could barely be seen in abundance past the barrier of the Plane being used as mounts, an air of peace and power permeating across this whole region as within its depths, it was protected by Reverend Noblesse!","'Or...it was.'","Henry's eyes were sharp as he saw another interstellar vessel leave the Styx Regality Plane, taking the aura of a potent 9th Boundary Layer existence with it as more and more beings were being pulled towards the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands where his father currently was!","It left the domains of all participating Lineages much more defenseless than normal, which made infiltration all that easier as from the words of Providence...the being he sought had already made his way into this domain of Noblesse!","The Planar Annals of Providence shone brightly before Henry's face as new words filled them at this moment, his figure buzzing with power soon after as he sent mental messages to the Dimensional Rulers, Emperor Penguin, Tiamat, Barbatos...and all others joining in on this mission.","On this hunt!","<The target has entered the domain as the most opportune time ordained by Providence is coming. Aunty Eowyn, you share a Karma of Death with him as we will depend on you for his initial location...>","They're all spread out across different regions near this domain in order to catch a single being.","A being who could escape instantly and disappear right in front of their eyes from what his father had told him.","To actually trap him...was an ordeal that would take the might of many beings!","HOOONG!","At this moment, rapid movements began to occur in the periphery of the Styx Regality Plane as multiple auras blazed powerfully.","It was time.","Henry felt a smile bloom on his face as Destiny and Providence wrapped around his figure and hid him even deeper, his voice spreading out across the established interaction channel at this moment!","<Begin!>","WAA!","The hunt for the True Emperor of Destiny kicked off spectacularly and silently as a tug of war between Destiny and Providence was played!","—","Below the surging Abyss in the Endless Thalassic Caverns of Nullity.","Past the periphery of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands, space and time twisted as Noah found himself gazing at fantastical sights outside of pure fantasy.","The landscapes of mountains were torn down by ever raging tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY- which were waves of chaos that destroyed everything but when Noah neared...they made way for him and even wrapped around him to be engrossed into his Body as he reached the cusp of the Terminus Stage of these concepts!","He was learning the True nature of destruction from them as due to their raging nature, he saw the mountains flattening as the thick tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY transformed into snaking rivers that all surged further inward.","Ophelia's Aeonic Soul Clone stuck to Noah tightly as she squinted her eyes further ahead, both she and Noah sensing the aura of clashing forces as the shadow of a massive Leviathan could be seen near them, a single figure pushing it back as behind it- a grand allure of a particularly potent treasure proliferating outwards.","Ophelia peered across the tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY as she voiced out lightly.","<There's danger and opportunities ahead, but actually even more danger behind us at this moment...>","...!","Her words were true, yet Noah smiled when he heard them.","Providence was already feeding him waves of information as he knew particularly powerful organisms were following the same path past the mountains and Leviathans to delve deeper into these treasured lands.","But he was not as curious about them as he was about the aura of the being he could feel ahead.","The one that had arrived and ignored all others as he delved deeper into these lands with purpose.","It was the Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar who was currently ahead of them, his advancement halted by a particularly powerful Leviathan!"]},{"number":2341,"title":"Chapter 2341: Chapter 2340 Aboriginals! I","paragraphs":["<Elephantine Zoster Hive Queen>","A bellowing Leviathan with four massive elephantine limbs and a trunk that seemed like a terrifying Spear caused the tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY in the surroundings to come crashing down on the figure of the Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar.","Noah and Ophelia came close to see this scene as Noah floated amidst the tendrils of red and silver lights while stroking his chin thoughtfully!","Ophelia saw his contemplative expression as she asked.","<Did you find something?>","<Mmm...> Noah nodded while continuing to sift through the many possible paths laid out by the Planar Annals of Providence.","<There is a path where I may share Karma and fate with this being.>","He voiced out what he was actively learning while experiencing the power of one of the renowned beings in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","Towards a Leviathan who had reached the 9th Boundary Layers of both RUIN and NULLITY...","OOOH!","Caesar seemed like an even greater beast as his skin pulsed with an obsidian stellar light.","As he was quite literally made of quasars, his body constantly changed from its humanoid form and into a circular rotating mass of extreme Gravitation- the essence of the Consummate Boundary of Borealis in the hands of Quasarians erupting from him as he released a concentrated point of gravity and temperature that burned and collapsed everything!","The impenetrable skin of the <Elephantine Zoster Hive Queen> was shredded as crimson gold blood overflowed, and before it could disperse its body into an endless array of foam, a gravitational force wrapped around it tightly as Caesar bellowed out once more.","BZZT!","And the thin lines of gravity instantly lit up with an obsidian light as it seemed like a black sun had formed around the <Elephantine Zoster Hive Queen>, its defenses melting under this light as even while collecting NULLITY and RUIN to protect itself- it wasn't enough!","Its massive body was instantly liquefied as a terrifying amount of Damage Values in the form of extreme temperature and Gravitation crushed it entirely.","<...>","And all that was left behind was a single champion.","He returned to his humanoid form as a stellar glow surrounded him, his gaze turning up from the molten earth he stood on to land on the figure of Noah and Ophelia in the silver red skies.","andasnovel.com It was a gaze without any emotions, and a brief one as Noah had a smile on his face when their eyes locked!","A gaze, and that was it. Caesar then turned around as he was about to continue on the same path that he was on. But...","<Oh my, we've actually come across interesting Aboriginals...>","An authoritative voice filled with unbelievable amounts of power emanated out.","It did not stem from Noah or Ophelia, nor did it stem from the Mad Reverend emperor Caesar.","Behind them both in the Crimson silver skies filled with tendrils of Chaos, waves of essence parted ways to reveal the appearance of a dazzling set of existences.","Their hair was tinged silver and gold, their skin releasing a radiant fair luster while they were adorned in armaments that would put even Epoch relics to shame- their materials crystalline in nature as the Armaments radiated white gold light.","Every single one of them revealed devilish handsomeness and beauty as their bodies released waves of potent Extremity. The weakest among these beings would be the equivalent of a renowned and mighty Commander of the Quasarians or the Noblesse!","They looked aloof and otherworldly, as if nothing could ever cause them fear, as if the very Skies they stood on belonged to them.","And the terrifying wave of consummate boundaries that they gave off seemed to confirm their standing, each of them looking like an unstoppable force that others could only dream of ever touching.","It was 12 beings divided equally into six women and six men as the women looked like Queens of grand dynasties while the men looked like Emperors of dozens of Planes of Existence!","Their eyes carried exceeding power and knowledge that rivaled sages of the distant past, with a single gaze of theirs able to discern the truth of nature.","The one who had spoken was distinguished even within this group as he floated further forward than all the others as while he spoke, the others only watched on calmly.","At Golden Glow surrounded the eyes of this being as his silver and gold hair release a radiant Stellar light","<This is interesting...Destiny is actually telling me that these Aboriginals have the power to stand in our way, and that they will actually be vying for the same opportunities that we came for as well. Are you guys getting the same reading?>","The 11 Regal existence behind him were all covered with a glow of Boundaries powerfully at the 9th Boundary Layer as each of them nodded lightly, with existence like them similar to Noah being capable of discerning fate to an unbelievable degree!","Of the 6 women, one had languid eyes with exceeding calmness that turned towards Noah at this moment.","<Especially so for this pretty boy over here. He seems to have multiple Consummate Boundaries under his belt...an abnormality in this Haven as he doesn't carry the atmosphere of any Haven apart from Dissolution. What shall we do, Titus? We were told not to interfere with the Aboriginals too much. But these ones will very well interfere with our mission.>","...!","From the distance, Noah heard these words as he nearly laughed, not remembering the last time that anyone ever referred to him as a pretty boy.","Providence was measuring the power of these beings as Noah also took the situation seriously, their power being higher than even the Mad Reverend Emperor below them as the reason was the same one that made Noah so powerful.","Multiple Consummate Boundaries at the 9th Boundary Layer!","The one called Titus smiled as the golden glow of Destiny increased around him, a devilish smile creeping on his lips as he spoke with potency and Tyranny.","<Naturally, we have to clear the hindrances in our route before we remorse it in the future.>","...!"]},{"number":2342,"title":"Chapter 2342: Chapter 2341 Aboriginals! II","paragraphs":["<Naturally, we have to clear the obstacles in our path before we regret it in the future.>","...!","A deadly set of words emanated out.","Immense silence descended as it was quickly broken by a resolute voice.","<I have no qualms with you all, nor do I plan on getting in anybody's way. I am only here for a single thing, and I shall be gone as soon as that is attained.>","WAA!","The Mad Reverend Emperor actually spoke reasonably while staring at the cluster of powerful Reverends above him.","<Oh?> His words piqued the interest of Titus as the glow of Destiny became even more pronounced around him.","<What you're here for is likely what we're here for. Otherwise, my destiny wouldn't have reacted. It should be the same Extremity Panaceas...born in the depths of the Initiating Extremity Vein. A treasure that reforges one's existence and grants the Extremity Foundation. The problem is...there aren't too many of them as you and that pretty boy over there- well, Destiny is telling me you will definitely get in the way.>","...!","Extremity Panaceas!","The Eyes of the Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar released a burst of light the moment he heard this as his own Destiny...it went wild at this moment and affirmed to him that this may very well just be what his daughter needed to survive!","If he could obtain it and bring it back in time, she should be cured so long as her very existence can be reforged.","On the other side, Noah touched his face as he wondered if his recent transformations and the addition of Consummate Boundaries made his beauty reach entirely new levels for multiple beings to refer to him as a pretty boy!","Such a distinction was trampling on the dignity of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor as his perceptive eyes locked on to these beings with a sharp gaze!","Meanwhile, on the molten earth below him.","<Extremity Panacea...> Caesar let the words roll out of his tongue as his gaze remained utterly calm.","He could see the smiles of control and confidence on the beings in the distant skies as when he thought about the state of his daughter and what their words were implying...","<I said I have no qualms with you not because you do not seem to be of this Haven, nor because I am afraid of your power. I simply don't wish to have my time wasted on pointless power struggles when the opportunities are so vast.>","BOOM!","Crackles of Boundaries surged around his body as a terrifying air that would even cause peak Reverends to shudder boomed out, his words continuing as his skin turned stellar black as if countless quasars spun on every atom!","<Below the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, I am unrivaled. Let us not make each other enemies for no reason. I will take what I need and leave right after.>","...!","The temperature in the surroundings rose to ridiculous levels.","Massive gravitational forces mixed in and raged out as Caesar stayed true to his distinction!","Against existences who were undoubtedly at the same stage of power as him, he was fearless!","Yet the figures above were unfettered as on their beautiful faces, dazzling smiles of confidence rose while Titus with utmost calmness.","andasnovel.com <Haha, old man...you're unrivaled below the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms? That distinction doesn't belong to you! You will come to realize that there are others far, far above you in strength even before being elevated to Apex Aeonic Lifeforms. As for the conflict between us...I tend to listen to my Destiny. If it tells me that you and that attractive boy will be getting in our way...I have to eliminate that threat and pull it from the roots entirely.>","...!","Transparent forms of Haki began to rise from the fair skin of this terrifying being.","The billowing temperature and rising gravity from Caesar were pushed at bay with the mere appearance of this formless Haki, things seeming ready to explode when a nonchalant voice rang out gloriously at such a juncture!","<There they go calling me a pretty boy again...Ophelia, have I changed drastically in beauty since you met me?> Waves of Quintessence began to burn on his body as radiant multicolored Haki accompanied it with utmost majesty.","Ophelia didn't skip a beat as she smiled, her light brown countenance releasing waves of beauty no less than the women gazing down at them from afar as she nodded slightly.","<Yes, Sacrarium Master. You were already stunning before, but your appearance now makes my heart beat just a tad bit faster.>","WAA!","Noah's brows rose at her words as he nodded with understanding, turning his oppressive gaze towards the being known as Titus and those around him as he spoke out while his aura continued to rise.","< There are always overly prideful beings who think all of reality is beneath their feet. They get their time to shine briefly, they then realize their mistakes and overinflated egos, they regret, and then they die. I...have seen this story play out too many times.>","...!","Glory and power erupted.","But it was held at bay as from the distance, Titus laughed freely!","<Interesting...but this isn't that type of story. Let me introduce myself.>","HOONG!","The surging tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY pervading moving in the surroundings instantly stopped.","Around Titus, a silver gold glow erupted out as everywhere it passed, RUIN and NULLITY were entirely erased as the silver red skies entirely faded, a terrifying Haki spreading out with maddening grandeur as feathery wings of silver and gold erupted from this being's back!","<From the Aeonic Haven of Genesis, I am a Haven Disciple of the Genesis Institute of Extremity- Reverend Emperor Titus.>","WAA!","The Aeonic Haven of Genesis!","There were Seven Aeonic Havens in the Havens of Extremity, and a series of frightening creatures from the Aeonic Haven of Genesis descended onto the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution for no purpose other than the utmost boons of its Initiating Extremity Vein!","They originated from an ancient faction known as the Genesis Institute of Extremity as this group...wasn't the only one.","And the Genesis Institute of Extremity was also not the only faction to send its people over as the Initiation of the Extremity Vein of the Youngest Haven...was something that drew in completely frightening entities with incomprehensible Origins stretched out across spacetime!"]},{"number":2343,"title":"Chapter 2343: Chapter 2342 Catastrophic! I","paragraphs":["A silver gold glow erupted out as everywhere it passed, RUIN and NULLITY were entirely erased as the silver red skies entirely faded!","Feathery wings of silver and gold radiated power from this being's back as he seemed like an untouchable existence- his Lineage and Origin unknown apart from his affiliation with the Genesis Institute of Extremity.","Titus!","<You think of me as some arrogant being who doesn't know the breadth and vastness of reality, and that I've somehow knocked onto something that I shouldn't have on this day. I can definitively tell you that any time I have a target...it is always an enemy that I can erase entirely with its roots entirely ripped out.>","WAA!","His voice was magnanimous.","His tonation was mighty!","He spoke with Absolute confidence as the other Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity floated behind him with eyes that showed they believed every single word!","And Titus shook his head as he seemed to think back on something before he continued.","<Of all the enemies I have faced so far, truly none remain alive to tell the tale.>","...!","A deadly silence descended as his released Haki caused everything to be calm.","The Sources of chaos were pushed away as if they didn't exist, Noah, Ophelia, and Caesar looking at this scene with serious eyes as even amidst all of this- Noah still replied calmly as his body continued to climb up in power.","<Well, there's a first time for everything.>","He didn't have enemies that he wasn't able to kill before, and nobody he had made a target had lived to tell the tale!","The True Emperor of Quintessence told such a being that there was a first time for everything!","And truth be told, Noah knew he was a horrifying enemy for his current self and single Clone here, where even now- Providence was calculating that once he expanded RUIN and NULLITY by utilizing the Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity already devoured by his body, he should be able to stand toe to toe with this being.","Toe to toe.","But there was no guarantee of being capable of granting him True Death!","And the issue became that this being wasn't alone.","There were 11 others that may have been of slightly less power than him, but they were just as deadly!","And it was all of them against him, Ophelia, and this Quasarian Commander who already seemed fed up at this moment.","Noah bid his time even now as his Origin continued to expand powerfully, his Aeonic Values in terms of Vitality, Defense, and Damage continuing to rise along with the strength of his body- with his Soul still continuing the transformation brought about by the Entropic Entity of Extremity.","And Ruin and Nullity were nearly at the end of the Terminus Stages as he absorbed billions of years of understanding from the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans he had defeated, so Noah knew the time wasn't too far away!","He just had to hold on for a few minutes longer and all of these transformations would be complete...and he could then gather exactly how powerful beings from other Havens were.","What their history and concepts were.","What their memories would tell of the vastness of Extremity!","But just as he was curious about what his enemies were hiding, so were they about himself.","<But, I do make it a habit of knowing exactly who my enemies are before erasing them. Let's see, who are you...>","The vibrant hands of Titus flashed as he pulled out a golden mirror that caused both Noah and Caesar to feel a profound sense of oppression, astonishment arriving from their faces as Titus continued with a sly smile!","<Ah yes, it is a instrument forged by an Apex Aeonic Lifeform as nobody under this stage can evade its effects. No offensive or defensive capabilities, but it can shed some transparency on who a being is.>","In less than an instant, a golden light flashed and passed across space to reflect on the figures of Caesar, Noah, and Ophelia!","Their prepared barriers and defense mechanisms acted as if it wasn't an attack as it truly carried no Damage Values- and it was akin to the light of Clarity released by the Eyes of the Apex Aeonic Lifeform that the Noblesse held.","It was too fast- and it truly was something that a different stage of Lifeforms normally utilized!","Titus had a calm expression as a golden light returned to the mirror, and he read on calmly.","<Ophelia, with an Aeonic Soul Age of 19 Billion Years. Quantitative Aeonic Soul Power approximately at the Peak Reverend Stage. A single Consummate Boundary under you as you are accepting other Consummate Boundaries even now...interesting.>","Titus read off the golden mirror freely as Ophelia's eyes released a profound light of Wisdom!","<Caesar, with an Aeonic Soul Age of 53 Billion Years. Quantitative Aeonic Soul Power approximately at the Unequalled Reverend Stage...haha, so at least you weren't lying about your power.>","BZZZT!","The stellar obsidian body of the Mad Reverend Emperor vibrated with power as he seemed ready to let loose and attack imminently, but the voice of Titus freely continued again as this time, his eyes turned sharp.","<The last one is...Osmont, with an Aeonic Soul Age of...what?>","His keen eyes blinked a few times.","The Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity behind him raised their brows and sent their Wills over to look as gazes of astonishment also came upon their faces!","Surprise followed by slightly more earnestness as Titus finished his words.","<Osmont, with an Aeonic Soul Age of less than 100 Years...my oh my, who are you...really?>","andasnovel.com ...!","An Aeonic Soul Age of less than 100 Years!","The horrifying instrument that Titus held was known as an Apex Aeonic Relic as even with its stupendous capabilities, it only gave approximations to a certain level.","It wasn't able to give an exact numerical value, where if someone was within a range of a few hundred years to a thousand, it would say less than 1,000 years.","If someone was below the age of 100, it would also simply say so as a specific number wouldn't be approximated!","So these Haven Disciples from the Genesis Institute of Extremity...didn't know that the True Aeonic Soul of the being they were focusing on currently...was barely a fraction of this 100!"]},{"number":2344,"title":"Chapter 2344: Chapter 2343 Catastrophic! II","paragraphs":["After Titus's glorious transformation, all the others had remained at bay.","But at this moment.","BZZT!","Radiant golden and silver wings blossomed on the 11 other beings as one of the most dazzling women in the silver gold crystalline armament squinted her eyes while reading out what was on the Apex Aeonic Relic.","<Osmont, with an Aeonic Soul Age of less than 100 Years. And Quantitative Aeonic Soul Power...unable to be defined at this moment. Titus, this is likely a genius affiliated with the Aeonic Haven of Penumbra for him to be able to mask even his Quantitative Aeonic Soul Power against the Haven Seeing Mirror. He may be similar to those fostered monsters from the Vicissitude Extremity Grotto with mutated souls for him to be this young...>","WAA!","The Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity gazed towards Noah as if they were seeing an equal for the first time, many assumptions being made by them as Titus didn't lose his smile.","<You may be right, Diona. His Consummate Boundaries are hidden as we can assume he had as many as us, and he must have been bathed in Aeonic Treasures of Extremity within the first few seconds of being born and infused with them for the next decades...haha, we've actually come across one of the Engineered Entities!>","...!","More and more assumptions were made as Noah's sharp eyes took in all of this information and expanded what he already knew.","He gave the enemies the time to freely give him more information while his transformation also finished, where he allowed them to continue making wrongful assumptions about him as much as they wanted!","A genius affiliated with the Aeonic Haven of Penumbra?","Akin to the fostered monsters from the Vicissitude Extremity Grotto?","Engineered Entity?","He was already wrongfully placed into so many destinations when all he was...was someone with Infinite Mana that continued to utterly break the laws of Reality!","<But...even if he is a being engineered since birth to speedily advance towards Extremity, I am turning 900 in a few days as our age discrepancy is not that large. I am curious what such a being will be able to show me as even with all this...my Destiny still thinks that he is not complete.>","WAA!","The silver gold glow around Titus became even more intense.","Those around him shook their heads while sighing and becoming serious, Diona pursing her lips as she radiated multiple Boundaries at the Consummate level.","<We'll have to finish this once we start it, and we also can't allow it to delay our search for the Extremity Panaceas. Those similar to us from other participating Havens are not too far off from our position.>","<Mmm...> Titus nodded as liquid silver and gold began to drip around his body, focusing strictly on Noah as he voiced out with a smile.","<Pretty boy, you ready? I want to see what mysteries the Haven Seeing Mirror couldn't unveil from you. I haven't yet met someone younger than me exhibit power at this level apart from those ridiculous beings from Extremity Lineages...and they have Extremity quite literally coursing in their veins. What will you show me?>","...!","Terrifying waves of Haki and battle intent spread out.","Noah's visage in the skies was unfazed as he spoke lightly towards Ophelia.","<Will you be okay? I'll take on as many of them as possible.>","<Mmm...> Ophelia nodded with a serious gaze as she continued. <My Aeonic Soul Clone shall not perish here today.>","WAA!","Their Aeonic Soul Values rose to unprecedented levels.","The beings before them posed terrifying power as they knew their current selves weren't their match!","But she was Ophelia, the one who deeply understood Wisdom.","And he...was the True Emperor of Quintessence. Battles were his Forte. Battles were where he thrived.","So long as he could overcome his enemies in battle, he would come out many times stronger than before.","Haven Disciples?","The Genesis Institute of Extremity?","Their distinction and standing didn't matter so long as at the end of it all, he triumphed over them and turned them into Loot.","BZZZT!","His newly risen Consummate Boundaries pulsed as they roared out to be released, the many tools under his belt ready to unleash their glory!","His soul...his soul that had undergone so many transformations was entirely different from what any soul should be.","The recent one of the changes brought about through the Entropic Entity of Extremity caused him to feel the Sources of Chaos from afar as even though the Haki and radiance released from Titus had pushed away the raging tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY, his body attracted new tendrils freely as just his existence in this space...increased the disorder and chaos.","Streaks of silver and red emerged from all directions and surged towards Noah as the smile on Titus expanded even more, his body instantly disappearing a moment later!","As for the 11 Haven Disciples behind him, they also turned into points of light that instantly disappeared as their speed was something that only Unequaled Reverend Emperors could even have a chance of releasing!","Unequaled.","Reverends who had no enemies apart from those at the same stage, and those above them who were Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","These were the beings they became entangled with as facing such a situation, a catastrophic amount of cerulean singularities the size of atoms blossomed from Noah to cause his surroundings to turn into a hellish torrential flame storm, tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY reforming as he released area of effect attacks to keep the coming enemies at bay.","Ophelia instantly released her Planar Domain as a golden light covered her body, Words of Wisdom spewing out freely!","While the Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar...","<I have no time for this foolishness!>","BOOM!","His figure bellowed out with utter rage as he was on a race against time, and these beings actually dared to stand in his way!","So what if they were from one of the older Havens?","What if they were on the same stage of power as him?!","He just had to erase them like all those that confronted before him in the past, and he would be ever closer to achieving what he wanted.","So he turned into a shining cluster of terrifying Quasars that seemed akin to trillions of black suns that could each burn weaker Reverends, the gravitational temperature he released being something that nobody could freely even come close to!","With such an surge of power, the eyes of the Mad Reverend Emperor entirely disappeared as when he thought about his dying daughter, he bellowed out fearlessly.","<LET'S GO!>","BOOOM!"]},{"number":2345,"title":"Chapter 2345: Chapter 2344 Catastrophic! III","paragraphs":["Catastrophic eruptions bloomed all around as the figures that had disappeared in the skies reached their targets horrifically quickly.","The visage of Titus shockingly cut through the blue, red, and silver flames of Entropy as his fair hand sparkled with silver and gold radiance while it led the way- untouched!","All the essence seemed to be contained within his very skin as it shone with crystalline grandeur.","<My body is my greatest weapon.>","BOOM!","A devilish smile was ever present on his face as he bypassed all the flames and began to crush the boundless auras and barriers around Noah's body.","His body took on a unique stance amidst his advance as his right hand swung down like a primordial hammer, the very fabric of Reality in the surroundings vibrating as a phantom of a catastrophically titanic hand briefly bloomed in the skies and joined Titus in this single move- that shattered all remaining barriers and ever-rising flames of Entropy around Noah, reaching his body right away!","...!","The light of multiple Consummate Boundaries shone on the fist of Titus as at this moment, the light of Noah's Consummate Boundaries also covered his body as the strike arrived!","...BOOOM!","The impact was dreadful as Noah felt like he was hit by the weight of a dozen Planes of Existence at the same time.","The hardness of his Body and his Foundation wasn't for show as paired up with his ever increasing Aeonic Defense Values, and the fact that he had released waves of attacks and barriers to reduce the terror of this attack...it all culminated into the shocking reality of him being capable of taking the strike of an Unequaled Reverend Emperor without his very skin ripping apart!","BZZZT!","The authority of multiple Consummate Boundaries surged as with this impact, Noah's figure was the one to be blasted down towards the stellar black earth as the strike was simply too heavy!","And at such a juncture, Titus continued to speak.","<With a wave of my hand, Realities collapse.>","His body once more took on a unique stance as if he was following the movement arts lost through the Aeons of Extremity!","<With a single punch, Planes of Existence shatter.>","...!","<This...is power. These...are the Extremity Martial Arts of Genesis.>","BOOM!","His momentum was relentless and utterly dominating as his hands repetitively punched out with shocking grace and power, his voice ringing out along with it!","<Genesis Wing Chun's Third Style>.","His hands formed fists at some points and released palms on other instances, but the result was the conjuration of all the strikes he had made into massive silver gold phantoms of palms and punches that covered all of Noah's vision!","Each one was utterly catastrophic as it was equivalent to a full strike of an Unequaled Reverend Emperor!","Yet even while facing such a horror-inducing sense of power, Noah's expression retained its majesty as his body exploded with concentrated Aeonic Mana of Extremity.","He could conjure any myriad of skills as he wished.","This time, he released thousands of severing rays of light that were composed of spinning singularities of blitzkriegs, tendrils of RUIN and NULLITY wrapping around them in a show of beautiful chaos and destruction as the moment they left his body, thousands more of such rays were released again...and again, and again!","As if...he was a conduit releasing countless and endless rays of severing light.","Each one with the effect of chaining between enemies as with the gradual increase in the authority of his Boundaries, Noah knew he would be capable of replicating the same reality altering effects of his most ridiculous skills on the scale of Extremity.","He could only achieve the chaining effect currently on the scale of Aeonic Soul Damage Values, but more would come in the future as for now...these endless rays of cerulean, crimson, and silver colored singularities were set by Noah to be released from his body endlessly without stopping!","The targeted enemies were selected as from his body, Aeonic Mana of Extremity surged out endlessly.","He targeted all enemies because while Titus threw down the terrifying strike above him, the aura of 5 more Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity surged towards him from the sides!","2 Haven Disciples swung like deadly blades towards Ophelia, and 4 of the Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity surged towards the Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar!","His Severing Rays endlessly barreled towards all of them as against the dominant attack released above...","'Genesis Wing Chun's Third Style, yes?' Noah gazed at the unique method of attacks as his skin bloomed to take on a cerulean hue.","The Arcane Planar Domain of Mana was activated as he glowed with an utter blue radiance, his body instantly taking on the Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity form as he expanded in size and became utterly glorious!","Seeing the cascading phantoms of hands barreling down, he actually reached up towards them and embraced their might as he wanted to absorb the essence of everything contained in this attack and redirect it elsewhere!","BOOOM!","The endless rays of severing light releasing from him became even more resplendent as along with this, the Planar Domains of Quintessence, Loot, Blood, Entropy...and the rest of his Boundaries that had exceeded the 6th Boundary Layer all erupted with fervor and at no cost.","Manadynamics deemed it so!","The explosion of all of these domains paired with the core that Noah had absorbed from the deadly attack of Titus was a trajectory laid out by Providence as the next step was to release it all and focus in towards one area where 2 Haven Disciples were!","If he could take down just a few, taking the rest of them out would be infinitely easier for him!","Yet the moment he took the next step and absorbed all of the damage values from Titus to convert it into chaotic forms of energy that were released towards two Haven Disciples as shown by Providence...","SHAA!","The figure of Titus materialized on this same trajectory as he stood together with the two Haven Disciples, their bodies glowing with bastions of silver gold light as Titus's smile became ever brighter!","<Haha, you're even more interesting....[Genesis Kenpo's First Style-Fortress]!>","...!","The hands of all three Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity moved on the same trajectory as their palms connected in front of their chests, a fantastical silver gold shield of light blooming around each of them as they even resonated to join together and rebuff Noah's oncoming redirected attack, and his eruption of the output of all his instantly released Planar Domains!","<...>","The impact destroyed all sound, raging winds of Extremity being thrown about as when the scene cleared, the forms of all three Haven Disciples were unscathed, Titus included.","Their gazes had only become more serious.","While Titus...seemed to be enjoying himself even more!","He saw the Endless rays of severing light flowing from Noah's stellar sky-blue countenance still as he rushed towards it freely, his body blazing with even greater concentrations of Haki!"]},{"number":2346,"title":"Chapter 2346: Chapter 2345 Unbound! I","paragraphs":["Within a communication channel ingrained in the Aeonic Souls of the Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity.","<Don't be caught off guard. He can absorb attacks to a certain extent and redirect them...you two would have just received something equivalent to my attack in addition to his own just now. Don't slip up!>","The voice of Titus spread to all those present under his group, excluding the other channels of communication of the few other groups of Haven Disciples spread out in different regions of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","His interest in this Entity before him increased more and more as when he tried to peer deeper into him with the Haven Seeing Mirror or even his own Destiny, a lot of the things he would see in others were veiled!","This meant that either this being had a truly powerful Boundary along the same lines as his Boundary of Destiny that had ridiculous masking capabilities, or he had made great accomplishments in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity with a unique soul.","'A Unique Soul...'","Titus smiled when this thought crossed his mind.","As he identified the many oddities around this being, he couldn't help but think in this direction as he recalled stories he had heard of from his teachers.","As he surged towards this being who released dazzling rays of volatile chaotic energies filled with the essence of multiple Consummate Boundaries as if his Aeonic Soul Values weren't being drained constantly because of it, Titus thought of the experiences of his Teachers who had come across beings who had undergone mutations along the pressure of Extremity- beings who then mutated to develop unique traits that distinguished them above others!","More often than not, some had Mutated Souls, while others had Mutated Origins, or Mutated Bodies out of other beings' wildest imagination.","When his teachers came across such beings and overcame them in the past...they were able to obtain the unique traits that made these existences so special!","One of his Teachers that was a step away from Extremity at this very moment had overcome an Entity with a mutated Aspect of Existence in the past that could devour and assimilate everything about their enemy and reproduce it for themselves without fail- and his Teacher had gained this unique mutation for himself after this being was defeated!","From his Teacher's experiences, there were also instances of the appearance of other Mutated Entities who turned all enemies they defeated into Legions of deathly shadows that did their bidding, Entities who were so technologically advanced they could calculate and foresee paths billions of years into the future, Entities who had been existences that reached Extremity trillions of years ago and had faced True Death...and yet they were reborn eons later!","Such Entities existed.","They were unique and powerful as if one wasn't careful, they may even fall to their sheer power.","There were even renowned Mutated Entities who were important personages across the Vaults of Extremity to this day!","'So...who are you?'","WAA!","Which faction was cultivating this Mutated Entity? With his Genesis Institute of Extremity, he didn't have to be wary of too many factions apart from the truly horrific and ancient ones- and those factions wouldn't send their prodigies into an excursion like the Initiation of the Extremity Vein of the Youngest Haven.","Their history was too deep, and they were among the first to scour the Oldest Havens of Extremity and obtain unimaginable boons.","Another indication that made Titus fearless and to count the faction this Osmont belonged to as something either at the same level as his Genesis Institute of Extremity or below...was the level of power this being displayed!","If he was truly from one of those ancient terrifying factions, their means were immeasurable as Titus would long be dead at this moment.","So he made a move.","He wanted to see if he could actually catch a mutated Entity in its infancy as there were many things about it that Titus was inquisitive about!","And at this moment, none were more pressing than the fact that this being endlessly released rays of light that attacked all of them here senselessly, and it didn't look like he was stopping anytime soon.","'Is it actually a Mutated Origin with a ridiculous resource usage? Haha, let's see!'","He became even more excited as he pulled from the Extremity Martial Arts of Genesis to unveil everything this Entity hid!","—","He was at the very center of it all.","Endless rays of severing light constantly unleashed from him as they smashed towards his enemies and were bounced away by silver gold barriers of light, but they instantly chained towards nearby Haven Disciples constantly as it was a never ending bombardment!","It kept the Haven Disciples targeting Ophelia somewhat occupied and allowed her some breathing room as she was much too weak for them, and it even aided the Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar as he raged and turned into trillions of burning Quasars!","Yet even with all this, the strongest being here was undaunted.","Titus continued his relentless advancement as to Noah's surprise, even though he absorbed all the Damage Values from his enemy's attack while in his Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity state, he inexplicably felt nearly 25% of his Aeonic Vitality Values sapped away!","It showed that this was one of the few extremely powerful enemies Noah had faced in recent times as he held means that could also heavily bend reality itself.","Facing such an enemy caused Noah's tyranny and Quintessence to burn brightly as it embraced the challenge, seeking to overcome it and come out even stronger as at this moment...any sense of shackles were released from him.","'Alright...let's get wild.'","WAA!","Such a thought blossomed as countless thoughts crossed Noah's mind, and after he validated them with Providence...he proceeded forward with a plan!","He had a predetermined number of Boundaries he could deem Quintessential as when he did so and simply brought them to the 6th Boundary Layer, they would then be propelled to the 9th Boundary Layer by Quintessence.","He had conserved the last 2 slots of RUIN and NULLITY.","But from taking down the Varicella Emperor Kong and Arachnoid Prion Queen, he gained the Sources of 4 Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity!","It meant 4 chances to bring four concepts to the 9th Boundary Layer.","And as he felt the fading life force even after absorbing the ridiculous Damage Values from Reverend Emperor Titus...","'Bring Prana to the 9th Boundary Layer.'","HOONG!","'Bring Dream to the 9th Boundary Layer.'","...!","The Sources that were already absorbed into his Body sunk into specific parts of his Soul and wrapped around the past Decreta of Prana and Dreams!","And...","BOOOM!","An astonishing amount of life force exploded within him as a verdant gold light shot up like an aurora of grandiosity to the colorful skies!"]},{"number":2347,"title":"Chapter 2347: Chapter 2346 Unbound! II","paragraphs":["An overabundance of life-force raged from his body akin to an erupting volcano!","And within his soul, a dreamy golden light permeated all around as it sought to turn dreams into a very real reality.","Events were still unfolding for Noah's True Sanguine Clone, but in Noah's eyes that reflected an aurora of colors in the depths of the Infinite Plane...time nearly came to a stop as dazzling prompts bloomed before his eyes.","<Your Dimensional Realities quintessentially resonate with the Sources of Prana and Dreams that have been greatly elevated towards Extremity.>","<The 9 Dimensional Realities in the Infinite Plane quintessentially resonate with the Sources of Prana and Dreams that have been greatly elevated towards Extremity.>","<A quintessential expansion of the Infinite Plane is beginning under the basis of Extremity.>","<A quintessential Expansion and Strengthening of your First Plane of Extremity has begun as your Dimensional Realities resonate with the expanded Sources of Decreta!>","<Your First Plane of Extremity is surging towards completion!>","...!","An unexpected change began in both his very own Origin and the Infinite Plane itself.","The Infinite Plane was already steadily advancing towards an entirely new construct due to its Natural Laws that bound it beginning their expansion to Extremity, the vast stretches of reality and Domains within it entirely different now from how they were just a day ago.","Now, the 9 connected Minor Planes within it and their Decreta that defined them...also rose up towards a phenomenal change!","What would happen when the authority of Dreams to make the impossible possible greatly rose to the upper boundaries of Extremity?","What would happen to Prana? Apollyon?!","His First Plane of Extremity was experiencing the greatest change in all this as he felt like his Aspects of Existence were being smelted by celestial fires and constantly reborn into a greater form.","First, it was the Obsidian Planar Origin Panaceas from the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans that propagated the expansion of his Origin along with the Sources of Extremity he continued to anchor onto it.","Now, his expanded Sources of Extremity relating to Decreta kicked this into high gear as everything was rapidly propelled forward!","The matches that lit everything up was the advancement of Prana and Dreams to the 9th Boundary Layers!","The life force that Titus had inexplicably taken was entirely replaced as the blood and amount of life within Noah exploded to become many times what it was before.","His Aspects of Existence and constantly surging essence became even more refined as the authority of Dreams squeezed itself into everything to help him achieve his wildest dreams!","And even here, he wasn't done.","'Bring...Apollyon to the 9th Boundary Layer.'","WAA!","A Dimension that had a profound Source of Chaos.","Since Noah thrived on chaos and became ever stronger through it, he released Apollyon even before Ruin and Nullity were ready as a molten crimson light boomed from his chest and tainted the Endless severing rays with a cataclysmic color!","Boundless strength coursed through him as he knew he exceeded Peak Reverend Emperors.","He wondered how far on the designation of Unequaled Reverend Emperors he had come as when he stared at the confident demeanor of the enemy coming towards him and the fancy moves he made, Noah's tyrannical will blazed as he wanted to establish Quintessence!","With an overabundance of life force coursing through his veins as information on the Boundary Layers Prana, Dreams, and Apollyon flowing into his mind, he spoke out calmly.","<Plane of Dreams>.","...!","<Plane of Prana>.","<Plane of Apollyon>!","HOONG!","It felt like he was pulling out the very Dimensional Realities within his Origin.","As if he was taking their grand power and imposing it on the outside world!","In the silver gold skies that were altered with the dominant Haki released by Titus and the other Haven Disciples, boundless stellar verdant vegetation flowered as trees that would put Yggdrasil to shame erupted out- an ancient forest blooming into existence as thick crystalline green vines sprouted and arched across the skies like snakes seeking to impose their Dominion.","Within this verdant eruption of light, dazzling green Cosmos could also be seen forming as they buzzed with both life and death- these Cosmos carrying a terrifying gravitational force as they carried a terrifying capability that had to be observed with the description of the Plane of Prana to fully appreciate its glory!","<The Sixth Boundary Layer of Prana>:: A Boundary that grants you the authority to call out the Plane of Prana and impose its dominion in the outside reality. As it is a Manifestation of your Prana Dimensional Reality, it comes at no cost to call out as once active, the Plane of Prana constantly releases a light of Aeonic Vitality Regeneration that rejuvenates 85% of your total Aeonic Vitality Values every nanosecond. In addition to this, Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Prana Cosmos manifest from the domain and thunder down towards you and your enemies. When smashing onto your enemies, they deal 2x your Maximum Aeonic Soul Damage Values as they specialize in sapping away the life force of intended targets, while you and your allies will experience a revitalization of 85% of your total Aeonic Vitality Values on every hit...","An astonishing Planar Domain.","It caused for the flourishing of Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Prana Cosmos as if they were verdant suns of life and death, streaming towards the Haven Disciples as they further added to the things they had to defend against while when such a cataclysmic Cosmos smashed onto Ophelia...","<Ahh!>","Her body released even greater bursts of power and vibrancy as immense life force flood-like raged in the surroundings!","Wisdom turned into words and commands that charged towards the 2 Haven Disciples trying to get close to her while also dealing with the many sources of attacks in the surroundings, their expressions currently full of frustration as traces of surprise were beginning to rise.","When the Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Prana Cosmos smashed towards The Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar, his Soul was extremely tuned as it didn't feel a sense of danger from them, allowing the Cosmos to hit him as they broke apart like eggshells on the exterior of trillions of Quasars that made his body, and the injuries he had sustained in the brief nanoseconds this battle began were all erased as he bellowed out while releasing even more terrifying waves of gravity and temperatures!"]},{"number":2348,"title":"Chapter 2348: Chapter 2347 Unbound! III","paragraphs":["Only the effects of the Plane of Prana were displayed so far as this alone caused the pace of the battle to rise up another octave, but this was only a single Plane.","Noah...had called out two others.","On the black earth below his feet, the Plane of Dreams and Plane of Apollyon were displayed at the same time as the earth cracked and splintered to reveal golden sand and Crimson black tendrils of lava seeping out chaotically.","All of the stellar black earth trembled and vibrated as it cracked apart, a plane of Dreams and Apollyon coming to be as it seemed like golden sandy dunes were rising along with crimson black volcanoes shooting out pillars of crimson destruction to the skies!","The scene...was utterly breathtaking as all souls here had to stop briefly to appreciate its wonders.","Ophelia felt as if the back of the being who supported her was immensely vast as when her will observed the pure fantasy playing out, all she saw was the form of an Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity with ever increasing pairs of auroras of cerulean wings behind it, muscular stellar blue limbs and a magnificent body with a face that only showed radiantly shining singularities for eyes!","No nose or mouth were present as this face still carried exceeding stellar beauty, the gorgeous verdant domain above, and the gold and Crimson domains below erupting with him at the center as each one was more beautiful than the last.","From the sandy golden dunes and rising molten mountains of destruction, halcyon and red Cosmos formed and spun out with shocking trajectory as they filled the battlefield similar to the raining Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Prana Cosmos, their radiance and usage just as fantastical as they represented Noah truly going wild on this day!","<The Sixth Boundary Layer of Dreams>:: A Boundary that grants you the authority to call out the Plane of Dreams and impose its dominion in the outside reality. As it is a Manifestation of your Dream Dimensional Reality, it comes at no cost to call out as once active, the Plane of Dreams will radiate a Quintessential Aeonic Dream Authority that augments all of your actions and thoughts towards the smoother alteration of reality, turning what you dream of into a more solid form. Its boons are hard to quantify in a numerical value as greater manipulation of reality with the Quintessential Aeonic Dream Authority must be experienced in order to be understood. In addition to this, Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Dream Cosmos manifest from the domain and thunder down towards you and your enemies. When smashing into your enemies, they obstruct and restrict their ability to alter reality, causing for the activation of their skills, usage of their resources, and other means of reality alterations to fail. When your allies are hit with the Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Dream Cosmos, they will gain a nanosecond multiplier of 1,000% to All Aeonic Parameter Values...","<The Sixth Boundary Layer of Apollyon>::A Boundary that grants you the authority to call out the Plane of Apollyon...it comes at no cost to call out as once active, the Plane of Apollyon increases the Sources of Chaos in the surroundings and enhances their effect. Once enough Sources of Chaos are concentrated in the surroundings, the Plane of Apollyon will begin calling down Aeonic Apocalypses of Extremity as they draw upon possible Unrecorded and Recorded Apocalypses of Extremity in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity to be displayed onto the Reality around you. Through your authority, only those in the surroundings selected as targets will undergo initiated Aeonic Apocalypses of Extremity that are carried out with 3x your Maximum Aeonic Soul Damage Values...","...!","Madness.","This was the advent of what Noah called forth as it was more than just going wild!","The Plane of Prana was drastic enough, but the Plane of Dreams came with its own abstruse uses while the Plane of Apollyon...","BOOOM!","It caused for the eruption and resumption of the tendrils of NULLITY and RUIN that were in the surroundings as they came back with ten times the concentration, the Crimson pillars of Apollyon rising to the skies pulling on the thick tendrils of NULLITY and RUIN as they were all converged towards a single location in the skies.","A location that blazed with deadly entropic chaos of boundless grandeur as a nanosecond after the Sources of Chaos were gathered, a ringing of an extremely ancient bell resounded out.","A bell that caused the raging figure of Titus to gaze up in surprise briefly as Noah...received a fantastical prompt!","<The Recorded Apocalypse of Extremity- Ruin's End, has been initiated.>","...!","CRACK!","From the gathering of the Sources of Chaos, the skies cracked with this area at the very center as from it, deep liquefied waves of crimson Ruin seeped out endlessly as they boasted horrifying Damage Values of an Unequaled Reverend Emperor.","Along with these liquefied waves of Ruin, roars rang out as from the cracked skies, the seas of Ruin joined together and also formed cataclysmic Terrors of the wildest chthonian dreams, these amalgamation rushing out with purpose towards all the Haven Disciples here as it was like an endless sea of Ruin was released on top of them!","All of this...in addition to the Endless severing rays of light that Noah released, in addition to the Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Cosmos that smashed around, and in addition to Noah's multiple other Planes already released and carrying out their own forms of attacks!","It was simply...dreadful.","And it was such concentrated Layers and layers of attacks and power that the eyes of the Haven Disciples...finally turned grim.","They couldn't ignore the attacks freely or block them as freely as they were doing before.","They became overwhelmed in all directions with just too many sources of attacks that they were now being forced to concentrate on defending...otherwise wounds would begin to appear on their flawless bodies as well!","It was an incredible development of events that when Titus looked at all this and the environment that were splitting apart as if Apocalypse had arrived...","<Haha...you're one crazy fucker, Osmont! What the hell is all this!>","WAA!"]},{"number":2349,"title":"Chapter 2349: Chapter 2348 On Another Level! I","paragraphs":["The very layout of reality was changed by him!","The skies rained down verdant Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Prana Cosmos as it looked like a starry field of green forest, while the earth below was tinged crimson and gold as sand dunes and mountains of lava that also constantly spat out terrifying Cosmos could be seen.","In the nexus of the skies, a singularity had caused everything to fracture as a Recorded Apocalypse of Extremity- Ruin's End, erupted out with glee!","All of these drastic changes to reality...were things that even after minutes, hours, or even years passed- their traces would be etched onto this space and remain for billions of years to follow.","For the mark of the being that called them out to stretch across history!","And at the center of it all was an existence taking on the Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity form as he released rays of boundless light.","WAA!","Titus bellowed out with ever luminescent eyes while at the same time, his hands unfurled to release something.","...!","Utterly terrifying words that even caused his allies to be shocked left this being as amalgamations of terrors formed from an endless sea of RUIN crashed towards him, along with severing rays of light and Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Cosmos seeking his end!","Yet his body became covered by a gorgeous and impenetrable silver gold glow as the object he released from his hands...was a radiant stellar feather.","A feather!","Yet its appearance caused a dreadful sense of oppression to appear in this space as this single feather...was not of the same form of life as them.","...!","The feather flashed.","The Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar roared out as an unprecedented feeling of danger descended, something being shattered and unleashed in his soul as a cosmic glow descended unto him.","At the center of it all, Noah's soul clearly felt the utterly dreadful feeling as his stellar eyes of singularities were concentrated with even more disorder and chaos, a trace of anger rising within them at this moment as he actually turned towards another direction entirely!","It was...towards the Aeonic Soul Clone of Ophelia that also seemed to sense something profound at this moment, a light sigh escaping her lips as when Noah turned towards her and locked eyes with her gaze, she spoke out with a tinge of guilt.","'I'm sorry.'","This was the last thought to flash as an instant later, the radiance of the Apex Aeonic Soul Totem erupted.","It erupted and covered everything entirely!","CAAA!","A celestial bird's cry reverberated out that carried sound waves that would normally shatter the souls of even Peak Reverend Emperors, followed by the appearance of corporeal silver gold claws that emanated grandeur far exceeding the 9th Boundary Layer.","These silver gold claws instantly manifested across this whole space as they tore down everything they came across, seeming like starry points of sharp light that tore apart any barrier they came across.","A few appeared near the Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar as he bellowed out while parts of his body were torn apart- his Soul receiving heavy Damage at the same time as immense gravitational waves were erupting from him to keep everything else at bay!","Even fewer streaks of these deadly claws appeared beside the figure of Ophelia as the endless glow of golden Wisdom covering her body...was torn apart as if it didn't exist, the light of the dreadful Apex Aeonic Soul Totem entering her soul and very quickly causing everything to dim.","<...>","Wisdom had told her that her Aeonic Soul Clone would not die here today.","But when it came to a power exceeding it...it wasn't even able to see as in this case, Wisdom turned out to be wrong.","A power outside the boundary of a lifeform like her descended as even though it wasn't the full attack that an Apex Aeonic Lifeform could release, it was an attack that infinitely neared this power as its true terror wasn't in any numerical sense in terms of damage values.","Its true terror was that it contained traces of power from an entirely advanced lifeform!","...!","The attack entirely destroyed the gorgeous countenance of Ophelia as after her defenses were bypassed, her radiant figure was instantly turned into ash as her Aeonic Soul Clone perished.","Destiny could be wrong. Wisdom could be wrong. When it came down to it, extreme Power was the only decider of a path!","A bellow of rage erupted out from the being that all the silver gold claws were actually targeting at the very center of, his countenance shown with dozens of overlapping Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Prana and Dreams Cosmos were ready to unfurl at a moment's notice- even greater authority being pulled upon as the 9th Boundary Layer of Prana and Dreams were activated!","From Noah's body, what seemed like two genuine lights of Minor Planes of Existence flashed to surround him as he withstood an attack that even his Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity form could not entirely negate- an overabundance of life force and dream authority surrounding him he sought to bring existence to his whims and overcome this!","The Recorded Apocalypse of Extremity, Ruin's End, converged towards him. His manifested Planes and now what seemed like palpable and genuine Minor Planes of Existence erupted from his massive body as glorious Quintessence shone from all around, Noah intending to match an unstoppable enemy who showed how different the creatures within the Vaults of Extremity were!"]},{"number":2350,"title":"Chapter 2350: Chapter 2349 On Another Level! II","paragraphs":["In the Abecedarian Sacrarium.","Atop the golden dream platform in the Abecedarian Observatory, the True Emperor of Light had a look of surprise bloom on his face as he turned towards Noah who was seated on the throne to speak.","BZZZT!","His visage was turning towards Noah seated on the throne as he spoke, but his words couldn't continue coming out as immense terror and fear gripped him and many others here in the next second!","It was because in this calm environment, a progression of unbelievable events bloomed for those perceptive.","First was the figure of Ophelia beside the golden throne that Noah sat on having a look of worry appear on her expression an instant before, this look changing into shock a moment later and acceptance as next, her light brown face became extremely pale as she fell to her knees while spitting out blood!","But this wasn't all.","Noah's figure on the golden throne released a bellow as he instantly adopted the Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity form, the Planes of Dream and Prana also being called out around this clone as horrifically, on the space above Ophelia...silver gold claws carrying the authority of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform shot out and cascaded towards her main body!","This...was the power of an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem.","The power of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","It didn't matter whether it was one's Clone or main body- when the soul signature of a being was targeted and deemed for death, it would seek the very source of this being.","The attack from the deeper areas of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands actually crossed an unknown distance to appear in the Abecedarian Sacrarium, Noah stepping between it and Ophelia's main body as he took the last vestiges of the silver gold claws into his Body that was wrapped by dozens of Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Prana and Dream Cosmos!","BOOOM!","The attack was devastating as behind Noah wasn't just Ophelia, but the clones of Adelaide, Anna, and many others who didn't leave with his son towards the Lands of Noblesse.","Noah stepped in front of them to take on the last vestiges of this deadly attack as it was much easier to handle than what his True Sanguine Clone currently faced in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands, the usage of multiple methods wrapping up the horrific damage and sense of oppression that this attack released as Noah contained it all.","WAA!","The skies closed back up as raging waves of Entropy surged, the impact contained- but the effect of what had just occurred was fresh in the minds of all beings!","The True Emperor of Light and the other Elder Ancestors standing before Noah had fallen to their knees due to the sheer pressure of this attack as Light was one of the two Reverends here.","And even he...felt a surge of dread at the attack that came through as he recognized it to be something carrying traces of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","Yet...this True Emperor of Quintessence had actually withstood it? Seeing the glorious cerulean form of the existence that was gradually fading as soon as the deadly attack was dispersed, Light and the other Elder Ancestors couldn't get their minds to wrap around the fact that this being truly was their Descendant.","He instead seemed like one of the Mysterious Entities they only heard of with caution and fear!","Light felt as if his mouth was extremely dry as he tried to open up his mouth and speak again- because the message he had was also something he considered of utmost importance.","Noah's resonant voice boomed out as one could feel the anger within it.","The True Emperor of Light felt his soul tremble as he realized that even when he thought he had overestimated the might of this Last True Emperor of their Barren Lands, he had still been too far off as his voice alone made him feel like he was talking to the respected personages that were entirely different Lifeforms!","Noah ignored the Elder Ancestors as after he looked at Adelaide and the others to confirm they were okay, he bent down to the form of Ophelia that was shivering on the dreamy golden sands as he cradled her into his arms.","She had suffered a heavy injury to her soul with the death of an Aeonic Soul Clone, her radiant light brown skin tinged red at this moment as Noah only felt his anger riding when seeing her in this state!","The type of might to have put her in this state was all the more dreadful as it stemmed from an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem, with her soul and Origin currently being unstable as a surging light spread out from his body and covered her- their figures moving across space to a different location as multiple Panaceas were already flowing from Noah's Expansive Space to heal her- the light of Prana currently being infused fully into her as Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Prana Cosmos were constantly being released from Noah's hands and showering her body.","In his mind, a great deal of computations were being carried out as while his Dream Dimensional Chassis took care of Ophelia, his True Sanguine Clone in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands had the ordeal of surviving the brunt and focused attack released by one of the more deadly enemies he had faced in recent times!","—","Across the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","In a domain far above an azure sky filled with the remnants of shattered Planes of Existence.","The voice was deep and ancient.","A voice filled with power and age as it rang out from a being shrouded by a violet light, his visage hidden as he talked towards another form bathed in a golden radiance not too far away!","The form bathed in a golden radiance held a deep light of fortune as it was the True Emperor of Fortune- the one who had built the Golden Forge and left their History recorded in the vestiges of the Barren Lands.","The voice was calm and filled with a deep sense of laziness as the opposing Apex Aeonic Lifeform who had spoken first let out a snort.","His violet haze shone with even grander radiance as he spoke out while gazing at the expanse of shattered Planes of Existence.","...!","His last words were left unsaid as from the True Emperor of Fortune, a light sigh of disappointment was the only thing that could be heard!"]},{"number":2351,"title":"Chapter 2351: Chapter 2350 On Another Level! III","paragraphs":["2350 On Another Level! III","Within the enacted domains of the Noblesse.","Around the Styx Regality Plane.","<Lock down the surroundings! A thief has broken into the Spirit Hall!>","The booming voice of a Reverend Emperor bellowed out with utmost rage as a VOID spread out madly in the surroundings, the Wills of many Noblesse scouring all space within and nearby the Styx Regality Plane as the Obsidian rivers of stellar light surrounding it made the darkness all the more oppressive!","Finding a hidden Reverend in such a situation was going to be extremely difficult.","'But finding me? It will be impossible for you all.'","Moving across the crevices of space, a vibrant thought rang in the mind of Oppenheimer as he relied on his new vibrant eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform to remain hidden from the scrutiny of the two Reverend Emperors left to defend the Styx Regality Plane and the Spirit Hall within it.","It made getting his portion of Aeonic Soul back unimaginably easy as the only thing was that its removal triggered the mechanisms of the Spirit Hall!","But Oppenheimer had already stepped out of the Styx Regality Plane as crossing the crevices of space, he knew he had all but escaped as he was already thinking of his next moves.","The remnants of the Barren Lands. The possible passage into other Havens...","Many possibilities swirled in his mind when all of a sudden...","DING!","His destiny released a sound of danger as if an attack was descending unto him at his very moment!","His expression changed as he prepared to defend, and it turned even more sour in the next instant as the 'attack' arrived!","From his hidden position in space...a blinding verdant gold light shot from him like a beacon of light that made his presence known to all.","It wasn't an attack. It was a marking! And one that was born from...","'Karma? A Karma of Death? Who the hell-'","BOOM!","<Surround him!> Before his thoughts could continue any further, the Wills of the Noblesse Reverend Emperors locked onto him and surged over as his slow escape plan was shredded to pieces, his eyes shining brightly as they released shocking radiance to fold space and have him leave this region even faster!","He moved in a straight line away from the Styx Regality Plane as an endless sea of the VOID approached him from behind, his figure luminous as the beam of light made him seem like a dazzling firefly in a dark stellar night!","And just as he moved a few light years forward...","BZZT!","He felt space coil and constrict around him as an instant later, an essence at his very core felt a rejection as his advancement was stopped and he was pushed back.","...!","He gazed towards the point of the rejection as unbelievably, a thin golden film of light could be seen extending in front of him and going on to cover the space above and below- this golden film of light even extending and wrapping around the far away Styx Regality Plane as it seemed like a circular barrier that contained everything!","<A Barrier of Destiny. Useless for many other beings, but specifically made for you with all the beings you shared destiny and karma within your Age...O True Emperor of Destiny.>","A powerful but young voice resounded out as Oppenheimer's clouded expression turned towards a corner of the golden barrier nearby where he saw multiple figures materialize.","A devilishly handsome young man he had never seen before.","But the others...","...!","His eyes opened wide with surprise as he saw beings he didn't expect to see ever again in his life.","The visage of the Dimensional Ruler of Avalon, Guinevere.","The forlorn figure of the Dimensional Deceiver, Lilith!","The sharp golden hair of a Dream Dimensional Ruler he remembered during his conquest, Eowyn!","One Dimensional Ruler after another appeared before him in a shocking turn of events, with all of these beings not merely making their appearance as an instant after...they released horrific Planar Domains of the essence of Consummate Boundaries!","Two Reverend Emperors behind him, and the sudden appearance of multiple combatants who seemed even more dreadful as they each released an aura of Consummate Boundaries- their purpose deadly and singular as it only seemed to be coming for his life.","Oppenheimer was more than surprised at such a progression of events as before they occurred, Destiny should have warned him!","Why would it not warn him?","HOONG!","He felt a dazzling sense of danger as even though he had obtained the Eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, he had yet to and couldn't truly make them his as so far, he had only been capable of using their closeness to Extremity to bring Destiny and one other Boundary to the 7th Boundary Layer.","With the might of the Eyes of Clarity, he was able to withstand attacks of Reverends and even hide from them as this situation...it wasn't in line with his destiny!","Just who had masked and messed around with his destiny...","As his body channeled the power of the Eyes of Clarity, they came to land on the visage of the young existence that had spoken.","When Oppenheimer looked closely at this being, his face held features he felt like he had seen before! Features of...","'Impossible...' The moment the thought entered his mind, Oppenheimer likened the image of the young being before him with that of the Entity he had evaded from the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands!","And when their gazes locked, this figure smiled with a knowing look as his voice echoed out.","<You overcame all the distinguished Destined Emperors and Chosen Emperors in your Age...I'm curious if you'll be able to do the same today!>","WAA!","With a burst of grandeur, the son of the True Emperor of Quintessence moved with desolating might against the True Emperor of Destiny!","—","Within the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","As the Son faced his first real challenge, the Father faced yet another arduous trial as his mission at this moment was surging against an assault from an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem!","Something that carried a trace of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","The moment it arched towards him, he felt his Lifeforms draining even with the countless layers of protections he had.","The only reason he kept his life was due to the constant instant regeneration from exploding Quintessential Kainos Aeonic Prana and Dream Cosmos and the benefits of the 9th Boundary Layers of these Boundaries that he had enacted.","Layers that...connected him to the genuine Minor Planes of Existence in his Infinite Plane!","<The 9th Boundary Layer of Dreams>:: The barrier between the Dimensional Realities in your Origin and the Dimensional Realities in the Infinite Plane becomes increasingly thin. At this point in time, you can extract the authority of the Dream Dimensional Reality to manifest in the surrounding area space as Quintessential Aeonic Dream Xystons will materialize and wander around any area of the presented Dimensional Reality to deliver attacks that contain 3x your Aeonic Soul Damage Values as well as the weight of the whole Dream Dimensional Reality. Another authority brought forth is that your Aeonic Vitality Values become fixed and bound to the Dream Dimensional Reality, where only when 90% of the Dimensional Reality is annihilated can your final Aeonic Vitality Value be destroyed. As the Infinite Plane and your own First Plane of Extremity change, the description of this Layer will change and have new features...","...!","Second chapter in the evening today as well ^.^","Adui"]},{"number":2352,"title":"Chapter 2352: Chapter 2351 On Another Level! IV","paragraphs":["2351 On Another Level! IV","The effects of the 9th Boundary Layers of Dreams and Prana were distinctive and glorious in nature!","Similar to the 9th Boundary Layer of Dreams, Prana was just as ecstatic.","<The 9th Boundary Layer of Prana>:: The barrier between the Dimensional Realities in your Origin and the Dimensional Realities in the Infinite Plane becomes increasingly thin. At this point in time, you can draw out the authority of the Prana Dimensional Reality to manifest in the surrounding space as Quintessential Aeonic Prana Xystons will materialize and wander around any area of the manifested Dimensional Reality to regenerate and bestow you an enlarged life force 3x your Aeonic Vitality Values as your Maximum Aeonic Vitality Values are temporarily exceeded while this authority is active. Another authority brought forth is that your Aeonic Vitality Values become fastened and bound...only when 90% of the Prana Dimensional Reality is annihilated can your final Aeonic Vitality Value be destroyed. The cost of utilizing the features of this Boundary Layer are paid for in full by the Infinite Plane...","A glorious addition to Noah's arsenal.","And he didn't have to even pay any resource cost for it!","The Infinite Plane would do so on his behalf as the Resonance between his own Dimensional Realities and the Dimensional Realities within the Infinite Plane was truly becoming thin.","When he bound the Sources of Natural Laws and Decreta, he was granted an authority that stated his main body would not truly face True Death unless the very Sources of these Planes were destroyed!","Now, he could release this authority with his own clones so long as he called out the 6th and 9th Boundary Layers of the past Decreta.","The 6th Boundary Layers allowed for an outward Manifestation in the skies or on the earth around him.","The 9th Boundary Layers allowed for a second Manifestation around his body as currently, miniature circular Planes of Existence roared around him!","Golden stellar sands and verdant streams of light surged all around as Quintessential Aeonic Prana and Dream Xystons flew around madly- opposing the streams of silver gold claws that wished him harm!","With the manifested Dimensional Realities above and below him, as well as their manifestations around him...he wouldn't perish so long as the damage to these domains didn't exceed 90%.","And how could his enemies know about such a fact?","SHIING!","The might of an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem focused on him was utterly dreadful as this wasn't a residual essence similar to what his Dream Dimensional Chassis had faced when protecting Ophelia's main body.","When just 50% of their horrific grandeur reached Noah, they broke through all defenses and pierced through his Aeonic Arcane Mana Entity form!","And even though he could nullify any damage at the 9th Boundary Layer and below, this surpassed it by another level as when Titus and the other Haven Disciples saw this scene, they felt their hearts settle a little.","Titus as the holder of the Apex Aeonic Soul Totem that he released felt everything even more closely as he sensed the Lifeforce of this being before him dwindling rapidly, where even the constant renewal when verdant Cosmos and stellar green spears hit him...the silver gold claws continued to shred everything down as Titus could almost see all of this being's Aspects of Existence annihilated in the next moment!","He smiled at such a scene as his resonant voice rang out.","<You were a tough one to crack, Osmont. Now let's see just what secrets you were hid-...oh come on, don't make me take back my words!>","Titus had begun his words with relative ease as he saw the life-force of this being near its end, but when it did near its end...it stayed there.","It didn't go down any further.","<...>","Titus smacked his lips as he began to frown in seriousness.","There seemed to be a trace of Life force- literally a small minuscule piece that could be taken at any time- and yet it didn't budge as the silver gold claws of the Apex Aeonic Soul Totem passed through his body!","Up until all the streams passed and faded, the cerulean form of this being remained staunchly in place as on its monstrously handsome face, the stellar eyes of singularity stared coldly towards Titus!","BOOM!","A verdant Cosmos and a green Spear of life smashed into his Body as his drained life force all but recovered in the next instant.","The green and gold manifestations of planes around him that were ripped apart somewhat began to radiate grandeur as they healed and reformed.","The Manifestation of the Minor Planes above and below them also radiated even more radiance as their deadly Cosmos began to swing freely again!","It was a shocking scene to come across as Titus became somber at such a development while sighing lightly.","<My guy, that was an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem you know?>","Frustration and seriousness were apparent on his face as what he used was a life protecting measure!","Yet this being just withstood it like this?","Even while he remained nonchalant on the outside, he sent communications to the other Haven Disciples who followed him.","'You all...if we want to see this through, get ready to use your Apex Aeonic Soul Totems soon. Helena, see if you can discern anything on the method we can use to kill this creature. Dionysus, move with me and focus on defending...'","Multiple commands echoed out from him as he didn't simply use up another Apex Aeonic Soul Totem without figuring out how this being survived- with his means being very methodical!","And he had to be this way as when he looked at the enemy he had chosen for himself today...this being stared towards him fearlessly as his singularities for eyes currently radiated wrath.","<Titus of the Genesis Institute of Extremity...>","His voice echoed out as it pulsed with intense Haki of tyranny and Quintessence, yet his tone carried immense disdain for even the name of the faction he called out as if he considered it all beneath him!","The being they only knew as Osmont stared straight towards the distinguished Haven Disciple of the Genesis Institute of Extremity as his voice boomed out while he moved with his cluster of fantastical abilities.","<...I'm gonna fuck you up.>","BOOM!","Essence erupted out with maddened grandiosity as the True Emperor of Quintessence began his counterattack!","Tomorrow's working chapter titles: Are you nuts?! I & II","Adui"]},{"number":2353,"title":"Chapter 2353: Chapter 2352 Are You Nuts?! I","paragraphs":["Chapter 2352 Are You Nuts?! I","'It must be a mutation related to resource usage. This level of unrelenting production is something that even 10 Unequaled Reverend Emperors can't keep up.'","The voice of Titus rang out amongst the communication channel of the Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity, their destinies interlinked as they sought to find the solutions to this enemy together!","Seeing the alterations in existence in the skies above and the earth below, as well as the radiant domains surrounding this being and just the constant and senseless energy usage...Titus could only come to this conclusion.","andasnovel·?om 'Anything on why his life force stopped reducing at the last second? How can we eradicate him completely? There must be an anchor holding him in place...'","Another voice rang out as no answer came!","They only saw the billowing stellar cerulean figure usher out more madness and chaos as Titus squinted his eyes while shaking his head once more.","He uttered one last message in the communications link before his body radiated silver gold light to meet the oncoming enemy.","'And his Damage Value Output seems to be constantly rising. It just jumped markedly again as if diverts attacks again, you all have to be careful. Make sure you don't fall to a nameless Entity in the Haven of Dissolution!'","WAA!","Titus's body took on a unique stance as he strengthened his core and shot out like a silver gold arrow!","The Entity's power had increased sharply.","Why was this?","It was always rising as Noah unlocked and elevated new Boundaries, but right after the release of the Apex Aeonic Soul Totem and its drastic results...something critical had occurred!","Away from this crucial battle.","Outside of the Vaults of Extremity, in the dazzling Planar Palisades of Extremity.","An Infinite Plane floated serenely as it was the size of a grain of sand, its very Source currently undergoing fundamental changes as its Natural Laws and Decreta all drastically changed while being expanded to Extremity.","And at this moment, these changes were even more so applicable to the master of the Infinite Plane as his Origin that received so many different sources of Elevation...could not take it any longer!","It had reached a critical juncture as from the Bound Sources of Extremity to the Obsidian Planar Origin Panaceas and now the Resonance with the elevation of the Concepts of Prana, Dreams, and Apollyon to the 9th Boundary Layers...","It all culminated to a single prompt.","<The First Plane of Extremity is ringing the bells of completion.>","...!","His Origin emanated intense grandeur as when his Will seeped into it...","Oh!","The sight was too illustrious to see as akin to a radiant tower, his 9 Dimensional Realities were stacked on top of each other as they had been expanded to be over ten times what they used to be in the past, their sheer breadth being massive as this wasn't a simple expansion!I think you should take a look at","They underwent expansion, refinement, and strengthening as every surface of these Dimensional Realities exceeded any other Minor Planes of Existence in quality!","Massive Reality Passages that seemed like stellar mountains and pillars of Ascendancy Stanchions stretched across the 9 Dimensional Realities, one of the grander changes being the potent aura of Extremity that this Origin now emanated.","It wasn't just Blood, Loot, and Quintessence that were now bound to his Origin- with all of the Boundaries he had raised to the 9th Boundary Layer having their Sources of Extremity bound to him as this also aided in his rapid elevation!","As he stared at the stellar rotation of the multicolored Cosmos and connections of his First Plane of Extremity, more prompts cascaded down as his whole Origin radiated potent rays of wonder.","Rays that pulsed with the dense aura of Extremity that only the most powerful Reverends would have as it passed through his main body and caused all of his clones to shine with shocking luminosity!","When a change occurred in one Aspect of Existence- it carried over to the other Aspects of Existence as well since all of Noah's was intricately bound by his Soul!","His Aeonic Soul Values continued their exponential rise.","His Body...it constantly shed unseen particles of dust and became ever resplendent as its hardness exceeded the most powerful EPOCH Relics!","Even though his Origin was the one that had accomplished a great change, his Soul and Body experienced Quintessential changes due to it.","<The First Plane of Extremity has been completed!>","<The path forward has been illuminated.>","<The Total Augmentation of the First Plane of Extremity has been expanded to grant a base of +500,000 Aeonic Soul Damage, Defense, and Vitality Values>","<Your Body alone can now withstand and release 500,000 Aeonic Soul Damage Values as the essence of any Planar or Innate Boundaries is nullified by 80% against it.>","...!","500,000 for his Origin, and 500,000 more from his body for a glorious 1 Million in his Base Values!","He had reached a new stage of power Entropy as everything about him jumped a degree higher, the prompts that had arrived showing only the start of the boons as there were more to follow!","<The 9 Dimensional Chassis connected to the First Plane of Extremity undergo a Quintessential advancement.>","<9 Sources of Extremity can now undergo a deeper binding to the First Plane of Extremity as they will cause the budding of the Pillars of Extremity to shoulder your Ascension to an Apex Aeonic Lifeform.>","<You can now begin the formation of the Second Plane of Extremity by choosing the 9 Dimensional Realities as templates to forge 9 Major Planes of Existence, or you can seek different Planar Templates across Extremity to forge as the basis of the Second Plane of Extremity.>","Unprecedented grandeur and brilliance erupted at the depths of his body and spread out to all Aspects of his Existence as the path forward became clear!","Would he take the 9 Dimensions that were Minor Planes of Existence as templates to forge Major Planes of Existence for his Second Plane of Extremity, or would he enact something else entirely based on other wonders in the Planar Palisades of Extremity or the Vaults of Extremity?","Bountiful choices waited for him as every part of him- down to the very atom...bathed in a profound light of power!"]},{"number":2354,"title":"Chapter 2354: Chapter 2353 Are You Nuts?! II","paragraphs":["Chapter 2353 Are You Nuts?! II","As his Main Body experienced the fantastical changes, the clones bound to the 9 Dimensional Realities resonated and advanced even further as the force of Extremity they released reached intense levels!","In a hidden domain within the Abecedarian Sacrarium, the Dream Dimensional Chassis experienced this transformation as well, and uniquely...one more person benefited from this more than any others.","It was the injured Ophelia.","To stabilize her Aeonic Soul that had suffered from the essence of an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem, Noah had infused her with boundless waves of Prana as well as his own Blood which was akin to an Ultimate Panacea, and he then connected even more closely with her through Dual Cultivation as all her injuries were healed in seconds while her power began to rise!","This...was before he completed the First Plane of Extremity.","After its completion, the Dream Dimensional Chassis radiated pristine levels of essence that came from the establishment of something pristine, and the being Noah was connected to at this time felt all her Boundaries churning as they devoured the potent aura of Extremity surging from him- all of Ophelia's Boundaries proceeding ever closer towards Extremity!","This applied even more so to the Boundary of Dreams she had also gained access to learn.","The First Three Boundary Layers of Dreams were achieved by her in mere seconds during this Dual Cultivation with the Dream Dimensional Chassis as in the midst of all this, Ophelia's light brown skin was tinged red as she managed to express her words through the surging brilliance around her.","<Woah, I should get injured more if this is the treatment I'm gonna receive every time...>","The boons brought forth by the First Plane of Extremity were plenty as what Ophelia coincidentally enjoyed now was something that others could as well- the change not only prohibited to Noah as those connected to him would also experience its wonders.","And this wasn't only limited to Dual Cultivation as all people under Noah would stand to benefit, either its true wonders yet to be unveiled!","—","In the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","In the deeper areas, the entire landscape was altered as the skies were tinged green, with the land colored crimson gold as vibrant Cosmos and spears surged around the whole area with deadly force!","Titus and 7 other Haven Disciples were focused around Noah as 4 others surrounded the visage of an injured Caesar.","The Mad Reverend Emperor had actually used his own shocking means to survive the blow of an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem, his body currently returning to a stellar Obsidian humanoid form as crackles of Extremity began to arc across his body.","andasnovel.com <I told you to leave me alone.>","HUUUM!","His voice began to bloom slowly, but it very quickly caused the expressions of the four Haven Disciples around him to become rather drastic.","<I said that all I came for was a single thing and that I had no qualms with you all!>","BOOM!","The skies began to vibrate in a shocking manner as even Titus who was clashing with Noah's ridiculous output of skills was forced to turn around as his eyes showed incredulity!","<I said all this...and you all just wouldn't stop. So...you can all die.>I think you should take a look at","...!","His humanoid quasar form suddenly illuminated with glory as all of a sudden, the immense authority of all of his Boundaries was brought forth as a radiant curved line suddenly came into existence on his stellar obsidian body.","A curved line blaring with multicolored radiance as it was...akin to a pulsing blood vessel that radiated Extremity!","<That...you, you can't be serious!>","The Haven Disciples saw this scene as their gazes became those of incredulity, because they knew very well what the manifestation of this multicolored vessel radiating waves of Extremity meant!","And after the appearance of one, The Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar bellowed out as a second and a third one appeared- his stellar obsidian quasarian form gaining three multicolored curved lines on his body as the power he gave off...neared the line of something all beings here were all too familiar with.","Titus saw this scene as his expression became grave, and he actually roared with a trace of anger and disbelief as he never expected a being to do this!","<Are you nuts?! The moment you begin your advancement towards becoming an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, you cannot touch any lifeform of lower levels!>","WAA!","Yes!","They knew all too well what this being was doing!","Those at the Unequaled Reverend Emperor level who had made enough achievements in the Boundary Expansion Realm and had at least 9 Boundaries at the 9th Boundary Layer could try and bring together all of their accomplishments and finalize their Foundation!","To finalize one's foundation, all of their culminations in the Soul, Origin, and Body had to resonate with their Boundaries to call forth the Aeonic Extremity Meridians.","It was a crucial process that even the most powerful beings took shelter in hidden locations or were guarded by those they trusted as any mistake during this process resulted in the shattering of one's foundation as they forever remained below the Apex Aeonic Lifeform level!","This was the process of Apexification!","The development of one's Aeonic Extremity Meridians to elevate one's existence, eventually taking a chosen Boundary from the 9th Boundary Layer and using this as a basis to define who they were as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform.","The greater the number of Aeonic Extremity Meridians, the more powerful one would be when they became an Apex Aeonic Lifeform. This was why Titus and other existences from multiple Factions across a few selected Havens...had sent their people to the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution to attain Extremity Panaceas from the Initiating Extremity Vein of Dissolution and establish an Extremity Foundation- a Foundation that granted one the chance to form a much greater number of Meridians and guaranteed their advancement to become Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","Yet at this moment, they saw a being recklessly begin the process of Apexification as while Aeonic Extremity Meridians continued to form magnificently on his body, his shining countenance that was gaining an entirely different power roared and rushed towards the nearest Haven Disciples.","<I can't make a move?! Let's see who will fucking stop me from killing you all today!>","HOONG!","With newfound dominance, the Mad Reverend Emperor made a move beyond anyone's calculations!"]},{"number":2355,"title":"Chapter 2355: Chapter 2354 The Mad Reverend Emperor! I","paragraphs":["Chapter 2354 The Mad Reverend Emperor! I","Apexification!","Titus felt like he was going mad when he saw such a scene as even amidst all this, he could still understand it somewhat.","Every existence who became an Unequaled Reverend Emperor and had accumulated over 9 Boundaries at the 9th Boundary Layer had the chance to initiate this process.","The failure rate was quite high as the price was being left behind and never touching the gates of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","So of course, if he and the other Haven Disciples were hunting down an existence and the choice was between death or throwing caution out of the window to try and advance to an Apex Aeonic Lifeform...the answer was clear.","Nobody would simply wait for death.","Titus understood this thought process, but he was still frustrated!","Because the process of Apexification in the middle of battle was also another method of death- with the chances of success being extremely minimal.","But this being did it nonetheless as even if he may not be successful, his initial burst of power may be able to take some of them down with him!","<Don't spare your Apex Aeonic Soul Totems! If he attacks any Lifeforms with the essence of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, he will not have much longer left to live!>","Titus bellowed out while his senses warned him of the terrifying Entity he had targeted arriving before him with a relentless momentum.","The attacks of this being had drastically changed in Damage Values as the many sources of attacks he released may very well break through his defenses if he wasn't careful.","'Ridiculous problems from all around...I better not end regretting this.'","He shook his head at such a development as while keeping an eye on the being who had begun the process of Apexification, he focused on Osmont as at this point in time- he actually had to!","BOOOM!","Immense reverberations bloomed as Six Aeonic Extremity Meridians could not be seen shining gloriously on the body of the Mad Reverend Emperor, his voice booming out as he descended like a cataclysmic singularity on the Haven Disciples that were attacking him- one of these beings pulling out an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem and Initiating it right away.","<You all used an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem on me with no repercussions, do you truly think yourself above everything that when I use essence similar to an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem- something will happen to me?>","...!","Terrifying words erupted from his mouth that caused the Haven Disciples to turn somber.","Yes.","The essence from Apex Aeonic Soul Totems was infinitely close to emulating that of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, but it wasn't all the way there.","andasnovel.com So long as Caesar was undergoing the procedure of Apexification and didn't become a genuine Apex Aeonic Lifeform...could he use his authority that was nearly there to wipe the floor with them?!","<Fucking hell!>","A curse came out from the Haven Disciple Caesar faced as the one who had activated an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem had a dazzling red light bloom from it, a massive Crimson bell forming in front of him as it emanated frightening waves of power and smashed towards the barreling figure of Caesar.","And in such an instance...I think you should take a look at","BOOM!","The billowing cluster of Quasars that was the Mad Reverend Emperor actually collided with the Crimson bell head on as the impact alone was maddening!","<You should've let me be.>","BOOM!","The crimson bell was pushed back as cracks began to appear from it, horrific waves of gravity pressing from all around as even space twisted.","<But some people do not get the message until death comes for them!>","BOOM...CRACK!","With an unrelenting force, The Mad Emperor broke through the force released by an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem as the crimson bell was crushed and folded by the weight of frightening gravity, his figure flashing towards the Haven Disciple that had released this attack as the shock and horror on the face of this being only became inches away from his.","...!","<What Genesis Institute of Extremity?>","BZZT!","His stellar obsidian hands shot out and wrapped around the neck of this profoundly powerful Haven Disciple as the temperature on his body alone caused this being's skin to melt, waves of torrential gravity pressing in from all around as this Unequaled Reverend Emperor began to be compressed as if he were a ball of mud!","<Julius!>","A bellow could be heard from Titus from afar as in the next instant, the being in the clutches of Caesar was squeezed into a small mass of crimson gold made of blood and bones as billions of years of hard work went to waste.","<Ah...>","An unreal reality settled in as unbelievably, a Haven Disciple from the Genesis Institute of Extremity had actually fallen.","Not only had they fallen in the Youngest Haven while seeking the Extremity Panaceas from the Initiating Extremity Vein of Dissolution, they were only in the periphery as they hadn't even neared the Extremity Vein- and yet one had perished!","This reality settled in as the one who had done this was relentless, even though his body pulsed with a tinge of instability as a Ninth Aeonic Extremity Meridian began to materialize on his body.","It was a scenario that further caused the gazes of Haven Disciples to change as the appearance of 9 Aeonic Extremity Meridians meant this being had a truly deep foundation as his success in the procedure of Apexification...was actually high!","Even with such a development, the Haven Disciples had clear thoughts as a bellow from Titus could be heard.","<Just hold him back for now! He can't keep this state any longer as he will have to advance or ruin his Foundation. The moment he becomes a full Apex Aeonic Lifeform, he won't be able to touch us!>","WAA!","Destiny flourished.","The three nearby Haven Disciples close to the Mad Reverend Emperor pulled back with wrathful expressions as they each initiated their Apex Aeonic Soul Totem, one source of frightening energy after another beginning to surge towards Caesar!"]},{"number":2356,"title":"Chapter 2356: Chapter 2355 The Mad Reverend Emperor! II","paragraphs":["Chapter 2355 The Mad Reverend Emperor! II","Waves of attacks from Apex Aeonic Soul Totems surged towards him, yet this being...","<One is not enough!>","BOOM!","He bellowed out with valor as the surrounding reality began to be scorched entirely.","<For your actions to force me to this and jeopardize the life of my daughter, all of you need to die!>","...!","He truly seemed to have gone mad as with indomitable might, 9 vibrant Aeonic Extremity Meridians shone on his body while giving off an austere air of power- his limbs beginning to disappear at this moment as they turned into stellar particles of light.","The process of Apexification was proceeding steadily.","It could not be stopped...unless one wanted to destroy their foundation!","Caesar's body clashed with the might of three Apex Aeonic Soul Totems as he wasn't pushed back, his power scaling upwards evermore as his body disappeared at a faster rate.","Stellar skin, muscles, bones...everything about him that made his old lifeform disappeared as the trillions of Quasars that made his cells all but faded into radiant lights.","Caesar could feel this transformation more than others as he knew his time was running out!","OOOH!","Waves of pressure were released from him as one singular Boundary paved the way forward- this Boundary wrapping around the 9 Aeonic Extremity Meridians as this was the concept he chose to define who he was.","Borealis!","It pushed away anything approaching with a dazzling force of gravity as all three Apex Aeonic Soul Totems and the force they released were shattered.","The Haven Disciples gritted their teeth at this as they prepared to take drastic actions themselves, but in this instant as the rage of the Mad Reverend Emperor was about to continue...","SHIING!","All of the body parts disappeared as in his place, only 9 Aeonic Extremity Meridians remained.","No Origin. No Soul. No Body.","Nothing could be felt outwardly as all of it...was contained in the 9 Aeonic Extremity Meridians that throbbed with potent waves of Extremity at this juncture!","Everything about one's old life would be erased as from the chosen Concept that defined them...they would be reborn into something else.","The Consummate Boundary of Borealis permeated across the 9 Aeonic Extremity Meridians as Titus and the other Haven Disciples sighed in relief- which was a unique sensation for them as they were actually forced to be happy about another being succeeding in their process of Apexification!","The second hardest juncture was during the formation of the Aeonic Extremity Meridians as the hardest juncture was the confinement of the chosen concept inside the Meridians. This being had passed all this seamlessly as at this moment...dazzling waves of light emanated out as the body of the Mad Emperor began to be reformed from the 9 Aeonic Extremity Meridians.","From the concept of Borealis itself!","The aura of life it gave off was entirely different from before as it was that of an entirely different lifeform.","Waves of such a lifeform began to spread out from here and extend outwards powerfully as it was a might that could not be so easily contained!","From the dazzling multicolored Aeonic Extremity Meridians, a brand new body was formed as quadrillions of atoms made of constantly spinning quasars came together to construct a humanoid form of a distinguished existence that held shocking beauty and grace.","Grace of an entirely different Lifeform as the 9 Aeonic Extremity Meridians disappeared in his body while shining brightly!","OOOH!I think you should take a look at","He bellowed out with magnificence as all beings here faced a profound sense of oppression- an oppression deep in one's Soul as they knew this being before them could without a doubt grant them true death!","And this mad being didn't delay as his first actions before he even stabilized his new existence...","<Did you really think I would stop here?! You all do not know what you've made me lose!>","...!","The gazes of others changed, but Titus remained stern and calm as dazzling obsidian rays of light ten times as powerful as any Apex Aeonic Soul Totem erupted from the figure of the Mad Reverend Emperor Caesar.","Nay, not the Mad Reverend Emperor- but the Mad Apex Emperor, Caesar!","The rays of stellar obsidian light he released surged towards every Haven Disciple here as at such a juncture...","BZZZT!","The skies above darkened.","An extremely ancient and undeniable aura of power cascaded from above as it stopped everything in its tracks.","The attacks that Caesar threw out halted in their tracks as his expression became one of utter rage, looking at the dark skies and bellowing out towards them in a shocking manner even though the aura seeping from them...was that of Extremity!","Extremity!","It utterly stopped everything in its tracks as it even wrapped around Noah and the Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity, Titus sighing inwardly as an ancient feminine voice descended from the darkened skies.","<The lives of lesser Lifeforms are not for us to interfere in. You already killed one, so take that as your recompense.>","...!","The voice carried undeniable authority as not even Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could withstand it, but the Mad Apex Emperor remained defiant as he bellowed out while vibrating with even more power!","<I am unwilling!>","BOOM!","A luminous stellar obsidian light shone.","But it didn't matter as from the genuine aura of Extremity in the skies, a just white hand instantly appeared as it came to wrap around the visage of the Mad Apex Emperor.","It wrapped around him without so much as any resistance as the ancient voice continued to resound!","<No Apex Aeonic Lifeforms can participate in the Initiation Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution, and you may not touch the lower Lifeforms here. For your indiscretion...>","HOONG!","The latter words were left unsaid as the just white hand snatched out Caesar's figure as if he were a mere weed, bringing his countenance up above and taking it away as these terrifying auras disappeared entirely!","<...>","Those below had no words as it seemed everything was brought to a halt, Noah also gazing at the skies where a hand had stretched past his materialized Dimensional Reality as if it didn't exist.","In the midst of all of these incredible actions, a small quasar the size of an atom escaped the eyes of all those that remained here as it floated towards him.","His Providence and destiny shone as he caught its path towards him, letting it land on his cerulean skin as this Quasar...carried a mark of the Mad Apex Emperor!"]},{"number":2357,"title":"Chapter 2357: Chapter 2356 Save Her I","paragraphs":["Chapter 2356 Save Her I","A massive white hand came down and plucked the visage of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform like it was nothing!","This hand rose up and disappeared from the skies above as if it never existed, but its significance was too profound as even while stabilizing the concept that defined him- Caesar truly could do nothing against it.","Across the folds of space, time, and reality.","A great deal of distance was traversed in an instant as Caeser felt the restrictions of his body loosened somewhat, the hand holding onto him unclasping as its pressure still bore down unto him!","<It was established long ago that on the path to Extremity, advanced lifeforms will not interfere with those below them. Violating this rule is worthy of death...only if you continue to be defiant. But I do not wish to kill one of the few Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in this Haven when it is already the youngest and weakest, so what will it be, Quasarian?>","thankful. Now, let's get you upto date on what it means to be an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, and what your responsibilities are from here The voice boomed with undeniable authority as one had to only agree to it, otherwise only doom awaited them as the Mad Emperor gritted his teeth while pulling his aura back, working on stabilizing his advancement and clearly taking the Boundary of Borealis to the 10th Layer!","<Good. You killed one lifeform before you fully became an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, and your own life was on the line, so this can be excused with a few years of service. Had I stepped in after you killed others, the tight wound fogeys connected to the Genesis Institute of Extremity would have demanded your death...so be thankful. Now, let's get you upto date on what it means to be an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, and what your responsibilities are from here on out...>","...!","The voice was ancient and regal at the same time as this fair hand was connected to a fantastical being- a being whose body was veiled with layers of Extremity as when one traversed past the hand, they would see a veiled head with two luminous eyes pulsing with grandiosity!","These eyes were currently coldly focused on Caesar, but their gaze also briefly crossed the veils of space and time as they sank down past the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity, delved into the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands, and focused on the cerulean figure surrounded by Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity.","The eyes of an Existence that had reached Extremity gazed at this cerulean existence conjuring manifested Planes around him as just briefly...this existence made a simple comment!","<Interesting...>","...!","---","During this utterly precarious ordeal, a minuscule Quasar carrying the will of a recently advanced existence flowed into Noah as he accepted it into his mind.","In one's mind, countless thoughts could be shared within an instant.","So the time outside was akin to being frozen as within a portion of Noah's mind, a Will communicated with him!","The scene formed was that of a vast cluster of quasars the size of Minor Planes stretching out for an unknown number of light years.","These quasars were unique as they seemed like advanced variations of planes, abundant life ever so present within them as at their very center, stellar obsidian Major Planes of Existence carrying a similar signature could be felt.","Far above this scene, the figure of Noah's soul form could be seen as in front of him, the stellar obsidian visage of none other than the Mad Apex Emperor Caesar gazed down with a face of frustration and anger!","<I have a daughter.>","He began by speaking simply as Noah walked beside this being to stare at the expanse of Minor Planes and Major Planes of the Quasarians showing below him.","He could feel the tug of Providence and Destiny as he continued to listen passively while Caesar continued.","<I have a daughter that I very sick, and what seems like the last hope for her was in this Initiating Extremity Vein of Dissolution...in the Extremity Panaceas that can reforge one's foundation. Because WAA!","of the recent actions, all of that is closed off for me.>","WAA!","His solidified will gave off impressive pressure as it turned around to face Noah at this moment, his eyes filled with power as he continued!","<Now, I do not know you or what you stand for, but you aided me against these vermin and are the only one nearby that Borealis deems trustworthy and powerful enough to acquire Extremity Panaceas. I stand before you not as a Quasarian or the Will of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, I stand before you as a Father who urgently wishes to save his daughter, and it seems I will be restricted in doing so for the near future as I cannot obtain the Extremity Panaceas myself. And even though you are trustworthy as Borealis deems, I understand that no being under the Havens of Extremity is a Saint. So...what will be your price?>","Golden Providence shone within Noah's eyes as he didn't even gaze back to Caesar before he replied.","<Two things. One...is that down there.>","He pointed towards the scene of the cluster of Planes that should have been one of the central domains of the Quasarians as the face of Caesar darkened even though he was expecting it- and this was the reason why the scene below was even shown!","This was the price that his Boundary of Borealis that had stepped into the 10th Boundary Layer told him as he steeled his heart to pay it and waited to see just what the second condition would be!","<The last thing I want...is a bet.>","<A bet?> The Mad Apex Emperor raised his brows while Noah nodded and finally came to lock his eyes with him, a devilish smile blooming on his face.","<Yes, a bet. A wager that within the next year, you and I will have a match. If I win this match...you will have to serve as my Vassal.>","BOOM!","A shocking term was put forth as Caesar's eyes flashed with danger and power!","He looked at another unflinching stare as his eyes squinted while he replied coldly.","<It is a bet...so if I win instead?>","<If you win, I'll give back the group of planes below and even follow you. Isn't it nice? You'd get back everything and more.>","...!"]},{"number":2358,"title":"Chapter 2358: Chapter 2357 Save Her II","paragraphs":["Chapter 2357 Save Her II","<If you win, I'll give back the cluster of planes below and even follow you. Isn't it nice? You'd get back everything and more.>","The devilish smile on Noah's face caused Caesar to be distrustful, and this Mad Apex Emperor thought back to the power Noah showed before as well as his confidence that he would be able to get past the Haven Disciples unscathed to even be able to continue forward towards the Vein of Dissolution.","With all of this and many more things considered, Caesar nodded with consideration as a burst of light shot forth from his Will and floated towards Noah.","<I managed to make the others use their Apex Aeonic Soul Totems to make it easier on you. So just get past them and attain the Extremity Panaceas as soon as possible. Here are the coordinates and authority for you to get into the Plane my daughter is in, as well as what you should be mindful of. Contact this quasarian signature here if you need help and can't get to me...>","The valley of light continued abundant information about Quasarians and secret information that only one of their strongest past Reverends would know!","Caesar gave it all out freely as after one ascended to the Apex Aeonic Lifeform level, the issue of Lineages was a minor one as what mattered the most were interests.","And nothing was of greater interest to the Mad Apex Emperor Caesar than his daughter.","So his fragment of will gazed calmly at the figure of Noah as he vocalized one last time while he began to disappear.","<Please, save her. Save my Xiaomi.>","WAA!","Boundless waves of Providence and Destiny shone serenely in Noah's mind as the fragment of will disappeared.","He silently gazed at the scenes and memories left behind as his mind quickly returned to the scene outside of it.","Towards the Haven Disciples that were sighing with relief after a madman was gone!","But he wouldn't let them have the relief nor satisfaction.","He had to wrap things up as he himself stabilized his Realm and understood the complexities of the completed First Plane of Extremity!","After all, he was the only one forging this path.","He was the pioneer that would expand new horizons and bring to light things others couldn't even imagine!","So these beings that currently stood in his way...","'It is time for you all to disappear.'","...!","He thought this not just because of his own authoritative will, but because at this very moment...","<Your Understanding of Nullity has reached the apex of the Terminus Stage>","<Your Understanding of Ruin has reached the apex of the Terminus Stage>","<You can now control the Sources of Chaos to breed more than just destruction!>","<You have come to a Quintessential understanding regarding nothingness and destruction.>","<You can now control the Sources of Chaos to breed more than just destruction!>","<The Expansion of Nullity and Ruin into Boundaries is now possible.>","...!","BOOM!","His soul ridiculously added yet another conduit of change as a profound understanding of the states of Verisimilitudes flowed in his mind!","And so with dominating momentum, he continued.","<Expand Nullity and Ruin into Boundaries...and deem them Quintessential.>","...!","He wouldn't need to utilize any Sources of Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity for them.","A simple expansion to the 6th Boundary Layer with lesser Pearls of Extremity and a designation of Quintessential would bring them all the way to the 9th Boundary Layer as thereafter, he would have intricate control over two more profound sources of chaos!","Sources that were states of being in the very Havens of Extremity themselves.","He felt that with this, his completion of his First Plane of Extremity, his ever strengthening Body and Soul that was constantly being reinforced by the feature of The Entropic Entity of Extremity...he felt that with all this and more, Unequaled Reverend Emperors should be dominated by his hands!","---","Titus barely caught a break as he sighed at the departure of the Mad Apex Emperor, his heart feeling a trace of respect for the fair white hand that had plucked him away as whether it was in the Haven or the Haven of Genesis, those that had reached Extremity were always being he looked up to!","Because many of his teachers still hadn't reached this state.","Only the most distinguished of beings in the Genesis Institute of Extremity had actually reached the stage of Extremity- and the actual number that they held was unknown even to Titus as it was a tightly guarded secret.","The stage of Extremity seemed ever close after one entered the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeform and enacted the 10th Boundary Layer of a concept that defined them, but it also seemed even further away as if one didn't attain something like the Extremity Foundation, it would be nearly impossible!","'So let's finish things up and proceed with getting the Extremity Panaceas. If the situation becomes too convoluted...I can also just lock my wounds and give up.'","WAA!","He was a straightforward man.","He would do what he wanted and go for the utmost benefits, but if it was turning out to be too much trouble...he would also abandon a path no matter how sweet it seemed!","'So let's finish this up-'","HOOONG!","Just as time resumed after the descent of the genuine aura of Extremity, Titus and the others turned to face their only remaining enemy as apart from the continuous production of abilities still pouring out from him senselessly...massive pillars of crimson and silver roared out from his body as the aura of Ruin and Nullity seeped out- but this time, it was that of immaculate Boundaries that did not at all seem low!","And the supremacy this being released...only exploded to a greater level as Titus looked at this radiant being while cursing out.","<Fucking hell...>","What would he do now? He sought help from his destiny once more as he weighed the pros and cons- on whether he should keep on this path or lick his wounds and go!"]},{"number":2359,"title":"Chapter 2359: Chapter 2358 Utter Trash! I","paragraphs":["In the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","The eruption of pristine power and grandeur of Extremity did not go unnoticed by those close by, with the many powerful individuals arriving from different parts of the Havens of Extremity sensing the shocking reverberations that occurred towards a certain area.","Even though they felt these shocking reverberations, very few beings actually made their way over as they inherently knew that the blaring aura of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform as well as the eruption of a genuine aura of Extremity not too long after...it was not something that they wanted to be up against or involved in!","So the few that did feel these auras...didn't dare to even come!","But there were others more distinguished than them.","There were others...who didn't even fear the aura of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, nor the genuine aura of Extremity!","Such beings were from extremely old and ancient Origins as they could call the Havens of Extremity their very homes.","One such being who was nearby and following her own path felt the reverberations of power as she floated towards it unlike all others...and it was mainly due to nothing other than her curiosity.","This existence has a unique feminine charm as she held a humanoid form with fiery red gold hair snaking past her shoulders, and yet a bright stellar crimson horn rose from her forehead and pointed to the skies as it kept in a shocking cluster of power!","Her countenance was full of calm and curiosity as she pierced across space extremely quickly, her figure appearing a light year away as even though she wasn't hidden in the veils of space, no being below the Supreme Aeonic Entity level would even be able to see she was there!","She was only known as Ayame, and to enter this Aeonic Haven of Dissolution...a member of her Lineage that had grasped Extremity had brought her over.","Her languid eyes full of power and grace looked over as she noticed the unfolding battle from afar, her fair hands covering her lips as even though there were current events playing, her eyes were seeing a different set of events as she saw what occurred seconds before this!","She saw the white hand pulsing with Extremity that came down, she saw the culprit who had called it down, and the beings that were to blame for this all as the Recorded History was easily revealed in her eyes- her manipulation of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity reaching shocking levels!","'I see...'","Her eyes lit up as she understood the whole situation and laughed lightly.","'Little brats from the Institute of Extremity Genesis attacking who they thought to be an aboriginal just because of their own greed...what around him screams aboriginal?'","Her face portrayed exceeding beauty as she followed the current events playing out and focused on the one she found to be called Osmont.","How dumb were these dense martial arts fools to believe they were attacking an aboriginal of the Youngest Haven? Even with her eyes that could peel across Layers of secrets utilizing the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, she couldn't find much about this being as it meant he had reached a similar level of expertise or had an even more profound secret.","'More than that, this isn't even his main body, so what did you even expect to gain if you managed to take him down?'","She only shook her head with more disappointment as she wondered how she came from the same Haven as these brats from the Genesis Institute of Extremity!","And as she gazed at their faces now, she could read their thoughts as clear as day as these Haven Disciples...were beginning to feel fatigue and regret as they saw Osmont erupt with the dense Boundary Essence of the States of Verisimilitudes- Ruin and Nullity!","Even though they were two of the most basic States, only accomplished Reverend Emperors could walk on their path and actually expand them towards high enough layers as this being...","'He already has four...eleven...'","She counted the number of different Essences of Consummate Boundaries she could feel around this being as when she affirmed they far exceeded 10, she became surprised again as a stray thought entered her mind.","'Isn't he at the same level that those prideful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that Grandpa wants me to choose from were at before they underwent Apexification...?'","A single stray thought. One that she shook her head wryly of as she refocused on the current situation.","Her eyes that could easily see the Recorded History of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity analyzed the ongoing battle as she figured out the wall that these Haven Disciples couldn't cross- they had brought down the life force of this Osmont to a minuscule level, but they couldn't entirely erase it as something seemed to be anchoring it down!","'What could it be...'","Ayame tried to put herself in their shoes as she wondered how she would tackle a foe like this, but before she could think any further, a drastic change that even caused her to be genuinely shocked bloomed.","From the rising pillars of Ruin and Nullity that were pervasively surging around this being, the tendrils of the Boundary Essence of Nullity released a brilliant light as they rose to the peak of the skies, but they were followed behind closely by tendrils of a cerulean Boundary essence that Sakura could only liken it to be similar to a variation of the ancient shape of Mana!","If it was just this, Sakura wouldn't be astonished as there were many different sources of Boundary Essences mixing around in this space from this being alone.","The issue was...the silver tendrils of Nullity and the cerulean tendrils of a shape of Mana were beautifully dancing and wrapping around each other as when they reached the highest point in the skies bounded by a verdant Planar Domain...the colors of silver and blue buzzed and mixed on a stupendous level as a heavy, primitive, and utterly wild aura instantly blared out!"]},{"number":2360,"title":"Chapter 2360: Chapter 2359 Utter Trash! II","paragraphs":["A heavy, primitive, and utterly wild aura instantly blared out!","'This...'","Ayame realized what was happening as it was something she had seen before.","Something that she had seen...only the most accomplished Apex Aeonic Lifeforms begin to do.","'The Amalgamation of different Boundary Concepts into one? That's...'","WAA!","Yes!","This was why she was shocked!","She wanted to say it was impossible!","She wanted to say that the action of beginning to fuse different Boundary Concepts was only possible for Boundaries that had reached the 10th Layer!","She wanted to say that only those who had established their Aeonic Extremity Meridians could do this!","She wanted to say a lot of things, but the scene before her defied all of her expectations as even though it seemed unstable and not fully there- the silver and blue Essences truly intermixed as a penetrative and deadly essence that caused even her own Aeonic Soul to tingle from afar tried to come to fruition.","It caused her shock, but for the Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity who were already beginning to feel overwhelmed by the ridiculous output of abilities from multiple Consummate Boundaries of this being...it actually caused a sense of fear to begin sprouting!","And even though it was the beginnings of fear, these beings reacted very quickly- especially the one called Titus as he seemed to have made up his mind, his humanoid form breaking apart as the image of a Celestial silver gold Planar Halcyon Sparrow bloomed!","The other Haven Disciples did the same as this also surprised Ayame, where when she read these beings earlier, she had seen they were about ready to abandon this venture if it was proving too much trouble for them.","The beginnings of the amalgamation of two Boundary Essences hit the nail on the coffin for such a risk as instead of running, they were actually staking it all? Ayame squinted her eyes as her expression turned sour soon after.","She realized why these Haven Disciples did what they did as her perceptive eyes very quickly caught onto waves of communication traversing across space and time- but they were Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as always!","HOONG!","Her eyes erupted with glorious light as her hands reached out, grasping onto these waves of communication as she saw they were intended to spread out to all the groups of Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity currently in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","Their message was simple.","<We have located a Mutated Entity who has inexhaustible resource reserves and can also spark the fusion of Boundary Concepts before reaching the Apex Aeonic Lifeform level! If we can grasp his secrets for ourselves, Extremity will be ever closer to our grasp. The danger level is high so...>","The more she read the message, the angrier Ayame became as she crushed the waves of this communication in her hands and spread out an unseen light that locked down any forms of communication in this region!","'You pick a fight with someone out of greed and when things get dangerous, you seek help? Rubbish.'","...!","Her gaze was piercing as she felt immense distaste for these beings, her crimson horn beginning to release a deadly light!","'If you wish to attain something that can bring you ever closer to Extremity, achieve it with your own hands...or die from overestimating yourselves. What utter fucking trash...'","She felt billowing anger from their actions as Ayame made a move through the very Aenic Annals of Extremity to prevent ongoing and outgoing forms of communication, her eyes coming to focus on a certain being who was moving with a dominating momentum as he seemed to be in an extended state of an epiphany!","—","For Noah, it was akin to a myriad of factors coming together that instantly ushered him into a state of epiphany.","Before he even entered the Havens of Extremity, he had pondered on trying to bring together Mana and Nullity!","He later found out that the only possibility for him to do so was to expand both of these concepts into Boundaries- and only then could he even have a chance of performing such a task.","And when both Ruin and Nullity began to surge across their Boundary Layers, Noah once more felt a familiar pull.","A pull between Mana and Nullity as Noah also felt a slightly weaker pull with Mana and Ruin!","And as if it was a chain reaction, the origin of his Main Body pulsed as an instant later, it felt like all of his Sources of Extremity were pulsing and resonating with Manadynamics.","With the Aeonic Mana of Extremity!","But all the other pulls and resonances didn't currently feel as potent as it was between Mana and Nullity, where Noah knew that if he tried to bring anything together...he would have the greatest chance of success with these two!","He truly didn't know why, but he closed off all his other senses and focused on this as he felt the Manadynamics surge, his Aeonic Mana of Extremity feeling the familiarity of not just a Boundary, but something that had the potential to transform into another concept entirely.","HOONG!","His Aeonic Soul led the way as it wept out with glory, Noah's main body raising his right hand up in the depths of the Infinite Reality as tendrils of Mana and Nullity rose up with it.","And when he did this action, his clones in the Infinite Plane and all other clones also found themselves raising their right hand as tendrils of silver and blue flashed with gorgeous radiance, a burst of information beginning to course through Noah's mind at this moment as he felt like understood things somewhat!","His Aeonic Mana of Extremity that stemmed from Manadynamics was a profound authority connected to Extremity.","It was from a natural law that at its basis...told of how essence was neither created nor destroyed, only changed into different forms!","Then came the state of verisimilitude, Nullity.","Nothingness.","No inherent quality apart from nothingness as this Boundary did not have an identity as pronounced as others!","What could be easier than to pair a Boundary that specialized in changing into different forms with a Boundary that was already formless?","BZZZT!","A spark of inspiration.","A flash of glory!","And then...an explosion of prompts cascaded down!"]},{"number":2361,"title":"Chapter 2361: Chapter 2360 Immovable! I","paragraphs":["It was something that many beings thought differently about as it made up a core part of the power of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","Others thought of it as the Amalgamation of different Threads of Extremity.","Others thought of it as the fusion of Concepts of Extremity.","Extremity itself could be seen as a collection of countless pathways, and those powerful enough could at a certain point in time pull together these pathways to produce even more astonishing paths!","Even more astonishing concepts as the type of essence produced from it...was on another level entirely.","But there were strict requirements in doing so!","Yet before the eyes of the True Emperor of Quintessence...glorious prompts arose.","<You have successfully sparked the convergence of two Boundaries of Extremity.>","<The Aeonic Annals of Extremity have recorded your accomplishments as you gain an even deeper understanding and access!>","These were the first set of prompts as Noah saw the cerulean light of the Aeonic Mana of Extremity and the silvery light of Nullity mixing, a blinding light being birthed from it as it took all of Noah's concentration and the concentration of his clones to simply keep the two energies together!","His Aeonic Soul Values were rapidly being depleted as it felt extremely hard to keep the two Sources of Extremity together, and it wasn't until a set of prompts came that Noah found it easier.","<The Eighth Boundary Layer of Nullity has been achieved.>","<The Ninth Boundary Layer of Nullity has been achieved.>","WAA!","Only when Nullity also reached the 9th Boundary Layer did the Resonance gain a sense of stabilization.","The two concepts were on the same stage as Noah found the effort required to keep them together was greatly reduced, and he could more efficiently mix these Essences as the brand new source of power rising from it began to flourish with even greater majesty!","<The Full Convergence of Manadynamics and Nullity is 1% completed and progressing further.>","<You have discovered a new unnamed form of energy!>","<Through the Convergence of two Boundaries at the 9th Boundary Layer, the Rank 1 Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity has been born!>","...!","An Unnamed form of energy!","When one tried fusing two Boundaries of Extremity together, they opened the pathway to a new form of power that was termed Dynamis of Extremity.","Dynamis!","A word that had many meanings, among which included potentiality, authority, and an immovable force or power!","All beings bringing together different Threads of Extremity would birth new and varying types of Dynamis of Extremity.","New forms of authorities whose power was unknown as the only authority that could withstand it was something similar.","So when Noah bought together the Aeonic Mana of Extremity and intertwined it with Nullity to birth a type of Dynamis of Extremity that he needed to coin the name of, how could his enemies that had yet to grasp this type of power stand against him?!","<Your Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity is in a rudimentary state until you can complete its process of Convergence.>","<The effects of your Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity can only be discovered by utilizing it on yourself or others.>","<Your rate of progression towards Extremity on all Boundaries has been increased by an unknown factor!>","...!","The prompts came down one after another as by this time, Noah's soul found stability from the fearsome power he called out as above all of his bodies that had their hands stretched upwards- they could see a radiant color of blue gray...a color commonly known as lividus!","It shone with blinding metallic cerulean radiance as this lividus color of light hung in the space above Noah's clones like a cataclysmic bomb that could dominate everything to oblivion.","Dynamis.","A type of energy that was immovable!","A type of energy that had the potential to transform into something others could only dream of!","Noah's senses wrapped fully around it as he felt his spent Aeonic Soul begin to recover rapidly, his body beginning to pull in this Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity into his own Aspects of Existence and beginning to circulate it as he felt every single one of his cells down to their very atoms beginning to buzz.","At the same time, he had his True Sanguine Clone in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands make a move as his hand that was raised to the skies...swung down like a verdict towards his enemies!","—","At a junction between a perilous future or running away...Titus chose the former.","This was because the being before him was entirely too special, with everything culminating in him pulling together two Threads of Extremity!","Something that one needed to have Aeonic Extremity Meridians to do as these different paths of Extremity had to at least be at the 10th Boundary Layer.","But this being defied that reality.","And Titus wanted to understand how he did so as even under the threat of losing the lives of Haven Disciples or even himself...he risked it all!","After all, something like this was at the same level as Extremity Panaceas if not greater as it nearing one of the things that Apex Aeonic Lifeforms had to do in order to get close to Extremity!","He comprehended the risks and the possible benefits as he sought for help that should arrive very soon after he sent a message.","He understood it, but...","SAA!","He couldn't help but feel a tinge of rising remorse as he felt the pulsing metallic blue light surge down with a command from this being.","<Use your Apex Aeonic Soul Tot->","...!","He saw this essence that caused his soul to feel a prickling sensation go towards one of the Haven Disciples close to it as this Essence...was too fast!","Even before an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem could be utilized, the metallic blue light arrived before him.","And a scene that caused their scalps to tingle unfolded as this Haven Disciple's Soul felt unmatched danger, his Planar Halcyon Sparrow form releasing over a dozen silver gold strongholds of defensive lights that would take concurrent attacks from over a dozen Unequaled Reverend Emperors to get past!"]},{"number":2362,"title":"Chapter 2362: Chapter 2361 Immovable! II","paragraphs":["Over a dozen silver gold bastions of defensive lights that would take simultaneous strikes from over a dozen Unequaled Reverend Emperors to get past were released.","Yet when the metallic blue essence arrived...these layers of defensive lights didn't even receive an impact as the Boundary Essence that made them...seemingly turned into a hazy state, instantly changing its colors from silver gold to metallic blue as the descending power that was a fusion between two Boundary Essences cleanly cut through- its concentration even increasing the more it moved forward!","Others may not be able to see what the intricacies behind it were, but Titus saw it clear as day as he felt his soul shake.","The metallic blue essence didn't meet any resistance where it went as it instantly changed the nature of the opposing essence that stood before it, transformed it into an essence akin to it, absorbed it, and nullified everything entirely!","When it came across an opposing essence, it entirely altered it and devoured it to become a part of its strengths as it became ever more concentrated and faster.","It meant that the layers of defenses that should have taken even Titus at least ten strikes to get through...were entirely bypassed and shredded in an instant as the metallic blue light smashed into the body of the glorious Haven Disciple!","...!","There was no explosion, blinding light, or a booming impact.","The terrifying light sunk into the body of the Haven Disciple freely as an instant later...all light and life force emanating from this being disappeared.","All the stellar silver gold radiance around this Planar Halcyon Sparrow disappeared as its massive body began tumbling to the ground below- golden dreamy sands reaching out to grasp it as if they were welcoming the corpse to its eternal grave!","And from its body, the terrific metallic blue light emerged with even greater vibrancy and power as it instantly shot towards another direction.","...!","Titus saw this scene as he felt as if his soul was standing on pins and needles, instantly pulling out two Apex Aeonic Soul Totems and activating the first one to release a silver gold light that protectively hugged his body!","<Fuck...fuck, fuck!>","Expletives escaped his mouth as he saw the deadly light that he assumed to be a type of Dynamis of Extremity wildly rush towards another Haven Disciple- everyone here beginning to feel surging waves of danger as their destinies warned them of their possible ends!","Titus looked at the unfolding scenes as he once more felt like he stood at a crossroads of choices.","Choices!","Had he made any right choices today?","Was the choice he was currently on the right one?","'And why the hell haven't I received any replies yet?!'","He screamed inwardly as by now, he should've heard back from other groups of his Genesis Institute of Extremity or even have some of the more powerful beings near this location.","His choice to stay on this path was dependent on them- and this was why he had called for help!","...!","When he had this thought, his soul trembled as he was forced to remember something one of his most prized teachers had told him a hundred years ago.","<Titus, you will come across many trials in your life. Something you need to remember is that in all of them, your life should always lie in the palm of your hands. If you ever find yourself relying more on Totems or the strength of others, you are leaving your life in the hands of Destiny. And destiny...is very, very fickle.>","WAA!","This memory blazed in his mind as he shuddered!","He...he had actually risked his life on the premise of relying on others to come and aid him.","How did he miss this? How did he forget something so critical?!","'Damn.'","Seeing the unfolding situation and putting his life in his own hands...he instantly made another choice.","Among the decisions he made today, this was the single most right one!","BZZT!","His magnificent Planar Halcyon Sparrow form turned around to instantly make a withdrawal and leave the battlefield as he forsaken his goal of obtaining the secrets of this Mysterious Entity right then and there!","Even though he had sacrificed many things to gain nothing, he would not put his life on the line any longer when this Entity revealed too many unknowns.","So he made the right choice, but...","BOOM!","His massive silver gold body was frozen in place as he felt his neck constricted, a voice reaching his ears as it originated much too close to him!","<I told you...that I would fuck you up.>","...!","While they were all focused on the horrifying metallic blue essence and what it was doing, they had lost sight of the man himself as he appeared right in front of Titus's retreating figure, his right hand clamped on his feathery neck as it felt like an Extremity Metalloid had clamped down on his body!","Vibrant metallic blue light covered the skin of this being as he looked like a devilish creature emanating essence from Unrecorded Aeons!","Yes, Titus had made the right choice. He had even made this choice as he chose to retreat first without alerting the Haven Disciples that followed him to this change- all for the sake of buying time for his retreat!","He made the right choice, the only problem was...he made it too late.","The silver gold defensive layer born from an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem around him didn't disappear as this being had forcefully constricted it onto Titus's feathery skin, the metallic blue glow around his hand clashing and shockingly pulverizing the power of this Totem ever so slowly as it actually seemed to win over it!","Titus had one more Apex Aeonic Soul Totem that he crushed at this moment to cause an attack to bloom right in front of the head of this being, silver gold light illuminating him as a boundless cluster of claws unfurled inches before his face.","And all there was...","BZZZT!","Was a scathing clash of Essences as the metallic blue luster on his skin actually kept the essence of Apex Aeonic Soul Totem at bay!","Titus's heart dropped at such a scene as a horrifying outcome neared this startling battle!"]},{"number":2363,"title":"Chapter 2363: Chapter 2362 Immovable! III","paragraphs":["The luster of his skin carried a dazzling lividus color as a metallic blue luster radiated from him- this vibrance actually able to hold back the grandeur of the essence of an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem!","A power that was approaching Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","All of this was due to nothing other than the Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity.","The convergence of Mana and Nullity that created a new essence- something that from a preliminary look...Noah saw that it could transform the essence of other beings into other forms and even devour this essence into itself, with the essence of Boundaries at the 9th Boundary Layer finding it hard pressed to stop it!","Then came the effect on himself.","When he allowed this essence to roam freely in his body and Origin.","It was a type of Essence that should've been unreachable for someone like him- where even now as the Convergence of Manadynamics and Nullity slowly climbed past 1%...Noah still found this essence extremely hard to control and holding a tremendous cost to use!","His Aeonic Soul Values were rapidly decreasing as the only reason he wasn't entirely drained at this moment was because of the brand new effects circulating that this essence brought.","Since it was something a step above Boundary Essence and even closer to Extremity, his Origin, Soul, and Body cheered as his Aspects of Existence swallowed the metallic blue essence and underwent even greater change!","<An Essence reserved for Apex Aeonic Lifeforms is coursing in your Aspects of Existence.>","<A tremendous refinement and strengthening effect is applied to your Aspects of Existence!>","<Continued Refinement with the Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity will open a pathway to forge a Type of Extremity Foundation geared towards the efficient Convergence of Threads of Extremity.>","...!","Boundless sources of information were constantly being infused into Noah while his True Sanguine Clone moved in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands, where even now when his right hand clamped onto the feathery neck of Titus and clashed with the essence of an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem- he was told of a tremendous blessing!","A Type of Extremity Foundation.","What Titus and others came to the Youngest Haven to achieve!","They came here seeking the Extremity Panaceas that even the Mad Apex Emperor Caesar wanted for his daughter in order to forge an Extremity Foundation that would allow them to smoothly become Apex Aeonic Lifeform and set up the building blocks to reach Extremity, but Noah could attain his own Extremity Foundation at this stage so long as he continued refining his Aspects of Existence with this new quality of essence!","This was his reward for achieving the impossible.","Something that even those in powerful factions from other Havens couldn't imagine.","And...he wasn't alone in this.","There was also the Infinite Plane.","It was governed by Manadynamics as at this moment, this governance had the intrusion of Nullity into it!","While Noah experienced the changes of this Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity, the Source of the Infinite Plane quaked as the dazzling silver of Nullity bloomed within it.","A light of nothingness and change mixing with the governance of Essence!","<The Infinite Plane has gained access to a new source of energy and authority.>","<The Authority of a Dynamis of Extremity courses through the Source of the Infinite Plane>","<The features of the Infinite Plane begin to undergo Quintessential elevations.>","...!","Many things occurred as even grander things were initiated.","The quickest ones...","<The Offensive Feature of the Aeonic Planar Xyston of Extremity has been born.>","<The Defensive Feature of the Aeonic Planar Aegis of Extremity has been born.>","...!","Terrifying new tools bloomed as Noah felt like he was receiving an overload of information from multiple sources!","From his Aspects of Existence. From his Origin. From the Dynamis of Extremity he had yet to name!","There were too many things coming towards him all at once.","His Soul felt like a small boat in the midst of a raging sea, barely weathering the storms around him as it drank from this sea and became ever more stable.","Because of the vastness of the sea that would take a long time to understand, he had to tune everything out at this moment!","And so he did.","All of his clones and main form stopped the blatant usage of the Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity.","Only his True Sanguine Clone in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands continued to shine with a metallic blue luster as the heavy cost of this authority was greatly reduced.","And as soon as he did this...","BZZZT!","The last layer of defense brought about from the Apex Aeonic Soul Totem around Titus shattered!","The sharp points of silver gold lines that was another dreadful attack from a Totem...only left a white mark on his forehead as it didn't pierce his skin that was bathed with the Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity.","It was a fantastical development as he looked at the enormous form of the Planar Halcyon Sparrow, his hand tightly sinking into the dazzling silver gold feathers around its neck as the essence of the Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity...already seeped into Titus's body!","His eyes locked with the gaze of this Haven Disciple who seemed to have many chaotic chaotic ideas in his head as he spoke lightly.","<I want to thank you for dropping by my feet and doing what you did today.>","WAA!","Noah's utterance was utterly serious as the actions of this being had spurred him forward, acting like a grinding machine where he came out of the other end even stronger!","Titus had attained an exceeding sense of calmness the moment that the defenses of the Apex Aeonic Soul Totem around him were broken and the terrifying essence around Noah entered his body, his Aspects of Existence beginning to feel cold and empty as when he gazed into the eyes of the being before him, he truly saw they were genuinely thanking him!","When he gazed at them, he tried to leave behind the rising remorse as he could only utterance out...","<You utter fucking monster...>","SAA!","Four words.","And that was it!"]},{"number":2364,"title":"Chapter 2364: Chapter 2363 Immovable! IV","paragraphs":["<You utter fucking monster...>","SAA!","Four words.","And this was it before the light in the eyes of this pristine existence faded.","He was alive in one moment, and gone in the next as the terror of the utilization of a Dynamis of Extremity was extremely unique!","It was akin to a scene that had occurred not too long ago amidst raging storms of Ruin where in a certain Plane, a shackled existence with only sockets for eyes had escaped.","His enemy did not even know when they had truly died, only realizing at a certain point that it was it for them as everything about them disappeared soon after!","<...>","The massive body of the Planar Halcyon Sparrow wasn't held up by Noah any further as he released it, dazzling sandy gold dunes rising from below and accepting it into their folds as the body was preserved in pristine conditions.","At the same time, the reality of what had just occurred set it as the remaining Haven Disciples...roared out while releasing their own remaining Apex Aeonic Soul Totems while they turned into blazing silver-gold lights to escape into different locations!","Noah's eyes were unfettered as events seemed to be playing out in slow motion under his eyes bathed in the Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity- eyes that currently watched a dazzling pair of prompts.","<The Sources of 12x Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearl of Extremity have been absorbed into your body.>","<The Sources of 1,000x Crimson Planar Origin Panaceas have been absorbed into your body.>","Prompts that didn't include the bodies and blood that Noah had kept intact!","Similar prompts that appeared when he killed the first Haven Disciple came, the only difference being that Titus granted 3 more Sources of Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity!","Along with this, the memories of Titus surged into his mind as they reinforced and expanded what he learned about from the memories of the first Haven Disciple he had killed.","Memories of the Aeonic Haven of Genesis and the Genesis Institute of Extremity!","Memories of the structure and Civilizations of a few different Havens, and of the experiences of 900 years this being had as shockingly, when Noah arrived at the portion of the memories that involved a specific being...","BZZT!","An oppressive light flashed.","It was a memory.","And yet within the vast array of memories, one particular one was Titus seated as he stared towards an aged man on a simple feathered throne.","The man seemed to be passing on the knowledge of Extremity as the moment Noah arrived at these memories, they shockingly stopped being so!","The aged man seated on the simple feathery throne raised his head and sighed as next, he stared straight towards Noah's will that was gazing at everything.","...!","And the right hand of this being snapped as an instant later, Noah felt a portion of his Soul sapped away- his mind entering the body of Titus seated on a halcyon marbled floor as the memory seemed to become reality!","---","Across the workings of spacetime continuum.","In an Unrecorded version of reality.","In the deepest reaches of the first Haven to undergo Extremity Sanctification- the Aeonic Haven of Genesis.","The marble gold floor beneath him was warm to the touch as it pulsed with life and grandeur, Noah placing his hands on it as he rose and gazes at his surroundings.","The marble floor had massive golden pillars and archways surrounding it, stellar and tall trees swirling with liquefied essence of Boundaries seen in the far distance as this location seemed to be at the very top of a mountain.","A mountain that when Noah stared further outwards, he could see numerous radiant Planes of Existence surrounding it that each held an overabundance of life!","And at the center of this marbled floor atop a stellar mountain surrounded by Planes, a simple feathered throne lay as the being seated on it spoke with a sigh while gazing at Noah's figure that looked around as if nothing here fazed him.","<I take on very few Disciples, and you have killed one.>","WAA!","His tone was deep and ancient.","His visage was astounding as a head full of vibrant white hair could be seen, his aged fave filled with an unbelievable sense of beauty and grandeur that would make others lost!","Noah's will that was brought here across spacetime finally turned to actually gaze upon the existence that had reached Extremity before his eyes.","Titus's strongest teacher- Marcellus!","Towards his statement, Noah only nodded lightly as he was given just a glimpse of the shocking power existences that had far exceeded the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","This being had merely appeared in a memory of another existence, and yet he had somehow caught Noah's portion of soul and brought it into this memory as if it were a reality!","When Noah spread his Will out from this grand mountain peak, he genuinely felt as if he was in an entirely different space- as if he truly was in the Aeonic Haven of Genesis as everything around him felt extremely genuine!","But he wasn't afraid.","This was still just a memory no matter how much it seemed like a reality!","The Existence that had reached Extremity rose from his throne as he looked at Noah closely, his voice continuing to ring out.","<What happened to cause conflict between you all? He should've barely just arrived near the Initiating Extremity Vein of Dissolution with his team. And for an existence below the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeform to kill him is even more surprising...>","He seemed more curious than anything else as Noah actually couldn't see rising rage or wrath from this being!","So he replied calmly while walking towards the edges of the golden marbled floor and overseeing the fantastical domain that was only a portion of the Genesis Institute of Extremity.","<His destiny sparked conflict while lying to him that he would obtain some great boon from me. He instead received an early end to his life.>","<Oh?> The brows of the Extremity Existence rose as he nodded. <I always did tell him that Destiny can be very fickle. If I ask, would you allow the rest of his team to live if they aren't already dead? I'll put something up for you.>","This existence stroked his beard as he spoke, Noah gazing at the wonderful expanse before him as he shook his head!","<Since I started this, I will just finish it. Killing one or killing eleven isn't too big of a difference. Although...can I now expect a distinguished being that has reached Extremity to be seeking me for revenge and retribution? I can't promise you that things won't end the same way as they did with Titus.>","BOOM!","His contained Will surged with Tyranny as he spoke fearlessly towards a being with unknown strength and standing!","And this being...actually smiled while shaking his head.","<No revenge or retribution from me. Though his Lineage within the Institute may seek recompense. When you reach the stage of Extremity, you mind come to understand many things...and just how crucial every single Apex Aeonic Lifeform or potential Apex Aeonic Lifeforms are. It is why I sought to save the others if possible. But fate is what it is. If our paths cross again in the future, I may even discuss destiny with the lifeform capable of wiping out a team of Unequaled Reverend Emperors with multiple Apex Aeonic Soul Totems...>","...!","CRACK!","The artificial reality began to break and fracture.","Noah nodded sharply while turning back to stare at the being that had reached Extremity.","It seemed like there was much for him to learn and understand about this stage.","But at this moment in time, he did not look back on his deeds as his Will left this recollection to erase every single Haven Disciple that threw attacks his way!"]},{"number":2365,"title":"Chapter 2365: Chapter 2364 The Spear And The Shield I","paragraphs":["The skies burned with a verdant light of life.","The earth shone gold and black as apocalyptic mountains burned furiously, golden sands roiling as they already held the bodies of two Planar Halcyon Sparrows!","At the center of the skies, a Recorded Apocalypse bloomed as in this stellar field of battle, the most powerful auras were spreading out and leaving in different directions for nothing other than escape.","And how could they not escape when the most powerful among them just had his soul erased with utter ease?!","Their hearts burned with regret as the being they had surrounded and attacked this whole time came back to full attention, his body feeling the arcs of an essence that came from a combination of two different Boundaries as he didn't actually give chase.","He would be able to do it with a little bit of effort from chasing each one, but Providence told him one or two would actually make him give chase across the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands as he could choose a more optimum path!","And that path...","His mind buzzed as he computed countless threads of information and arrived at a single one. It was actually one of the boons to come from the fruition of the Unknown Dynamis of Extremity- the newly elevated features of the Infinite Plane!","The Aeonic Planar Xyston of Extremity and Aeonic Planar Aegis of Extremity! Noah traced their descriptions as he saw a myriad of similarities among them, eventually seeing the two features come together under a single description to tell exactly what they stood for.","<Aeonic Planar Xyston of Extremity and Aeonic Planar Aegis of Extremity>:: The Offensive and Defensive components of the Infinite Plane manifested by its Master. The Xyston and Aegis carry great Aeonic Planar Defense Values and Aeonic Planar Damage Values equivalent to the Weight and Sources of Extremity currently bound to the Infinite Plane. Due to their nature, they heavily amplify the abilities of the Master of the Infinite Plane as abilities can be cast through these weapons to achieve a quintessential effect. All abilities cast through the Aegis and Xyston be infused with the Unknown Dynamis of Extremity from the Source of the Infinite Plane, with two preset modes of offense and defense also being possible. The preset modes of [Planar Emperor's Stellar Bastion of Immovability] and the [Planar Emperor's Stellar Spear of Penetrability] can be utilized at no cost to you, all resources paid for by the Infinite Plane. Including these preset abilities, all abilities cast through the Aegis and Xyston carry Absolute Aeonic Automatic Targeting- where once an enemy is chosen as the target of the ability, it will cross the spacetime continuum or even versions of different realities to always reach the chosen enemy. Additional features of the Aegis and Xyston are still being added with the transformation and expansion of the Infinite Plane, with their base utilizations also coming at no cost to you...","Yes.","A power that required him a great deal of resources before, and yet now...the cost was paid for by the Infinite Plane that had begun to collect Sources of Extremity and continued to expand and proliferate even though Noah had not absorbed any new Minor or Major Planes of Existence!","In the past two days since it entered the Planar Palisades of Extremity, it had more than doubled in size and the number of realities and cosmos within it- purely from the spurred changes brought about with the expansion to Extremity.","It was becoming more and more like a miniature Haven as at this moment, Noah's will called out The Aeonic Planar Xyston of Extremity and Aeonic Planar Aegis of Extremity!","—","What was he doing now?","Ayame was already given a great surprise at the might of the displayed Dynamis of Extremity, but she also expected it at the same time as whenever she sparred with Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, their utilization of essence that exceeded normal boundary essence always caused her great difficulty!","She knew that normal methods could not handle it. Even the essence of Apex Aeonic Soul Totems...only clashed with it as since the Dynamis essence was closer to the means of a genuine Apex Aeonic Lifeform- it would win in the end! And this was showcased when the one called Titus fell.","But as his entourage scrambled to escape, Ayame wondered if she should lend a hand as she had now mixed herself in with the threads of Fate after stopping the communications of these beings. She wondered this because Osmont didn't make a move instantly as they escaped, but a moment later...her eyes fluttered greatly.","This being suddenly released a stellar glow as in his right hand, a dazzling spear shining blue, purple, and gold appeared. Its spearpoint was excessively sharp as it caused one's eyes to prickle, while multicolored lines of realities flowed out at its base to give it an ethereal flow! At the same time, a shield holding similar colors came to be grasped on his forearm as it was a perfect circle- its exterior being inscribed with multicolored stellar infinity lemniscate runic etchings that pulsed with the essence of multiple Sources of Extremity!","Osmont seized these two weapons as Ayame felt her eyes open wide at their appearance- her soul feeling a sensation that exceeded any EPOCH Relics as they seemed to give off waves of essence close to Apex Aeonic Relics if not exactly the same!","Holding the spear and shield, he looked like an ancient warrior from eons ago as paired with the cerulean grandeur and pulsing Haki surging around him- he carried an indomitable sense of grandiosity!","And at such a juncture, the stellar blue form of this being glowed as the essence of the Dynamis of Extremity gloriously shone on his body, with the only action he did...being to push his shield and spear forward.","Simple.","And yet...nine streams of a metallic blue light flashed out as they rushed towards the 9 different directions that the Haven Disciples had disappeared towards!","Ayame happened to catch the unbelievable sight that bloomed next as the most this being made this move, spacetime twisted as a terrifying essence was carried over at an insane speed to instantly appear above the heads of the radiant Planar Halcyon Sparrows from afar!","Above some of them, a massive multicolored illusory Aegis flourished in the skies as it spun with horrific gravitational waves that would put even Major Planes of Existence to shame- these waves fixing the Haven Disciple in space as the illusory Aegis then descended while spinning with even greater force- the metallic blue light of a Dynamis of Extremity shining from it as even though the body of the Haven Disciple was left intact, Ayame could see that with every spin of the Aegis- a desiccating force smashed and crushed the soul of the Haven Disciple on all sides as death was the only possibility!"]},{"number":2366,"title":"Chapter 2366: Chapter 2365 The Spear And The Shield II","paragraphs":["A massive illusory Aegis appeared above some of them as it spun with heavy gravitational waves that seemed to carry the essence of twice a dozen Boundaries on top of the essence of a Dynamis of Extremity, grinding down the enemy's soul from afar as on top of other Haven Disciples, the illusory scene of multiple spears of light bloomed as they cascaded down with immense brilliance!","Such a scene appeared simultaneously on all Haven Disciples as none were spared.","OOOH!","Many of them felt these shocking waves of power and the unprecedented danger their souls felt- those with Apex Aeonic Soul Totems still using them as all they did was buy them a little bit more time, with those who simply tried to defend with their 9th Boundary Layers finding the essence of a Dynamis of Extremity unimaginably hard to bypass as their souls were ground down in an instant!","A single attack where he simply pushed forward a shield and spear...simultaneously targeted 9 beings in different directions and oppressively crushed down with Dynamis of Extremity- grinding their souls as if they were at the very center of a forming singularity of infinite density and gravity.","It meant that within a single move, the grand light of Soul Totems was shredded apart as the soul light and the authentic force of life in Nine Unequaled Reverend Emperors...was extinguished simultaneously.","<...>","Their bodies lost their support as they still seemed lifelike, but they fell towards the cold earth as nine dense streams of golden sands stretched out from afar to receive them, welcoming them into their final sleep as at such a scene, Ayame couldn't help but smack her lips!","She was further recalled of the mysteries and anomalies out in the vastness of Extremity that could always change things, with a whole party of Haven Disciples from one of the Oldest Havens never expecting to fall even before they laid eyes of the Extremity Vein of the Youngest Haven.","It was a reminder, but just that.","She appreciated the power and decisiveness this being showed as she was even more interested by his capability to bring two concepts of Extremity to Converge, but that was it.","Intrigue.","She didn't need to attach anymore to it than that as similar to this being, she could also be considered an existence that was anomalous and mutated compared to others!","So she had enjoyed the show as she nodded with a smile and prepared to leave, when...","<Leaving so soon?>","WAA!","The magnetic voice of the existence valiantly holding a stellar spear and shield reached her position as her brows rose.","He was able to see her?","—","<The Sources of 9x Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity have been absorbed into your body.>","<The Sources of 1,000x Crimson Planar Origin Panaceas have been absorbed into your body.>","<The Sources of 9x Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity have been absorbed into your body.>","<The Sources of 1,000x Crimson Planar Origin Panaceas have been absorbed into your body...>","Before his eyes, a set of two prompts repeated 9 times over as 81 Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearl of Extremity had their Source absorbed into his body.","More Pearls than the number of Boundaries he now held as every single one could be brought to the 9th Boundary Layer as the Sources of the remaining Pearls...he could even pass them through his lineage to others connected to him!","Boundless waves of information flowed in his mind as he admired the power of the Aeonic Planar Xyston of Extremity and Aeonic Planar Aegis of Extremity, his Soul then calling out towards a certain direction where an existence who had subtly interfered in today's battle was about to leave.","<Leaving so soon?>","...!","His words came as a surprise to her, his eyes able to see this clearly as in the next second, her figure was unveiled.","Fiery gold hair releasing lights of splendor.","A crimson horn radiating immense power rose on her forehead!","Eyes that gave off a feeling of immense confidence and power as if in this whole Haven, not a single being would be able to give her any sense of danger- Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and Existences that had reached Extremity included!","Seeing that Noah had actually to see her when nobody could, her feet moved a single step as an instant later, she materialized a few feet away from Noah.","<Yes, I am. I interfered because their actions were distasteful to me, and now that things are done, I shall leave. It was interesting to observe you, Osmont.>","She talked freely as Noah's body still pulsed with the grandeur of a stellar shield and spear arcing with the core of a Dynamis of Extremity that utterly eradicated Unequaled Reverend Emperors, and yet she didn't show an ounce of fear as if this was something she could handle!","And Noah...he could barely discern anything about this being as even when he fully utilized the authority of Providence and his expertise in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity...only a letter of two of her name was coming to him!","The being before him seemed to sense this as she laughed calmly.","<I am known as Ayame. Ayame of Infinite Extremity.>","...!","BOOM!","The surroundings buzzed chaotically at the mere mention of her last two words as Noah's eyes constricted, his Soul even feeling the events playing out being recorded with ever greater clarity in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","<Infinite Extremity.>","He knew of this from the memories of Titus and others that he had just killed.","One of the ancient inheritances to exist in the Havens of Extremity.","Their name was boldly Infinite Extremity!","They held great weight in the Aeonic Haven of Genesis as it was common sense for no beings to ever mess around with those who proclaimed themselves to be from this aged inheritance.","Against her magnificent introduction, Noah didn't feel any sense of inferiority or act differently- the mention of this ancient behemoth she belonged to meant nothing to him as he knew of his own boons and talents!","So just like she had introduced herself...","<I am Noah Osmont. The True Emperor of Quintessence!>","WAA!","The manifested Dream, Prana, and Apollyon Planes vibrated with glory at his mention as he nodded lightly while moving past Ayame.","<Thank you for the aid.>","He was unfettered in his demeanor as Ayame's eyes shone while she watched him pass inches from her, his form becoming humanoid and devilishly handsome as he moved ever further into the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands without looking back.","Behind him...a fantastic landscape was left behind!","It was forever altered as in the skies, a verdant stellar forest remained with radiant cosmos shining brilliantly, and on the earth below- golden sand dunes and crimson mountains releasing tendrils of chaos remained."]},{"number":2367,"title":"Chapter 2367: Chapter 2366 The End Of The True Emperor Of Destiny! I","paragraphs":["Across the Havens of Extremity","Near the Styx Regality Plane.","A thin golden Boundary stretched out for light years as it released waves of golden destiny, reverberations booming within as a great battle unfolded.","Towards a corner of this domain, one young man floated with an aura of sharpness and power as he seemed like a blade ready to strike at any moment.","He watched.","With every ounce of his Aeonic Soul, he watched every single move that the trapped enemy made as his goal was to ensure that escape wasn't even a possibility for him!","After all, the enemy had something as unpredictable as the Eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","BOOM!","A golden light exploded out as the surroundings were filled with golden Treasure Caches releasing beams of light that snaked around the whole domain- giving the two Noblesse Reverends that had joined the fray trouble along with the main target of today's venture- Oppenheimer!","On top of the Planar Domain of Loot, seas of crimson blood occupied and encircled all other areas as the multicolored light of Quintessence formed into unique constructs that also closed off all sides.","The only being at the center of this all was Oppenheimer as his body moved with contained calmness and a somber expression!","He currently faced the attacks of all Dimensional Rulers here as a valiant Eowyn was at the forefront, her golden hair radiating might as she merged with the golden light of Loot while swinging a massive blade that held a half-crescent moon at its hilt- the grandeur of Ruination also being put to use.","On top of Eowyn and Arthus, Lilith, Guinevere, and other Dimensional Rulers who were all utilizing the Boundaries that stemmed from a single man, the roaring figures of Kazuhiko and the Emperor Penguin were among others who weaved in and out to release attacks on all sides that made sure Oppenheimer couldn't make an escape in any direction.","Even though he held the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, he had not been able to leave this whole time!","Every point of space was covered with Boundary essence as if there were any gaps...the dreadful light of an Undead Legion buzzing with Boundary Essence filled it as Barbatos sat atop an Aeonic Abyssal Bone Dragon also watching everything closely.","It had been minutes since the battle began, and Oppenheimer still couldn't break out as the only reason he had survived so far was the multicolored glow released from his eyes.","It rebuffed and reduced the might of the attacks of the inhabitants of the Infinite Plane that had reached the 8th Boundary Layer easily as it was the only reason this being was still alive!","But after these few minutes, the cost of keeping this up was wearing him down as his soul could already feel the strain.","His golden destiny that always showed him innumerable routes only had a few lines he could follow- with most of them requiring him to sacrifice everything just for the possibility of escape!","So for the first time since the encirclement began...","\"Why would you all so vehemently do this?\"","WAA!","His booming voice filled with majesty echoed out as he weaved across the cylindrical beams of light coming from treasure chests, the light of Destiny knocking back the flippers of an arrogant Penguin at the same time while the tentacles of the Kraken barely grazed his body!","There were too many enemies around him as his voice continued to ring out.","\"I alone worked to save you all when a Noblesse located our Plane of Existence. My methods may have been brutal, but it was the only way as the other option was complete annihilation!\"","...!","He always showed the serenity and regality of an Emperor.","After all, he had risen and reigned over an entire Age- even coming to end an Era!","And even now, he had only taken a few of his Boundaries to the peak of the Seventh Boundary Layer due to the Eyes of Clarity, and yet he stood against multiple beings who had achieved the 7th Boundary Layer in multiple Boundaries.","He was brave and indomitable as anyone at the same stage wouldn't be able to match him!","Yet now, he spoke with a sense of urgency as the innumerable routes he always had were slowly dwindling amidst this trap.","\"Hah! You worked to save us? You decimated the forces of the Dream Dimension among multiple others just to cement your reign, you ripped apart my Aspects of Existence in front of my own father!\"","BOOM!","Eowyn bellowed out with burning anger as from her body, blue flames rose as a tinge of Manadynamics bloomed!","Oppenheimer released tendrils of Destiny to block this off as he replied.","\"This was in a time of war where each of us was fighting for the title of True Emperor. I had to dominate a certain few to gain the might to save all the 9 Minor Planes and the Desolate Mausoleum. The reason you all stand here today and why Desiderius did not deserve everything was because of me. Me!\"","...!","Anger seemed to be rising from the visage of the True Emperor of Destiny.","How long had he worked for this? How far had he come?","He came from nothing to overcome Destined and Chosen Emperors as today...it would be the same!","The eyes transplanted on his sockets gazed and calculated everything as an instant later, they turned towards the direction of the devilishly handsome youth who seemed to be silently weaving and controlling the direction of this whole battle.","Unseen tendrils of Destiny and Providence surged from him as Oppenheimer could see one of the few remaining pathways...was this being.","And so...","SHIING!","Space twisted and contorted from the usage of the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform as Oppenheimer instantly appeared before Henry, spears of Destiny booming out while his voice emanated out.","\"The only reason you were even born was due to me ending an Era and giving your father the chance to stand atop a new one. All of you owe your lives to me!\"","BOOM!"]},{"number":2368,"title":"Chapter 2368: Chapter 2367 The End Of The True Emperor Of Destiny! II","paragraphs":["Dazzling Spears of Destiny clashed with a golden light of Providence around the Child of Destiny, tendrils of the VOID weaved into it as Oppenheimer went all out!","Yet the young man before him...","\"You were a great man who rose from nothing and made a name for yourself out of an entire Age. For that, I commend you.\"","WAA!","Around his body, blazing Quintessence bloomed along with a raging light of Destiny that formed into a Blitzkrieg, pillars of multicolored light forming behind him and cascading down as he continued!","\"But in that rise, you made too many enemies. You hurt too many beings just to achieve what you wanted. But you weren't thorough enough...and the past came back to haunt you.\"","BOOOM!","The surrounding space buzzed amidst their clash as this whole area became enclosed by multiple stacked Planar Domains, the Oldest Dream, Guinevere, and others keeping the Noblesse Reverends at bay while locking down this entire area with domains to the point that only the figures of Henry and Oppenheimer were enclosed in this single area.","Oppenheimer breathed heavily amidst his grandeur as he came out unscathed from the radiance of multiple Consummate Boundaries, but his Aeonic Soul Values were even further used up as he now felt a great strain to keep the utilization of the Eyes of Clarity active!","\"I was born to forge my own destiny. Even in these Vaults of Extremity, I would rise to become an indomitable Apex Aeonic Lifeform as I would etch my name in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. Oppenheimer would ring out across eons!\"","...!","His soul truly felt the strain.","It was unbelievable and commendable that he stood against dozens of beings with 8th Boundary Layers in multiple Consummate Boundaries all by himself when his highest was Destiny at the 7th Layer- and it only further exemplified the terror of the Eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform he held!","It was commendable.","But it could only continue for so long.","His Aeonic Soul Values couldn't use the Eyes of Clarity to their full potential with his current accomplishments. If he had more time as he planned. If...","\"Possibilities. That is all that those were, Oppenheimer. You may have very well had your name etched across the Vaults of Extremity as even now...I can see possibilities of it.\"","Henry spoke out with a sigh as he felt something move within his very Lineage.","\"You can see it too?\" With his body covered by a dimming light from the Eyes of Clarity as the last of his Aeonic Soul Values kept the raging Essences of the Consummate Boundaries at bay, the True Emperor of Destiny stared at the Child of Destiny.","The boundless future he dreamed of. The one that was right before his grasp...","\"Yes. But...you were inevitably connected to and affected by the Destiny of a man much greater than you. Even though he isn't here, you can't imagine how much his influence brought all of this to fruition, even to this very moment.\"","Henry spoke with brilliant eyes as through his Quintessential Kainos Emperor Lineage, he felt multiple Sources of Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity course through and settle into his soul for his use.","What had his father done for him to obtain enough Pearls of Extremity that can raise Boundaries to the 9th Boundary Layer to the extent he could freely give some away to him? How many Reverend Emperors had he taken down in these last few minutes?","Henry only had this passing thought as in the next moment, the Source of Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearl of Extremity burned as Quintessence was the first one risen to the 9th Boundary Layer- Destiny being the next one to follow as the power around Henry...rose to a shocking level!","Around his body, liquefied golden flames of Destiny began to rise torrentially as Oppenheimer looked at them from afar and found himself sighing.","His figure stopped on the dazzling space at the center of all attacks as his body got into a seated position, his hands resting on his knees as he looked at the golden flames of Destiny that seemed further on the path of Extremity that his own Boundary of Destiny by numerous Layers.","\"A foe I didn't even confrontation with, and yet I lost to him?\"","His voice was deep and low as around him, a golden throne manifested as his visage released boundless waves of nobility and grandeur.","As he released a genuine aura of an Emperor that very few others could match!","But around his body...the light grew dimmer as his Soul Values were truly too drained from all the adversaries he faced, this being before him grinding down all of his strength to the extent that now, he could only wait for a single thing.","For a single path.","\"You lost to him, you also lost to me. Your destiny was bright Ages ago as you overcame countless adversities...but mine shone brighter.\"","HOONG!","Torrential golden flames of Destiny jumped out like celestial snakes from Henry as they came to wrap around the True Throne of Destiny and the Emperor atop it.","Utmost calm and grandeur could be seen from Oppenheimer as the last of his Aeonic Soul Values faded, his implanted eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform being the only thing shining brightly at this moment as his Aspects of Existence could no longer support their heavy cost!","BZZT!","Tongues of golden flames of Destiny latched from his throne and onto his body one after another as within moments, his visage became enshrined with golden flames.","But they weren't his.","And they burned what remained of his Aeonic Soul as he stared fearlessly at the young being to do this to him.","The Child of Destiny was bathed in golden flames as he looked like an incarnation of a fated creature from the legends of the Elysium Bloodlines, his figure coming to float in front of the True Throne of Destiny as he looked straight at Oppenheimer's burning figure.","The one who had split apart Reality.","The average soul that rose to triumph over countless Chosen Emperors and Destined Emperors.","The True Emperor of Destiny!","His Aeonic Soul burned as he didn't make a sound, facing death with a straight face as the last thing he gazed at was the majesty of Destiny.","The majesty of Destiny...as well as the hands of a being reaching out for everything he had attained.","One hand surged towards his eyes in order to pluck out the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform. The other hand surged behind him and grabbed his golden throne as right before his death, Oppenheimer realized this being even wished to seize his True Throne of Destiny!","And then...the golden light he always gazed and followed all but faded as immense darkness descended all around him.","It was the end of the True Emperor of Destiny...and the rise of an even greater one!"]},{"number":2369,"title":"Chapter 2369: Chapter 2368 Usurpation Of Destiny!","paragraphs":["He was truly seated on his Throne.","On his very throne!","And yet...","The visage of another being bathed in shining gold flames of Destiny that were immolating his whole being plucked out the dazzling eyes in his sockets while wrapping them in immense flames of Destiny, his other hands clamping on the golden throne of Destiny that was also enshrined with burning flames.","This scene became privy to all as the layers that covered them disappeared, the Planar Boundaries laid out being deactivated as they still left behind their signature in space even then.","Those that surrounded this space were able to see the unfolding scene.","The scene of an aflame Oppenheimer as Henry dug out dazzling eyes from this being, his clamping right hand releasing seas of golden flames of Destiny that wrapped around the True Throne of Destiny which ultimately...he bellowed out while pulling outward!","HOOO!","And the golden throne moved across space, making a semilunar arc and coming to be stationed behind him as Oppenheimer's figure was left seated alone in space, mere burning as his skin crackled.","<...>","Henry then felt the throne behind him that was commandeered by his own Destiny, his body going to be situated on it without so much as a delay.","A flash of gold erupted out and rose to the skies at such an action.","Destiny permeated throughout as all beings here could feel the essence of a 9th Boundary Layer emanating from such a concept!","Eowyn and Lilith floated close and watched the burning figure of Oppenheimer with complex emotions.","The former nearly had their Aspects of Existence broken by him, and the latter had her father entirely erased by him!","Yet now, this being lay dead before them even after all his glory.","Kazuhiko, the Emperor Penguin, Kraken, Anna, Dimensional Rulers...all the prominent Vassals of the True Emperor of Quintessence that were on this venture saw this scene as well as the so of the being they followed become enthroned atop the True Throne of Destiny as they felt their Origins buzz.","They looked towards such a being as his devilish handsomeness was ever enhanced by the burning golden flames as his voice echoed out.","\"Oppenheimer is no more as from this point onwards...there shall be a new True Emperor of Destiny!\"","BOOM!","His words were accompanied by burning golden fire torrentially rushing all around, his other hand holding two jewel-like eyes moving and smashing towards his socket as a golden light of Destiny carried them into his sockets!","A pristine aura of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform emanated from these eyes as the first thing that Henry confirmed was that who they belonged to was not dead.","The second was that he...would be able to better utilize them than Oppenheimer ever dreamed of as the essence of Quintessence and Destiny surged out and sank into these Eyes of Clarity- Henry intent on refining them to become his own even if the True Emperor of Genesis they stemmed from was still alive!","Blinding radiance emanated out as he blinked after the eyes were inserted, each time seeming like the lids of a sun opening and closing due to the brilliance as his gaze became locked with the two shocked Noblesse Reverend Emperors from a distance, and the even more vibrant forms of life in the Styx Regality Plane as he spoke out with a young sense of tyranny.","\"Let the Conquest of Quintessence resume...let the Lineage of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor resound across the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!\"","OOOOOH!","The space buzzed as the aura of over a dozen Consummate Boundaries blared out, the Vassals of the True Emperor of Quintessence wishing to expand his glory as his Son led the way forward on the domains of the Noblesse!","He sat on the golden True Throne of Destiny as he watched the unfolding Conquest towards the Styx Regality Plane and the scrambling Noblesse Reverends as he thought of many things.","The throne below him, the eyes he refined in his sockets.","All of them came with the assistance of his father as at this moment, Henry wished to be able to give even grander things back to his father.","His father had already told him the blessing from Oppenheimer was fine for him to keep, with him actually not showing interest in the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","'You wouldn't already be approaching such a stage or have your body already transforming into one, right?'","Henry had a passing thought that he deemed too ridiculous, shaking his head as he moved forward.","It had barely been two days since his father entered the Vaults of Extremity- where his power was only at the 6th or 7th Boundary Layer after he had defeated Desiderius.","Surely, he wouldn't already be set to advance in becoming an entirely different lifeform?","—","Across the spacetime continuum.","Within the Planar Palisades of Extremity.","In a region where the past Barren Lands used to be, the humanoid appearance of a man wrapped in white essence could be seen floating silently.","His sockets were empty yet filled with profoundly swirling milky white light, his stare desolate as he gazed at where his past home would have been!","He couldn't feel the faint bindings of Natural Laws anymore.","He couldn't feel the Source of the Lands he was the First Emperor of!","In his absence, too many things were decided as the reality he was waiting for didn't even get a chance to play out.","The reality of the Barren Lands being like many other scattered Planes of Existence in the Planar Palisades that were pulled towards the Havens of Extremity.","Since the region of the Planar Palisades of Extremity it was in fell under the influence of the Youngest Aeonic Haven of Dissolution, the Barren Lands that was extremely far away would have gradually been pulled towards the Youngest Aeonic Haven until it was fully absorbed to become one of the many Planes of Existence within it.","This was the history Genesis had learned of when it came to the Older Aeonic Havens that had already undergone Extremity Sanctification!","These Havens had Existences from an endless number of nearby Planes of Existences that emerged and survived the dangers within the Planar Palisades of Extremity.","They were absorbed into the folds of the Vaults of Extremity and spread out across different factions!"]},{"number":2370,"title":"Chapter 2370: Chapter 2369 The Vein Of Dissolution! I","paragraphs":["Countless lineages were absorbed into the folds of the Vaults of Extremity and spread out across different factions over the eons that passed.","If they held grand destinies and Providence, they may just be capable of speedily expanding their Boundaries towards Extremity- or even be capable enough to become Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","Genesis and the Ancestors of the Barren Lands were merely lucky enough to find access into the Havens of Extremity first even before the Initiation Step of the Extremity Vein began in the Haven they were in.","It was a great opportunity as many of them rose in power, but they couldn't Conquer or advance as much as they wished to due to other Lineages that already had their Planes of Existence here- Lineages like the Noblesse!","Thus, they sought for greater forms of power.","They abandoned their Plane of Existence entirely and even used Minor Planes to bind the Major Plane.","In his absence, his people even laid down the verdict of destruction!","And now, the Barren Lands were not where they used to be.","\"What did you do...O Last True Emperor?\"","His deep voice echoed out as he couldn't sense any Planar destruction here, knowing full well that the Barren Lands were not destroyed.","But where were they? What had the ruling being of its Last Age done? Were the Barren Lands already absorbed into the Youngest Haven since its Initiation of Extremity Sanctification just began?","Genesis had many questions, with the milky white essence surrounding him buzzing powerfully as it exceeded any common Boundary essence.","It held a luster of none other than a Dynamis of Extremity as it told the True Emperor of Genesis...the answers would actually be back in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution. Within his very own Lineage!","And he knew just what great a change was coming to the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution now that its Extremity Sanctification had begun.","It would not be a few simple Lineages ruling domains across this Haven any longer.","Planeswalkers, Quasarians, Noblesse, Lernaeans...they would merely be among many others.","Their powerhouses would be dispersed to join powerful factions that had their histories etched in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","Even within the Ancestral Lernaeans...there were already Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that set their hearts on specific factions from the offers they had received!","A great change was coming.","The walls between the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution and other Havens would become even thinner as Extremity Sanctification progressed.","And those seeking Extremity would swarm towards the budding Extremity Vein of Dissolution to obtain what others obtained in their own Havens. To obtain the Seeds of Extremity that were mainly fated for those who had been in this Haven of Dissolution and no others!","It was the approaching of a greatly tumultuous time as the moment the Initiation Step ended...even Apex Aeonic Lifeforms would roam freely!","Before such chaos fully unfolded, Genesis had to rectify his wrongs.","He had to locate the Barren Lands and ensure its safety. He had to defend the Lerneans to not become divided and separated across terrifying Inheritances that would soon stretch their tendrils towards them.","With his empty sockets surging with a milky white light of a Dynamis of Extremity, his figure disappeared!","—","Pure majesty flowed between his very atoms.","His main body took the reigns to circulate the Unknown Dynamis of Extremity as with every circulation- his cells drank this essence and became ever so refined.","His Aeonic Soul Values took it in and continued scaling upwards in growth.","His Origin pulsed as the First Plane of Extremity that couldn't be expanded any longer...had its Dimensions still absorbing this essence as they shone with ever greater splendor!","This Unknown Dynamis of Extremity was born from Aeonic Mana of Extremity that Noah had an infinite amount of. It was mixed with Nullity which wasn't Infinite.","One of the reasons Noah's soul was even able to handle the essence that greater Lifeforms could call forth...was because half of it stemmed from a source he could endlessly call out!","But even now, if Noah wanted to keep the convergence of both Mana and Nullity, his Aeonic Soul Values had to be in active use to do so.","This power was that pristine.","But it allowed him to refine his Aspects of Existence and take him towards a type of an Extremity Foundation, continuing to cement his power in the upper layers of Reverend Emperors!","At this point in time, Noah took stock of his current strength and might as he wished to solidify it all and bring every part of him to an unprecedented level in the stage of Unequaled Reverend Emperors.","The 9 Natural Laws and the 6 Fundamental Natural Laws of Reality.","The 9 Decreta of Dimensions.","His other expanded boundaries that when he added the Natural Laws and Decreta...his total number of Boundaries exceeded 30.","With the dozens of Sources of Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity...","\"Bring all currently expanded Boundaries to the 9th Boundary Layer.\"","...!","His voice echoed out commandingly as he began taking actions to build an unimaginable foundation.","\"Take all those not already at the Consummate level forward...\"","His Soul cried out at being out to work even more as it also worked dutifully to control the Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity, stretching itself out once more as it opened the Aeonic Annals of Extremity to alteration Recorded Histories into something else!","To alter Innate Boundaries to become Consummate Boundaries!","All of these changes...would heavily impact Noah and the Infinite Plane as every single one of its Natural Laws and Decreta were about to reach an unmatched level.","As for Noah himself...he would be an Unequaled Reverend Emperor that controlled dozens of Consummate Boundaries- his goal being a Foundation that was a rarity even in the Havens of Extremity across its eons of Recorded and Unrecorded History!","And as his 9 Decreta of Dimensions connected to his very Origin began their upwards surge towards the 9th Boundary Layer, they spurred his Origin forward as he came to make a choice.","\"Begin the forging of the Second Plane of Extremity. The Templates for the Second Plane of Extremity...shall be the 9 Dimensional Realities as Major Planes of Existence.\"","...!","His First Plane of Extremity held 9 Minor Planes of Existence! For his Second Plane of Extremity, he could have based it off any Planes across Extremity- or expanded upon the Dream, Prana, Apollyon, Fantasia, Niflheim, Elysium, Avalon, Mirror, and Quantum Dimensional Realities.","He...already had his soul stretched out across too many concepts as he didn't wish to add and enlarge even more at this moment. He wanted to take the Dimensional Realities from Minor to Major Planes of Existence as he wondered.. how would the Decreta be altered? How would the Infinite Plane be changed? And just what magnificence would arise from his Second Plane of Extremity being built like this?","There were many unknowns for the future, with the only thing he was sure of being that his Foundation was going to be something that would be Unrecorded across eons when he was done.","As for what he would do for the future Third, Fourth, or Fifth Plane of Extremity and onward? Only time would tell!"]},{"number":2371,"title":"Chapter 2371: Chapter 2370 The Vein Of Dissolution! II","paragraphs":["His Aspects of Existence continued their ever-constant refinement and strengthening as all his Boundaries surged towards the 9th Boundary Layer, and they were then altered to become Consummate.","In the midst of all this, his Soul still kept great focus on the Convergence of Manadynamics and Nullity- the percentage of Convergence slowly rising as with it, many things gradually became clear on what uses the Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity would have!","The combination of Mana and Nullity. The fusion of pure energy and nothingness...just what would come from it?","As Noah's soul controlled the metallic blue light of the Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity, he gradually gained a clearer picture!","[As the percentage of Convergence increases to perfect the Unknown Dynamis of Extremity, the nature of this Authority will gradually become accessible to you.]","[The Full Authority of Aeonic Anti-Mana seeks to come to fruition.]","[The Full Authority of Aeonic Mana Drain seeks to come to fruition.]","...!","Yes!","Just from his preliminary tests with the lividus colored essence, he was gaining understanding in abilities termed Aeonic Anti-Mana and Aeonic Mana Drain!","As the Convergence of Mana and Nullity slowly came to a close, these abilities and more would be in the palm of his hands as they were shown somewhat during the fight against the Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity.","So he focused on the circulation of this essence across his aspects of Existence as he knew that by the time it reached full Convergence...it would remain Unnamed no longer.","This Dynamis of Extremity would gain a distinction as Mana and Nullity would birth something glorious!","'But while all of this occurs...'","His main body which was surrounded by tendrils of lividus colored essence rose its head and stared out into the aurora of lights around him as he connected to his True Sanguine Clone in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","It had continued forging forward after being delayed by Titus and the Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity, but his Will could see a change in the space around him as the Expansive mountains and storms of Nullity and Ruin...were becoming thin.","He was getting past the outer periphery of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands and finally about to delve towards its deeper areas!","—","His True Sanguine Clone had called and kept the Aeonic Planar Xyston of Extremity and the Aeonic Planar Aegis of Extremity on his hands as he became ever familiar with the Offensive and Defensive methods of the Infinite Plane.","His figure looked like a valiant warrior recorded eons ago with the multicolored stellar weapons in his hands, the streams of miniaturized Realities on the end of the Spear and the countless Infinity symbols on the Aegis making his whole demeanor give off oppressive waves of power!","The Sources of Chaos around him weaved over his skin and even sank into it as Ruin and Nullity seemed ever docile- with their density thinning as Noah progressed until soon enough...","SHAA!","He came to a stop before a liquefied wall that mixed crimson and silver together to produce a dull red expanse that stretched out in all directions.","The only thing to be uttered about it was its vastness...as well as the concentration of Ruin and Nullity interlinked together to the extent that it seemed to exceed the aura given off by essence at the 9th Boundary Layer!","Such a wall would isolate and not allow entrance to average Reverend Emperors as only those with multiple Boundaries at the 9th Boundary Layer would theoretically be capable of bypassing it.","But for Noah who even now was still having his soul undergo changes from the boons of the Entropic Entity of Extremity...","BZZT!","His Xyston merely touched the massive liquefied wall of Ruin and Nullity as liquid tendrils emerged to wrap around the Spear, eventually traveling up and latching onto Noah's body as his soul released a deep brilliance! He was then sucked in by the tendrils of liquefied essence as within them, he felt a dense spatial aura of spacetime and...something even more profound!","His body was wrapped in this light as he felt like he wasn't just passing through a wall to go from one area to another.","He felt like he was being transported somewhere else entirely the moment he withstood the tendrils of Ruin and Nullity, an essence of spacetime and something that seemed even more pristine than even the essence of Dynamis of Extremity passed through him as he was shuttled across space!","BOOM!","His soul felt like it was being squeezed as changes were forcibly applied to his body, his size reducing greatly as he materialized in a brand new space.","Yes. Forceful size alteration!","Noah normally had his size interchangeable depending on the area he was in, where he adapted to be as small as a world or as large as a Cosmos or even as immense as a river of Reality depending on the space he was in.","But at this moment, an unimaginably deep and powerful authority seemed to impose itself on him as his size was set akin to his form when he was a human on the blue planet- approximately 2 meters!","And he felt this even more as in the area he appeared in...he felt as if he were a mere ant in the face of its vastness!","Countless crimson and silver tower like obelisks floated in space.","Noah's figure was atop one of these obelisks, his 2 meter size being like a grain of sand as the tower like obelisks ranged to be 100,000 to 1 million times larger than him!","The entire space was lit up brightly with these radiant obelisks that seemed like solidified Ruin and Nullity!","There was no earth below, only endless radiating light with the peaks of other obelisks barely being seen...along with one particularly dazzling feature.","Only a portion of it could be seen as it seemed to be submerged in a heavy darkness, and yet it snaked endlessly behind and forward while disappearing into the dense darkness that surrounded it.","Noah didn't have to stare too hard to know its identity, his eyes releasing a heavy light as he realized what endlessly snaked below him amidst countless obelisks.","It was a mere glimpse of Dissolution.","The Extremity Vein of Dissolution...as well as the authority that enforced itself to forcefully reduce his size!"]},{"number":2372,"title":"Chapter 2372: Chapter 2371 The Vein Of Dissolution! III","paragraphs":["Dissolution!","It wasn't just the name of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution and the distinction of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution.","It turned out to be a pristine authority that exceeded any Boundaries Noah had come across- and it felt even more pristine than the authority of a Dynamis of Extremity!","After all, it was something an entire Haven was named after.","Noah's will was surging to understand it, but he couldn't just pay attention to this as in addition to the dazzling crimson and silver obelisk stretched throughout and the dazzling exterior of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution that seemed to have barely a thousandths of a percentage of itself showing....there were also horrifically powerful auras stretched throughout!","Auras of creatures standing strong atop the obelisks of Ruin and Nullity, with their size not at all being restricted as compared to Noah...they were truly titans.","He initially wanted to call them Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans, but when truly gazing at them...their distinction rose up easily before Noah's eyes as it was one of wonder.","[Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution]","Massive creatures akin to the Aeonic Abyssal Sanctity Leviathans, but their name truly lived up to its meaning this time around as truly...they were Leviathans compared to Noah.","And at this moment, all of them seemed to be staring coldly and lazily forward as none made any moves.","Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution!","Their size wasn't restricted as even the smallest one Noah could see from afar was a hundred times larger than his 2 meter figure, with the largest ones so far occupying a tenth of the peak of an obelisk.","\"Fucking massive.\"","A voice echoed out from afar as it wasn't Noah's.","This was because apart from this dazzling environment of crimson and silver tower like obelisks and the small view of an unbelievably vast Vein wrapped in darkness below, with auras of dozens of massive Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution that could be felt just nearby...there were also auras of Reverend Emperors beginning to materialize or already here!","Noah was delayed just for a little bit with Titus and the Haven Disciples of the Genesis Institute of Extremity, and yet many powerful newcomers had come through as unknown changes had bloomed on the entrance of the Abyss with the fates of the Legions of Noblesse, Lernaeans, and Quasarians unknown- with Noah feeling the auras of other Lineages here!","Many of them seemed to be arriving in real time at this moment with others entering this space around the same time as him, all of them teleported on top of crimson or silver obelisks in the outer periphery as their figures released powerful waves of power.","Many had potent auras like Titus and the Haven Disciples as others felt even more dreadful, but they were all just like Noah where under the authority of Dissolution...they were limited to approximately 2 meters in size!","On the crimson obelisk of solidified Ruin Noah was on, he could even feel new auras arriving every few seconds as each of them were Reverend Emperors.","Beings stemming from outside this Haven!","Their count rapidly increased and ballooned upwards as the Initiation of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution truly drew too many beings from other Havens!","Titus was only leading one of the Groups from the Genesis Institute of Extremity as there were multiple other groups, and this was only a single faction within the Aeonic Haven of Genesis.","Multiple other clans just from the Aeonic Haven of Genesis sent their Reverend Emperors over as apart from this Haven...there were also beings from a myriad of Factions of different Havens among the Seven Aeonic Havens!","This was why their numbers were plentiful as the auras of a few hundred could already be felt by Noah.","Some in particular were more dazzling than others, with some being low key as around this same time- Noah also recognized the aura of Ayame of the Infinite Extremity actually materialize on the same crimson obelisk as him- those entering near the same region across the liquefied wall that divided domains seemingly clustered together atop nearby obelisks!","The one who had spoken and allowed his voice to stretch out all around came from a silver obelisk to Noah's right, this being rising in the air with magnificence and confidence at this moment as below his feet, a rotating blue runic magic circle could be seen radiating a profound light.","On the same obelisk, others similar to him could be seen with a variety of colored runic magic circles rotating around the base of their feet, their bodies giving off terrifying waves of power at the Unequaled Reverend Emperor level!","\"Friends from across the Havens...\"","WAA!","His voice continued to stretch out towards all those on the obelisks and those arriving as his visage was exceedingly handsome to look at, his hair shining with a stellar white and blue luster as he was adorned in a cerulean mage's robe that gave off an aura exceeded EPOCH Relics!","\"I am Phos of the Extremity of Light from the Aeonic Haven of Helios...\"","He gave a devilish bow towards all being here as he rose with power and unbound confidence, his voice continuing to echo out.","\"...We've all come from extremely faraway Lands to seek our destinies within the Initiating Extremity Vein of Dissolution. So why don't we make the rules of engagement clear? After all, we stem from many different powers across these Havens and we don't want to spark an all out war between each other with the extinction of any parties.\"","...!","His words caused the expressions of many to turn sharp and somber.","The confidence and power he released was genuine.","After all, he stemmed from a Haven as old as Genesis- the Aeonic Haven of Helios and even further stemmed from the Extremity of Light!","An inheritance so extremely deep and unfathomable that it was one of the few untouchable ones in the Aeonic Haven of Helios.","There were few others like it...but they were there nonetheless.","It meant that among those listening, there were beings similar to this being in stature if not higher!","And one such being spoke out at this moment as her figure rose, the crimson horn on her forehead shining brilliantly as she spoke out with utmost regality.","\"Oh? And what rules of engagement will the Fanatics of Light present today?\"","WAA!","Eyes and Wills buzzed as many auras came to focus on the obelisk Noah was on, and the rising figure of Ayame of the Infinite Extremity!","With the appearance of these beings here and the many more still entering, the landscape of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution was slowly changing.","From its relative peace and quietness, things were beginning to erupt with chaos all around as a great number of beings turned their attention onto its Initiating Extremity Vein of Dissolution!"]},{"number":2373,"title":"Chapter 2373: Chapter 2372 The Vein Of Dissolution! IV","paragraphs":["Utterly massive Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution silently stood atop floating obelisks in the distance while existences stemming from different Havens gathered.","Noah stared calmly at all of them while observing the best possible paths for him to take, with him currently gathering information as his Will and the Wills of many beings here locked onto the figure that had risen to address others!","Phos of the Extremity of Light from the Aeonic Haven of Helios!","The magic circle beneath his feet radiated Light through his body as he seemed too dazzling for any others here, his hair shining with a stellar white and blue luster as even when Ayame of the Infinite Extremity rose up and spoke, he remained unfettered.","His smile only became wider as he continued.","\"Friend from the Infinite Extremity...I simply feel great benevolence towards others here, which is why I propose this to actually be in their favor.\"","\"Oh?\" Ayame's stellar crimson horn shone sharply as she smiled back at this being who continued with an unfettered momentum while nodding.","\"Yes. There are those like me and you from Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity that have deep histories and power across the myriad Havens. Others cannot even touch us in power alone, not to mention the Inheritances that stand behind us.\"","...!","Yes!","Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity!","Factions that were stretched out across eons and had their accomplishments Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity in abundance!","Factions with dense reserves of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and terrifying beings that had reached Extremity.","They reigned above other Inheritances and Factions as the Extremity of Light that Phos stemmed from and the Infinite Extremity that Ayame stemmed from were some of them.","And they knew it.","Phos knew the power and weight he held, and the even greater power behind him.","And he wasn't alone because as he spoke...other distinguished groups atop crimson and silver obelisks from Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity also rose up with grandeur and power as they seemed to agree with the words of Phos!","\"The discrepancy between us is too large. So to prevent any mishaps...those of us from Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity will make a move first and retain ownership of any upcoming Extremity Panaceas. Once those from the Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity have obtained a sufficient number of Extremity Panaceas, the rest can begin to make moves.\"","WAA!","A devilishly charming smile was present on Phos as if he had ushered forth a truly magnanimous solution.","Groups from the Genesis Institute of Extremity and other factions that were a level below Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity adopted somber expressions as their eyes turned sharp.","\"Oh my...\" Ayame had a surprised expression on her face as she nodded while placing her fair hand on her chin thoughtfully, her fiery red gold strands of hair seeming like burning flames as she spoke out mockingly.","\"...How very magnanimous of you. As expected of one of the Fanatics of Light. You always seek the best interests of others.\"","Her tone was clear in its mocking and disdain.","Those from the Extremity of Radiance had their eyes turn sharp as the magic runic circles below their feet turned, but Phos kept his charming smile as he looked at Ayame.","He gazed at her stellar crimson horn and exceedingly beautiful face as he knew her identity.","How could he not?","Even though she was from the Aeonic Haven of Genesis, Phos and all other prominent beings from Aeonic Inheritances of Ultimacy knew those rivaling them as their factions were not isolated over the eons- many meetings occurring between them as the last time he saw her...was less than a hundred years ago during the Centennial Exchange of Extremity.","A gathering when prominent powerhouses of Inheritances exchanged their ideologies and power, showing the extent their Limits took them towards Extremity as all those in the Boundary Expansion Realm could participate!","Reverend Emperors had their own stage.","Apex Aeonic Lifeforms had even grander stages as their exchanges were the highlight whenever they occurred- drawing an immense number of audiences and powerhouses.","Phos remembered seeing this crimson horned existence from the Infinite Ultimacy in the last Centennial Exchange of Extremity.","He didn't meet her in battle, but he saw her unrelenting might as she dominated one prodigy after another from multiple Inheritances before she grew bored and was escorted away by an Existence that had reached Ultimacy before the matches even ended!","An existence that had reached Extremity...was escorting her!","So even as she spoke mockingly right now towards him, he raised his hand and calmed those below him while keeping his devilish charm.","\"Yes, I am simply thinking about the positions of other Inheritances and giving them a way out. They can't match up to us in power, and even if they did...would they dare fight seriously to injure or even kill those from Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity? Their whole Lineages and Inheritances would be erased as where is the fairness in that? So they can only wait their turn until all those from the Aeonic Inheritances of Ultimacy obtain their Extremity Panaceas, then they can fight amongst themselves thereafter...\"","...!","His words resounded all around as many other groups gazed on coldly while not saying a word.","Others clenched their fists, but when they truly thought about it- he wasn't wrong!","Ayame's scoffing expression became that of displeasure as she stared towards Luminance and other groups that gazed on coldly from Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity, traces of disappointment swirling in her eyes as she was about to speak once more when...","\"Ah, what about me though?\"","A voice rang out from the same obelisk she floated off.","A voice that didn't carry an ounce of fear as it even vibrated immense regality and grandeur.","It stemmed from a devilishly handsome man letting off a radiant glow of an Emperor- a stellar multicolored spear and shield grasped on each of his hands as he looked like a gladiator from ancient times!","He spoke off freely as in the surrounding space, Entropy began to rise as chaos slowly built up!"]},{"number":2374,"title":"Chapter 2374: Chapter 2373 The Vein Of Dissolution! V","paragraphs":["\"Ah, what about me though?\"","The tone of these words was too damn calm and carefree.","To Phos, it felt even worse than hearing the words of Ayame as his eyes and the eyes of many turned towards a certain crimson obelisk.","An obelisk where the True Emperor of Quintessence began to rise in the air while looking towards Phos and the others head-on!","The words felt mocking.","It felt as if this being didn't have an ounce of fear towards Phos and or what Inheritance stood behind him!","\"Who the fuck are you?\" The happy expression on Phos disappeared from being interrupted by a nobody as he spoke with a cold smile.","Others watched on with intrigue as they knew the power of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity well, and no being would dare to insert themselves in a situation like this unless they had backing...or they were extremely dumb!","Since all of them were existences that had lived for a great deal of years and pondered on Extremity, they gave a benefit of the doubt towards the former as many eyes watched on sharply.","Was it another being similar to the crimson horned Ayame from an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity, or...","His voice was magnetic as it rang out clearly for all beings to hear.","\"I don't belong to any big Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity nor any Inheritances outside this Haven like you all. I'm just an aboriginal from this Haven of Dissolution as I wonder...when do you think I can make a move to also obtain the Extremity Panaceas stemming from the Initiating Extremity Vein of my home Haven?\"","WAA!","The space filled with crimson and silver radiance brightened up evermore as many Wills came to focus on Noah.","His eyes carried no trace of fear as his words felt carefree!","As if in this domain, nobody could even touch him!","\"Hah...\" Phos shook his head and laughed with a hint of disbelief at the words uttered out as the magic circle below his feet shone with even greater brilliance, his smile turning cold as he looked towards Noah with a hint of playfulness.","\"I thought all Aboriginals were left behind in the outer fringes before even getting here so I didn't consider you, little guy. Naturally, you can have your chance to fight for the opportunities after all of us here get what we need. And just a warning before you open your mouth again- I will tolerate your initial disrespectfulness, but anything more than that...\"","BZZT!","Terrifying waves of Haki barreled out from him that caused those nearby to feel a sense of dread.","They contained the essence of over a dozen Boundaries at the 9th Boundary Layer along with a hint of something else that was unknown...the mere waves of the soul of this being released in the form of his Will causing others to feel stifled as his Aeonic Soul Values seemed to exceed the normal bounds of Reverends!","\"Oh?\" Yet the being this was directed to remained floating undaunted.","Ayame watched on as an intrigued smile rose on her face, while prominent Reverend Emperors from other Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity watched on calmly and lazily, while Phos and other groups from the Aeonic Haven of Helios watched on coldly!","And under the gazes of all these beings in front of him as well as the completely unmoving Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution situated on obelisks behind him, he spoke out grandly.","\"Well, it seems I must make a proposal as well...\"","His devilishly handsome features became apparent to all as the aura of Quintessence began to swirl around him.","\"...You see, I think the discrepancy between me and you all is much too large, and I do not wish to accidentally butcher any fools from Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity while I'm seeking the Extremity Panaceas. So I shall move first and retain ownership of any upcoming Extremity Panaceas, and once I feel like I've gotten enough...then you all can begin to make your moves.\"","...!","BOOM!","His words were akin to a thundering hammer that smashed into the surroundings, with the Reverend Emperors here having to confirm they heard correctly as their eyes constricted at such a development!","And this being wasn't done as he continued, his tone seeming sincere as if he was only speaking the truth!","Something everyone also noticed was how his words...seemed to be very similar to what Phos of the Aeonic Haven of Helios had said!","\"I'm only thinking about the positions of you fools from all these different Inheritances and giving you a way out. After all, if you start dying towards me and your whole teams get wiped out, would your Inheritances be able to handle my fury when they inevitably come seeking revenge? Can you imagine it? Can you imagine your Extremity of Light and other Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity all wiped out just because a dumb fuck like you decided to float up and commence speaking gibberish? So, you should really hold off your opportunity as when I'm done taking however many Extremity Panaceas I need, you can fight together for what remains. How does that sound?\"","\"...\"","Immense silence descended.","Utter and intense silence!","Ayame's pink lips opened into an \"O\" as even she was dumbfounded!","She had seen through the power of this being and knew where he came from, but for him to just speak like this...","\"Haha!\" Laughter couldn't help but escape her lips at this development!","'The True Emperor of Quintessence, huh? Well, you have the balls for it, I'll give you that!'","An additional hint of interest was added in her mind when it came to this being, but even though she reacted half-heartedly...there was the being that these words were directed to.","There was Phos of the Extremity of Light from the Aeonic Haven of Helios.","This being's facial muscle muscles trembled as the magic runic circle below him released a blinding radiance, all other groups from the Extremity of Light exploding with such blinding glow as their facial expressions turned from coldness to rage and killing intent!","But...this wasn't all.","Noah didn't just attack Phos with his words.","He attacked the Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity behind him...and the Inheritances of all those here who went with his words or didn't speak out against him!","He effectively talked back against beings that nobody ever talked back against...and poked a group of utterly powerful beings nobody would ever dare to even touch!","This...was taboo!"]},{"number":2375,"title":"Chapter 2375: Chapter 2374 The Vein Of Dissolution! VI","paragraphs":["He spoke against existences that normally never had anybody speak against!","He defamed the name and distinction of the Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity!","The being affected the most by this was Phos, with Noah's eyes staring directly at him when he spoke.","The gaze of this being turned utterly hostile along with multiple other groups from the Extremity of Light...and even some groups from different Inheritances!","But...there were over half of all the Reverends here who remained utterly still and watched on coldly.","Some held truly deep and ancient Inheritances similar to Ayame as even events like these seemed beneath them, one such group being 10 Reverend adorned in pure pink robes.","A runic etching of a flower petal could be seen for their pupils as they gave off an overabundance of life and power!","A Reverend Emperor positioned last within this group spoke up at this moment in a way that only those around him could hear.","\"Did he really just say that? For him to actually have the gall...\"","Anger could be seen rising on his face as before he could continue...","\"You dumbass, that's not what you need to be thinking of.\" A prominent voice cut him off as the being that had spoken prior turned very respectful towards a man with a demeanor of a long standing Emperor in the lead of this group.","\"Senior Brother Atlas...\" He spoke cautiously as he waited for this being whose hair and brows shone with a stellar pink color to continue speaking.","\"You shouldn't be thinking along the lines of that he actually had the gall to say what he said. Your line of thought should be the fact that he knows about Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity and sees the sheer power of all beings here, and regardless of all that....he still said what he said. What does that mean?\"","WAA!","A profound light of power shone in the flower petal pupils of Senior Brother Atlas as he asked this question, the junior brother behind him hesitating briefly before he replied with firmness!","\"It should be that he's somehow confident to say that and come out unscathed. Does he actually have a backing?\"","\"You're finally getting some sense. And it doesn't matter if he has backing or not. No being that has cultivated to the stage of a Reverend would suddenly turn suicidal. So for him to do what he did, he is either baiting others to attack him, or he is simply someone potent enough that he took offense to the words of that fool and couldn't just sit back. Either way...it has nothing to do with us. Understood, Junior Brother Jax?\"","...!","His gaze was unshakable as he questioned, Jax nodding powerfully soon after as this group of beings stared closely at what was unfolding before them, their Wills also ready to act as they looked at the Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution and the region past the many Obelisks.","They stemmed from another Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity with extremely deep history, their grandeur also rooted in the Aeonic Haven of Helios as they stemmed from the faction known as The Plum Sword of Extremity!","The one termed Senior Brother Atlas gazed towards Noah as he crossed his hand behind him, speaking as if he was imparting lessons to the Junior Brothers and Sisters behind him.","\"In the vastness of Extremity, there are countless oddities, anomalies, and even Mutated Entities. When you see something that doesn't necessarily make sense, do not be so quick to anger or have your pride take over rationality. Just in this domain right now, there are likely multiple beings like me with a Mutated Aspect of Existence or special in their own way, with power exceeding what normal Unequaled Reverend Emperors can muster. Don't be so quick in seeking death by jumping on every little thing...death will come soon enough.\"","WAA!","His words resonated in the minds of others from the Plum Sword of Extremity as they nodded and watched on carefully!","This group of beings wasn't the only one as over half of all Emperors here maintained aloofness and calmness in this situation, whether they stemmed from Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity or not.","They knew their purpose here and would act accordingly as events unfolded, many choosing not to jump headfirst into a situation with a lot of unknowns!","Some of the more potent beings who were offended by Noah's words...even sat back and watched to allow others to test him before they decided to make any moves or not!","But...there were still those whose pride was stepped on enough for them to act regardless of the background of everything.","Among all Reverend Emperors here, the one who felt as if all gazes gathered onto him and his standing after he was rebuffed by an mysterious being...Phos was the first one to make a move as his voice boomed out.","\"I care not what backing you have...the dignity of the Extremity of Light cannot be stepped on.\"","...!","Brilliance flashed.","The magic runic circle below his feet radiated pristine splendor as in the next second, his figure entirely disappeared.","[Superluminal Burst]","His voice was the only thing that could be heard as thereafter...","BOOM!","A heavy and dense impact that would eviscerate any normal Unequaled Reverend Emperors resounded as the visage of Phos appeared right before Noah, his fist covered by layers of light as his speed...was utterly monstrous!","Superluminal!","Speed that far, far exceeded light.","It was something all beings stemming from the Extremity of Light located in the Aeonic Haven of Helios were very prideful of.","Speed that their enemies couldn't even match as when they attacked, the battle was usually over!","And yet...","Phos's eyes became ever sharper as he saw this being's eyes actually follow him, where he was even able to react and bring his shield up to meet his punch at this very moment!","Booming tendrils of essence surged between the two of them as the stellar entity holding the Spear and shield didn't move a step back, while the power of Phos seemed fixed as glow and light overflowed around him!"]},{"number":2376,"title":"Chapter 2376: Chapter 2375 The Vein Of Dissolution! VII","paragraphs":["Phos was surprised.","But opposite to him, Noah was also surprised as he gazed at the being before him.","His Shield was surrounded by the metallic blue luster of the Unknown Dynamis of Extremity, and yet this being opposed it without losing to it due to a dense layering of essence that covered his hand!","Essence that contained over a dozen Boundaries weaved together in a fantastical way as they bore fruit to something even greater- whatever this something was being the factor that actually allowed this being to clash with Noah.","Granted, the Convergence of the Unknown Dynamis of Extremity had not even come close to 100% as this Essence was not complete, but it was capable of rivaling and even penetrating Apex Aeonic Soul Totems!","What did Phos from an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity have that Titus from a lesser Inheritance didn't have?","Noah looked at this being closely as even while standing before him and feeling the pulsing immensity of a Energy of Extremity- whether he recognized it or not, this being was fearless.","His billowing blue robe and pulsing runic lights made him look like a Battle Magi from ancient times as he pulled his hand wrapped in layers of essence while he spoke out.","\"There are anomalies and Mutated Entities out there who believe themselves to be the best.\"","WAA!","\"You may have thought this way and decided to say what you said, but even if that may be so...you did not just denounce me. You denounced many beings here and the Inheritances behind them as whatever power you may hold...I am not alone.\"","...!","As he spoke, dozens of lights flashed as heavy auras moved.","Those from his Extremity of Light were the fastest as dozens surrounded the whole periphery in an instant.","Then other Inheritances from the Aeonic Haven of Helios moved as soon after...multiple other groups followed suit!","Yes, many of the powerful Unequaled Reverend Emperors here did not make a move.","Many simply sat back and watched the show.","But the provocation Noah had uttered out was still one that some of these prideful beings could not take lying down!","They knew that many terrifying Entities existed out there, but they still didn't fear as each of them was in a group that came from powerful Inheritances.","And there were multiple groups here each more terrifying than the last as there was strength in numbers!","And the strength of groups of Unequaled Reverend Emperors from Inheritances across the Aeonic Havens...was utterly dreadful!","\"Since the grandeur of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity does not seem to be known in this Aeonic Haven of Dissolution, let us use you as an example to instill it while reminding all others. There is a reason why we remain Recorded throughout History. There is a reason why we lead the masses towards Extremity. For you to disparage us...is to disparage the very concept of Extremity itself!\"","BOOOM!","\"Apex Aeonic Relics will not save you. Apex Aeonic Soul Totems will not save you...even the intrusion of a genuine Apex Aeonic Lifeform will not save you. Not from us.\"","...!","His voice was magnetic as atop the obelisk Noah floated on, a few hundred immense powerful existences gathered and placed their scrutiny on a single being- something that even the renowned Mutated Entities here wouldn't want to face as some watched with curious eyes from afar.","In the midst of it all was Noah.","Carrying his Xyston and Aegis, he floated at the center of this all as he seemed like an indomitable champion undaunted by the reality around him!","Why did he react and say what he did towards the ridiculous words of Phos?","Firstly, his nature as the Tyrannical Emperor- as the True Emperor of Quintessence...didn't allow for him to simply follow the commanding words of another and take a step back to not seek Loot!","The other...was that he needed the pressure.","Providence showed many paths as this particularly difficult one...was the one that guaranteed his complete Convergence of Manadynamics and Nullity to come the fastest.","If he could survive it that is!","And when it came to the tools of survival he had at his disposal, there were already many.","And at this very moment, Providence and Destiny told him he was about to get an even grander tool!","—","At the depths of the Infinite Plane, within its very Source of Reality.","Noah's main body was releasing milky waves of multicolored radiance as his Origin was undergoing major remodifications currently.","Apart from the tower-like First Plane of Extremity that was contained in its own continuum, an even more massive and grander domain began to come together above it as it utilized the Templates of its Minor Planes to begin the establishment of Major Planes of Existence!","Above the First Plane of Extremity, the Second Plane of Extremity began to form as the Templates of 9 Dimensional Realities that would grow to become Major Planes were being built one singularity after another as Noah send in the essence of all Planar Origin Panaceas he obtained from his recent enemies, with his bound Sources of Extremity also acting to spur the formation, expansion, and reinforcement of the sprouting Planes as the essence of his Boundaries permeated throughout!","The Essences of his Sources of Extremity.","HOONG!","When all the Sources of his enacted Boundaries wrapped around the Templates of Planes of the Second Plane of Extremity along with their prior connection to his First Plane of Extremity...immense radiance overflowed as prompts rose before his eyes.","[You have stably bound 36 Sources of Extremity with your expanding Origin.]","[The Completion of the First Plane of Extremity and the Initiation of the Second Plane of Extremity through the same Planar Templates has given birth to a Quintessential Feature linked to your Sources of Extremity.]","[The Feature of Quintessential Clones of Extremity stemming from bound Sources of Extremity has been used as the basis.]","[The Quintessential Feature of Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Reification has been born.]","...!","Immaculate multicolored splendor was released from his Origin as his Sources of Extremity began running wild.","The reason was a simple one!","[Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Reification]:: A feature that allows your Origin to manifest and summon their bound Sources outwardly in the forms of autonomous Reified Sources of Extremity. These manifestations can move according to your will as they will represent their Source of Extremity to the fullest, their Damage and Defense Values varying from your main body depending on the Source of Extremity they represent as the Values may be Quintessentially greater or lesser. Since they are isolated forms of Extremity, their focus is on locating and ascending their own Source towards Extremity- with all prior abilities of Quintessential Clones of Extremity retained by the Reified Sources of Extremity. When adding the essence of the Unnamed Energy of Extremity to their composition, they can absorb and assimilate the conceptuality of other Boundaries they come across into themselves to get ever closer to Extremity...]","[...The forms that the Reified Sources of Extremity take are determined during their conception and heavily influenced by the nature of the Boundary they represent. Once a sufficient number of Reified Sources of Extremity have been called out, the name of the feature will change from Unrecorded to Recorded Aeonic Extremity Reification. Summoning the Reified Sources of Extremity comes at no cost to you, and upon facing True Death, they will only be recalled into your Origin and hibernate for a day before they can be manifested again. Current number of Reified Sources of Extremity that can be summoned- 9. As your Origin continues to grow, more slots will be accessible as manifesting the Reified Sources of Extremity of your Boundaries simultaneously is a possibility...]","...!"]},{"number":2377,"title":"Chapter 2377: Chapter 2376 Reified Sources Of Extremity! I","paragraphs":["Reified Sources of Extremity!","The workings of the Quintessential Clones of Extremity were incorporated into this feature as through it, Noah could call out manifestations of the very Boundaries that made them.","But just how different were these manifestations compared to the Quintessential Clones of Extremity?","There was a great deal to learn about them, but Noah already noticed three things from the description.","They could quite literally absorb the essence of other Boundaries to raise their own progression towards Extremity, it was of no cost to him, and that even upon facing True Death...they would only be recalled into his Origin to Hibernate as they wouldn't truly die!","These three factors alone were dreadful enough, but Noah felt like there should still be more.","Providence told him so!","So as his main body began constructing his Second Plane of Extremity and created an even grander foundation, his Will moved to test out exactly what this newly risen feature held in store.","After all, it should have even grander things in store than what was simply stated in the description!","—","Stellar crimson and silver obelisks floated grandly in space.","The auras of powerful beings were raging in abundance as far from the obelisks they were clustered atop of, massive Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution watched on coldly as even at this moment- they didn't make a move!","These massive titans were hundreds and thousands of times larger than the Reverend Emperors here who were restricted to an average of 2 meters, seeming like entire islands or world sized Beasts to them as some Reverend Emperors felt their destinies ring out warning bells.","But the Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution never made a move so far.","It was as if they were waiting for something.","Something that had yet to occur!","The space that was most active in this region had a few hundred Unequaled Reverend Emperors surrounding one Entity who gazed at all of them fearlessly.","The cold expression on Phos of the Extremity of Light was even more pronounced along with those from the Aeonic Haven of Helios who chose not to take Noah's words lying down.","He looked at all of them and their massive numbers as towards Phos's words of him being outnumbered no matter his strength...he smiled as he looked around him.","\"And who said I was alone?\"","...!","His words caused the cautious Reverend Emperors to look around, only to see no beings coming to aid Noah as their eyes became even sharper!","Ayame was off to the side as she pondered while looking at the show with interest, but even she didn't make a move.","Before any moment could pass, a dark light flashed from Noah's body.","Dazzling waves of authority erupted out as he spoke grandly.","[Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Reification]","WAA!","A feature was activated. No resources were paid as his Origin spun with utmost glory!","And he then spoke out which concept of his was to be proclaimed and reified.","[Entropy]","[Manadynamics]","[Nullity]","[Ruin]","[Dream]","[Apollyon]","[Loot]","[Blood]","8 concepts were called out one after another as blaring auras of dreadful might bloomed like singularities around Noah!","And from the Initial magnitude of the singularities alone...they seemed to exceed the limitation of mere two meters that the terrifying authority of Dissolution was imposing on all beings here!","And after calling out 8 names, Noah spoke the last one with most regality.","[Quintessence]","WAA!","Blindingly oppressive waves of power erupted that caused the Reverends nearby to back off as the scene gradually became clear.","The first one to appear released dreadful obsidian waves of essence as a prompt rose!","[The Harbinger of Entropy- Bellicus, has been Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.]","...!","Stellar tendrils of black light surrounded the apparition.","Rivers of Entropic reality could be seen coming together to form the musculature and backbone of a beast reminiscent of a Singularity Traversing Quantum Warhorse, it's body forged from rivers of entropic Realities as atop it...the visage of a devilishly handsome man held its reigns.","His face seemed like an aged version of Noah as he was donned in a crystalline black armor, strands of dark hair falling past his shoulders as the pupils within his eyes...they constantly rotated with clusters of tens of singularities!","His gaze was cold and dreadful as when he appeared, Noah finally understood more of the features of the Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Reification.","[The Harbinger of Entropy- Bellicus, has been born from the Source of Entropy as he can exhibit 3x your main body's Aeonic Soul Damage Values and only half of your Aeonic Soul Defense Values]","[Bellicus shall only draw upon Entropy for all of his resources as he seeks to unleash extreme chaos.]","...!","Yes.","The other crucial aspect that was written in the description of the feature of The Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Reification, but not clearly understood.","No cost to Noah.","No cost in calling them forth, and no cost in his Aeonic Soul Values or Resources as the Reified Sources of Extremity drew upon their own independent reserves from the concept that made them!","They could be utilized on the battlefield and be sustained without Noah having to even lift a finger! Not to mention...the Damage Values of the dazzling Harbinger of Entropy were deemed to be 3x as high as Noah's.","And the more amazing thing...was the magnitude of Bellicus.","This older version of Noah was over 200 Meters in magnitude as he was more than 100 times larger compared to Noah's own True Sanguine Clone and other Reverends here- the authority of Dissolution that was imposed on all beings here not falling upon it!","And why was this?","Unlike the existences here, the Harbinger of Entropy was not a lifeform.","He was a concept.","He was a Source of Extremity!","[OOOOOH!]","Seated upon a Singularity Traversing Quantum Warhorse, Bellicus bellowed out with utmost fervor as an instant later...","[The Recorded Apocalypse- Aeonic Plane Cataclysm, has been called forth.]","[The Unrecorded Apocalypse- Entropy's Feast, has been called out.]","...!","The terrain began to change a moment after his appearance.","And he...was just one of 9!"]},{"number":2378,"title":"Chapter 2378: Chapter 2377 Reified Sources Of Extremity! II","paragraphs":["[You have obtained the Title of The Harbinger of Entropy- Bellicus]","Amidst the appearance of a massive being similar to him in appearance, more and more prompts cascaded over Noah's eyes as this Source of Extremity was merely among the first that he had called out.","After the blazing eruption of apocalypses that Bellicus ushered forth, those summoned thereafter manifested one after another.","[The Arcane Haven Source Engine has been Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.]","[The Arcane Haven Source Engine has been born from the Source of Manadynamics as it can exhibit 3x your main body's Aeonic Soul Damage Values and 3x your Aeonic Soul Defense Values, with all resource requirements for its abilities reduced by 95%]","[All other Reified Sources of Extremity will be supported in resource usage so long as the Arcane Haven Source Engine is active.]","From Manadynamics, a terrifying Engine came out as a circular construct of pure blue light manifested, countless runic lines interweaving around it as this...was a Source Engine that could run a type of Haven!","Tendrils of pure blue light weaved on its cerulean surface as it seemed like a burning blue sun that blinded all eyes.","HOONG!","Waves of shockingly pure essence emanated out as in the surroundings, a storm of cerulean grandeur blooming out.","Arcane.","Similar to the Arcane Mana Entity form Noah could take, the Source of Manadynamics that was manifested held the grandeur of such abilities and more that even Noah had yet to unfold!","And this was only the second Reified Source of Extremity!","A booming sound as if the skies were cracking apart echoed out in the next second as two piercing roars burst the eardrums of weak nearby Reverends.","[The Apocalyptic Haven Dragon of Ruin has been Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.]","[The Apocalyptic Haven Dragon of Ruin has been born from the Source of Ruin as it can exhibit 4x your main body's Aeonic Soul Damage Values and 25% of your Aeonic Soul Defense Values.]","[The Nullified Phoenix of Cataclysm has been Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.]","[The Nullified Phoenix of Cataclysm has been born from the Source of Nullity as it can exhibit 4x your main body's Aeonic Soul Damage Values and 25% of your Aeonic Soul Defense Values.]","The Apocalyptic Haven Dragon of Ruin and The Nullified Phoenix of Cataclysm!","Massive Beasts similar to the Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution from afar manifested as a billowing crimson dragon with wings made of pure Ruin roared out, its crystalline crimson scales radiating a pure aura of Extremity as above its draconian head, a stellar crimson crown of Ruin rotated with power!","Beside it, a silver feathered Phoenix of pristine beauty roared out, silver flames raging around it as a burning crown rotated above it- torrential flames of nullity very soon also engulfing everything around it.","This Reified Source of Extremity and those preceding it all gave off immense waves of power that seemed to approach the massive Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution situated from afar- their very makeup being utterly different from others as they weren't even on the same stage of life as the Reverend Emperors.","And appearing besides these current Reified Sources of Extremity...","[The Dreamer of Extremity has been Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.]","[The Aeonic Demon Emperor of Destruction has been Recorded...]","[The Aeonic Cache Bringer has been Recorded...]","[The Vampyre of Extreme Sanguinity has been Recorded...]","One Reified Source of Extremity after another unfolded to reveal shocking forms as there was one last Singularity that bloomed to eclipse every single one of them.","It was the last name to be called.","It was the last Reified Source of Extremity to manifest, and yet it stood at the forefront of the other 8 that all lined up beside it.","[The Quintessential Emperor of Extremity has been Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.]","...!","BZZZT!","[You have called out the Source of an Unprecedented Lifeform!]","From a distance away, Ayame's expression became grim as she looked towards the manifested constructs of Extremity, but none more than the last one.","None more than the humanoid visage of stellar appearance before them!","Phos and other Unequaled Reverend Emperors also felt a heavy feeling of oppression that they could only feel emanating from the Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution from afar- the 8 prior manifestations only expressing an aura close to it as this one...it felt genuine!","Humanoid in appearance.","Skin shining with the luster of Cosmos and reality as he seemed celestial in nature, his whole body radiating purple blue stellar waves of light.","A sculpted musculature with a head emanating devilish handsomeness that only displayed two bright eyes. Eyes that within their pupils, lemniscate symbols rotated with extreme power and wonder!","Behind him, an aurora of wings of multicolored stellar light radiated glory and power.","He seemed like a life form who only came to be through countless possibilities, his aura alone dwarfing everything as his face was Noah's face...only more Quintessential!","The Reified Source of Quintessence was simply Noah in a more dazzling form.","And the moment the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity appeared, he stared at all the Reverend Emperors around him coldly as their bodies unconsciously buzzed with defensive layers.","But he didn't make a move.","He actually turned around from them and stared at the far distance.","Towards the Extremity Vein of Dissolution.","Towards the massive Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution!","He gazed towards this direction as he was the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity.","To make his name true as it was, his search for Extremity was something other Sources couldn't even compare to!","And towards the distance, he sensed tools to take him ever closer towards Extremity.","Noah's will and Soul were fully infused into this manifested concept as he understood everything with utter clarity.","So...","The hand of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity rose as he instantly took control, ready to command the other Reified Sources of Extremity!","The True Sanguine Clone that was holding an Aegis and Xyston who had called him out actually took a backseat.","Noah's soul fully resonated with the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity as a dreadfully magnetic voice emanated from him.","[I was never alone.]","...!"]},{"number":2379,"title":"Chapter 2379: Chapter 2378 The First Radiance I","paragraphs":["He shone gloriously with stellar purple blue luster as his very skin looked cosmic, his sculpted humanoid form laying itself bare as he seemed like an amalgamation of countless singularities and Realities!","His pupils shone with radiant blue spinning Infinity symbols that seemed to draw in the surrounding essence, the aurora of multicolored wings behind his back radiating pure light while he simply floated there.","He only had the terrifying eyes of spinning Infinity symbol singularities on his face and no mouth or nose, yet his voice still reverberated outwards as it caused the gazes of the Unequaled Reverend Emperors from Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity to turn sharp!","[I was never alone.]","He never was alone.","He had a myriad of versions of himself he could call upon as the moment that the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity was called out, he took center stage!","The True Sanguine Clone that had called out the feature of the Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Reification seemed dim in comparison as his leading position instantly disappeared, Noah's reified Source of Quintessence taking the lead as what exactly was its power?","The others already had fantastic variations in their Damage and Defense Values along with unique capabilities to their nature, but Quintessence...","[The Quintessential Emperor of Extremity has been born from the Source of Quintessence as it can exhibit 9x your main body's Aeonic Soul Damage Values and 9x of your Aeonic Soul Defense Values.]","[The Quintessential Emperor of Extremity can commandeer the unique aspects of any active Reified Sources of Extremity, copy it, and display it outwardly with the full effect.]","[The Quintessential Emperor of Extremity has the capability to initiate the fusion of all current Reified Sources of Extremity- this being the only ability that will pull upon the Aeonic Soul Values of the Main Body. To maintain this state of fusion between all active Reified Sources of Extremity, it will currently take 98% of your Aeonic Soul Values every nanosecond.]","[You have obtained the Title of the Arcane Haven Source Engine.]","[You have obtained the Title of the Apocalyptic Haven Dragon of Ruin.]","[You have obtained the Title of the Nullified Phoenix of Cataclysm.]","[You have obtained the Title of the Dreamer of Extremity...]","Utterly dreadful prompts rose up as at the same time...Noah was reminded of something.","He was reminded that even though he was rising ridiculously fast in a short period of time, his Soul was still very, very young and barely being launched upwards exponentially in power with all the different transformations he went through!","But...it was still not the strongest it could be.","And this was shown more clearly at this juncture as just the act of fusing all active Reified Sources of Extremity took 98% of all of his current reserves of Aeonic Soul Values just for a single nanosecond!","But what did this temporary fusion of the Sources of Extremity mean?","Wasn't that...exactly the path to attain Dynamis of Extremity? One that didn't just involve 2 Boundaries, but the Source of multiple!","It caused Noah's stellar heart to beat with countless possibilities as his hand rose up.","OOOOH!","The moment it did, the 8 other Reified Sources of Extremity buzzed with mad waves of power towards the Unequaled Reverend Emperors encircling them, their size being a hundred times larger or even more compared to the restricted 2 meter average from the Authority of Dissolution as they were a force to be reckoned with!","As for the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity himself...","His aurora of wings buzzed as he began to float towards the deeper region of this domain.","Towards the Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution and the barely discernible pulsing Vein of Dissolution in the far distance!","—","Such a development caused the eyes of many observing existences to react differently.","Seeing the massive statures of creatures called out from the mysterious being holding a shield and spear and the feeling that these beings gave off was enough to allow some beings to form their ideas and opinions relatively quickly!","It was enough to cause many to turn serious, but there was a significant number of beings that still looked at this with curious smiles.","Such beings were those with Mutated Aspects of Existence as they held terrifying confidence and power, or they were simply stemming from utterly dreadful Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity.","Then...there was one particular existence situated on a far floating silver obelisk on the left side.","Other forces that had appeared on the same obelisk as him all moved away when they noticed him, this including those from Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity as he was a being known across the Havens!","An existence that placed among the positions of the top 10 in the last few Centennial Exchanges of Extremity.","Even though there were a great number of distinctive beings who didn't participate in the Centennial Exchange of Extremity over the years, those who did were still distinguished.","And he was such an existence who bulldozed many Unequaled Reverends of Extremity as even though it wasn't confirmed...Inheritances had heard rumors that this being sparred with Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the immeasurably deep and ancient faction he stemmed from!","He laid back on a malleable crystalline white throne as auras of powerful Unequaled Reverend Emperors surrounded his left and right.","His visage seemed towering as even though the authority of Dissolution pressed down to limit all beings to 2 meters, his figure seemed a level bigger than the rest as he was at least 4 meters in stature!","His epidermis was tan as uniquely, white slippers could be seen on his feet as he donned loose stellar white shorts and a blue beach shirt as if he was on a vacation inside a reality made up entirely of cerulean waves of seas!","\"What do you think?\"","His voice was commanding as he spoke to those around him with a smile.","The Unequaled Reverend Emperors to his left and right were decorated in crisp black and white suits that released ancient waves of power that seemed to be at the Apex Aeonic Relic level at the very minimum!"]},{"number":2380,"title":"Chapter 2380: Chapter 2379 The First Radiance II","paragraphs":["Among the Reverend Emperors donned in crisp suits, a particularly dazzling woman moved Apex Aeonic Relic glasses closer towards her eyes as she spoke calmly while looking towards Noah's manifestations!","\"Definitely a Mutated Entity, the potency of Extremity he is currently showing is enough to rival or exceed what the Disciples of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity can bring out due to their Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi. Depending on how much more of his power he is hiding, he could possibly give you a fight...Master Erikson.\"","WAA!","Her eyes were astute as they captured everything, the imposing visage of the man in beach wear increasing in pressure as his smile became ever brighter.","His face was one of utmost beauty and power as dark hair wildly vibrated akin to obsidian Realities, his eyes shining with majesty as he nodded.","\"Possibly, and it seems he caught onto what is to come as well...\"","His magnetic voice rang out again as Master Erikson looked towards the stellar figure of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity whose gaze crossed the far reaches of space towards the region holding the mere glimpse of a pulsing Vein submerged in obsidian darkness.","On the surface of this Vein that seemed to constantly change in structure, a point of singularity suddenly bloomed from it.","A point of singularity. This was how it could best be described as it truly seemed like a budding point of Infinite mass and density- a myriad of lights erupting around it as the dense aura of Extremity could be felt!","And from the budding light...the structure of a flower bloomed.","Immense life force and an ancient air of Extremity spread out from it as at such a juncture, the massive Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution finally began to stir.","\"The budding of the First Extremity Panacea...you all remember the words of The Extremity of Fate on how special the First and Last Extremity Panaceas to bloom are. It appears the quickest, and yet it's the one that is hardest to take a hold of...shall we go fight for it?\"","A smile of power and majesty became ever wider on the imposing stature of Master Erikson as in his laid back attire, he moved forward!","The eyes of many others followed, but one of the first beings who had sensed what had just occurred before it did was already on his way to the very forefront.","It was the stellar being radiating a profound source of Extremity- it was the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity!","As he went towards one direction, 8 other Sources of Extremity staunchly stood before dozens of Unequaled Reverend Emperors who also gazed fervently towards the first radiance of an Extremity Panacea that was surrounded by Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution, but before they could even move towards it...","\"Since you so readily wanted to be first to obtain an Extremity Panacea over all others, let me ensure that you and your Extremity of Light don't even catch their glimpse.\"","...!","From the mouth of the Harbinger of Entropy- Bellicus, terrifying words were addressed to none other than Phos and those behind him as these existences from an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity had their bodies visibly burn with a singular power!","The expression on Phos was a dark and cold one as he was forced to look away from the radiance of the First Extremity Panacea to focus on the 8 manifestations before him, their auras not being something he could ignore as he spoke out powerfully while his body disappeared into glimmers of light.","\"For those who aid us in quickly bypassing and reigning in these enemies before us...the Extremity of Light will not forget your efforts as we will fully support your Apexification through the countless methods on our hands!\"","...!","If a blade wasn't sharp enough to quickly cut something, one could only try to make it sharper as Phos did just this in order to achieve his aims!","—","The spark of the Initiating Extremity Vein of Dissolution had just begun as already, a great number of beings were drawn towards it.","New powers expanded into the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution as the Initiation was merely that- the first step!","Many more steps followed as the Aboriginals who were most influenced by this Haven over the years held slightly more sway in its Destiny, and this was especially so for the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that underwent Apexification in this Haven.","They were linked inexplicably to Dissolution in ways that normal beings couldn't even fathom!","In time, it wouldn't just be Reverend Emperors participating for the waking Vein of Dissolution as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms would get involved sooner rather than later, and due to this...the Lineages within the Haven of Dissolution were experiencing more pressure to join am Inheritance if they weren't already closely interlinked with one already.","The mysterious and powerful Planeswalkers already had a Behemoth supporting them as now, even the Ancestral Lernaeans received word through their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of contact with different Inheritances who sought to absorb them into their folds!","It was a give and take relationship as in exchange for a great deal of boons, the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of their Lineage would work for the linked Inheritance in the times to come.","\"And in the midst of all this...a being rises from our Descendants who wishes to destabilize the unity of Lerneans?\"","A calm voice boomed out from a being who stared towards a far away Abecedarian Sacrarium.","This being was situated in a massive bone armored carriage that was being pulled by a silver feathered Chaoticus Three-Legged Crow, dozens of potent Reverend Emperors accompanying him even though he was only an Aeonic Soul Clone!","Only an Aeonic Soul Clone...but he was a distinguished being that was forced to make a move as the knowledge about the True Emperor of Quintessence spread among the Ancestral Lernaeans.","He was the Soul Clone of the Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor- a being that represented the Wills of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of their Lineage!","And he came here today accompanied by the many advisors and Seers of their Lineage as they had to face a headache inducing being that rose out of nowhere.","\"You're sure of your findings?\"","The Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor spoke out calmly towards a few aged Seers behind him who nodded with clear eyes.","\"Enticements won't work on him, brute force may just result in mutual destruction...with the only possibility of gaining the Consummate Boundaries he holds lying in him getting what he wants.\"","...!","An aged Seer spoke out with grim eyes as silence reigned in the surroundings.","\"Haha, it really seems like you all are telling me to relinquish the seat I took not too long ago. He wants the distinction of the Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor that easily...let's go meet this True Emperor of Quintessence and see where Fate leads.\"","...!","A group of the most potent and authoritative existences in the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage below their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms went towards the Abecedarian Sacrarium where the Last True Emperor lay in wait!"]},{"number":2381,"title":"Chapter 2381: Chapter 2380 Lernaean Lineage Emperor Maximilian! I","paragraphs":["A radiant bone armored carriage that was being pulled by a silver feathered Chaoticus Three-Legged Crow was currently stationed outside the bounds of the Abecedarian Sacrarium, a procession of extremely powerful beings already moving from it and entering the Abecedarian Sacrarium as pristine waves of power emanated from them.","At their forefront, the visage of a man with luminous golden hair and simple white robes could be seen- the air surrounding him being so unique that he made all the Reverend Emperors around him pale in comparison.","With eyes as deep as an endless night, it was Lineage Emperor Maximilian- the Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor!","His Aeonic Soul Clone was escorted by many prominently powerful Ancestors, some past True Emperors of Ages who weren't confident enough to make the leap to undergo the process of Apexification and become Apex Aeonic Lifeforms being among them as they could be considered those with ruling and power within the entire Lernaean Lineage!","A light smile was etched on Emperor Maximilian as he looked at the vibrant far away stretches of Realities and Cosmos within the Abecedarian Sacrarium that looked different today.","\"My authority supposedly stretches across all the Sacrariums we've enacted over the years, and yet when I walk through here today...it feels like I am a guest in my own home.\"","His smile was dazzling as his demeanor was carefree yet extremely noble, his eyes inquisitive piercing everything around him as within seconds of their entry, the True Emperor of Light and a few Elder Ancestors that were already within this Sacrarium appeared to receive them!","\"Lineage Emperor.\"","The Elder Ancestors nodded with respect along with challenging expressions, Maximilian seeing this as he kept his smile while going forward.","\"Speak, what is it?\"","The gaze on the True Emperor of Light was a challenging one as this entire time, he felt like he was walking on pins and needles as he didn't even bring himself to send any additional information into his Automaton as he felt like the will of the True Emperor of Quintessence was pervasively pressing all around!","Even though it was only reporting what happened in the past, he still felt stifled to do it as streams of light emanated from his hands in the form of memories that the Lineage Emperor accepted.","It was memories of none other than the grand actions that occurred not too long ago.","Emperor Maximilian scrutinized through it as his gaze didn't change, only nodding lightly as he continued forward with his procession.","\"He can withstand the might of an essence approaching the level of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms...it should be from a Soul Totem. It means he's already in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands and must have made significant progress to even come across other Lineages as a heavy battle erupted which caused the usage of Apex Aeonic Soul Totems...\"","He spoke calmly as the entire party approached the Abecedarian Observatory that was currently shining grandly with gold sandy light, the potency of a particular decreta expanded to become a Boundary seeking Extremity being extremely potent as the gazes of the incoming Reverends continued to change!","An aged woman beside Emperor Maximilian reached out towards the tendrils of expanding golden sand beginning to appear around them as her voice was a somber one when it came out.","\"This is the essence of the Plane that made me...this is the essence of Dreams!\"","Her voice was forlorn, sad, and unbelieving at the same time as she could feel Dreams in the form of a Boundary with extremely high attainments, and not just this...","\"It feels greater than Innate.\"","BOOM!","Another voice echoed out that affirmed the disbelief many had as truly, what they knew to be the decreta of Dreams...currently lay before them as the immaculate essence of a Boundary.","Their hearts felt inexplicable emotions as this was just one of the many concepts they abandoned along with their homes!","Yet now...","\"Just how did he...\"","One Elder Ancestor questioned what all the others were thinking as they stepped into the Abecedarian Observatory, their feet stably landing on the Consummate Boundary Essence of Dreams that seemed to cover everything right now like a layer of golden earth.","The expression on Lineage Emperor Maximilian remained the same as he felt the sifting golden sands beneath his feet, his gaze kept straight towards the area that held clusters of beings as well as a golden throne.","Sitting upon this golden throne, an Entity of immense focus and dedication could be seen as his devilish charm and handsomeness were enough to cause even Reverends to take a second look!","Golden dreamy robes draped over him as Maximilian gazed over him and the myriad of beings around him, walking forward with his procession as their gazes met.","BZZZT!","Unseen waves of Haki exploded out as it wasn't as much a clash of power or soul force- but merely the prestige and grandeur of two Emperors meeting.","The one seated upon the sandy golden throne had a amazing history and disposition.","The one clad in the white robes walking in was also a being that was chosen above all others in the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage to be its Lineage Emperor!","Interim was the word, but he managed everything below the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and even had an opinion among their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","Who was he?","Stemming from the First Generation of Ancestors like Genesis and many others, he was one of the few to step into the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution- not just to step in it, but he was also the one crossing the Planar Palisades of Extremity who managed to find the nexus in space that led into the Havens of Extremity!","He...was the being that one could say effectively pioneered the Ancestral Lernaeans into the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","Yet he had a very rough history as even with such accomplishments, he had only just recently taken the reins as the Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor.","To this day, he had not touched the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","Yet among all Lernaeans, he stood on par in authority with their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","He was Emperor Maximilian!"]},{"number":2382,"title":"Chapter 2382: Chapter 2381 Lernaean Lineage Emperor Maximilian! II","paragraphs":["Emperor Maximilian locked gazes with the True Emperor of Quintessence, these two beings saying nothing between them as Maximilian came ever closer.","When he was a few meters away from the dreamy gold throne, the Emperor atop it waves his hands to cause the rise of another makeshift throne to appear opposite to him, Maximilian waving his hands behind the procession behind him as all others came to a stop while he proceeded forward.","He looked at the sandy gold throne conjured for him as he actually sighed while sitting down, gazing up to see the visage of Elder Ancestor Ophelia beside the True Emperor of Quintessence before he settled back on this being.","Two Emperors sat before each other as an air of shocking regality wrapped around them, those around feeling a stifling pressure as after these two stared at each other for a few seconds, Emperor Maximilian was the one to speak as his golden strands of hair shone with austere light.","\"I apologize.\"","BOOM!","His first words caused the Elder Ancestors who came with him to be shaken as they gazed forward with incredulity, but Maximilian only continued with a calm expression as he stared towards the True Emperor of Quintessence!","\"It was under my watch that the final verdict was given to the Barren Lands. All responsibility lies with me.\"","WAA!","His eyes were deep and with immense knowledge as he spoke, yet they were also unreadable as one couldn't easily ascertain just what he was thinking!","His words caused the True Emperor of Quintessence to raise his brows while he continued.","\"It was me and my party that initially stepped out of the Barren Lands and found the entry into the Havens of Extremity, and everything that has occurred after that is history. And now, we are at an even more vital juncture of history where after all the mistakes and choices made over the years, even grander ones have to be made. So let me officially introduce myself as one of those who makes these choices...I am Maximilian, born from the Halcyon Singularity Domains of the Quantum Dimension of the Barren Lands, and the current Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor.\"","...!","His grandeur was dominating as all others were breathless after he finished talking, the True Emperor of Quintessence nodding at this moment as he replied.","\"I am the Last True Emperor of the Lands you all had forsaken, the True Emperor of Quintessence- Osmont!\"","The sandy golden earth churned at his mere words as Maximilian nodded with a smile and waved his hands, causing an illusory scene to appear that showed dozens of points of light stretched out across vast stretches of regions.","\"These are all the domains under the Ancestral Lernaeans stretched out across the Haven of Dissolution. Some were strategically found around unique Planes of Existence like this Abecedarian Sacrarium, and others were built atop reserves of unique metalloids used to make our Automatons and Vessels among other things. This...is what represents all of the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage.\"","\"...\"","His phrases gripped all beings here as the Elder Ancestors behind him had worried looks, none of them knowing what Emperor Maximilian was going to say next as nothing he had uttered so far was what they expected!","They had the support of their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","He held the influence of their power...so why exactly was he speaking like this right now?","None of them knew what would happen as at this juncture where all the sacrariums of the Ancestral Lernaeans were shown stretched out across the Haven of Dissolution, Maximilian looked towards Noah calmly and spoke candidly.","\"You see, there's been a great deal of talk amongst us and even the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms on how to...handle you as they called it. How to take care of a being that is supposedly weaker than our strongest forces, and yet we also want the things he has. The mere mention of your demand of taking the reins of the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage has others rising up in arms and roaring out as me personally...I don't truly care.\"","BOOM!","\"Whether you hold me as the only one responsible for the decision of the Barren Lands, I can take on all the punishment for it. It matters not. What does matter...are all these Sacrariums stretched out across this Haven. The quintillions of beings within them. Their hopes and dreams. They are what matter the most.\"","Emperor Maximilian pointed to the illusory images of the Sacrariums he had conjured up as his words caused the Elder Ancestors behind him to rise up while calling out to him!","Yet on his conjured throne...","HUM!","A regal crimson air rose as it was a genuine Bloodline Authority.","An authority afforded only to the Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor as he could actually suppress the Bloodline of those he ruled over!","Those behind him quieted as before him, Noah had an interested smile as even Ophelia was shocked at this unfolding situation.","\"You see, I am going against the words handed down to me by our Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that mainly included threats and reminding you how there were multiple others above you in power, but even they are missing the point.\"","WAA!","His golden hair danced with majesty as seared upon his throne, he truly seemed like a genuine Emperor!","\"Why do we continue to seek power? Is it just for ourselves? Those who think so have lost their direction. Everything I've done so far is for the Lineage. For the countless lives within them. I care not for my own prestige and might as in my life...I will never be able to even touch the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeform.\"","...!","As he spoke, his hands went before his chest as his robe was pulled aside to reveal his fair skin underneath- skin that showed stellar sparkling wonder as one could see...a few Meridians that were twisted and fractured!","Aeonic Extremity Meridians that represented a entity who had failed in their Apexification!","Noah looked at such a entity curiously as Providence told him his phrases were genuine!","\"For the sake of all Lernaeans, I have no qualms stepping down after my failures, but the only way I would do that is if I have a confirmation from you. Because you see, at this very moment...Inheritances from other Havens have reached out to us seeking our fealty to them. They will divide us and displace us into different regions, and they will throw our lives into the fires of the Extremity Sanctification as they so wish. Towards these factions that have multiple existences that have reached Extremity...how will you deal with them to ensure the abundance of all Lernaeans?\"","...!"]},{"number":2383,"title":"Chapter 2383: Chapter 2382 I Will Forge My Own Inheritance! I","paragraphs":["For the prosperity of all Lernaeans!","Under the burning flames of Extremity Sanctification, Emperor Maximilian knew that the Ancestral Lernaeans would only be more fuel to it by the Inheritances that reached out to them.","He had his own ideas on how to best navigate and minimize the damage of what was to come, while at the same time...obtaining as many boons as possible!","Having an identity connected to an Inheritance with a deep history was also a tool in itself.","Consummate Boundaries. Apex Aeonic Relics. Aeonic Treasures of Extremity.","All of these were already in line to be offered as all that was left was their decision.","So if an existence appeared from their own Lineage who had somehow forged Consummate Boundaries that could elevate the strength of their whole Lineage by another level...a different pathway could open up for them.","Maybe they could forge their own path!","But, all this depended on just what Entity had risen forth from the ashes of the Ancestral Lernaeans.","\"For the prosperity of all Lernaeans, huh?\"","The voice of the True Emperor of Quintessence reached Maximilian as this being held an immovable smile on his face.","He gazed at the Elder Ancestors in the surroundings as he spoke freely.","\"If you can believe it, I never lost any sleep thinking about the prosperity of all Lernaeans.\"","WAA!","\"Just like they never lost any sleep for me and the Barren Lands, I also don't give a damn about them. Let the Inheritances come and rip you all apart. Join their factions as just one of the countless Bloodlines there as within a few million years, the identity of the Lernaean Lineage will be all but erased as they only identify with the Inheritance that took them in. Those that end up surviving anyways...\"","...!","Extremely heavy words left Noah's mouth as immense silence descended in the surroundings!","He didn't bullshit anything as his true thoughts were unveiled without any falsification.","His bright eyes swirled with Providence as he looked at the visage of the Aeonic Soul Clone of the Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor before him.","Maximilian.","A being who had actually failed during his process of Apexification!","Uniquely for him, he had actually managed to survive such an ordeal as within his body, fractured and twisted Aeonic Extremity Meridians could be seen.","He didn't have a path in front of him.","Even being the one leading the party that discovered the entrance into the Havens of Extremity, even being one of the oldest Lernaeans currently in existence...none of it had changed his destiny as here he was now.","He genuinely seemed to care about the countless quintillions of Ancestral Lernaeans due to his cut off path as his being the one chosen to become the Interim Aeonic Lernaean ancestry Emperor was a very fitting choice!","Such a being looked towards Noah as the Lineage Authority still remained leaking from him.","It pressed down on all the Elder Ancestors behind him even though some wanted to erupt at Noah's words, his gaze remaining calm as he seemed to see things others didn't.","He leaned forward from his Throne as he replied with squinting eyes.","\"You don't hold any attachment to the vast number of Lernaeans...and yet you moved your body to stand in front of one of our Elder Ancestors right here when an attack from an Apex Eternal Soul Totem came.\"","His eyes came to land on the terrifically beautiful visage of Ophelia who stood out greatly among the masses currently!","The memories of what had happened prior were shared with Maximilian as towards his words, Noah smiled and gave a light nod.","Yes.","Why did he defend Ophelia? Could this being before him quickly catch on to what he was saying?","\"You don't care for the Ancestral Lernaeans, but if it is anyone who is underneath your rule...you will put your own life on the line for them. You are saying that so long as Lernaeans are under you- along with their long history, their Sacrariums, everything they have built over the eons...only then will they share in your boons and fate.\"","WAA!","Dazzling words emanated out as nobody could say anything else!","Noah reclined on his Throne with a smile as he gazed at the pondering expression on Maximilian.","He had made his intentions clear when the first few Elder Ancestors had arrived.","If they wanted his Consummate Boundaries, they had to pledge fealty!","But now, the new factor of Inheritances came into the picture came.","And this was of utmost importance as Maximilian nodded towards Noah's smile of affirmation while continuing.","\"The Cult of Endless Shadows from the Eternal Haven of Penumbra, the Genesis Institute of Extremity from the Aeonic Haven of Genesis, and the Light of the Seven from the Aeonic Haven of Helios have all sent forth Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to meet with ours. They offer the inclusion of our Lineage into their Inheritances in exchange for our Apex Aeonic Lifeforms working for them after the end of the Initiating Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution, including the ones that rise in the 10 Billion years to come. They offer identity and protection against other Inheritances as the continuation of our Lineage is guaranteed. If you were reigning over Ancestral Lernaeans, how would you manage this?\"","...!","A question that caused the Elder Ancestors behind him to tremble.","What exactly was Emperor Maximilian doing? Why was he entertaining all these words and ideals when talking to this being?!","These were things that were only supposed to be discussed with their Apex Eternal Lifeforms as they dealt with the very future of their Lineage.","Was Emperor Maximilian truly serious...","\"Interesting.\"","Noah's voice echoed out as he rose from his sandy gold throne, the essence of Dreams swirling around him as he stared out into the vastness past even the boundary of the Abecedarian Sacrarium.","\"The Cult of Endless Shadows, Genesis Institute of Extremity...or whatever other legacies out there seeking to spread their influence- why the hell would I join any of them?\"","...!","\"I will simply create my own Inheritance that shall echo its glory across the Havens of Extremity!\"","BOOM!"]},{"number":2384,"title":"Chapter 2384: Chapter 2383 I Will Forge My Own Inheritance! II","paragraphs":["\"I will simply forge my own Inheritance that shall echo its glory across the Havens of Extremity!\"","...!","The words reverberated and resounded from the Abecedarian Sacrarium as their waves of grandeur spread out even further, immense majesty present within them as they shook the souls of all those who heard them!","Enact one's own Inheritance!","What a wild thought!","Current Inheritances had been existing for eons as they held deep histories and reserves of treasures, their experts countless as their support was unfathomable.","Yet for a being who hadn't even become an Apex Aeonic Lifeform to proclaim this...","\"Hmm...\"","Emperor Maximilian also rose up as he stared straight towards Noah's astounding visage.","His body gave off utmost regality and majesty as he also stared at the vast expanse while replying.","\"To be without the support of behemoth organizations that will be backing the Noblesse, Quasarians, and Planeswalkers. To forge our own path in the midst of Extremity Sanctification...well, I can tell you this isn't the path that the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeform were thinking of.\"","He didn't actually rebut Noah or say it was impossible, only that those at the highest seats of power did not have the same thoughts!","\"And what are your thoughts?\" Noah's resonant voice boomed out as he came to focus on Maximilian.","The golden hair on this being shone with a dazzling light as remained impassive while replying.","\"For the best prospects of Ancestral Lernaeans, I would do anything. You have the authority of Dreams and Natural Laws from what I've heard. Will you let me take a glimpse of Providence that we abandoned long ago? I wish to see if this and Destiny can show me which arduous path the Lernaeans should walk on.\"","Maximilian spoke honestly as Noah smiled at his words, the golden light of Providence erupting around him as a Consummate Boundary.","What he could give others power to access, he could also take away.","So he simply gave access to the workings of Providence- a golden light descending on the Emperor that had failed Apexification and now led as the Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor!","—","As a golden glow of Providence descended on him in the Abecedarian Sacrarium, Maximilian's main body was in a vastly different location across the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","Towards the center of the domains they had managed to control over the years.","The earth below was covered by raging waves of a silver sea of Nullity, the auras of countless Chaoticus Beasts swimming within it as the potent aura of Nullity was enough to cause any being in the Boundary Expansion Realm to be careful.","Deep within this silver sea of Nullity, massive crystal mountains stretched throughout its depths as the figures of armored Lernaeans with pickaxes releasing the light of EPOCH Relics could be seen mining the crystalline mountains to harvest materials that would make terrifyingly powerful weapons!","And past these crystalline underwater mountains towards even deeper regions, the boundaries of a Major Plane could be seen.","This was known as the Argentate Sacrarium- one of the most important locations for Ancestral Lernaeans within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!","Within this Major Plane, hidden amongst layers of spacetime continuum where even normal Unequaled Reverend Emperors would be able to find, there was a serene domain filled with calm liquefied streams of Nullity.","Heavy auras of power were currently present within this domain as the Main Body of Emperor Maximilian could be seen sitting on a silver throne, with there being multiple other silver thrones in the surroundings that were empty for the vast majority, but a few currently held the auras of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that were talking amongst each other!","\"The positives in joining the Cult of Endless Shadows is that they're the closest to becoming a genuine Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity after a few billion years. Having the backing of such an Inheritance would ensure our prosperity for the years to come.\"","One overbearing voice echoed out as another one replied dismissively.","\"So what? The Genesis Institute of Extremity stems from the Aeonic Haven of Genesis. One of the Oldest Havens as it's rumored to even be a subsidiary of a genuine Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity. Wisdom tells me this is a much better choice....\"","Discussions were abuzz at this moment as at such a juncture, one gaze focused on Emperor Maximilian as it spoke out calmly, causing silence to descend in the surroundings.","\"Maximilian, you should have arrived in the Abecedarian Sacrarium by now and met with this Mutated Entity that our Lineage bloomed. Will he give back and share the boons of the Consummate Boundaries that fell on his lap...or is he seeking the hard way?\"","BZZZT!","The voice held a tinge of force and malice as it spoke, Maximilian's main body raising its head at this moment as he gazed at the terrifying auras around him.","Some of them used to be his friends.","One was even under him in the party he led that ventured into the Havens of Extremity first.","Yet now, their dispositions and eyes seemed so far above that at times, they seemed alien to him!","He had failed, while they succeeded.","And now, they wondered which place to sell themselves to for the most gain as for them to advance closer towards Extremity- the allure of powerful factions was undoubtedly the best choice!","But was this also the best choice for all Lernaeans?","As the Eyes of multiple Apex Aeonic Lifeforms locked onto him, the Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor voiced out calmly.","\"I met the True Emperor of Quintessence. Instead of binding our Lineage into a faction that will use and divide us, he suggests that we forge our own path. He proposes we forge our own Inheritance.\"","BOOM!","Heavy Wills and Haki erupted out...along with a vibrant laughter filled with a chilling light!","\"Hah! Forge one's own Inheritance? Against Inheritances from Havens that have already undergone Extremity Sanctification and are led by personages that have already reached Extremity? Mere dreams and words of a child! This is why I was against to even holding a discussion with a mere Descendant. Those of our own Blood...we can move against them if it is just to Discipline them. The Extremity Adjudicator would not interfere with something like this!\"","...!","Sharp words boomed out as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform spoke out with a Will filled with disdain and anger!","And at such a juncture, before any more conversations could continue...","\"Since when did we point our swords to our own people?\"","HOONG!","A overbearing aura surpassing many of those here silently appeared as multiple Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms rose up with heavy waves of power and shock.","They soon calmed down though when they saw the appearance of a Lifeform they recognized, with the only difference being his Eyes...they held empty sockets!","It was the True Emperor of Genesis making his entrance as Destiny and Providence were unstably showing things heading in unknown directions!"]},{"number":2385,"title":"Chapter 2385: Chapter 2384 Choices I","paragraphs":["A stellar luster covered his figure as he appeared, the most eye-catching thing being the fact that only sockets could be seen...his eyes entirely missing!","When the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms saw this being, they were greatly shocked as some even had remorseful looks on their faces.","\"Orion...\" A sonorous voice of a gorgeous woman rang out as clad in a pink dress, an Apex Aeonic Lifeform instantly appeared before the True Emperor of Genesis and placed her hand on his fair cheeks.","Tears sparkled in her eyes as she spoke with tenderness.","\"I searched for you high and low, I told them to not care about anything else and wage war on the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of the Noblesse you retrieve you, but we are heavily outnumbered. I...I'm so sorry.\"","Her voice broke near the end as one could sense profound weakness and strength at the same time.","The True Emperor of Genesis gazed towards her calmly as he simply nodded, an action that caused this woman before him to feel like her heart shattered!","He moved past her as he came to stare at the less than a dozen Lernaeans Apex Aeonic Lifeforms here.","Others were still stretched out across the Haven of Dissolution or even within other Havens at this juncture.","The True Emperor of Genesis, Orion, looked at those he considered close friends before as he continued.","\"I come back and the first thing I hear is how we can punish our own people? What has happened, Maximilian?\"","He turned his heart towards the Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor at the end as with an expression of weakness, Maximilian sighed while releasing a burst of light from his hands.","A light that the True Emperor of Genesis accepted as it conveyed a great deal of memories of everything that had occurred recently!","Of the appearance of the True Emperor of Quintessence and the Consummate Boundaries he portrayed!","The moment that the True Emperor of Quintessence perused these memories, his empty sockets brightened up like blooming singularities as a hint of a smile barely appeared on his face before it disappeared.","He turned towards the pristine Lifeforms before him after catching up as the words that left his mouth were utterly cold!","\"When our Descendant rises to correct our mistakes and even hold surprises that can change the very structure of our Lineage, the first answer you all went with was to put him down?\"","...!","The words were criticizing and held a hint of anger that the other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms couldn't bring themselves to speak against!","The vast majority of them couldn't.","But there were still some.","There was still one!","Seated on a throne covered by a violet light, an exceedingly handsome man with vibrant violet hair raised his head calmly as he replied.","\"We've shown great restraint by not making any moves so far. We even showed a Descendant much more respect than he deserves by sending Maximilian to speak with him about all this. If we continue to pamper them and heed their requests as if they are spoiled children...then we will have no power over them!\"","BOOM!","The words were immaculately powerful and even holding a trace of power very few beings here held- a trace of a Dynamis of Extremity!","Those hearing it would feel its dominance and composure, but their perceptive eyes saw that the True Emperor of Genesis- Orion didn't even blink.","A milky white light of even greater quality rose from his body as the surroundings vibrated, heavy waves of Haki emanating out as the aura of yet another Dynamis of Extremity could be felt!","Sensing such deep wonder, many Lifeforms were shocked and joyful in the next instant as the Apex Aeonic Lifeform donned in pink behind Orion came beside him with an utterly happy expression.","\"You've broken through? You fused Genesis and...\"","\"It matters not what I have done.\" Orion cut off her words as he remained cold.","He gazed towards the man surrounded by a violet haze as he continued.","\"We are supposed to work together and build our Descendants ever higher, not think of plans on how we can control them or have power over them.\"","His words caused Maximilian's dark face to lighten up as he and others listened, yet the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeform on the violet throne only adopted an even colder air as he spoke out authoritatively.","\"I think I have earned more than sufficient authority to decide the measure taken on our own Descendants. After all, it is I who currently holds the authority of Apex Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor, not you.\"","WAA!","His eyes shone like grand violet suns as the power he gave off was off the charts!","Interim and Apex!","One was Maximilian who managed the daily workings of all Sacrariums and their workings, and the difference of [Apex] was above this as it was the ruling authority that even made crucial decisions regarding their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","This being atop the Violet throne was the one holding such a title.","Yet Orion stood before him undaunted as he nodded.","\"You are right, Roan. You hold such an authority...but I will ensure that it won't be so much longer.\"","...!","Shocking words left his mouth as he turned around soon after, leaving behind disbelieving Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms along with Apex Aeonic Lineage Emperor Roan whose expression had turned livid!","He watched coldly as the True Emperor of Genesis- Orion, left, and even the fact that the Apex Aeonic Lifeform donned in a dazzling pink dress bit her lips before following right after him.","The rage on Roan's face remained as he coldly looked at the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms on the thrones around him who hadn't even spoken a word.","Even now, their gazes were those of contemplating as they seemed to only be looking for their own opportunities!","He mocked at such a scene and what the return of the True Emperor of Genesis meant, his right hand flashing to reveal a lively Aeonic Runestone that represented a singer character.","It read [Shadows]!"]},{"number":2386,"title":"Chapter 2386: Chapter 2385 Choices II","paragraphs":["The Runestone gave off an ancient air as it was something that represented the identity of a grand Inheritance!","Apex Aeonic Lineage Emperor Roan had received it not too long ago as he had to come to a decision soon for the direction he wanted to have...and the direction of all Ancestral Lernaeans.","'Consummate Boundaries, Treasures to aid in the Convergence of Dynamis of Extremity, the promise of reaching Extremity, the inclusion into an Inheritance that is very soon to become an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity...all in exchange for giving up the boons of Dissolution and sacrificing a few trillion Aeonic Souls to the Endless Shadows...'","A dangerous thought crossed his mind as he thought of the words of the delegation of the Cult of Endless Shadows he had met, and then thought of the Descendant pending his chest and seeking glory who only held a few Consummate Boundaries.","When one compared a Behemoth of an inheritance with countless boons and protection against a mere Descendant who wasn't even an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, was it even a question of what had to be done?","'Fools, all of them! This is why we struggled weakly against the Noblesse for billions of years. This is why we hold a brand of weakness even in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution. I will reform the weak mindset you all have and make sure to elevate Lernaeans to a stage that even the Noblesse, Quasarians, and Planeswalkers will look upto!'","HOONG!","The Aeonic Runestone is his hand buzzed as he infused his essence into it, the Apex Aeonic Lineage Emperor Roan coming to a decision at this juncture.","'And for you to return and try to usurp my authority right away? I will show you that I no longer follow behind your brilliance, Genesis!'","His thoughts were vibrant and filled with a great need for power as he made a choice!","—","Across the folds of the spacetime continuum.","The figure of the True Emperor of Genesis moved extremely fast while another Apex Aeonic Lifeform tried to keep up behind him, his power being stupendous as he arrived where he wished to within a span of a few seconds!","He appeared in a domain of space that had halcyon waves of milky light swirling all around, a massive golden waterfall cascading down in the distance as at the center of this domain, a massive golden cloud floated serenely as it shone the brightest in this whole area.","Atop it, one could see dazzling crystalline treasures, Relics, and even Aeonic Treasures of Extremity seamlessly strewn about as it was enough to make any Reverend Emperor go crazy!","Yet at the very center of it all, the visage of a woman with shocking beauty could be seen.","Hair as gold as the strands of milky light around them, and a fair skin tone that made it seem she didn't seem like she stayed within one place for too long.","A light white robe wrapped around her as one could almost see her blessed figure to its fullest, her countenance that of laziness as she turned her head to see the True Emperor of Genesis!","She scoffed and spoke out lazily as she grabbed one of the shining crystals around her that formed into mountains and crushed it with her white teeth.","\"You actually made it out by yourself, Orion. I told you that you would be on your own if you were foolish enough to go against the Noblesse by yourself. They snatched your eyes?\"","She was carefree and without worries.","She was the owner of the Golden Forge that was enacted within the Barren Lands and the construct that Noah based his Infinite Forge on!","She was Caterina Aurelia Dismukes- Caterina the Great!","\"Aurelia, I've already exhausted myself for too many years trying to change your nature, so I won't even try anymore. But I need your help.\"","His voice was earnest as when the pink dressed Apex Aeonic Lifeform behind him just arrived to hear this, her eyes turned sad and angry as she stared at Orion and Aurelia!","She saw these two beings lock their gazes and ignore her entirely as frustration couldn't help but rise on her face as she came to float beside the True Emperor of Genesis.","Aurelia didn't even spare her a glance as she blinked languidly at Orion while sighing.","\"What is it now?\"","\"The vast majority of the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms reached their stage because of the aid from your Aeonic Forge of Extremity. I need you to exert your influence and have them strip the authority of Apex Aeonic Lineage Emperor from Roan. The times to come are tumultuous and involve Inheritances that hold supreme power. Him holding an authority at this moment to decide the direction of the whole Lineage could put us on a path of destruction, if he hasn't already taken the steps to do so. We must make haste.\"","...!","Words of usurpation echoed out as Aurelia's eyes were finally roused from her laziness, coming to focus on the True Emperor of Genesis as she sighed while nodding lightly.","She then turned towards the Apex Aeonic Lifeform donned in a pink dress beside Orion as she spoke while shaking her head pitifully.","\"Lucia, I've advised you many times to stop chasing after this guy. Can't you see that he doesn't hold any sort of romance in his heart and he only thinks of duty? He's even gone and lost his eyes entirely as you need to cast your stones elsewhere...\"","BZZT!","Arcs of profound Loot light surged from her devilishly gorgeous figure as she rose, Lucia glaring towards her angrily while remaining quiet, which only caused Aurelia to sigh even more!","\"Surrounded by fools all around. Alright, let's go.\"","She waves her hands while yawning as she was about to move from her domain for the first time in quite a while!","Orion nodded as his body buzzed with a milky white light, his Soul beginning to expand a portion of itself outside.","\"One second.\"","A dazzling radiance erupted as an Apex Aeonic Soul Clone was gradually formed, Aurelia raising her brows at this as before she could even ask...","\"A Clone to go meet this True Emperor of Quintessence that has further propelled the current sequence of events. I need to see the state of the Barren Lands myself...\"","...!","Even more choices were made as the paths of many beings crossed.","Countless destinies were intersecting all at once as a bountiful result would arise from it all, with no one being the wiser as to what exactly would unfold under the boiling heat of Extremity Sanctification!"]},{"number":2387,"title":"Chapter 2387: Chapter 2386 The First And The Last True Emperors I","paragraphs":["\"I need to see the state of the Barren Lands myself...\"","The voice of the True Emperor of Genesis- Orion, rang out as his words caused the eyes of the architect of the Golden Forge to sparkle, Caterina Aurelia Dismukes also releasing a golden glow from her body as she spoke lazily!","\"I'm also inquisitive as to what the Barren Lands managed to produce as the last True Emperor. The quality of Emperors over the past Ages has only continued to grow poorer and poorer...\"","A woman laden in gold manifested beside her as the Apex Aeonic Soul Clone turned into a streak of light soon after, her voice being the only thing left behind.","\"Try to keep up.\"","The message was for Orin's Soul Clone that became wrapped in a milky white light while disappearing, its speed no less than Aurelia's close as they disappeared instantly!","The figures left behind were the main bodies of Orion, Aurelia, and Lucia who had a different destination- towards the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Domain where the grandeur of all their powerhouses would be gathered.","The goal was singular.","The usurpation of the current Apex Aeonic Lineage Emperor Roan as in these tumultuous times, his methodology was not something that the True Emperor of Genesis trusted!","—","Genesis.","Orion.","The Eyeless Lernaean.","He had many titles and distinctions, the last one being something that the Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeforms had given him after he had his eyes taken away.","He was always humble as he knew he was never the most talented, fortunate, or smartest of beings!","And he was reminded of this more and more whenever he was around Caterina Aurelia Dismukes.","The True Emperor of Fortune.","The one who had remained hidden in the Barren Lands during the Age of Fortune as she constructed the Golden Forge and did absolutely nothing but enjoy its boons thereafter, achieving the distinction of True Emperor after she accumulated the most fortune within this Age.","When she ascended to the Havens of Extremity, her Aeonic Soul had continued to focus on her Golden Forge as she was initially looked down upon as she never joined any expeditions to seek Aeonic Treasures of Extremity or any explorations, where she actually shut herself off from others and remained secluded most of the time!","Yet the same beings who looked down on her came to find themselves gazing towards her brilliance as over the years as they agonizingly crossed the Boundary Expansion Realm, they found Aurelia to be ascending faster than any of them as she very quickly joined the ranks of the Lernaean Reverend Emperors.","This was when her Boundary of Fortune reached the 9th Boundary Layer as with it and her overly strong soul that had been refined by countless treasures, she transformed her Golden Forge into the Aeonic Forge of Extremity!","A tool that within a thousand years of her achieving it...she underwent Apexification to join the very few Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms at that time.","And since then, she continued her seclusion while simply getting treasures from her unique construct that no others seemed capable of replicating.","She elevated their Lineage ever higher when they begged her to aid some of their most powerful Unequaled Reverend Emperors to become Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","She became one of the strongest pillars of Ancestral Lernaeans, and yet Orion knew she never really joined any battles or wars.","And now as he followed behind the golden magnificence of her Aeonic Soul Clone, he couldn't help but be humbled again as he sighed when he saw the powerful light of none other than a Dynamis of Extremity.","And it didn't seem to only be a single one at that as he was once more reminded that Age wasn't everything!","He was the First True Emperor, and yet even he had fallen behind as this True Emperor that came much later than him seemed unfathomable in her power.","\"Don't dwell on the strength of others and focus on yourself more, old man. When do you plan to reclaim your eyes?\"","Aurelia's Soul Clone spoke towards him without even looking back as Orion was taken out of his reverie, shaking his head as when one looked at his Clone- they would notice the same quality of empty sockets still in place!","\"They will naturally come back to me if I am deserving to see with Clarity again. Before then, I don't deserve them.\"","...!","A small silence descended between the two who were heading towards the Abecedarian Sacrarium as soon after, Aurelia shook her head lazily once more.","\"So stupidly sentimental...\"","SHIING!","She turned into an even faster streak of light that began to pull away from Orion's Soul Clone, their arrival into the Abecedarian Sacrarium imminent as it was the convergence of multiple destinies!","—","Noah's eyes reflected arcs of vibrant light as he watched Maximilian be surrounded by the light of a few Boundaries before he ultimately blared with the shocking radiance of Providence at the 8th Boundary Layer!","This was a very shocking and decisive action as Noah had felt multiple Boundaries sacrificed to make such a thing a reality- even the light of a 9th Boundary Layer that Maximilian held being burnt just to be capable of propelling the Consummate Boundary of Providence to the 8th Boundary Layer.","He stopped here as just with this...it was equivalent to multiple Innate Boundaries even at the 9th Boundary Layer.","\"Ah...\"","The light of Providence shone on his body as he let out a sigh of immense pain and sadness, as if he was one of the few Lernaeans to be the first to realize just how big of a mistake they had made back then when they abandoned the Natural Laws!","Now that he felt Providence again and saw just what grandeur it could unleash...his heart couldn't help but ache at their past actions!","Noah could somewhat understand this reaction, but he didn't sympathize as he continued to plan for his own future.","He turned his head towards the far distance as at this moment, he could feel the Infinite Plane that he was intimately connected to moving across the Planar Palisades of Extremity and remaining utterly hidden from everything else.","He could tell with Providence that very soon, the time would come to begin absorbing more Planes of Existence into it- with his forces led by his son beginning their Conquest in the Lands of Noblesse while he himself...was already looking at the Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor Maximilian who would hand him the keys to the many Sacrariums of the Lernaeans!","The only question and difficult realm to maneuver was the presence of their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","Just how much impact would they be able to exert?!"]},{"number":2388,"title":"Chapter 2388: Chapter 2387 The First And The Last True Emperors II","paragraphs":["When Noah thought about the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, he wasn't just accounting and making plans for the Ancestral Lernaeans.","He also had to take into account the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Noblesse, Quasarians, and eventually the Planeswalkers when he directed his Conquest to them as well!","And even past this, there were the Inheritances that were already backing these Lineages or about to.","He had to plan and prepare for countless possibilities with all of these factors in the picture while at this same time...his Reified Sources of Extremity were about to clash with the Scions of Inheritances spread out from multiple Havens while seeking Extremity Panaceas!","There was never a dull moment in his life as he always seemed to be constantly moving, and the countless thoughts shared by his conscious were forced to isolate the Dream Dimensional Chassis at this moment as it felt something grand.","Within the depths of the Abecedarian Sacrarium, the Dream Dimensional Chassis separated from Noah's massive collective consciousness and wholly focused on the domain it was in as Providence sent forward warnings- warnings of beings exceeding the stage of Unequaled Reverend Emperors by a large margin nearing!","Emperor Maximilian opened his eyes that swirled with Providence at this same time as he spoke out while gazing towards a certain direction.","\"Your ideals are great as Providence seems to favor this path more for the lives of all Lernaeans, but even I wouldn't have been able to shoulder the decision alone. Luckily, it seems those who can carry much heavier loads on their shoulders are about to arrive.\"","WAA!","His words caused the many Elder Ancestors that weren't voicing their thoughts and opinions to look around ecstatically- because anyone greater than the Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor was...","...!","BZZT!","A heavy aura instantly enveloped the Abecedarian Sacrarium.","It wasn't just one as it felt like multiple, each of them seemingly locating exactly where they were as after these auras spread out, the majesty of 2 shocking Lifeforms began to bloom at the edges of the spread out sandy gold dreamy platform!","One was adorned in a white robe as his face carried exceeding charm and grace, a head full of dark hair mixed with stellar white tendrils of light present as his eyes were mere sockets of light- his figure actually arriving second.","The one that arrived first was an exceedingly gorgeous woman, her visage plentiful as she was more on the thicker side- and yet her beauty exceeded most others as she was surrounded by the golden brilliance of fortune.","A golden robe draped over her as her hair seemed like mere golden streams of reality, her gaze looking over all the Lerneans here as her eyes actually lit up when she saw the figures of two Emperors standing next to opposing thrones, all others surrounding them in a grand gesture.","\"If those other fools were here seeing you sitting throne to throne, they would call it treasonous.\" Her voice was melodious to listen to as it emanated in the surroundings, causing all Lernaean Reverend Emperors and Elder Ancestors to kneel with fervor and respect as the one that had spoken was one of their most revered leaders!","The Apex Aeonic Lifeform who could be called a mobile Vault of Treasures- Caterina Aurelia Dismukes!","Emperor Maximilian's eyes lit up at her appearance as he smiled brightly while bowing towards her, after all...it was all due to her valuables and power that he was still alive today after failing Apexification.","\"What do you call it, Sister Aurelia?\"","\"None of my business is what I would call it, and I told you not to call me Sister.\" Caterina Aurelia spoke succinctly while she waved her hands, her words continuing soon after as she turned towards Noah's golden visage.","\"What is my business though...is the structure of my Golden Forge that I can faintly sense hidden within the depths of your soul.\"","BOOM!","The air suddenly turned very thick.","She had only just arrived as it had been mere seconds, and yet she seemed to have obtained an overabundance of knowledge as her gaze instantly locked onto Noah!","She moved forward as she beckoned her hands to bring up the golden sand around her feet, the white robes eyeless existence behind her doing the same thing as he seemed to be in a stupor.","\"The Essence of Dreams and the smell of Providence as well as multiple other Laws around you...you must be the Last True Emperor of Barren Lands.\"","Her steps were light as she carried imposing pressure, very few existences being able to even lift their heads at her prowess as she came to stand beside Maximilian while looking at Noah's calm visage as she continued!","\"I care not for any of that though, as much as I do for the template of my Golden Forge. How did you manage to obtain it and even make something out of it? How far have you gotten while refining it with Boundary essences and your Aeonic Soul? What's the highest Loot you get daily? Weekly? Yearly?\"","The more she spoke, the more her eyes shone as the laziness within them gradually faded to reveal unexpected interest!","Interest that when Noah met her eyes, the essence of Loot, Fortune, Destiny, and Providence rose and whipped around madly as even Noah's soul couldn't help but smile.","Yes! Where exactly had his Infinite Forge reached now? What stupendous valuables could it give him per diem when his soul and the Systems built within it were constantly being upgraded the more that his Aeonic Soul Values rose?","Towards the question that the first Architect of the Golden Forge asked, Noah actually spoke freely as he felt like he had met another lover of Loot!","\"The refinement of my Realm and Soul should soon finish their stabilization as I can completely quantify the boons I get every day at that time. But at this point, I should be receiving multiple Aeonic Treasures of Extremity daily, along with the highest EPOCH Relics, Lineages, Modus Operandi, or even possibly chances to attain Loot at the Apex Aeonic Lifeform level...\"","...!","\"What!\" The eyes of Aurelia exploded with golden light as she instantly appeared before Noah!","Her astounding power was torrential as it caused Ophelia beside him to kneel, yet Noah remained standing as he looked at this woman before him who released a profound glow of Loot.","\"Daily? I could only attain Aeonic Treasures of Extremity per diem after I became an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, and at that point, they were useless to me. You can acquire them now at your current stage? Along with even more? You...let me see it.\"","WAA!","\"What?\" Noah felt like this woman before him was insane as towards his question, she only repeated herself again!","\"Show me your Forge. I won't believe it until I see it for myself. And if you show me yours, I'll show you mine.\"","\"...\"","The Elder Ancestors in the environs were dismayed while maintaining their kneeling positions of respect, not knowing how to fully wrap their minds around this!"]},{"number":2389,"title":"Chapter 2389: Chapter 2388 The First And The Last True Emperors III","paragraphs":["\"Show me your Forge. I won't believe it until I see it for myself. And if you show me yours, I'll show you mine.\"","The words rang out in the surroundings from the pink lips of a pristine Apex Aeonic Lifeform as others didn't even know how they should perceive them!","Emperor Maximilian shook his head dubiously as the other Apex Aeonic Lifeform to arrive came out of his stupor to also sigh at the unfolding scene.","Yet towards the request of Aurelia...","\"No.\" Noah answered firmly and calmly as the shining expression on Aurelia's face dwindled before becoming even brighter.","\"You...I just wanted to appreciate the Loot because I thought you were like me. You would actually deny?\"","BZZZT!","Her body danced with wild power as a milky golden light of a Dynamis of Extremity even began to paint her skin, the Elder Ancestors in the surroundings feeling their Souls tremble as they sank even further into the golden sand!","Yet the True Emperor of Quintessence didn't falter due to the pressure as he nodded while replying calmly.","\"Yes. Though I do hold an interest in the Forge of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, so I can show you a reflection of mine after everything is quantified in a bit.\"","\"A reflection? No, I want to see the real thing in your Aeonic Soul. How you constructed it in your soul, what changes you made to my forge, I want to se-mmm!\"","Before the words of Aurelia could finish, she was cut off as the Apex Aeonic Soul Clone that came behind her placed his hand on her lips and pulled her figure backwards, his voice emanating out apologetically as it caused the Elder Ancestors who heard it to recognize him as they trembled with shock and incredulity!","\"I apologize for her behavior. She has never acted like this before...\"","...!","It was the voice of the True Emperor of Genesis.","The First Emperor of the Barren Lands.","His gaze was deep and filled with wisdom as at this moment, he locked his eyes with none other than the Last Emperor of the Barren Lands!","The ones who ruled the Barren Lands first and last!","Their gazes intersected at this moment as if felt like entirely different regions of the spacetime continuum coming together.","Yet even during such a grand meeting...","BZZT!","Aurelia's body buzzed with power as she seamlessly pushed Orion away from her, her gaze dissatisfied as she looked towards him.","She held a hint of respect towards this being, and this was why even though she was greatly more powerful, she still didn't show that she could easily rebuff his authority and overcome him as she allowed him to just do what he did!","But even so, she was still an Emperor of utmost prestige and wonder.","\"Orion, don't force my hand...and you...\" Her gaze returned back to Noah as she continued.","\"...I'll let you have a peek at my Forge first, how about that? You can even take whatever you find fancy. I've begun to even generate treasures for Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in there. But right after, let me into your Soul.\"","...!","A set of sentences that were disastrous to all Elder Ancestors here rang out!","A view into the Forge of the True Emperor of Fortune!","Who had actually been granted a right to explore into it before? So far, only the most powerful Unequaled Reverend Emperors and Apex Aeonic Lifeforms among the Lernaeans had received treasures from her Forge, but they were not able to ever step foot in it.","They didn't even think it was a possibility","But hearing this...","An inexplicable sense of loss seemed to settle in their hearts as they remained kneeling.","Yet even before an answer could come from the True Emperor of Quintessence...","\"Aurelia.\"","The voice of the True Emperor of Genesis emanated out as he gazed with seriousness towards Aurelia.","His single word was enough to convey his intentions. That now wasn't the time. That there was something much greater they had to ascertain!","\"Tsk.\" And Aurelia begrudgingly accepted this as she didn't push any further, her laziness returning as she moved back while beckoning with her hands- tendrils of the Boundary Essence of Dreams from the golden floor surging towards her as she analyzed it freely.","At this juncture, Genesis and Quintessence came to gaze upon each other once more as the Emperor adorned in sandy gold was the first one to speak while looking towards Genesis with curiosity!","\"I met a portion of the Will of your past self within the Barren Lands.\"","\"Oh?\" Orion's eyes lit up as he smiled wryly before continuing. \"It must have been a Will filled with remorse and weakness.\"","\"It was.\"","WAA!","Noah spoke such shocking words as if the being before him was a peer, and he didn't stop there.","\"It was a Will that thought it had exhausted all other avenues and had to fall in line with others. It advised me to find a different path.\"","And at such words, Orion nodded with a smile as if a heavy light was lifted off his shoulders.","Off to the side, Aurelia was still analyzing the Consummate essence of the Boundary of Dreams as she rolled her eyes while the two of them talked, yet Orion paid her no heed as he replied while staring intently at Noah.","\"I can see your Eyes. You found much more clarity than I ever could as you embarked on a path none of us had seen or thought of. I just wanted to see...the outcomes of your path. My greatest wrong and regret. I wanted to see the Barren Lands.\"","...!","The Barren Lands.","Among the Lernaeans here, who had been graced with seeing them again?","Had even the Lernaean Vassals Noah had attained gotten a view of it? The answer was no!","Now, its First True Emperor sought to view at magnificence as at this, Noah smiled devilishly and replied.","\"Of course, this can be arranged.\"","...!"]},{"number":2390,"title":"Chapter 2390: Chapter 2389 The First And The Last True Emperors IV","paragraphs":["\"This can be arranged, but I would first need you to glimpse Providence again and take it to the Third Boundary Layer at the very least.\"","A golden light erupted from his body that even Aurelia brought her sharp eyes to gaze at- it was the light of a Consummate Boundary, the light of Providence!","It clustered towards Orion as he came to hold the bundle of gold in his hands.","The figure of Aurelia appeared beside him as she spoke out calmly.","\"I want it too.\"","WAA!","\"Be my guest.\" Noah freely gave out what all Elder Ancestors here were looking for, this being his condition for Genesis to glimpse the Barren Lands again as anyone who grasped his Boundaries...he could exert a level of influence on!","After all, he had bound their Sources.","They were integrated with him!","He could even slowly and pathogenically influence a soul without its knowledge.","Of course, a Soul that was vastly stronger than him like that of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform would be affected very little as they would even likely find out the moment he used Quintessential Pathogenicity on them.","But then, there was also the Barren Lands that were the tool Noah used to bind the Sources of Extremity he held.","The control they could exert over beings who were connected or utilizing its Source was stupendous as Noah had affirmed with Providence and Destiny multiple times- but even an Apex Aeonic Lifeform could be repulsed or expulsed instantly so long as they held a strong enough connection to one of its Sources!","It was simply another Layer of protection even though Noah knew and Destiny foretold that Orion nor Aurelia would never make any moves to harm the Infinite Plane. But it didn't mean Noah couldn't take precautions, nor that he couldn't gain benefits from it like gaining a line of influence into Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","BZZT!","The golden light of Providence was absorbed into Orion's body as inexplicable emotions rose, unimportant Boundaries being sacrificed within his soul at this moment as a potent light of Providence very quickly arrived at the 9th Boundary Layer.","He didn't merely stop at the Third Boundary Layer as Noah had mentioned, this being the first Consummate Boundary that he held as he rose it to the highest level that he could in a short period of time!","Taking it to the 10th Boundary Layer was a whole other task entirely as even Aurelia beside him stopped on the 9th Boundary.","\"Interesting, this really is that same Providence...this gives you some sort of assurance?\"","Aurelia spoke succinctly as Noah nodded with sharp eyes, pointing his hand behind him as a resplendent gateway bloomed an instant later!","It was none other than a cluster of spatial vortices merging together that led into the Infinite Plane still floating in the Planar Palisades of Extremity.","\"It is not named the Barren Lands any longer, so let me welcome you to...my Infinite Plane.\"","WAA!","Utmost grandeur and majesty erupted out as the figure of Genesis gravitated towards the gateway as if he could feel an unbreakable pull.","His empty sockets surged with a milky white light as his visage and the visage of Aurelia followed the Dream Dimensional Chassis into the dazzling gateway- no other beings moving an inch as Ophelia was the first one to sigh in relief as if a heavy weight was lifted off her shoulders, turning towards the clones of Adelaide and others who didn't venture out for Conquest as they felt like they could finally converse freely once more!","\"That went better than I could have even imagined...\" Ophelia spoke towards Adelaide who held a similar devilish smile as Noah, her starry attention reading the emotions of all those around them as she replied to Ophelia.","—","The Barren Lands.","This was what he knew them as.","But when he stepped through the gateway...what he found seemed to be the home he remembered, and yet it seemed to be something else entirely!","Even Aurelia gazed on in seriousness as they appeared in a region filled with stellar particles of light weaving endlessly for light years- this region being in the outer periphery of the Infinite Plane as before their senses, they saw the stacked structure of 9 Minor Planes filled with uniquely colored Cosmos and structures, as well as endless rivers of reality and massive Cosmos unlike anything they had seen before!","\"All of it...you saved all of it.\"","Orion spoke with genuine shock in his eyes as he was bracing for the worst.","But there it was.","Radiant.","Stellar.","Gorgeous.","It was the 9 Minor Planes he knew and the vastly bigger Major Plane that seemed to contain them, endless clusters of Realities and Cosmos weaving amongst each other as on top of all this...","\"Why is there such a potent aura of Extremity?\"","Aurelia was the one to voice it out quizzically as even though it was the Planes they knew, they also felt the environment feel very similar to the Havens of Extremity as Noah calmly replied to this confusion.","\"The Natural Laws and Decreta that govern it are all going towards Extremity. Naturally, the Infinite Plane itself is doing the same thing.\"","BOOM!","Shocking words emanated from Noah as they caused both the Clones of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to gaze at him.","It was simply too preposterous as when Orion felt the aura of Consummate Boundaries stemming from all fabric of Reality in these past Barren Lands...","\"It may actually be possible. With something like this, your ideals of forming an Inheritance may not be an impossibility.\"","...!","As Orion spoke, his Will perked up as he noticed the aura of multiple beings begin to appear before them.","His soul trembled as it was auras of the Lineages of the 9 Minor Planes he very well remembered.","The figures of Albus from the Prana Dimension, The Old Dreamer, Guinevere...the main bodies of all the Dimensional Rulers began to appear as those who had remained behind in the Barren Lands met those who had left too long ago!","—","An meeting of destiny and Providence.","An meeting of choices!","Choices.","They were ultimately what decided the path to be taken as at this moment, the main bodies of Orion, Aurelia, and Lucia tore through space ever faster to arrive at the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Domain.","Orion's expression was bright as only he and Aurelia's clones were seeing the Infinite Plane with their eyes, Orion's voice echoing out as they were seconds away from arriving into the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Domain.","\"Aurelia, an even grander path may just be possible. With all of the Natural Laws and Decreta expanding towards Extremity along with the Plane itself...we will have to make sure everything is taken care of quickly in order to explore this path even more and seclude ourselves from the Eyes of others. They must not know just what we have!\"","His eyes were sharp.","He knew that the usurpation of Roan's authority had to happen quickly as their Lineage had to prepare and steer clear of the attention of Inheritances, the benefits they had alone being something they needed time to swallow as they didn't need to sell themselves off to factions that would divide and use them!","So he made his choice as his blazing aura and that of Aurelia and Lucia arrived in the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Domain.","Dozens of thrones lay before their attention as the few that remained taken were still the same, the violet throne where a certain Apex Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor Roan sat being just as bright if not brighter as he looked towards them impassively.","Seeing the holder of the Aeonic Forge of Extremity standing beside Orion and knowing very well of her power and influence, rage couldn't help but rise in the attention of Roan as he saw Orion was truly serious about his usurpation!","But...just as Orion had made his choice, so had Roan.","And he now stared at his fellow beings that had come for his throne and authority without fear as no matter what choice they made...it could not be grander than the one he had just made with an Inheritance from the Aeonic Haven of Penumbra!"]},{"number":2391,"title":"Chapter 2391: Chapter 2390 Divergence! I","paragraphs":["\"Caterina...\"","The eyes of multiple Apex Aeonix Lifeforms lit up at the appearance of one of the pillars of the Lernaean Lineage!","Yet seeing Caterina Aurelia Dismukes appearing along with Orion right after his exchange of words with the Apex Aeonic Lineage Emperor Roan, a terrifying and palpable pressure seemed to descend as their overly strong souls knew something grand was about to happen.","\"I won't waste any of our time, so I will simply state that I am here to invoke the Lernaean Enthronement Ceremony to depose Roan Gregorius Acidinus and to anoint a new Apex Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor.\"","BOOM!","Space shook and trembled as powerful Wills collided and vibrated at such an announcement!","To Depose the current Emperor and call forth a Lernaean Enthronement Ceremony that would raise a new Emperor!","It was a sacred ceremony that was determined by the majority of the currently present Lifeforms in the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Domain at the point in time that it was invoked.","All those present within this domain held a vote as it was one of the most sacred places for Lernaeans!","Even the Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor Maximilian who was here held a vote, even though he wasn't an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","The violet visage of Roan was utterly cold as veiled anger and hurt could be seen in his eyes, his fist clenched as he didn't say a word.","He simply watched on as at such a reaction, the swirling milky white light within Orion's sockets churned as a sensation he didn't want to feel began to flourish!","So he became even more determined as he continued.","\"All those in favor of deposing Roan Gregorius Acidinus as the current Apex Aeonic Lineage Emperor.\"","His hand rose in a grand show of wonder as the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms present glanced at each other without any movements.","Maximilian's main body was the first one to join Orion as from his throne, his hand rose!","There were many others here more powerful than him- the less than a dozen Apex Aeonic Lifeforms seated on the thrones amounting to 9 without including Orion and those he arrived with.","Yet his hand was the first to rise as Roan gave him a powerful cursory glance.","Thereafter, an annoyed voice echoed out as the fair hand of Aurelia laced in golden light rose.","\"I left my abode to come here for this, so let's make it quick.\"","Her hand rose.","The eyes of the 9 Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms gazed at it as in sequence...","BZZT!","They began to raise their hands one after another!","If Caterina the Great supported this ordeal, how could they deny it?!","Unless none of them wanted to receive stupendous treasures in the future, they could only follow even if their Wills thought differently.","Out of all the Lernaean Lifeforms here, only three did not raise their hands.","Roan and the two Lifeforms closest to him.","Their eyes held deep conviction as they also sighed internally, their bond with Roan running too deep as they had to at least stand with him!","As for Roan himself.","His gaze was currently billowing with cold anger as he remained outwardly calm during all this, watching those who had raised their hands to give the majority win needed in order to depose him with a chilling light!","At this point, Orion nodded with a heavy expression as the next words he wanted to say were simple ones.","The stifling foreboding sensation on his soul only became heavier as his milky white Dynamis of Extremity surged over his skin like heavy tendrils of light, with him not being the only one as beside him...Aurelia's eyes had long since become stern before his!","Since the majority vote had been cast, Orion was going to say that at this moment, Roan was deposed as another vote would be held to decide the new Apex Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor.","But he didn't say these words.","The heavy sensation in his heart fully settled as instead, he asked gravely.","\"Roan...what have you done?\"","WAA!","\"Oh?\" The Deposed Emperor seated upon his violet throne raised \"I thought you were about to call the premature end to the vote, and I was going to tell you that you do not have the majority.\"","...!","The air became utterly stifling.","This domain hidden deep under a vast sea of Nullity within the heart of the domains of the Lernaean Lineage trembled at this juncture as the expressions of many changed at this moment- their Wills catching Roan flick out a Runestone that read {Shadows}!","And an instant later, the blazing auras of over a dozen Apex Aeonic Lifeforms began to bloom one after another.","A radiant obsidian light of grandeur bloomed as with it, 13 dazzling shadows manifested behind Roan!","Each one seemed like a volatile singularity as the power of a powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeform emanated from each of them!","Their sudden appearance caused the expressions of all here to change drastically as this domain was a distinctive kind of a Minor Plane of Existence. Without the correct authority, no being could simply enter.","And such an authority was always granted to the most distinguished Lernaeans.","Until today.","Until Roan...","\"You fool...what have you done?!\"","It was Aurelia who bellowed out at this instant as her vivacious body pulsed with immense power, their Wills very vividly catching the appearance of these 13 Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that were in no way connected to the Ancestral Lernaeans!","Their expressions were those of utmost calm and grandeur as even though they appeared behind Roan, they floated slightly above his throne as they seemed to portray their own importance and power.","Their eyes were callous as if everything happening around them was inconsequential, with the most dreadful thing being...their shadows.","They endlessly stretched behind them and towards an invisible distance as all 13 beings were wore with glimmering stellar black robes that held the writing of {Shadows}!"]},{"number":2392,"title":"Chapter 2392: Chapter 2391 Divergence! II","paragraphs":["Shadows!","This grand word was inscribed into an Apex Aeonic Relic that seemed to constantly release billowing smoke, the identity of these existences being clear as day!","At such a juncture, Roan finally rose from his throne as he looked grand and livid while staring towards Orion and Aurelia.","\"I have led, Aurelia. I have led!\"","BOOOM!","\"Led our Lineage to even greater glory. On a path of survival! I need no lecture from you nor Genesis as I know full well the result of my choices and actions. Now...I believe we were voting. All those in favor of me continuing to act as the representative of all Lernaeans!\"","Roan's hand shot up as soon after, the hands of the 13 newly appearing shadowy figures rose, those who sided with Roan coming out of their shock and sighing as they also raised their hands up in conjunction.","\"I believe I have the majority of those present within this domain.\" His voice was magnetic and powerful as he spoke, the expressions of Orion, Aurelia, and Lucia among others turning entirely ugly as their bodies blazed gloriously with power!","Orion's expression was one of utter disbelief and rage as his sockets radiated Light that burned brighter than any sun, his words booming out along with his Dynamis of Extremity that was turning into milky white flames around him.","\"You know full well the result of your choices?! If you knew, you wouldn't have made such a stupid one! You have invited outsiders into our very homes, into the very heart of our Lineage!\"","WAA!","His voice was explosive as beside him Aurelia was blazing with a golden Dynamis of Extremity as her eyes were entirely filled with extreme disappointment and anger.","Yet even in the face of all this, Roan faced them coldly with the backing of immensely powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms whose auras seemed to match Aurelia's most powerful visage if not greater!","\"They are outsiders no more. As the Representative of the Ancestral Lernaeans in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution has chosen to enter into an agreement with the Cult of Endless Shadows, we are one and the same. And the Lernaean Representative, I hold the authority of keeping Order within my Lineage by using the forces provided by the Cult of Endless Shadows.\"","...!","Words that only caused the expressions on Orion and Aurelia to change more and more emanated out as an instant later, a leading man who seemed fairly young stepped out from the 13 newly appearing Shadows, his exceedingly handsome face becoming prevalent to all as he smiled and spoke out.","\"That is right, Grand Primeval Roan. With your current distinction, this is within your power along with the boundless boons mentioned before. To the rest of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms here, the positions of Primevals are free for you all to take within the Cult of Endless Shadows, along with multiple Consummate Boundaries and many more treasures to assist you in the Convergence of Dynamis of Extremity.\"","His voice carried a dazzling allure as his hair was a shadowy black and red, his pupils radiating endless darkness as he smiled while he continued.","\"Of course, entering our folds is the decision you all can freely make as nobody will be forced. Nobody will come to harm...so long as the Order with the Ancestral Lernaean Lineage that is now one of the Lineages connected to the Cult of Endless is kept. If there are any who disrupt this order and go against the best interests of Lernaeans as deemed by Grand Primeval Roan...then I, Grand Primeval Silas, will personally make a move.\"","...!","The threat was clearly laid out as only billowing Shadows rose to the skies!","The surroundings turned strangely silent as the heavy pressure of Wills was all that remained, the visage of Roan stepping forward again and looking at the heavy expressions of his Brethren as he spoke out calmly.","\"You may think however you want of me. I made this move early to preserve my position, yes, but it is also for the best interest of all Lernaeans as we had to choose an Inheritance sooner or later. The Cult of Endless Shadows is a grand Inheritance whose boons surpassed all others as I ask you...my brothers and sisters of the same blood and creed- join me in this glory.\"","WAA!","The Deposed Emperor spread his arms out as he preached to his people, a terrifying development ensuing as the intersections of choices gave way to a terrifying result!","\"Our domains will be centralized and moved from their far reaches into a single glowing cluster, with all Lernaeans enjoying the resources and protection of the Cult of Endless Shadows as the Noblesse, Quasarians, nor Planeswalkers can touch us. With this, the succession of our Lineage across the eons is preserved as it will be baptized under the flames of Extremity Sanctification and become etched in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!\"","With the support of 13 terrifyingly formidable Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, Roan seemed invincible as even though Orion and Aurelia's figures trembled with rage and incredulity with every part of their bodies screaming to erupt and fight, their souls could sense the enemies before them vibrating with multiple Dynamis of Extremity within each of them!","The scene in the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Domain was quiet and yet utterly destructive as a vast Shadow covered a Lineage with a rich history.","—","Within the Infinite Plane.","The gazes of the Soul Clones of Orion and Aurelia who were meeting with the Dimensional Rulers instantly changed, but they weren't the only ones as the expression on the eyes of the Dream Dimensional Chassis also flickered sharply!","...!","\"Oh?\" Yet Noah's eyes lit up when he heard this, his figure radiating Noah had the swirling light of Providence burn within his eyes as before the two Apex Aeonic Soul Clones even uttered anything, his voice emanated out.","\"It seems like my plans have become that much harder to carry out...what has happened?\"","His gaze turned towards Orion and Aurelia, the latter seeming much more fuming as she spat out with distaste.","\"A damn fool has carried out the assimilation of the Lernaean Lineage into an Inheritance forcefully, dividing us internally as even waging a war will only cause deaths amongst ourselves!\"","...!","\"Oh?\" Yet Noah's eyes lit up when he heard this, his figure radiating a magnificent light as he gazed towards the stellar layers of Dimensions within his Infinite Plane while continuing.","\"Another force is trying to get their hands on something I have my eyes on...then, it seems the time has come for me to absorb the Lernaean Sacrariums into my Infinite Plane. As for whatever inheritance is trying to stretch their fingers into something that is mine...they can only lay at my feet in the form of Loot!\"","WAA!","The light of conquest and tyranny began to burn.","Even under the pressure of an Inheritance, Noah was unfazed as new plans formed in his mind at this very moment!"]},{"number":2393,"title":"Chapter 2393: Chapter 2392 Merely An Inheritance! I","paragraphs":["Eowyn, Guinevere, and a myriad of other Dimensional Rulers heard of the changes occurring within their Lineage as their souls blazed with battle intent.","Their Clones moved with Henry in the Domains of the Noblesse as under Noah's gifts, they had scaled the Boundary Expansion Realm rapidly as they could pose as genuine forces against their current enemies!","If they could contribute in any way...their hearts burned to do so.","These were their thoughts, but the thoughts of the maddened Apex Aeonic Soul Clone of Orion caught onto Noah's words and what they could truly mean as he asked carefully while calming his soul.","\"You say that you can absorb the Lernaean Sacrariums into this Barren...no, Infinite Plane? Is it a mechanism of your unique power or?\"","\"No, it is a boon of the restructured Barren Lands that is now an Infinite Plane. Think of it as a Construct and not like any Plane of Existence or domain- and this construct can devour any Sacrariums that are based within Planes of Existence.\"","Noah replied to Orion simply even though his words were of great shock to him!","The same applied to Aurelia as the rage in her golden eyes was pushed aside briefly while she focused on Noah.","\"A construct? Is your Forge not your greatest accomplishment? Exactly what did you do to the past Barren Lands?\"","...!","What did Noah do?","He wouldn't tell them that he entirely assimilated and bound the Source of Reality into a construct that began as a mere floating landmass, a spiritual land in an insignificant world! He wouldn't tell them that the current Dimensions they saw were entirely consumed and reformed by him.","He only smiled grandly as he replied while moving his gaze from Aurelia to Orion.","\"Whatever I may have done, I can affirm that within a matter of seconds- I can displace an entire Plane of Existence into the Infinite Plane. Its Source will either be utilized to enlarge the currently existing Planes in here or structured into another Plane entirely. As for the existences within a targeted Plane...they can also be brought into the Infinite Plane so long as they offer up an insignificant portion of their soul to be bound to me!\"","WAA!","The sockets of Orion and the eyes of Aurelia sparkled with profound thought as Aurelia was the first one to reply.","\"You mean for them to bend the knee?\"","Noah smiled devilishly as he replied. \"In a way. After all, I have to have assurances before bringing just anyone into this Infinite Plane. Nobody is restricted in any way as the only things I impose are rules to follow to keep this wondrous construct concealed from others and the stoppage of conflicts against each other.\"","...!","This was what existences who sworn Fealty to Noah went through!","And now as time came to greatly enlarge his Vassals, Noah could feel the essence of Conquest being roused as this Boundary pulsed with fervor.","And as his words settled in, the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms before him truly seemed to understand just what they meant as Orion shook his head with great anger and sorrow.","\"With such a tool like this available, we could have quietly assimilated all of the Lernaean Domains into this hidden Plane while adapting to understand the Consummate Boundaries here. With enough time and resources that will only increase in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution as Extremity Sanctification is underway...we could have raised frightening Unequaled Reverend Emperors and Apex Aeonic Lifeforms without being under the scrutiny of others, where the dream of becoming an Inheritance ourselves...would truly not be an impossibility!\"","His words were filled with regret and possibilities as it was too late!","All of this could've happened in the past as...","\"If only Roan had not...ah!\"","Orion couldn't even bring himself to say much else as to this, Noah's visage moved forward while he spoke out.","\"I will begin moving to swallow as many Lernaean Domains as possible. The Apex Aeonic Lifeforms siding with this foolish Roan or from the Cult of Endless Shadows can't do anything to me, and any Reverends they send...will only become energy for me!\"","A commanding light erupted from him as Orion came to focus on his figure closely.","The First True Emperor was briefly silent before he asked.","\"I know not of the True extent of your power as a Reverend, but can you match even the strongest Unequaled Reverend Emperors from an Inheritance? They have Extremity Circulation Modus Operandis as their tools, and with them, they can harmonize and circulate the essence of their strongest Boundaries through every single cell to achieve an effect similar to a Dynamis of Extremity even before they have become Apex Aeonic Lifeforms. Some of them are even Mutated Entities as their power isn't something captured within the bounds of common sense. Under the excuse of keeping Order within the Lernaean Lineage, the Grand Primeval Silas of the Cult of Endless Shadows will send droves of such beings to stop you the moment that word spreads.\"","...!","Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi!","Methodologies on the circulation of multiple Boundary Essences to achieve shocking effects as they were also one of the tools powerful Inheritances held which brought being ever closer to forming Dynamis of Extremity.","Noah recalled the unique layering and cluster of Essences on the body of Phos from the Extremity of Light that had collided with his Unknown Dynamis of Extremity unscathed as a light of profundity shone within his eyes.","From the memories of Titus and others, he knew about such Methodologies even though any true thought about them seemed to be burned away within their souls as he couldn't attain anything.","Titus and the others he had destroyed so far stemming from Inheritances also didn't seem to practice it as those who did seemed to be the cream of the crop! And truly, only within an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity would such profound methods exist where they may even be capable of disseminating it to all of their Scions.","But even against all of this, Noah was fearless!"]},{"number":2394,"title":"Chapter 2394: Chapter 2393 Merely An Inheritance! II","paragraphs":["In the face of the immense power an Inheritance held and the countless tools at their fingertips, Noah was unfettered as he looked straight at Orion and replied to his worries.","\"So what if they have Extremity Circulation methodologies, Mutated Lifeforms, or even Apex Aeonic Soul Totems? They are merely forces from an Inheritance- one that hasn't even become an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity! Whatever they send will not be worth much in my eyes as they won't stop my advancement.\"","WAA!","Glorious words filled with power and confidence emanated out as those who heard them could only take them in silently.","Orion looked at Noah with an utterly serious gaze as he seemed to have made up his mind, speaking out a moment later.","\"Then I shall trust in your words no matter how unreal they sound. After all, you were able to accomplish wonders with the past Barren Lands. Instead of jumping straight into waging a war with an Inheritance, let me aid you. Before Roan can disseminate his new authority and before the Cult of Endless Shadows entrenches themselves into the Lernaean Lineage, we can have you take in as many Sacrariums as possible before they even catch on.\"","...!","His gaze was firm as the milky white light within his eyes shone with ever greater majesty!","\"I can immediately teleport you to all the Sacrariums stretched out across the Havens of Dissolution, you can take them into this Infinite Plane with whatever methods you have, and I will release my authority as Genesis to command the Lernaeans within to give up a portion of their souls to you in order for them to be allowed entry into this Plane as well. Maximilian can manage relocation and everything else thereafter...\"","The True Emperor of Genesis thought about his own power and what he could do before things became drastically worse, and the path he chose was to take as much of the Lernaean Lineage away before Roan nor the Cult of Endless Shadows even noticed!","It was a path that in Noah's perspective...he was being delivered grand benefits by an Apex Aeonic Lifeform himself.","Who could've expected his Conquest of the Lernaean Lineage to flow this way? That one of its strongest beings when pressured on all sides by foreign enemies would deliver Noah to the Sacrariums himself and even use his authority to have the countless Lernaean swear loyalty to him?!","And yet when Noah came to this thought...the Dream Dimensional Chassis shone with a golden light of brilliance while at the same time, 8 other vibrant lights began to manifest around it.","\"There isn't even a need for you to use your authority to convince them of anything. Due to the limitations of time where we have to do this as quickly as we can, I can overpower it and obtain the Fealty of any average beings at the 9th Boundary Layer of achievements or below with a release of my will. No harm will come to their souls and I can move all of them an instant after...\"","...!","A devilish glow shone in his eyes as he spoke of a grand ability while around him, other Chassis began to manifest.","An ability that came from nothing else but the 9th Boundary Layer of Conquest!","[The Ninth Boundary Layer of Conquest]:: You have reached a stage of Conquest that allows for your Aeonic Soul to gain the capability of Aeonic Dominator's Haki. It is the release of your Tyrannical soul power and the essence of Conquest to allow for the widespread Conquest of any beings that fall under the area of effect of your released will. The Haki is uniquely concentrated as it will impose a heavy pressure and burden on any Soul that resists the initial outburst. Those with less Aeonic Soul Values than you will have a 99% certainty of Conquest, with those at similar levels of Aeonic Soul Values having this certainty reduced to 25%, and those stronger than you being able to resist your will as there is less than a 1% chance to Conquer their souls. The spread of the Aeonic Dominator's Haki requires 1% of your Aeonic Soul Values to release. The more Aeonic Souls you Conquer, the greater quantity and quality of the Aeonic Light Conquest you will accumulate. With a sufficient concentration of the Aeonic Light of Conquest, the elevation of Boundaries across the Consummate stage is possible...","Yes!","A pure soul attack that allowed him to release Aeonic Dominator's Haki and immediately subdue those weaker than him to forcefully make them his Vassals!","If Orion was going to take him to different Sacrariums for them to be quickly devoured and assimilated by him along with the countless Lernaeans within it, this terrifying ability to immediately Conquer the souls of those weaker would make the process even faster.","BZZZT!","As he was speaking the 8 dazzling lights around him fully manifested as the other Dimensional Chassis who were remaining in the Source of Reality cultivating to accumulate Quintessential Experience Points of Extremity stopped their tasks as they stepped out, each of them beginning to pulse the light of a certain feature of the Infinite Plane.","It was the feature of Pocket Infinite Plane that allowed for a miniaturized cluster of authority that represented the Infinite Plane itself!","It was this that Noah could utilize for the process of assimilation and assimilation of planes!","And as he summoned them out, the voice of Aurelia rang out sharply as Orion seemed to still be thinking of his words.","\"You have 9 bodies that correspond to the 9 Dimensions of the past Barren Lands? Is that how you turned it into a construct? Did you merge your will with the very Planes?\"","Her eyes released profound light as she tried to pry for Noah's methodology, his Dimensional clones only smiling towards her as the visage of Orion nodded with affirmation at this time.","\"It matters not what his means were. Okay, we can do it as you propose. Let us make haste and start with the Abecedarian Sacrarium. And if all the bodies you've called here have the same capabilities to displace Planes, this will make it even faster...\"","WAA!","A milky white light of a Dynamis shone as an unprecedented covert mission bloomed!"]},{"number":2395,"title":"Chapter 2395: Chapter 2394 Merely An Inheritance! III","paragraphs":["The means of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were unfathomable to lower Lifeforms.","The actions of Orion sought to display such a statement fully as the milky white light twisted space and time while commandingly pulling it forward- bending it to its will as within the next few nanoseconds, one portal after another began to form.","His expression didn't seem the least bit fazed as he spoke out after 9 milky white portals formed.","\"Each one will lead you above a Sacrarium Domain where you can begin your displacements. I will attack my will with them and sense any changes that occur around each one. When you're done, simply enter through the same portal again as I will have it set to directly link to a different Sacrarium.\"","...!","An ecstatic method bloomed as Orion seemed to react to Noah's methods, where the moment multiple clones were unveiled- so was this new move by Orion!","At the same time, Aurelia's body blazed with a golden light as a Dynamis of Extremity erupted to smoothly mix in with the milky white, a dense aura of Extremity radiating from this region as her sonorous voice rang out.","\"I'll also actively mask you and the movements you make in the regions these portals lead to ensure that you aren't found out too quickly. With this, we can reclaim the vast majority of Lernaean Domains without already falling into war. When they find you, they cannot attack you, but they will know where to flaunt their might as we will be the next targets. So hurry.\"","WAA!","Two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms provided the support they could as Noah's Dimensional Chassis from 9 different Dimensional Realities moved forward calmly, each one delving into one of the dazzling milky gold white portals ad they carried the authority of the Infinite Plane in a miniaturized Pocket Dimensional Reality!","—","Above the Abecedarian Sacrarium.","Maximilian had received word from Orion about the recent developments and what they planned to do in this relatively short period of time, his heart fluttering at this newfound situation that was rolling out at an extremely fast pace as when he raised his head, he could see a golden white light cracking open the space above the massive Plane of Existence they were in- this golden white color spreading out many light years as at its center...a man adorned in gold stepped out.","It was the Dream Dimensional Chassis of the True Emperor of Quintessence.","Maximilian recalled Orion's words as he saw this being buzz with wild power in the next instant.","'His Soul will sweep to dominate and take a portion of the souls of the Lernaeans he saves in order for them to be taken into the old Barren Lands. You will be needed to keep order and relocate all those that arrive now and later, so be among the first to release a portion of your soul to him. For the sake of all Lernaeans.\"","...!","Orion didn't ask him to pledge fealty by using his authority and commanding it so.","He reminded him that he was doing all this for none other than the countless masses of beings he bore the weight of!","So in the next second as a maddening soul storm surged out in the form of Haki from the True Emperor of Quintessence, Maximilian was among the first to leave his soul free of any influence.","For the sake of Lernaeans, he would do anything- even if it was giving his soul up to a Demon with unknown means!","Above the Abecedarian Sacrarium.","Noah's soul vibrated madly as he spoke out.","[Aeonic Dominator's Haki]","...!","An insignificant portion of his Aeonic Soul Values were used up as Aeonic Mana of Extremity filled in the rest, a point of constant usage also forming as Noah commanded his Haki to expand and cover all of the Plane before him!","A multicolored wave of pressure released with him at the very center.","How had his power changed over the weeks and months?","He had no need to converse or send messages for others to pledge fealty at this moment in time.","He would simply release his Haki as all those falling within its range would automatically fall under his banner of conquest!","From young to old.","From those who had just expanded their first concept towards Extremity to those who had expanded this concept into the 9th Boundary Layer!","Every single area within the Abecedarian Sacrarium that his Aeonic Dominator's Haki passed, the minds of Lernaeans shook as they were immediately conquered with a pledge of Fealty being made!","From the Elder Ancestors positioned beside Maximilian, and all the way to the ramparts and fortresses enacted in the periphery of the Abecedarian Sacrarium where existences coming in from the Planar Palisades of Extremity had to cross.","All the way to the figure of a newly arriving Charlemagne and a few other Ancestral Descendants who had left the Barren Lands two days ago as one of the two parties from the Quantum Dimension and were just now arriving with nearly all of their party wiped out from traversing the terrors of the Planar Palisades of Extremity alone...even these beings were blanketed by the waves of Haki as they were incredulously forced to oath Fealty!","Noah gazed at the vast light years his soul reached across as he saw dazzling lights of conquest surging upwards towards his own Soul, his visage decisive as he spoke out while releasing the authority of the Pocket Infinite Plane towards the region below him.","\"Devour and assimilate.\"","BZZZT!","For the first time in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, the light of a gourmandizing construct flashed in the Havens of Extremity to devour a Plane of Existence!","Within the Plane itself, beings like the True Emperor of Light who had achieved the status of a Reverend and weren't prepared for the wave of Haki that descended were only able to resist for a moment before their Wills were overcome and a oath of Fealty was made.","Ophelia and other beings already made Vassals watched on with shining eyes as they were among the few who managed to observe what happened next.","They managed to witness what prodigious and terrifying stage of might the Infinite Plane had reached as the entire process to consume the colossal Plane that was the Abecedarian Sacrarium...took a grand total of two seconds!"]},{"number":2396,"title":"Chapter 2396: Chapter 2395 Merely An Inheritance! IV","paragraphs":["Maximilian's Soul Clone had accepted the descending haki and pledged Fealty quicker than all other Lernaeans, and he was among those who were able to regain their faculties and witness just what happened next.","The best way he could describe it...was that an unimaginably dense singularity of Infinite mass and energy erupted out and devoured everything- the very structure of the fabric of Reality around them and their bodies included!","They then faced an immense darkness as a second later, his Will was able to discern golden brilliance.","He felt the golden sands around him shift as he knew he was no longer in the Havens of Extremity.","When he gazed up, he saw radiant and massive sandy gold Cosmos spinning in an endless stellar expanse, where even further up, the purple light of...","\"Avalon?\"","His eyes trembled as he was barely able to recognize that he was on the sandy gold floor of the genuine Dream Dimension that stretched out endlessly, and far, far above them was the exterior of the Avalon Dimension that could barely be seen!","In his amazement, he also observed how around him, quintillions upon quintillions of Lernaeans began to appear across the expanse of sandy golden dunes as they looked around in incredulity and shock.","When he saw this, he immediately came out of his stupor.","This was his task.","To manage the countless Lernaeans that were about to arrive here as it didn't matter how any of this was possible!","\"O my people!\"","...!","—","A milky white gold portal lay behind him.","And before his eyes, it seemed like a massive chunk of space was missing as if it had been entirely eaten, the whole Abecedarian Sacrarium nowhere to be seen as Noah only gazed down coldly while his soul felt ever greater waves of power!","The essence of the Plane of Existence was devoured as it would be added to the ever expanding Planes within the Infinite Plane, and the countless Lernaeans were deposited into the Dream Dimensional Reality for their future integration into these lands where they would choose where to live.","His Dream Dimensional Chassis did such a dreadful thing as after ascertaining no signs of life in the surroundings, he entered the milky white gold portal behind him as he was shuttled across the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution and towards another location that held a Sacrarium of the Ancestral Lernaeans!","At the same time he did this, 8 other Dimensional Chassis also turned away from points in space that looked like empty holes carved out of their reality- 8 other Planes of Existence being devoured within a matter of seconds along with countless Lernaeans.","Quintillions upon quintillions instantly pledging fealty to him.","It caused the light of Conquest to burn brightly as his Aeonic Soul Values continued their exponential ascent!","Just like this, Noah began to devour the domains of one of the four prominent Lineages of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution silently and with haste- the Inheritance that had just spread their influence on this Lineage being none the wiser!","—","Within the hidden folds of space where the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Domain resided.","A vast Shadow seemed to cover everything as it extended from The Deposed Emperor- from the Grand Primeval Roan of the Cult of Endless Shadows and seemed to stretch out Infinitely!","Roan watched the wrathful gazes of Orion and Aurelia as he knew they wouldn't take things lying down, and he already had plans for this as-","\"Okay.\"","...!","His pupils constricted as he heard a single word from Orion as he seemed to be containing his rage.","\"When the other Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms return, let them know of the grand choices you made on behalf of all of us. When the very identity of Lernaeans is washed away in the river of history...only then will you truly understand what you have done. When you have no legacy nor friends to accompany you, I hope the power you've achieved will be sufficient to console your soul then.\"","WAA!","His words felt sharper and more dreadful than any attacks he could have thrown!","Roan still thought correct. Orion didn't take it lying down as he did attack, but he attacked in the worst way possible even his steeled soup vibrated at his words that continued.","\"I will not participate in what is to come, so I can only wish that you truly bear the weight of your choice and see what future will unfold for Lernaeans. For any of those opposed to Roan's choice, you can follow me.\"","A deep voice full of contained anger and wisdom.","This was what emanated out as soon after, three blazing lights of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms left their positions to come float beside Orion, Aurelia, and Lucia.","Others remained where they were with difficult expressions as since things had come to this...why not follow the flow of Destiny and attain the boons of an Inheritance of their Lineage that had already fallen under them? Yet they still felt shameful of their choices as their heads turned down to not even gaze towards Genesis and the others.","Maximilian's main body had a profound expression in his eyes as he also appeared behind them, immense loss present on his face as when Roan looked at all of them, even more anger rose from the depths of his soul!","\"Foolishness. Where will you go that will provide you with a path towards Extremity if not an Inheritance? You will have to give up even more if you try joining an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity once you leave here. If things have come to this, why not just accept them as they are? Keep our forces together. Just adapt to the situation and join the Cult of Endless Shadows.\"","Even in his anger, he still brought himself to say such a thing as he wanted all of them to rise together!","Yet...Orion's gaze was cold as a milky portal appeared behind him.","\"You've made your choice, we shall make ours.\"","...!","A radiant milky white brilliance bloomed as one after another, Orion and those who followed him went into it.","\"...\"","A heavy silence descended on the surroundings soon after as it was only broken by laughter from Grand Primeval Silas!","\"Hah, that was truly surprising. I never would have thought that many would choose to leave when such great boons are before them. This is perplexing...\"","His potent gaze and visage that was wrapped by multiple Dynamis of Extremity emanated immense magnificence as Roan snorted while replying in distaste.","\"It is only because they believe they can make something of themselves because from our Descendants, one who holds a few Consummate Boundaries rose.\"","His words immediately caused the brows of Grand Primeval Silas to rise.","\"What?\"","\"Yes, an unruly Descendant who wants to be enthroned to lead Lernaeans in exchange for his Consummate Bou-\"","BZZT!","Before Roan's words even finished, a glorious power erupted from Grand Primeval Silas as he harrumphed while interrupting.","\"Why didn't you say so earlier? If there's someone like that, we can not have them taking him away. Since all Lernaeans are under the banner of the Cult of Endless Shadows, so is he. And any Boundaries held by our people...are also our property. Let's go. No matter how unruly, I will show you how to deal with a Scion that won't cooperate.\"","...!"]},{"number":2397,"title":"Chapter 2397: Chapter 2396 Merely An Inheritance! V","paragraphs":["\"You would concern this much for the Consummate Boundaries stemming from a single being? I would have thought the Cult of Endless Shadows held more than enough in their hands - of even greater quality too.\"","Roan spoke towards the visage of Grand Primeval Silas who was forming a massive spatial vortex in front of them.","The eyes of this being from the Cult of Endless Shadows were full of calm and power as he replied.","\"As you get more familiar with the Convergence of Boundaries to form Dynamis of Extremity, you will come to understand the importance of Consummate Boundaries. They are akin to the most pristine ingredients to form a Dynamis of Extremity as one can most easily and successfully achieve Convergence with the highest chance from such a level of Boundaries. It is nearly an impossibility to form Dynamis of Extremity with Innate or Planar Boundaries entirely. But apart from this...they also have to fit together akin to a piece of a puzzle.\"","...!","\"The biggest issue that stands in the way of Boundaries converging to become Dynamis of Extremity is not just how arduous it is to fuse even two Consummate concepts together, but the fact that finding two that harmonize and match is immensely difficult. So the more Consummate Boundaries you collect, the better. You might come to find that the Consummate Boundaries of this being you're considering as nothing may just be the key to solving a puzzle that will birth a Dynamis of Extremity across any of us here...so, what are the coordinates where this Lernaean is at?\"","His composure was overwhelming as he asked, Roan's eyes shining sharply as he waved his hands to infuse the coordinates of the Abecedarian Sacrarium into the massive spatial vortex that Grand Primeval Silas had been forming.","\"Zaka, Nigel, Christopher...stand by and take stock of all the domains of Lernaeans that now fall under the Cult of Endless Shadows. Check them to see if any Mutated Entities are hidden within for us to discover, and begin the process of Domains Centralization.\"","...!","Grand Primeval Silas gazed towards a few other members of the Cult of Endless Shadows as he spoke of profound concepts!","One was the discovery of any Mutated Souls within the Ancestral Lernaeans as the other...was Domain Centralization.","A concept that was most commonly understood in other Havens where multiple Inheritances reigned across different regions.","It was the action of forcibly moving the scattered Domains of a certain lineage or faction across a Haven and bringing them together into one massive cluster!","It meant utilizing the power of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to stably wrap around Planes of Existence or whatever environment their existences were living in and transporting it for countless light years into a predetermined location.","It was to contain all of their forces in one area where they could patrol and defend, and they would expand their domain outwardly from there over the years that passed!","Roan's heart was heavy as he saw this whole procession start, his gaze coming to land on the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that stood by him as he also voiced out.","\"Aid them in any way you can.\"","He would have to familiarize himself with it soon, but there was about to be no distinction between Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms or those from the Cult of Endless Shadows as they would soon be one and the same!","\"Oh, silly me, before I forget...\" And at such a juncture...Grand Primeval Silas beckoned behind him as his massive shadow that stretched out endlessly spat out dazzling crystalloids to float above his hand, their grandeur shining brightly as they were Aeonic Runestones possessing an unknown number of things within them.","They floated towards Roan and other Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as Grand Primeval Silas smiled brilliantly.","\"Runestones containing Consummate Boundary Essence Crystals for you all to get started on our Consummate Boundary of Shadows and more, along with Apex Aeonic Relics and many more surprises within. Let me officially welcome you all to the Cult of Endless Shadows!\"","WAA!","His demeanor was full of grandeur as Roan accepted a second Runestone while others obtained their first, their gazes finally settling after getting their hands on boons as they would be all that much more agreeable in what was to come!","Grand Primeval Silas smiled at this as his visage floated into the massive vortex he had conjured up, Roan following behind him along with 7 more Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Cult of Endless Shadows.","\"Let's go see this unruly Descendant possessing Consummate Boundaries. If that Orion is interfering and trying to take him, then you know what I must do, right?\"","Their figures shuttled across an unknown number of light years as the voice of Silas emanated out.","\"It would be interfering with the order of a new faction that is now a part of the Cult of Endless Shadows. Akin to him stealing from us.\"","...!","Roan's eyes were sharp as he replied coldly.","\"You promised me no deaths for any of the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in all this. Just incapacitate him and those following him. They will turn to us soon enough when this avenue is closed as well.\"","A chilling light passed through the eyes of Grand Primeval Silas as he heard this, his smile becoming ever brighter as the end of the spatial vortex appeared while their figures stepped out.","\"Of course...\"","SHAA!","The scene before then changed as a rift opened in space to reveal their overwhelming figures.","9 powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in total- Grand Primeval Silas and Roan along with 7 from the Cult of Endless Shadows!","They appeared above the Abecedarian Sacrarium as...","\"What is this? These are the coordinates to the Domain where the unruly Descendant is in?\"","Silas' gaze changed as he saw a smoothly carved out depression on a stellar earth that extended for many light years below him- his will surging out and seeing no signs of smart Lifeforms in this area below him!"]},{"number":2398,"title":"Chapter 2398: Chapter 2397 Merely An Inheritance! VI","paragraphs":["\"It is the Abecedarian Sacrarium...\" Roan voiced out in shock at the absence of the massive Plane of Existence that was here as his gaze changed, feeling a dangerous aura erupt from Silas at this situation!","It was truly perplexing as even if Orion and the others were involved in forcibly moving the Sacrarium away from here, it was a process that took time as they had to stabilize the stellar bodies within the Planes with their very own souls and move them slowly- otherwise the stellar bodies and Lifeforms within could undergo great destruction from the sudden and rapid movements of their Plane of Existence.","It was akin to plucking a world that was stably moving in space with one's hands as if the existences within it weren't stabilized and anchored in a unique way, everyone within such a world would be crushed by the sudden changes in gravitational forces and movement!","\"This is a declaration of war against us. You all, start spreading out and wait for my word. Engage the moment you see them.\"","As he spoke, Silas' body released magnificently dense smoke that covered the vast region above the concave depression.","\"Let's see where you went...\"","A Singularity of darkness bloomed and expanded to form a thin sheet of darkness that stood over the area where the Abecedarian Sacrarium used to be, and then an instant later...this thin film of darkness reflected the scene of the concave depression on the stellar earth below as spacetime continuum began to twist and churn!","\"Everything has a shadow. History lays behind the greatest shadows as we can easily peek to see the shadows of history here...\"","Silas' voice was grand and majestic as he spoke, the illusory scene reflected in the shadows showing a reversal of time at a very rapid pace as within moments...they saw the eruption of an illusory shadowy Plane of Existence!","...!","This scene surprised the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as they expects to see a reversal of time that showed the direction that the Plane was taken to, but it seemed like it disappeared right here.","Silas' eyes became sharper as he slowed the reversed scene down.","A few seconds before the disappearance of the Plane, his perceptive eyes captured the blooming of a milky white portal as well as the visage of a being stepping out of it who brought his hand down to barely touch the bounds of the Plane below him as seconds after that...","WAP!","The Plane entirely disappeared.","\"...\"","Silence reigned as the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms watched this scene.","The figure coming out of the portal was veiled as Silas had to erupt with waves of dense obsidian light before the veil covering him became clear, Roan looking at the figure shown on the illusory scene in shock as he recognized it from the intelligence reports sent out through the Automaton Boundary Modulators!","\"That is...the unruly Descendant who wants to be enthroned. How did he...?\"","\"Oh? This is more serious than we thought if this Descendant has such capabilities. If he did this for the domain here, he may be doing it for other domains as well...quickly, share the coordinates of all other Lernaean Domains nearby!\"","WAA!","The minds of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms worked fast as those Roan had sent out to look for traces were recalled, Roan sending out a dense cluster of information that contained all the coordinates of Lernaean Domains as he spoke out.","\"Even if you locate him, you cannot do anything against him. How do you plan to-\"","\"You let me worry about that and find his current location first. I have dozens of groups of Shadowlings meant to enter the Extremity Vein of Dissolution that I've sent a message to be redirected. Find his current location first and simply lock down the space. We can do that much without the Extremity Adjudicator admonishing us!\"","...!","The power of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms buzzed as they used their terrifying prestige to locate a single being!","—","[Aeonic Dominator's Haki]","BOOM!","His Will raged down with glory as quintillions upon quintillions of souls were conquered in the blink of an eye.","His hand then extended down the authority of the Pocket Infinite Plane a fiery crimson Major Planes of Existence below him that floated in a region of lava-filled mountains began to twist and distort, everything about it devoured within the next few seconds as Noah turned back to enter to milky gold portal once more!","He had already done this process 8 times just with the Dream Dimensional Chassis alone as the other 8 Clones were making just as much progress.","His figure was shuttled across spacetime under the control of the spatial vortices that continued to be created by Genesis and supported by Aurelia as very quickly, he appeared in another region.","Tendrils of Nullity could be seen arcing in the distance as below him, a cluster of Minor Planes of Existence could be seen- this being a major Domain of the Lernaeans known as the Argeus Cluster!","His Haki reverberated out once more as he began the procedure all over again, and just as he was devouring the last Minor Plane here...","HOONG!","His soul buzzed.","His gaze turned towards the far away space as an instant later, a terrifying aura ripped across spacetime and teleported in as it was an existence whose shadow stretched out endlessly behind him, his face covered with a dark veil as the moment he appeared- a stupendous dominance emerged from him the moment he noticed Noah's figure!","Massive chains of darkness pulsing with a Dynamis of Extremity emerged and covered everything in an instant, space becoming utterly locked as moving across it or teleporting in or out would mean denying the dominance of a Dynamis of Extremity that was just set down!","And the one to do that had to have just as much power if not more.","The vibrant milky white gold portal behind Noah still pulsed and resisted as he could've abandoned the remaining Minor Plane and escaped, but he didn't even make a move to do so as he calmly finished fully devouring the last Plane half a second later, where at this time...dazzling obsidian shackles wrapped around the white gold portal as it could be accessed no longer!","An enemy Apex Aeonic Lifeform appeared before him, and yet the True Emperor of Quintessence didn't choose to run.","If they found him this fast, it meant that they had discovered something and were randomly looking across the Lernaean Domains to track him down.","Since they had found him, he wouldn't give them another chance to keep on looking and find the other 8 Clones moving in different regions that continued to devour more and more Sacrariums!","'Focus on me...' His eyes released a grand golden light as just like he expected...","BZZT!","Besides the Apex Aeonic Lifeform that appeared first, multiple more came in one after another until 9 dazzling auras caused the surrounding space to creak and tremble.","One aura exceedingly stronger than the rest appeared at the forefront as Noah recognized the figure of Lineage Emperor Roan beside him from the many memories he had obtained from Lernaeans!","His eyes became sharp as a devilish smile bloomed on his face.","Even though he stared at frightening Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, he spoke out freely.","\"Well, isn't this a special day. To have the Lernaean Lineage Emperor Roan himself and multiple other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms lock down space just for me...\"","...!","The pressure of the entities before him increased a hundredfold as none of it was localized on him, the covering on the strongest aura here lifted as a handsome man surrounded by darkness unveiled himself with a calm smile as well.","\"The unruly Descendant that holds Consummate Boundaries...do I really not see even an ounce of fear as you stand before esteemed Lifeforms from the Cult of Endless Shadows?\"","His demeanor was just as overbearing as he didn't even leave room for Roan to impose himself. Hair as black as night and eyes that seemed like singularities of darkness.","A dazzling rune of [Shadows] was etched on the left side of his obsidian robe as he emanated grand power!","This was the Grand Primeval Silas of the Cult of Endless Shadows- the holder of multiple Dynamis of Extremity who was currently put in charge of overseeing the matters of the Cult of Endless Shadows in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!","Yet towards his words and prestige- in front of multiple other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms...the True Emperor of Quintessence whose sandy gold Clone was surrounded by streams of abundant milky white essence of Conquests...this being gazed towards Grand Primeval Silas with eyes of immense confidence and tyranny as he spoke out clearly!","\"It is merely the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of a mere Inheritance barely Recorded across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. Why would I ever show even an ounce of fear towards such beings?\"","\"...\"","...!"]},{"number":2399,"title":"Chapter 2399: Chapter 2398 Of Light And Shadows! I","paragraphs":["\"It is merely the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of a mere Inheritance barely Recorded across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. Why would I ever show even an ounce of fear towards such beings?\"","BOOM!","Shocking!","Indomitable!","This was the only word one could think of while watching the visage of the True Emperor of Quintessence who floated in the skies while 9 Apex Aeonic Lifeforms made their presence clear!","His words were astonishing as when Grand Primeval Silas heard them, his shadowy smile only became wider as his eyes radiated unbound darkness.","The visage of Roan beside him had a cold expression as with his identity as the Lernaean Representative, it was his duty to Discipline those of his Lineage!","So before anything else could occur, his voice emanated out.","\"A descendent like you that has only just risen up may not know when and where to show fear...but such a time is now. Do not say anything else more foolish and forget whatever Orion has told you. Our Lineage now follows the Cult of Endless Shadows, and so do you. Fall in line and contribute to the elevation of Lernaeans, or make a futile struggle and find only darkness waiting for you.\"","...!","A grand violet haze wrapped around Roan as he spoke, where at the same time- his very body buzzed powerfully as he called forth his Bloodline Authority!","The authority as an Ancestral Lernaean whose blood covered the branch Lineages that rose in the 9 Dimensions and the Desolate Mausoleum.","And as the Apex Lernaean Lineage Emperor, this Authority was moreso magnified as it was one of the few things an Apex Aeonic Lifeform could utilize against juniors of his Lineage as a form of discipline without it breaking the unspoken rule of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms attacking lower Lifeforms!","For those of the same Bloodline, it was an irrefutable form of attack that they couldn't deny!","And before Noah's eyes...","[A Bloodline Authority with traces of compositions linked to a portion of the Bloodlines under you seeks to impose control!]","...!","His eyes shone sharply a crimson glow erupted around him, his gaze turning towards Roan with utmost coldness as a multicolored radiance shone around him.","[The Lineage of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor admonishes the poor authority targeting its composition!]","His body shone with a multicolored radiance as it wasn't affected in the least bit, the glow around him making him seem like an untouchable creature graced with unwavering brilliance!","\"I may have been born in the Barren Lands, but my Lineage is not something that the likes of you can claim to be Ancestors of.\"","WAA!","His voice was grand as Roan looked towards him with a trace of shock.","Was he actually not of a branch of their Lineage?","Even while such a question rose, the voice of the True Emperor of Quintessence continued to emanate out.","\"You know what I see when I look at you? Your name and your distinctions fall under my gaze.\"","Providence shone brightly as the Aeonic Annals of Providence remained branded in Noah's eyes- boundless streams of information flowing into him even if the vast majority was restricted!","\"There are grand and glorious titles such as the Apex Lernaean Lineage Emperor Roan and Grand Primeval Roan, but there is also something like the Deposed Emperor Roan!\"","WAA!","His visage was dominating as he actually floated towards the 9 Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, his figure coming ever closer to them as even though 8 of them cast massive shadows extending in the distance, his brilliance seemed to be covering the endless expanse behind him as he spoke freely towards Roan.","\"A fake Emperor like you dares to try and impose their authority onto me? Onto my Lineage that far supersedes yours?! Stand the fuck down and know your place, O Deposed Emperor!\"","BOOM!","A light of glory shone around him as he came to float not too far away from existences as pristine as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","Within Roan's eyes, incredulity and bubbling rage rose as when had anyone ever spoken to him like this?","Even other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms didn't ever speak to him in such a manner as who did this being think he was?","His expansive rage was rising to such an unimaginably high level that Roan even had the thought...would the cost of killing this being be too high for him to bear if he acted at this moment?","But before such a thought could be carried out, clapping could be heard as loud laughter from Grand Primeval Silas could be heard.","\"Haha, what a unrestrained personality! You're something that would be a great fit with our Cult of Endless Shadows.\"","The Endless darkness around Silas became restrained as he stared at Noah from a distance. His hand had risen towards Roan as he made his intentions clear, the Deposed Emperor remaining silent with rising rage as the stares of Silas and Noah locked onto each other.","\"The Unruly Descendant...Osmont, is it? I know your type.\"","\"Oh?\" Noah's gaze was frosty as his hands remained behind his back cooly while Silas nodded and continued.","\"Yes. Geniuses who haven't really faced all that much adversity towards the Boundary Expansion Realm. Over the years, you've built up your confidence as you overcame one weak enemy after another, giving you a fake sense of invincibility as you've never really been knocked down. Words will not work on you as you will only continue to express rudeness and apathy. No...the only thing that will work on you is a very clear demonstration of power. For you to be shown that the Havens are vast. For you to be shown that you aren't the only Genius out there. That there are other Unequaled Reverend Emperors out there just as powerful if not more powerful than you. Mutated Souls with even more unique qualities. What you need...is to be shown for the first time in your life that you are not special. You need to be knocked down.\"","...!","The expansive Shadow that was restrained behind him began to expand again, this time showing countless figures within it that released terrifying waves of power!"]},{"number":2400,"title":"Chapter 2400: Chapter 2399 Of Light And Shadows! II","paragraphs":["The smile on Grand Primeval Silas was chilling as he continued.","\"But do not worry. After I knock you down, I will lift you up again and rebuild your confidence as a member of the Cult of Endless Shadows. As the Shadowlings you will now face who will be the ones to expand your vision and show you that in the vastness of Extremity...you really aren't too special!\"","BOOM!","The shadow extending behind him spat out dozens of figures that radiated immense power below the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","Each one was an Unequaled Reverend Emperor as 36 Shadowlings appeared behind Grand Primeval Silas, their eyes releasing a profound light of power as they were akin to the enemies Noah was facing in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands right above the periphery of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution.","He gazed at their appearance and smiled as he replied lightly.","\"You cannot act against me, so you call upon these poor souls to teach me a lesson? To show me that I am not special within these vast Havens? Hah! All you have done is bring out creatures that will fall under my feet like many others in the past.\"","He pointed to the powerful members of the Cult of Endless Shadows that had just appeared as he spoke with utmost solemnity.","\"All you have done is bring your people to my door for them to die.\"","...!","His dominance never once falter as of the newly appearing Shadowlings, three stood out the brightest as they immediately blazed with powerful Haki that contained the essence of multiple Consummate Boundaries!","\"Control your tongue, otherwise even after your beatdown and subsequent assimilation into our Cult of Endless Shadows, you will only remain an outcast with no allies.\"","WAA!","The one to speak was a tall and slender woman with hair steeped in darkness, her beauty on different scales entirely as beside her, the auras of the two other most powerful Shadowlings bound her left and right as they were men of powerful stature!","One held an obsidian bow pulsing with the aura of an Apex Aeonic Relic, another grasping a massive hammer wrapped in darkness that pulsed with a similar aura.","\"Haha, Rosalind...as I've just said, this is not a being that words will work on. He will only be convinced when reality hits him in the face...so show him. Show him that out of the vastness of Extremity, he isn't the only one blessed with gifts.\"","...!","A command came from above as the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms became concealed by shadows.","\"Yes, Grand Primeval.\"","The one called Rosalind nodded as the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms disappeared- the reason for this being that they had already played too much of a hand against this being before them already! Their souls could feel that if they moved any further and continued to press their oppressive auras down on him even after they called forth Unequaled Reverend Emperors, the Extremity Adjudicator would be justified to make a move as for now...they could only watch.","HOONG!","From the Shadowling Rosalind, a pillar of darkness rose around her as her fair skin slowly became inky black and took on a shadowy luster, her voice echoing out.","\"I am a Haven Rank Shadowling of the Cult of Endless Shadows, and I shall show you the heights of the Havens and the depths of the Earth today. Mateo, Starr...take your squadrons to surround him. What we seek today is complete submission to make this being understand that he cannot insult a Grand Primeval of our Cult.\"","...!","They were meant to join many other beings in the Extremity Vein of Dissolution to seek Extremity Panaceas and other boons to complete their foundations.","To be recalled here to deal with a single overconfident being made their hearts extremely bitter as all it did was take away from their time and opportunities!","So they sought to finish this fast as the being they surrounded smiled brilliantly at this moment.","\"You all seem to think you can call others to fight for you, but I cannot.\"","Even in this situation, his confident eyes never faltered as he stared in the direction of the concealed Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who still had this space locked down!","\"I will show you all today that the beings you've called out to suppress me...I will not even have to lift a finger against them.\"","WAA!","\"I'll actually sit back and show you all who think you've seen the vastness of Extremity...that you haven't seen anything yet!\"","BZZZT!","Brilliance flashed around him as a sandy gold throne of Dreams rose, his visage sitting on it as on top of this, the pure and unbound essence of Consummate Boundaries leaked madly around him.","—","Within the depths of the Source of Reality of the Infinite Plane.","Noah's main body rose its glorious visage upwards towards the aurora of surging essence around him as he spoke out.","\"It is time to release them and let their names be Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.\"","He spoke towards the Infinite Plane itself.","He spoke towards the tools that were uniquely tied to itself.","He spoke of the weapons that had been recalled into the Source of Reality after their battle was done- he spoke of the Enders of Nature that were born of the very Natural Laws themselves!","Natural Laws that were now each standing at the 9th Boundary Layer of Extremity!","One must not forget, Noah bound the Sources of all the Boundaries he held- the Natural Laws included. But there was another Entity that helped him in this binding as it was even more closely interlinked to these Laws!","If during Noah's elevation, he could obtain the Reified Sources of Extremity as he called out reified forms of his Boundaries, how could the Infinite Plane not be able to do so?","ROAAR!","From the overabundance of multicolored light within the Source of Reality, the bellow of the Draconian Qilin Phoenix cleared the scene as it displayed dense clusters of Enders of Nature that now had at their base...bodies that were remade with the Sources of Extremity bound to the Infinite Plane.","There wasn't a mixing of different Boundary Essences yet as this was too advanced at this junction.","The dazzling Draconian Qilin Phoenix didn't hold multiple Essences of the past natural laws around it as it only shone with a glorious cerulean glow of Manadynamics.","Within its body, every atom was remade through the Source of Manadynamics!","It, and all the others behind it...were no longer mere Enders of Nature.","Noah's eyes were bright as he gazed beside the Draconian Qilin Phoenix to see the countenance of the Draconic Elephantine creature that was the past Hyperion as he voiced out grandly.","\"Release the Reified Enders of Extremity.\"","...!","BOOM!"]}]);
